{"964a5a8366f7": {"fn": "openclaw/openclaw", "sha": "964a5a8366f7", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "运行在自有设备上的开源 AI 助手，接入聊天渠道", "review": "OpenClaw 是开源 AI 助手，运行在用户自己的设备上，通过 Discord、iMessage、Slack、Telegram、WhatsApp 等 20+ 聊天渠道以及 macOS/iOS/Android/Windows/Linux 原生应用交付。一个 Gateway 既可作为个人助手运行，也可作为团队共享部署。状态、记忆与凭证存于本地硬件；模型与 agent harness 作为可替换插件接入；默认仅每日版本检查联网，匿名统计需主动开启。由独立 501(c)(3) 基金会维护，无付费层或托管服务。", "highlights": ["Gateway 本地控制面管理会话、工具、事件与渠道连接", "接入 20+ 聊天渠道及多平台原生应用", "模型与 agent harness（Claude、Codex、本地模型）以插件方式可替换", "沙箱配置与消息发送者配对等安全机制"], "use_cases": ["在自有设备上部署个人 AI 助手并通过常用聊天软件交互", "团队共享部署一个统一的助手实例", "搭配本地模型实现数据不出本地的助手使用"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AI助手", "聊天集成", "自托管", "Gateway"], "domain": "AI 助手/基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L11: OpenClaw is an open-source AI assistant that runs on your own computer and meets you in the channels you already use: Di", "L13: **Yours, with no catch.** State, memory, and credentials live on your hardware. Models and agent harnesses (Claude, Code", "L63: - The Gateway is the local control plane for sessions, tools, events, and channel connections."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [13], "note": "Claude 作为可换插件被提及，无专门适配细节", "quotes": ["**Yours, with no catch.** State, memory, and credentials live on your hardware. Models and agent harnesses (Claude, Code"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [31, 34], "quotes": ["Already manage Node.js? Install the published package instead (Node 24.16+ or 26.1+; Node 26 recommended):", "npm install -g openclaw@latest --allow-scripts=openclaw"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [92, 94, 95], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw.git", "pnpm install", "pnpm build"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": []}}, "025a818f0cac": {"fn": "affaan-m/ECC", "sha": "025a818f0cac", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 Claude Code 等 AI 编码 harness 安装 agent 工程系统的插件", "review": "ECC 是面向 AI 编码代理的开源 harness 系统，以 Claude Code 插件（ecc@ecc）和 npm 包（ecc-universal）形式分发，提供 71 个 agent、311 个技能、97 个命令、hooks、规则包、记忆与持续学习机制，以及 AgentShield 安全扫描（扫描 prompts、hooks、MCP 配置、权限、密钥）。项目按 plan→test→implement→review→verify→remember→improve 流程组织。对 Claude Code 提供引导式插件安装，Codex 与 Kimi Code 有引导路径，Cursor、OpenCode、Gemini、Zed、GitHub Copilot、Qwen 等通过能力受限的适配器支持；README 注明需查看支持状态矩阵，不保证功能对等。MIT 许可，另有面向私有仓库的托管 Pro 版 GitHub App。", "highlights": ["71 个 agent、311 个技能与 97 个命令的插件化分发", "AgentShield 扫描 prompts、hooks、MCP 配置、权限与密钥", "hooks、记忆、会话摘要与持续学习等运行时机制", "提供 npx/pnpm/yarn/bun 引导式安装与 dry-run 预检"], "use_cases": ["为 Claude Code 或 Codex 安装统一的计划-测试-审查工作流", "扫描 agent 相关配置中的密钥与权限风险", "把反复成功的做法沉淀为可复用的技能与规则包"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["agent工具链", "编码助手插件", "开发者工具", "安全扫描"], "domain": "开发者工具/Agent 基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L98: Your agent can write code, but ECC gives it a coordinated engineering system and toolbox: it plans before it builds, ver", "L108: ECC is MIT-licensed open source. It works best with Claude Code today, has native Codex and Qoder plugin paths, and prov", "L110: Access to 71 agents, 311 skills, and 97 legacy command shims, plus hooks, rules, memory, continuous learning, and AgentS"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [296], "quotes": ["This is intentional. Anthropic marketplace/plugin installs are keyed by a canonical plugin identifier, so ECC uses `ecc@"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [139, 177, 178, 179, 180, 191, 205], "quotes": ["npx ecc-universal@2.2.3 setup", "|npm / npx|`npx ecc-universal@2.2.3 setup`|", "|pnpm|`pnpm dlx ecc-universal@2.2.3 setup`|", "|Yarn 2+|`yarn dlx ecc-universal@2.2.3 setup`|", "|Bun|`bunx ecc-universal@2.2.3 setup`|", "npx ecc-universal@2.2.3 install --guided", "npx ecc-universal@2.2.3 install --guided \\"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "compat", "lines": [266, 267], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC.git", "cd ECC"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [56, 108, 130, 132, 198], "note": "主要目标 harness，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["## Install with Claude Code", "ECC is MIT-licensed open source. It works best with Claude Code today, has native Codex and Qoder plugin paths, and prov", "> ECC 2.2 includes guided package setup for Claude Code, Codex, and Kimi Code.", "> requires Git and Claude Code 2.1 or newer on `PATH`.", "|Claude Code|Native `ecc@ecc` plugin with one `user`, `project`, or `local` scope and an ECC hook profile|"]}, {"term": "Kimi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [130, 186, 194, 200], "quotes": ["> ECC 2.2 includes guided package setup for Claude Code, Codex, and Kimi Code.", "The wizard inventories the official marketplace and every native Claude install scope before making changes, then instal", "It lets you select any combination of Claude Code, Codex, and Kimi Code, shows each install channel and destination, pre", "|Kimi Code|Managed project files under `./.kimi-code`; ECC hooks, model/provider settings, and authentication are not co"]}, {"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "mention", "lines": [108], "quotes": ["ECC is MIT-licensed open source. It works best with Claude Code today, has native Codex and Qoder plugin paths, and prov"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [108, 228], "quotes": ["ECC is MIT-licensed open source. It works best with Claude Code today, has native Codex and Qoder plugin paths, and prov", "ECC also ships advanced managed adapters for `cursor`, `antigravity`, `gemini`, `opencode`, `codebuddy`, `joycode`, `qwe"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [108, 228], "quotes": ["ECC is MIT-licensed open source. It works best with Claude Code today, has native Codex and Qoder plugin paths, and prov", "ECC also ships advanced managed adapters for `cursor`, `antigravity`, `gemini`, `opencode`, `codebuddy`, `joycode`, `qwe"]}, {"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "mention", "lines": [563], "quotes": ["`/astra-review` sends Claude-written code to GPT-6-Astra for an independent cross-provider review. It runs the locally i"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "05ecfe9c2cfd": {"fn": "morluto/rea", "sha": "05ecfe9c2cfd", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 agent 接入逆向工程工具的 MCP 服务器，从应用行为到原生二进制", "review": "REA 以 MCP 服务器形式将 agent 连接到逆向工程工具集，可检视原生二进制、JavaScript/Electron 应用、.NET 程序集、Android APK、网站、网络抓包等 20 类目标；返回结论附带证据与局限，分析在本地运行。原生深度分析需调用已有的 Hopper、Ghidra 或 IDA 安装；静态 JavaScript/.NET 检视无需原生引擎。通过 `npx rea-agents setup` 向 agent 注册并安装工作流说明，也提供 CLI（`rea`）在终端直接使用。要求 Node.js 22.19+/24.11+/26+ 与 npm。", "highlights": ["单一 MCP 服务器覆盖原生二进制、JS/Electron、.NET、APK、固件、抓包等约 20 类分析目标", "支持 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、Gemini CLI 等多种 agent，其他客户端可手动注册 MCP", "原生分析可复用已有 Hopper/Ghidra/IDA 安装，也可配合 objdump、Rizin、JADX、pwntools 等", "结果附带证据与局限说明，分析在本地运行"], "use_cases": ["想了解某应用功能如何实现，让 agent 检视无源码的应用并给出证据", "分析 APK、固件或二进制的结构、符号与反编译结果", "从 Electron 应用目录或 ASAR 提取模块、导入与 IPC 边界", "在终端用 CLI 命令做快照与脚本化分析"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["逆向工程", "MCP服务器", "二进制分析", "CLI工具", "agent工具"], "domain": "开发者工具/逆向工程", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供简体中文等多语言版本"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L6: ### One MCP for reverse engineering across binaries, applications, and runtime behavior.", "L41: REA connects your agent to tools for inspecting native binaries, JavaScript and Electron apps, .NET assemblies, and webs", "L43: Setup registers REA with your agent and installs matching workflow instructions. Native analysis can use an existing Hop", "L66: Setup supports Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Grok Build and"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "none", "lines": [66], "note": "L66 提到的是 Claude Code（agent 产品），非 Anthropic 模型接入", "quotes": ["Setup supports Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Grok Build and"]}, {"term": "xai", "rel": "none", "lines": [66], "note": "L66 提到的是 Grok Build（agent 产品），非 xAI 模型接入", "quotes": ["Setup supports Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Grok Build and"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [23, 59, 94, 122], "note": "npx rea-agents setup / npm install --global rea-agents 为本产品安装途径", "quotes": ["<code>npx rea-agents setup</code>", "npx rea-agents setup", "npm install --global rea-agents", "npx rea-agents@latest setup"]}, {"term": "go", "rel": "none", "lines": [149], "note": "L149 说明分析 Go 二进制无需安装 Go，与安装本产品无关", "quotes": ["|Go binaries|Embedded compiler version, modules, replacements and build settings|Built-in static ELF/PE/thin Mach-O insp"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [66, 230], "note": "被支持的 agent 客户端，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["Setup supports Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Grok Build and", "Any agent that supports local MCP servers. Setup configures the"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [66], "note": "被支持的 agent 客户端，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["Setup supports Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Grok Build and"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "4ab412d23539": {"fn": "NousResearch/hermes-agent", "sha": "4ab412d23539", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "自学习循环的个人 AI Agent，可在多终端与消息平台运行", "review": "Nous Research 开发的命令行 Agent：运行时通过内建学习循环创建与改进技能、维护长期记忆与用户模型，并支持跨会话检索历史对话。提供完整 TUI 终端界面与消息网关（Telegram、Discord、Slack、WhatsApp、Signal、Email），内置 cron 调度、子 Agent 并行、七种终端后端（local/Docker/SSH/Singularity/Modal/Daytona/Vercel Sandbox），并面向训练用途提供轨迹批量生成与压缩。安装脚本覆盖 Linux/macOS/WSL2、原生 Windows 与 Android/Termux。", "highlights": ["内建学习循环：技能自动创建、使用中改进、Agent 主动持久化记忆", "单一网关进程接入 Telegram/Discord/Slack/WhatsApp/Signal/CLI 六个入口", "七种终端后端，含 Modal/Daytona 的无服务器持久化", "从 OpenClaw 一键迁移设置、记忆、技能与 API key"], "use_cases": ["在云 VPS 上挂一个长期运行的助手，从 Telegram 随时对话", "用自然语言配置每日报告、夜间备份等定时任务", "为工具调用模型训练批量生成执行轨迹"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AI助手/Agent", "CLI工具", "消息网关", "技能学习", "自动化"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L15: **The self-improving AI agent built by Nous Research.** It's the only agent with a built-in learning loop — it creates s", "L21:  A closed learning loop Agent-curated memory with periodic nudges. Autonomous skill creation after complex tasks. Skills", "L24:  Runs anywhere, not just your laptop Seven terminal backends — local, Docker, SSH, Singularity, Modal, Daytona, and Verc"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "openrouter", "rel": "mention", "lines": [17, 176], "quotes": ["Use any model you want — Nous Portal, OpenRouter, OpenAI, your own endpoint, and many others. Switch with `hermes model`", "- **API keys** — allowlisted secrets (Telegram, OpenRouter, OpenAI, Anthropic, ElevenLabs)"]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "cf104af98852": {"fn": "obra/superpowers", "sha": "cf104af98852", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给编码 agent 的技能框架与软件开发方法论", "review": "Superpowers 是一套面向编码 agent 的软件开发方法论，由一组可组合的技能与启动指令构成。技能按阶段自动触发：先通过头脑风暴澄清需求并产出设计文档，再生成细粒度实现计划，随后以子 agent 驱动或内联方式执行任务，强制红绿 TDD、代码评审与分支收尾流程。以插件形式分发到 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、Gemini CLI 等多种编码工具，另提供企业商业支持联系方式。", "highlights": ["可组合技能库：测试、调试、协作、元技能四类（如 TDD、系统化调试、git worktree）", "brainstorming→计划→子 agent 执行→评审→分支收尾的七步工作流，技能自动触发", "提供 diagnosing-superpowers 技能，读取会话记录定位流程异常", "支持十余种编码工具的插件安装途径"], "use_cases": ["让编码 agent 在写代码前先澄清需求并产出设计文档", "以子 agent 分派任务并附带两阶段评审的自动化开发流程", "强制执行 TDD 与代码评审约束的团队开发", "排查编码 agent 会话中技能未触发或偏离计划的问题"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["编码agent", "软件开发方法论", "技能框架", "TDD"], "domain": "AI 编程工具/开发流程", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Superpowers is a complete software development methodology for your coding agents, built on top of a set of composable s", "L15: Next up, once you say \"go\", it launches a *subagent-driven-development* process, having agents work through each enginee", "L29: Superpowers is available via the official Claude plugin marketplace"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [27, 29, 33, 36], "quotes": ["### Claude Code", "Superpowers is available via the official Claude plugin marketplace", "- Install the plugin from Anthropic's official marketplace:", "  /plugin install superpowers@claude-plugins-official"]}, {"term": "xai", "rel": "mention", "lines": [159, 161, 163, 166], "quotes": ["### Grok Build CLI", "Superpowers is available via the official Grok plugin marketplace.", "- Install the plugin from xAI's official marketplace:", "  grok plugin install superpowers@xai-official --trust"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [266], "quotes": ["  git clone https://github.com/obra/superpowers.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [27, 41, 226, 254], "quotes": ["### Claude Code", "The Superpowers marketplace provides Superpowers and some other related plugins for Claude Code.", "Qwen Code installs plugins from Claude Code marketplaces directly.", "Superpowers is available as a native Muse plugin — same repo, same skills, all harnesses. The `using-superpowers` bootst"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [93, 95], "quotes": ["### Cursor", "- In Cursor Agent chat, install from marketplace:"]}, {"term": "Devin", "rel": "mention", "lines": [103, 108], "quotes": ["### Devin CLI", "  devin plugins install obra/superpowers"]}, {"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "mention", "lines": [145, 150, 156], "quotes": ["### GitHub Copilot CLI", "  copilot plugin marketplace add obra/superpowers-marketplace", "  copilot plugin install superpowers@superpowers-marketplace"]}, {"term": "Kimi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [175, 177], "quotes": ["### Kimi Code", "Superpowers is available in Kimi Code's plugin marketplace."]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [224, 226, 231], "quotes": ["### Qwen Code", "Qwen Code installs plugins from Claude Code marketplaces directly.", "  qwen extensions install obra/superpowers"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "0397f17f6156": {"fn": "tensorflow/tensorflow", "sha": "0397f17f6156", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向研究者与开发者的端到端开源机器学习平台", "review": "端到端开源机器学习平台，提供工具、库与社区资源，供研究者推进 ML 研究并让开发者构建和部署 ML 应用。最初由 Google Brain 机器智能团队的研究者与工程师开发。提供稳定的 Python 与 C++ API，并为其他语言提供非保证向后兼容的 API。通过 pip 安装，含 CUDA GPU 支持包与 CPU-only 精简包，另有 nightly 测试包与 Docker 容器、源码构建途径。", "highlights": ["端到端机器学习平台，含工具、库与社区资源生态", "稳定 Python 与 C++ API，其他语言 API 非保证向后兼容", "pip 安装含 GPU（CUDA）包 tensorflow 与 CPU-only 包 tensorflow-cpu", "官方构建覆盖 Linux/macOS/Windows/Android(LiteRT)/树莓派"], "use_cases": ["训练与部署机器学习/深度神经网络模型", "在 Ubuntu/Windows 上使用 CUDA GPU 加速训练", "在 Android 或树莓派等平台部署模型"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": "cpu-ok", "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "line