ch claude", "Supported integrations include Claude Code, Codex, Copilot CLI, DeepSeek Harness, Droid, and OpenCode."]}, {"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "mention", "lines": [145, 147, 153, 174], "note": "社区客户端描述中提及", "quotes": ["- LibreChat - Enhanced ChatGPT clone with multi-provider support", "- NextChat - Cross-platform ChatGPT UI (docs)", "- Chatbot UI - ChatGPT-style web interface", "- macai - macOS client for Ollama and ChatGPT"]}, {"term": "Perplexity", "rel": "mention", "lines": [148], "note": "社区项目自称其开源替代", "quotes": ["- Perplexica - AI-powered search engine, open-source Perplexity alternative"]}, {"term": "Dify", "rel": "mention", "lines": [162], "note": "社区集成列表提及", "quotes": ["- Dify.AI - LLM app development platform"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [197], "note": "社区项目自称其开源替代", "quotes": ["- Void - Open source AI code editor, Cursor alternative"]}, {"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [216, 217, 219, 223, 225], "note": "社区库列表中多个 LangChain 变体", "quotes": ["- LangChain4j - Java LangChain (example)", "- LangChainGo - Go LangChain (example)", "- LangChain and LangChain.js with example", "- LangChainRust - Rust LangChain (example)", "- Elixir LangChain - Elixir LangChain"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "d9b3cba04445": {"fn": "Significant-Gravitas/AutoGPT", "sha": "d9b3cba04445", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向用户与开发者的 AI agent 构建与运行平台", "review": "AutoGPT 提供构建、部署和运行 AI agent 的开源平台，支持用自然语言描述任务（AutoPilot）或在可视化画布（Build）中逐步编排工作流，agent 可按需、按计划或由触发器运行。平台包含 Agents 仪表盘与 Marketplace 社区 agent 市场，连接 45+ 平台与数百个 AI 模型。提供托管 Platform（付费、含模型访问）与自托管（免费、需自备 Docker 基础设施与模型 API key）两条路径；原独立版 AutoGPT Classic 保留于 classic/ 目录，采用 MIT 许可证。", "highlights": ["AutoPilot 对话转 agent 与可视化 Build 画布两种构建方式", "45+ 平台集成（Gmail、GitHub、Slack、Notion 等）", "托管 Platform 与自托管双路径，同一代码仓库", "AutoGPT Classic 以 MIT 许可证保留在 classic/ 目录"], "use_cases": ["用自然语言把日常流程变成定时或触发式运行的 agent", "自托管平台并接入