ollection of **prompts** for AI chat models. Originally created for ChatGPT, these prompts work great with an"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [104], "note": "提供插件安装渠道", "quotes": ["### Claude Code Plugin"]}, {"term": "Windsurf", "rel": "mention", "lines": [180], "note": "致谢开发工具", "quotes": [" Built with Windsurf and Devin"]}, {"term": "Devin", "rel": "mention", "lines": [180], "note": "致谢开发工具", "quotes": [" Built with Windsurf and Devin"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [191, 193, 195], "note": "源码 MIT，提示词内容 CC0", "quotes": ["This project is dual-licensed:", "- **Source code and site-authored content** is licensed under the MIT License,", "- **Prompt content and data** (prompts.csv, PROMPTS.md, user-submitted prompts) is dedicated to the public domain under "]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "108bf7e29c09": {"fn": "AUTOMATIC1111/stable-diffusion-webui", "sha": "108bf7e29c09", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给创作者提供 Stable Diffusion 的浏览器图像生成界面", "review": "基于 Gradio 实现的 Stable Diffusion Web 界面，提供 txt2img 与 img2img 两种生成模式，附带外绘、内绘、提示词矩阵、放大（RealESRGAN/SwinIR 等）、Textual Inversion、Lora、检查点合并、批量处理、CLIP 反推提示词、API 等功能。通过一键脚本安装运行，支持 NVidia GPU、AMD GPU、Intel CPU/GPU 与 Ascend NPU，也给出 Windows/Linux/Apple Silicon 的安装说明；生成参数可保存于图像元数据中供还原。", "highlights": ["txt2img 与 img2img 两种生成模式及内绘/外绘", "集成 GFPGAN、CodeFormer、RealESRGAN 等修复与放大网络", "生成参数写入 PNG/EXIF 元数据并可一键还原", "提供 API 与社区扩展脚本机制"], "use_cases": ["在本地浏览器界面里用提示词生成和修改图像", "对已有图片做内绘、外绘或放大修复", "训练和使用 Textual Inversion 嵌入与 Lora", "合并多个 Stable Diffusion 检查点模型"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "viral", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "消费者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["图像生成", "Stable Diffusion", "Web UI", "扩散模型"], "domain": "AIGC/图像生成", "alternative_to": [], "competitors