的应用原型并快速迭代", "构建需要编排多步骤任务的 agent 工作流", "在实验中切换比较不同模型供应商"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM框架", "agent开发", "应用开发"], "domain": "LLM 应用开发框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L14: LangChain is a framework for building agents and LLM-powered applications. It helps you chain together interoperable com", "L22: uv add langchain"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [9, 10, 22], "quotes": [" PyPI - License", " PyPI - Downloads", "uv add langchain"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [14, 17, 22], "quotes": ["LangChain is a framework for building agents and LLM-powered applications. It helps you chain together interoperable com", "> Just getting started? Check out **Deep Agents** — a higher-level package built on LangChain for agents that have built", "uv add langchain"]}]}}, "ddfcabf56d8c": {"fn": "github/spec-kit", "sha": "ddfcabf56d8c", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 AI 编码代理提供结构化流程与模板的工具包", "review": "开源工具包，为 AI 编码代理提供结构化流程、可复用模板与文档化产物。内置规格驱动开发（SDD）流程，附带可选的 bug 修复与想法评估扩展，并提供扩展、预设、工作流、捆绑包、目录等组合机制用于定制或自建流程。以 CLI 形式安装，依赖 Python 3.11+ 与 uv，在代理聊天中以 /speckit-* 技能形式调用。MIT 许可。", "highlights": ["内置 SDD 流程：specify → plan → tasks → implement → converge", "扩展、预设、工作流、捆绑包等组合机制可定制或自建流程", "bug 修复与想法评估作为可选扩展按需安装", 