作", "在自有 Python 应用中嵌入可配置模型的浏览器 agent", "给 Claude Code 等编码 agent 增加浏览器控制能力", "在无 Chrome 的服务器/CI 环境用云浏览器跑自动化"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["浏览器自动化", "AI Agent", "网页操作", "MCP/工具集成"], "domain": "AI Agent/浏览器自动化", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L41:  Three ways to use Browser Use: the hosted V4 agent, the Browser Use CLI, or the open source Python library. All three d", "L160: - **Python Library:** Run the open source agent in your own application, with custom tools, structured output, and your ", "L202: The Python library is free and MIT-licensed. Model inference and hosted browsers are separate: API providers, including "], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [124, 126, 131, 133], "note": "提供 Claude 浏览器工具集官方集成，基于 Anthropic SDK", "quotes": ["Maintained by Browser Use. Compatible with Claude.", "Use Claude's browser toolset with Browser Use as the driver. Browser Use", " Claude uses Browser Use browser actions and Bash through the Anthropic SDK. The browser can be local or remote; Bash ru", "Requires an Anthropic SDK version that includes `anthropic.tools.browser`."]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "mention", "lines": [202], "note": "FAQ 提及可用 Ollama 本地模型", "quotes": ["The Python library is free and MIT-licensed. Model inference and hosted browsers are separate: API providers, including "]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [74], "quotes": ["uv add browser-use"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [59, 159], "note": "可接入本产品的既有 agent，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["Paste this prompt into Claude Code, Codex, Hermes, OpenClaw, or your favorite agent.", "- **CLI:** Give an existing agent (Claude Code, Codex, Hermes, OpenClaw, Pi, Cursor, etc.) browser access. You can use i"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [159], "note": "同上", "quotes": ["- **CLI:** Give an existing agent (Claude Code, Codex, Hermes, OpenClaw, Pi, Cursor, etc.) browser access. You can use i"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "f790443f2802": {"fn": "JuliusBrussee/caveman", "sha": "f790443f2802", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给编码 agent 省token的代理与技能：压缩回答与读取内容", "review": "以 CLI 安装的代理加技能组合，让编码 agent 用受控短语风格输出，压缩日志、JSON、CSV、测试输出等模型读取内容；包含六项功能：短回答、读前压缩、按任务选模型与effort的 Auto、脚本复用 Blocks、token 浪费修复、网页压缩。通过 npx 一条命令覆盖 Mac/Linux/Windows，需 Node.js 22.13+，在本机以用户自己的密钥与登录运行，支持 Claude Code、Codex、Gemini CLI 等 30+ agent；README 标注部分测量为中期数据或未复测。", "highlights": ["短回答技能：同一修复 63 token 降至 20，代码与命令保持原样", "读前压缩：日志/JSON/CSV/测试输出整体会话输入 token 减少 33.2%（README 自报）", "Auto 模式按任务选择模型与 effort，README 自报成本降 54%", "Blocks 代码模式：脚本保留在仓库并在 PR 检查，提供 8 个内置 block"], "use_cases": ["降低 Claude Code 等 agent 的日常 token 开销", "压缩 agent 读取的大体积日志与测试输出", "按任务难度自动分配模型档位以控制成本"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "Adobe Research CAVEWOMAN paper（README 提及引用本仓库）", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["prompt工程", "token优化", "编码agent", "代理/中间件"], "domain": "LLM 工具链/开发效率", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5: **Caveman make your AI agent say less and read less. Code stay exact. Brain still big.**", "L47: One command. Mac, Linux, Windows. Caveman find your agents and your logins, show what it change. Press Enter. Done. Need", "L49: After that, plain `claude` stays caveman'd. So do Codex, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, and 30+ more. It runs on your machine, wi"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [49, 174, 180, 183, 211], "note": "Auto 默认 Claude 模型；warm cache 针对 Anthropic prompt cache", "quotes": ["After that, plain `claude` stays caveman'd. So do Codex, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, and 30+ more. It runs on your machine, wi", "|**Auto**, plus OpenAI and open models|42.9%|$3.47|16.7 min|", "caveman providers add openai   # optional: give Auto more models, on your own key", "Works in Claude Code, OpenCode, and Codex on a ChatGPT login, with API keys, Claude Pro/Max, or ChatGPT. Any other model", "|Warm cache · new|Step away and the provider forgets your session, so the next ask pays full price. Caveman keeps Anthro"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [44, 108, 136, 140, 142], "quotes": ["npx @caveman-ai/cli@latest", "npx skills add JuliusBrussee/caveman -g", "irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman/v4.0.1/install.ps1 | iex", "`npx --allow-git=root -y github:JuliusBrussee/caveman#v4.0.1`", "Changed your mind: `npx -y github:JuliusBrussee/caveman -- --uninstall` (on npm 12+, add `--allow-git=root` too)"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [12, 120, 126, 152], "note": "被支持的目标 agent，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": [" 33.2% fewer input tokens, whole sessions 54 Claude Code runs, 18 of 18 answers right", "# Claude Code plugin, auto-starts every interactive session, subagents too", "Already inside Claude Code? Same rock, slash form. Type these where you talk to Claude:", "|File type|The file, through caveman|File saved|Whole Claude Code session, 3 runs|Session saved|"]}, {"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "mention", "lines": [103], "quotes": ["\"Be concise\" is the real baseline; new models already know it. On top of it, `/caveman` cuts 3% more at the median and `"]}, {"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "mention", "lines": [183], "quotes": ["Works in Claude Code, OpenCode, and Codex on a ChatGPT login, with API keys, Claude Pro/Max, or ChatGPT. Any other model"]}, {"term": "Vercel AI SDK", "rel": "mention", "lines": [214], "quotes": ["|Middleware|Same shrinking inside the Vercel AI SDK, LangChain, OpenAI, or Anthropic call you already make. TypeScript ·"]}, {"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [214], "note": "middleware 可嵌入的框架", "quotes": ["|Middleware|Same shrinking inside the Vercel AI SDK, LangChain, OpenAI, or Anthropic call you already make. TypeScript ·"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "73a471ddb228": {"fn": "supabase/supabase", "sha": "73a471ddb228", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 Web/移动/AI 应用开发者提供 Postgres 后端开发平台", "review": "基于 Postgres 的开发平台，将数据库、认证授权、自动生成 API、实时订阅、函数、文件存储与向量嵌入工具集组合为一体化后端。架构由 PostgREST、GoTrue、Realtime、Storage、pg_graphql 等开源组件构成。提供托管平台（注册即用）与自托管/本地开发两种方式；官方客户端库覆盖 JavaScript、Flutter、Swift、Python、Kotlin 等，并有 C#、Go、Java、Ruby、Rust、Godot 等社区库。README 未列出安装命令与硬件要求。", "highlights": ["托管 Postgres 数据库与认证授权、REST/GraphQL 自动生成 API", "Realtime 通过 websocket 广播数据库变更（基于 Elixir 服务器）", "AI + Vector/Embeddings Toolkit 与 pg_graphql 扩展", "多语言官方客户端库（JS/Flutter/Swift/Python/Kotlin 等）"], "use_cases": ["为 Web 或移动应用搭建带认证与实时功能的 Postgres 后端", "为 AI 应用存储和检索向量嵌入", "自托管一套开源的 Firebase 类后端服务", "用 Edge Functions 编写服务端逻辑"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Postgres", "后端即服务", "数据库", "向量检索", "认证"], "domain": "开发者平台/数据库", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Supabase is the Postgres development platform. We're building the features of Firebase using enterprise-grade open sourc", "L15: - [x] AI + Vector/Embeddings Toolkit. Docs", "L43: Supabase is a hosted platform. You can sign up and start using Supabase without installing anything."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "6ba1a9901bc5": {"fn": "openai/whisper", "sha": "6ba1a9901bc5", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为开发者提供多语言语音识别与翻译的开源模型", "review": "OpenAI 发布的通用语音识别模型，基于 Transformer 序列到序列架构，在大规模多语言音频数据上训练，可执行多语言语音识别、语音翻译、语言识别与语音活动检测，以单一模型替代传统多级语音处理流水线。提供 6 种模型规模（含 turbo 加速版），附带命令行工具与 Python API，依赖 ffmpeg 处理音频。代码与模型权重以 MIT 许可发布。", "highlights": ["单一模型支持多语言识别、语音翻译、语言识别与语音活动检测", "提供 6 种模型规模（tiny 至 large，含 turbo），各档标注显存需求与相对速度", "提供 CLI 与 Python 两种使用方式，代码与模型权重均以 MIT 许可发布"], "use_cases": ["将多语言音频文件转写为文本", "把非英语语音翻译为英语", "识别音频所属语言"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2212.04356", "demo_url": "https://colab.research.google.com/github/openai/whisper/blob/master/notebooks/LibriSpeech.ipynb", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "link