 agent that brings the power of Gemini directly", "L124: ## 🔐 Authentication Options", "L308: Configure MCP servers in `~/.gemini/settings.json` to extend Gemini CLI with"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [41, 42, 48, 85, 95], "quotes": ["# Using npx (no installation required)", "npx @google/gemini-cli", "npm install -g @google/gemini-cli", "npm install -g @google/gemini-cli@preview", "npm install -g @google/gemini-cli@latest"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "support", "lines": [51, 54], "quotes": ["#### Install globally with Homebrew (macOS/Linux)", "brew install gemini-cli"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "mention", "lines": [236], "note": "示例中 git clone 本仓库用于演示，非安装途径", "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": true, "lines": [3, 4], "note": "免费层与 Google One 用户已于 2026-06-18 被 Antigravity CLI 取代"}}}, "89caefa5d882": {"fn": "pytorch/pytorch", "sha": "89caefa5d882", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给开发者的 GPU 加速张量计算与动态神经网络 Python 库", "review": "提供 GPU 加速的 NumPy 式张量计算与基于 tape 机制的自动微分动态神经网络，组件包括 torch、torch.autograd、torch.nn、torch.multiprocessing 与 torch.utils。定位为深度学习研究平台，强调 Python 优先集成、命令式执行、可扩展的 C/C++ 扩展 API。安装途径为官网提供的 conda/pip 二进制，或从源码构建（需 Python 3.10+、C++20 编译器、10 GB 磁盘等），并分别给出 CUDA、ROCm、Intel GPU 的构建说明。", "highlights": ["GPU 加速张量计算与基于 tape 的自动微分", "组件划分：torch / autograd / nn / multiprocessing / utils", "支持 CUDA、AMD ROCm、Intel GPU 三类 GPU 后端构建", "提供二进制（conda/pip）与源码两种安装途径"], "use_cases": ["用 GPU 加速替代 NumPy 做科学计算", "搭建并训练深度神经网络模型", "用 Python 编写自定义神经网络层并通过扩展 API 接入 C/C++"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": "cpu-ok", "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "科