6], "note": "兼容的订阅接入方式", "quotes": ["- [x] 兼容 胜算云、APIMart、Cloudflare AI Gateway、魔搭 ModelScope、AIHubMix、AIML API、EvoLink、OpenRouter、API Route、Fluxion AI、Ollam"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "a845d6084b77": {"fn": "thedotmack/claude-mem", "sha": "a845d6084b77", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 AI 编码 Agent 提供跨会话持久记忆的压缩与注入系统", "review": "以 Claude Code 为主要目标的上下文记忆压缩系统：通过生命周期钩子自动捕获会话中的工具使用观察，生成语义摘要存入 SQLite 与 Chroma 向量库，并在后续会话启动时注入相关上下文。提供 4 个 MCP 搜索工具与三层渐进式检索流程以控制 token 消耗，经 npx 安装器或插件市场接入 Claude Code、OpenCode、T3 Code、OpenClaw 等宿主。安装时需登录或显式指定 provider，免费试用结束后回落到 Anthropic 计划。", "highlights": ["生命周期钩子自动捕获会话观察并生成语义摘要", "SQLite + FTS5 与 Chroma 混合检索（语义+关键词）", "4 个 MCP 搜索工具，三层渐进式检索节省 token", "多宿主支持：Claude Code、OpenCode、T3 Code、OpenClaw、Antigravity 等"], "use_cases": ["让编码 Agent 在新会话中延续之前的项目上下文", "用自然语言检索项目历史操作记录", "在团队共享记忆空间中协作与交接任务"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Agent记忆", "上下文工程", "编码助手", "Claude Code插件", "MCP"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 记忆", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["提供简体中文等多语言 README（L13）", "支持 code--zh 中文观察模式（L320）"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L46:  Persistent memory compression system built for Claude Code.", "L103:  Claude-Mem seamlessly preserves context across sessions by automatically capturing tool usage observations, generating ", "L235: 1. **Lifecycle Hooks** - SessionStart, UserPromptSubmit, PreToolUse, PostToolUse, Stop, SessionEnd. Each is one shell-fr"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [123, 281], "note": "提及 Anthropic 计划与 Claude Code 要求，非专门 provider 接入", "quotes": ["The installer sets everything up first, then asks you to sign in to claude-mem in your browser (email magic link — no ca", "- **Claude Code**: Latest version with plugin support"]}, {"term": "xai", "rel": "mention", "lines": [107, 110, 115], "note": "Grok Bot 为宿主 IDE，非模型 provider 接入", "quotes": ["Install claude-mem for Grok Bot:", "npx claude-mem install --ide grok-bot", "**Awareness push pilot (LFG + Orifice):** needle observations (`decision`, `bugfix`, `security_alert`, `sensitive`) are "]}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "mention", "lines": [123], "note": "作为可选记忆 provider 的 key 被提及", "quotes": ["The installer sets everything up first, then asks you to sign in to claude-mem in your browser (email magic link — no ca"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "mention", "lines": [155, 162], "note": "DeepSeek Harness 为宿主插件，非模型接入", "quotes": ["Or install the native Pi extension or DeepSeek Harness plugin:", "Pi and DeepSeek Harness use the worker runtime. See native harness setup for capture, recall, and troubleshooting."]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [110, 120, 130, 138, 146], "note": "npx claude-mem install 为主要安装途径；npm install -g 仅装 SDK（L174）", "quotes": ["npx claude-mem install --ide grok-bot", "npx claude-mem install", "npx claude-mem install --ide opencode", "npx claude-mem install --ide t3code", "npx claude-mem install --ide antigravity"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [46, 164, 172], "note": "主要宿主环境，非替代/竞品", "quotes": [" Persistent memory compression system built for Claude Code.", "Or install from the plugin marketplace inside Claude Code:", "Restart Claude Code. Context from previous sessions will automatically appear in new sessions."]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [113], "note": "声明安装本插件不会安装 Cursor", "quotes": ["Grok Bot has no host hooks, so we watch the chat log files. Default is CMEM Pro, the hosted memory. Local observer is op"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "4c1687bc7263": {"fn": "Panniantong/Agent-Reach", "sha": "4c1687bc7263", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 AI Agent 一键配置读取与搜索互联网渠道的 CLI 能力层", "review": "Agent Reach 定位为能力层：为 Claude Code、OpenClaw、Cursor 等可执行命令行的 Agent 选型、安装并体检各平台的读取工具，覆盖网页、YouTube、RSS、GitHub、Twitter、B站、Reddit、小红书等 17 个渠道。每个平台维护「首选+备选」的有序后端列表，按序真实探测选择可用路径，接入方式失效时切换路由。凭据仅存本地，`agent-reach doctor` 可诊断各渠道状态；安装默认只读检查，显式 `--system` 才修改系统。", "highlights": ["17 个平台渠道，6 个零配置即用，其余按引导配置登录态", "每平台「首选+备选」多后端路由，失效自动换路径", "agent-reach doctor 一条命令诊断各渠道可用性", "凭据本地存储、默认不修改系统的安全安装流程"], "use_cases": ["让 Agent 帮我读 YouTube 字幕、搜 B站、刷小红书内容", "给新装的 Agent 一句话配好各平台读取环境", "平台接口被封后不用自己折腾，切换到可用路由"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["agent-infrastructure", "网络读取/搜索", "CLI工具", "MCP"], "domain": "AI Agent 基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["全中文 README", "支持 B站/小红书/Boss直聘/雪球等国内平台", "提供 AtomGit 国内镜像", "作者联系方式为 foxmail 邮箱与微信"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L75: |🤖 **兼容所有 Agent**|Claude Code、OpenClaw、Cursor、Windsurf……任何能跑命令行的 Agent 都能用|", "L165: **Agent Reach 是一个能力层（capability layer），不是又一个工具。**", "L178: ├── twitter.py      → twitter-cli ▸ OpenCLI ▸ bird"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["pypi"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "deepseek", "rel": "mention", "lines": [32], "note": "赞助商广告中提及的模型，非本产品接入对象", "quotes": [" 优刻得星图astraflow大模型，支持200+模型一键调用：内置 Kimi K3、DeepSeek V4/V3、Qwen 3、GLM5.2、happyhorse等全球领先开源大模型，无需自训，开箱即用"]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [75, 118], "note": "提及 Claude Code 等兼容 Agent，未提及 Anthropic 官方接入", "quotes": ["|🤖 **兼容所有 Agent**|Claude Code、OpenClaw、Cursor、Windsurf……任何能跑命令行的 Agent 都能用|", "> 设置后重启 Gateway（`openclaw gateway restart`）并开启新对话即可。其他平台（Claude Code、Cursor、Windsurf 等）不受此限制。"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [141, 248], "note": "明确提示不要从 PyPI 安装同名包；pip uninstall 为卸载方式", "quotes": ["1. **安装 CLI 工具** — 从本仓库安装 `agent-reach` 命令行（自带 yt-dlp、feedparser；不要从 PyPI 安装同名包，它不是本项目）", "卸载 Python 包本身：`pip uninstall agent-reach`"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [32], "note": "赞助商广告中提及", "quotes": [" 优刻得星图astraflow大模型，支持200+模型一键调用：内置 Kimi K3、DeepSeek V4/V3、Qwen 3、GLM5.2、happyhorse等全球领先开源大模型，无需自训，开箱即用"]}, {"term": "Kimi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [32], "note": "赞助商广告中提及", "quotes": [" 优刻得星图astraflow大模型，支持200+模型一键调用：内置 Kimi K3、DeepSeek V4/V3、Qwen 3、GLM5.2、happyhorse等全球领先开源大模型，无需自训，开箱即用"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [75, 118, 120], "note": "支持的宿主 Agent 平台，非替代/竞品", "quotes": ["|🤖 **兼容所有 Agent**|Claude Code、OpenClaw、Cursor、Windsurf……任何能跑命令行的 Agent 都能用|", "> 设置后重启 Gateway（`openclaw gateway restart`）并开启新对话即可。其他平台（Claude Code、Cursor、Windsurf 等）不受此限制。", "复制这句话给你的 AI Agent（Claude Code、OpenClaw、Cursor 等）："]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [75, 118, 120], "note": "支持的宿主 Agent 平台", "quotes": ["|🤖 **兼容所有 Agent**|Claude Code、OpenClaw、Cursor、Windsurf……任何能跑命令行的 Agent 都能用|", "> 设置后重启 Gateway（`openclaw gateway restart`）并开启新对话即可。其他平台（Claude Code、Cursor、Windsurf 等）不受此限制。", "复制这句话给你的 AI Agent（Claude Code、OpenClaw、Cursor 等）："]}, {"term": "Windsurf", "rel": "mention", "lines": [75, 118], "note": "支持的宿主 Agent 平台", "quotes": ["|🤖 **兼容所有 Agent**|Claude Code、OpenClaw、Cursor、Windsurf……任何能跑命令行的 Agent 都能用|", "