 (Intel)**", "pip uninstall onnxruntime onnxruntime-openvino", "pip install onnxruntime-openvino==1.21.0", "**Note:** `onnxruntime-openvino` newer than 1.21.0 must be installed together with `openvino`, and the two versions must", "|onnxruntime-openvino|OpenVINO|"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [124], "quotes": ["git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/hacksider/Deep-Live-Cam.git"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [143, 186, 188, 237, 252], "quotes": ["pip install -r requirements.txt", "pip install -U torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128", "pip install onnxruntime-gpu==1.26.0", "pip install onnxruntime-coreml==1.21.0", "pip install onnxruntime-directml==1.21.0"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "support", "lines": [159, 221], "quotes": ["brew install python@3.14", "- If you get error about `_tkinter` missing, reinstall the tkinter package: `brew reinstall python-tk@3.14`"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [310], "note": "模型下载链接托管于 Hugging Face，非竞品/替代", "quotes": ["## Download all models in this huggingface link"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "b33840486af5": {"fn": "infiniflow/ragflow", "sha": "b33840486af5", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "企业级开源 RAG 引擎：融合 Agent 能力为 LLM 提供上下文层", "review": "RAGFlow 是 infiniflow 维护的开源检索增强生成引擎，结合 Agent 能力为 LLM 提供上下文层。核心机制包括基于模板的分块、文档/数据集级知识编译（生成 Wiki、图谱、树、思维导图等）、多步 Agentic 检索（Low 到 Ultra 四档思考模式）、可追溯引用的可视化分块。支持 Word、PDF、网页等异构数据源接入，提供 API 集成。本地部署支持 Docker 或源码构建，另提供 cloud.ragflow.io 云服务。注意源码构建依赖 Go 1.27、Clang 20 等工具链。", "highlights": ["模板化分块与文档可视化干预，引用可溯源", "知识编译生成 Wiki、Graph、Tree、PageIndex 等结构化产物", "Agentic 检索支持 Low/Medium/High/Ultra 四档思考模式", "支持 Word/PPT/Excel/PDF/网页等多格式数据源"], "use_cases": ["为企业知识库搭建检索增强问答系统", "对复杂格式文档做深度理解与知识提取", "用预置 Agent 模板构建生产级 AI 应用", "通过 API 将 RAG 能力集成到业务系统"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://demo.ragflow.io", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["RAG", "知识库问答", "Agent引擎", "文档解析", "企业搜索"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/RAG", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["简体/繁体中文自述文件", "infiniflow（英灵无限）"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L57: RAGFlow is a leading open-source Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) engine that fuses cutting-edge RAG with Agent capa", "L131: Local deployment supports both Docker deployment and launching from source. Docker is suitable for quick evaluation, int"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["npm"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [131, 133, 138, 187], "quotes": ["Local deployment supports both Docker deployment and launching from source. Docker is suitable for quick evaluation, int", "### 🐳 Docker Deployment", "- Docker ≥ 24.0.0, Docker Compose ≥ v2.26.1.", "   docker compose -f docker-compose.yml up -d"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [131, 227, 229, 251], "quotes": ["Local deployment supports both Docker deployment and launching from source. Docker is suitable for quick evaluation, int", "### 🔨 Launch from Source", "#### 📝 Source Build Prerequisites", "   ./build.sh --all"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "mention", "lines": [131, 299, 303], "note": "仅前端开发所需，非本产品安装途径", "quotes": ["Local deployment supports both Docker deployment and launching from source. Docker is suitable for quick evaluation, int", "7. Only when developing the frontend, install Node.js and npm, then start the React frontend:", "   npm inst