l/medium 三档部署规模", "提供 LLM 训练数据集构建流水线，并与 Dify、RAGFlow 等框架集成"], "use_cases": ["把 PDF 论文、报告批量转成 Markdown 喂给 RAG 知识库", "识别身份证、街景、书籍、工业部件等自然场景中的文字", "解析含表格、公式、印章、图表的复杂版面文档", "为 LLM 微调构建高质量的文本识别训练数据"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["OCR", "文档解析", "RAG 数据准备", "多语言识别"], "domain": "文档处理/OCR 与文档 AI", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["vllm", "cpu-infer"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供简体中文版本入口", "PP-OCRv6 原生支持中文", "支持中国藏文与孟加拉文等语言", "昆仑芯 XPU 硬件后端支持"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L17: **PaddleOCR converts PDF documents and images into structured, LLM-ready data (JSON/Markdown) with industry-leading accu", "L24: * **SOTA Document VLM**: Featuring **PaddleOCR-VL-1.6 (0.9B)**, the industry's leading lightweight vision-language model", "L39: * **LLM Data Flywheel**: A complete pipeline to build high-quality datasets, providing a sustainable \"Data Engine\" for f"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "bedrock", "rel": "none", "lines": [17], "note": "误命中：原文为 'bedrock' 比喻用法，非 AWS Bedrock", "quotes": ["**PaddleOCR converts PDF documents and images into structured, LLM-ready data (JSON/Markdown) with industry-leading accu"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [46], "note": "HPD-Parsing 支持 vLLM 定制化运行时推理", "quotes": ["- HPD-Parsing supports both OpenAI-compatible serving and local inference through a customized vLLM runtime, making it s"]}, {"term": "cpu-infer", "rel": "support", "lines": [56, 148], "quotes": [" - **Faster inference**: 5.2× CPU speedup (OpenVINO), 6.1× on Apple M4 (tiny), 0.13s on A100 GPU.", "- Accelerate inference using engines like OpenVINO, ONNX Runtime, TensorRT, or perform inference using ONNX format model"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [7], "quotes": ["PyPI Downloads"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Dify", "rel": "mention", "lines": [17, 38], "quotes": ["**PaddleOCR converts PDF documents and images into structured, LLM-ready data (JSON/Markdown) with industry-leading accu", "* **Seamless Integration**: The premier choice for the AI Agent ecosystem—deeply integrated with **Dify, RAGFlow, Pathwa"]}, {"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [58, 67, 83, 89], "note": "模型发布渠道与 Transformers 推理后端，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": [" - **Model availability**: All models are available on HuggingFace and ModelScope.", " - **Try it now**: Available on HuggingFace or our Official Website.", " * **Try it now**: Available on HuggingFace or our Official Website.", " - **PaddleOCR-VL** is a SOTA and resource-efficient model tailored for document parsing. Its core component is PaddleOC"]}, {"term": "文心一言", "rel": "mention", "lines": [89, 92], "note": "ERNIE-4.5-0.3B 为 PaddleOCR-VL 的语言模型组件", "quotes": [" - **PaddleOCR-VL** is a SOTA and resource-efficient model tailored for document parsing. Its core component is PaddleOC", " - **Compact yet Powerful VLM Architecture**: We present a novel vision-language model that is specifically designed for"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "285872f1693e": {"fn": "unclecode/crawl4ai", "sha": "285872f1693e", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 LLM 与 AI Agent 提供网页抓取，输出干净 Markdown", "review": "开源网页爬取与抓取库，把任意网页转换为面向 LLM 的 Markdown，用于 RAG、AI Agent 与数据管道。提供 Python 库、CLI（crwl）、Docker 自托管服务器与 Crawl4AI Cloud 托管服务四种形态；内置 CSS/XPath/正则等免 LLM 的结构化抽取策略，也支持接入任意 LLM 做 JSON 抽取；通过 Playwright 控制浏览器，支持会话、代理、深爬与自适应爬取。Apache 2.0 协议并要求署名。", "highlights": ["pip 安装后 crawl4ai-setup 一键配置浏览器", "CSS/XPath/正则免 LLM 抽取与 LLM 抽取策略并存", "Docker 自托管 REST API 与 MCP 端点，提供 AMD64/ARM64 镜像", "云服务提供 /scrape、/extract、/search、/serp、/answer 端点"], "use_cases": ["为 RAG 知识库把网页批量转成 Markdown 语料", "给 AI Agent 提供 MCP 形式的网页抓取工具", "用 CSS/XPath 模式从页面抽取结构化 JSON", "自托管爬取服务器供团队内部调用"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["网页爬取", "RAG", "数据抽取", "MCP", "LLM基础设施"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/数据抓取", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L19: Crawl4AI turns any website into clean, LLM-ready Markdown for RAG, AI agents and data pipelines. Run the open-source web", "L100: - 🔎 **CSS and XPath schemas**: fast extraction with no LLM (`JsonCssExtractionStrategy`, `JsonXPathExtractionStrategy`, ", "L157: pip install -U crawl4ai"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [53, 56, 137, 150], "note": "Claude Code 作为 MCP 接入示例，非 LLM provider 适配", "quotes": ["3. Give it to your AI agent. Claude Code shown; Codex, Cursor and OpenCode →", "   claude mcp add --transport http crawl4ai https://api.crawl4ai.com/mcp \\", "- 🤖 **MCP**: connect Claude Code and other agents to your own server.", "- 🤝 **MCP for your agent**: one line in Claude Code, Codex, Cursor or OpenCode. Docs →"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [26, 157, 168, 175], "quotes": ["pip install -U crawl4ai", "pip install -U crawl4ai", "Pre-release versions: `pip install crawl4ai --pre`", "pip install -e \".[all]\"     # or: pip install -