 {"fn": "rohitg00/ai-engineering-from-scratch", "sha": "04419059ebe5", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的 AI 工程免费开源课程（542 课/20 阶段）", "review": "以 MIT 许可发布的 AI 工程课程仓库，含 542 节课、20 个阶段，覆盖模型内部机制、检索管线与 agent 运行时，使用 Python、TypeScript、Rust、Julia。提供三种学习方式：网站阅读、编码 agent 当导师（通过 npx 安装 Agent Skills，支持 Codex、Claude Code 等宿主）、本地克隆运行代码。含 3 个带本地评分器的分阶段项目与十题定位测验生成个性化学习计划。", "highlights": ["542 节课、20 个阶段，提供 23 种语言翻译", "3 个分阶段项目（检索评估、trace 调试、工具调用防火墙）带本地评分器与参考实现", "AI 导师模式：npx skills add 安装后由 Codex/Claude Code 等宿主调用学习技能", "十题定位测验映射起点阶段并生成个性化学习计划"], "use_cases": ["系统学习模型内部、RAG 检索与 agent 运行时的实现原理", "让 Claude Code/Codex 充当课程导师逐课教学并出题", "只学 MCP 或 Agent Skills 时走 17 课/5 课的聚焦路线", "克隆仓库后本地运行课程代码并留存学习证据"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["课程/教程", "AI工程", "MCP", "Agent Skills", "编码agent导师"], "domain": "教育/AI 工程", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Implement model internals, retrieval pipelines, and agent runtimes. Test them, inspect failures, and keep the code and e", "L149: If Node.js, `npx`, and a skill-capable coding agent are already installed, your coding agent can become your tutor. A re", "L152: npx skills add rohitg00/ai-engineering-from-scratch"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [216], "note": "提及 Claude 认证导师课程，非模型接入适配", "quotes": ["|`claude-certification`|Certification tutor. Chooses CCAO-F, CCDV-F, CCAR-F, or CCAR-P; teaches each lesson; runs labs; "]}], "ins