ecomes a graph of agents: deep research over tho"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "compat", "lines": [69], "note": "/login 支持 Claude 订阅登录", "quotes": ["**Mix models without thinking about it.** Use the frontier models you love together with the cheap ones. Just sign in: `"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [51], "note": "npm i -g omo-ai 为官方安装途径之一", "quotes": ["Prefer a package manager? `bun add -g omo-ai` (or `npm i -g omo-ai`) installs the same OmO. The package is `omo-ai`; the"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "mention", "lines": [69], "note": "订阅登录支持的模型服务，非替代/竞品表述", "quotes": ["**Mix models without thinking about it.** Use the frontier models you love together with the cheap ones. Just sign in: `"]}, {"term": "Kimi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [69], "note": "订阅登录支持的模型服务", "quotes": ["**Mix models without thinking about it.** Use the frontier models you love together with the cheap ones. Just sign in: `"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [90], "note": "用户评价中提及取消 Cursor 订阅改用本产品", "quotes": ["> \"It made me cancel my Cursor subscription. Unbelievable things are happening in the open source community.\" - Arthur G"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [92], "note": "用户评价中与 Claude Code 对比", "quotes": ["> \"If Claude Code does in 7 days what a human does in 3 months, OmO does it in 1 hour.\" - B, Quant Researcher"]}]}}, "b1bc6ba59b03": {"fn": "microsoft/AI-For-Beginners", "sha": "b1bc6ba59b03", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 AI 初学者的 12 周 24 课系统课程", "review": "微软出品的 12 周、24 课时人工智能入门课程，内容含符号 AI（知识表示与推理）、神经网络与深度学习、计算机视觉、自然语言处理、遗传算法、多智能体系统与 AI 伦理等模块，每课提供 Jupyter Notebook、测验和实验，代码以 PyTorch 与 TensorFlow 双框架呈现。仓库含 50+ 语言自动翻译、本地/ Codespace 运行指