。仓库持续维护、几乎每周新增实现；通过 pip 安装 labml-nn 包使用。面向学习与理解算法的读者。", "highlights": ["60+ 篇深度学习论文的 PyTorch 实现并配讲解笔记", "覆盖 Transformer 变体、LoRA、扩散模型、GAN、RL、GNN、优化器等类别", "官网以旁注格式并排渲染代码与说明", "pip 安装 labml-nn 即可使用"], "use_cases": ["对照旁注笔记理解 Transformer/扩散模型等论文算法", "复用优化器、归一化层等组件的实现代码", "系统学习强化学习与 GAN 的实现细节"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["论文复现", "深度学习教程", "PyTorch", "学习资源"], "domain": "科研/深度学习教育", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5: This is a collection of simple PyTorch implementations of", "L10: renders these as side-by-side formatted notes.", "L146: ### Installation"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [149], "quotes": ["pip install labml-nn"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": []}}, "9bcaef7b81c3": {"fn": "mem0ai/mem0", "sha": "9bcaef7b81c3", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 AI 智能体和应用提供可持久化记忆层的基础设施", "review": "Mem0 为 AI 助手和智能体添加记忆层：记录用户偏好与状态，随交互持续学习。提供三种形态——pip/npm 安装的库（测试原型用）、docker compose 启动的自托管服务器（含 Dashboard 与鉴权）、云平台（托管服务）。记忆提取采用单遍 ADD-only 机制，检索融合语义、BM25 关键词与实体匹配，并含时间感知检索。需外部 LLM 运行（默认 OpenAI gpt-5-mini），嵌入默认 text-embedding-3-small。提供 CLI 管理记忆，Apache 2.0 协议。", "highlights": ["多层级记忆：User/Session/Agent 状态保留与个性化", "多信号检索：语义、BM25 关键词、实体匹配并行融合，含时间感知排序", "提供 Python/JavaScript SDK、CLI 及支持 skills 标准的编码助手技能包", "库 / Docker 自托管 / 云平台三种部署形态"], "use_cases": ["客服机器人记住历史工单与用户偏好", "AI 助手跨会话保持上下文连续性", "医疗场景记录患者偏好与历史", "自托管部署记忆服务供团队使用"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "arXiv:2504.19413", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["智能体记忆", "LLM基础设施", "个性化", "自托管服务"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/智能体记忆", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L70: Mem0 (\"mem-zero\") enhances AI assistants and agents with an intelligent memory layer, enabling personalized AI interacti", "L102: |**Setup**|`pip install mem0ai`|`docker compose up`|Sign up at app.mem0.ai|", "L186: Mem0 requires an LLM to function, with `gpt-5-mini` from OpenAI as the default. However, it supports a variety of LLMs; "], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [204], "note": "浏览器扩展提及 Claude，非专门适配", "quotes": ["- **Browser Extension**: Store memories across ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Claude (Chrome Extension)"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [92, 102, 112], "quotes": ["npm install -g @mem0/cli      # or: pip install mem0-cli", "|**Setup**|`pip install mem0ai`|`docker compose up`|Sign up at app.mem0.ai|", "pip install mem0ai"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [92, 125, 169], "quotes": ["npm install -g @mem0/cli      # or: pip install mem0-cli", "npm install mem0ai", "npx skills add https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0 --skill mem0"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [102, 137], "quotes": ["|**Setup**|`pip install mem0ai`|`docker compose up`|Sign up at app.mem0.ai|", "cd server && docker comp