ills update` inst", "For standalone installation, default to the **core set** — the router installs each creation workflow on demand. `npx hy", "Standalone installs stay lean after that: `npx hyperframes init` keeps the **core set** fresh (the router, the `hyperfra"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [27, 52], "quotes": ["For Claude Code, install the versioned plugin:", "The skills teach agents the HyperFrames production loop: plan the video, write valid HTML, wire seekable animations, add"]}, {"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "mention", "lines": [36], "quotes": ["for Copilot, VS Code, Cursor, Gemini CLI, updates, and migration."]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [36, 52], "quotes": ["for Copilot, VS Code, Cursor, Gemini CLI, updates, and migration.", "The skills teach agents the HyperFrames production loop: plan the video, write valid HTML, wire seekable animations, add"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "47cfd8c8f6e3": {"fn": "keras-team/keras", "sha": "47cfd8c8f6e3", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给深度学习开发者用的多后端神经网络框架", "review": "Keras 3 是多后端深度学习框架，可在 JAX、TensorFlow、PyTorch 之上运行，另提供仅推理的 OpenVINO 后端；通过环境变量 KERAS_BACKEND 或配置文件切换后端，导入后不可更改。覆盖计算机视觉、自然语言处理、音频、时序、推荐等任务，可作为 tf.keras 的替代（drop-in replacement），Keras 模型可用 tf.data.Dataset 或 PyTorch DataLoader 数据集训练。Linux/macOS 直接安装，Windows 建议 WSL2。", "highlights": ["多后端支持：JAX、TensorFlow、PyTorch、OpenVINO（仅推理）", "通过 KERAS_BACKEND 环境变量或 ~/.keras/keras.json 配置后端", "作为 tf.keras 的 drop-in replacement，支持迁移现有代码", "提供各后端 CUDA 依赖的 requirements 文件"], "use_cases": ["在多个底层框架上运行同一套高层建模工作流", "将现有 tf.keras 代码迁移到 JAX 或 PyTorch 后端", "编写跨框架可用的自定义层、模型与指标", "从笔记本扩展到 GPU/TPU 集群进行大规模训练"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": "cpu-ok", "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["深度学习", "多后端框架", "神经网络", "模型训练"], "domain": "机器学习/深度学习框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["cpu-infer"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Keras 3 is a multi-backend deep learning framework, with support for JAX, TensorFlow, PyTorch, and OpenVINO (for inferen", "L84: You can export the environment variable `KERAS_BACKEND` or you can edit your local config file at `~/.keras/keras.json`"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "cpu-infer", "rel": "support", "lines": [3, 30, 70, 103], "quotes": ["Keras 3 is a multi-backend deep learning framework, with support for JAX, TensorFlow, PyTorch, and OpenVINO (for inferen", "The `openvino` backend is available with support for model inference only.", "The `requirements.txt` file will install a CPU-only version of TensorFlow, JAX, and PyTorch. For GPU support, we also", "**Note:** The OpenVINO backend is an inference-only backend, meaning it is designed only for running model"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [19, 24, 42], "quotes": ["Keras 3 is available on PyPI as `keras`. Note that Keras 2 remains available as the `tf-keras` package.", "pip install keras --upgrade", "pip install -r requirements.txt"]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "mention", "lines": [91], "quotes": ["In Colab, you can do:"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "CPU-only", "rel": "support", "lines": [70, 71], "quotes": ["The `requirements.txt` file will install a CPU-only version of TensorFlow, JAX, and PyTorch. For GPU support, we also", "provide a separate `requirements-{backend}-cuda.txt` for TensorFlow, JAX, and PyTorch. These install all CUDA"]}], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "ec0aad1d51ea": {"fn": "upstash/context7", "sha": "ec0aad1d51ea", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 AI 编码代理提供最新版本库文档的检索平台", "review": "Context7 是 Upstash 维护的文档检索平台，向编码代理注入最新的、特定版本的库文档与代码示例，缓解模型训练数据过时导致的问题。提供两种模式：CLI + Skills（通过 ctx7 命令抓取文档，无需 MCP）与注册 MCP 服务器让代理原生调用文档工具。一条命令完成安装与 OAuth 认证，可用 --cursor/--claude/--opencode 定向配置；支持库 ID 精确匹配与版本指定。注意：API 后端与爬虫引擎为闭源，不在本仓库。", "highlights": ["CLI + Skills 与 MCP 两种接入模式，一条命令完成设置", "按库 ID 与版本精确检索文档（/mongodb/docs、/vercel/next.js 等）", "MCP 客户端手动配置支持 30+ 客户端", "提供 MCP server、CLI、TypeScript SDK、Vercel AI SDK 工具等多个包"], "use_cases": ["让编码代理生成基于最新版本文档的代码示例", "减少 LLM 幻觉出不存在的 API", "为多个 AI 编码客户端统一配置文档检索能力"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["MCP", "文档检索", "编码代理", "vibe-coding"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/开发工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["提供简体中文与繁體中文文档版本"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L21: Context7 pulls up-to-date, version-specific documentation and code examples straight from the source — and gives them to", "L41: - **CLI + Skills** — installs a skill that guides your agent to fetch docs using `ctx7` CLI commands (no MCP required)", "L42: - **MCP** — registers a Context7 MCP server so your agent can call documentation tools natively"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [90], "note": "Claude Code 规则配置位置，非模型接入", "quotes": ["- **Claude Code**: `CLAUDE.md`"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [52, 57], "quotes": ["npx ctx7 setup", "To remove the generated setup later, run `npx ctx7 remove`. If you globally installed the CLI with `npm install -g ctx7`"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [55, 89], "note": "支持的 MCP 客户端之一", "quotes": ["Authenticates via OAuth, generates an API key, and installs the appropriate skill. You can choose between CLI + Skills o", "- **Cursor**: `Cursor Settings > Rules`"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [55, 90], "note": "支持的 MCP 客户端之一", "quotes": ["Authenticates via OAuth, generates an API key, and installs the appropriate skill. You can choose between CLI + Skills o", "- **Claude Code**: `CLAUDE.md`"]}, {"term": "Vercel AI SDK", "rel": "mention", "lines": [130], "note": "提供了针对该 SDK 的工具包", "quotes": ["- `@upstash/context7-tools-ai-sdk` - Vercel AI SDK tools"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "1e4aa4e5511c": {"fn": "jingyaogong/minimind", "sha": "1e4aa4e5511c", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "从零训练 64M 超小语言模型的开源教程项目", "review": "从 0 开始完整复现小语言模型训练的开源项目：核心算法用 PyTorch 原生实现，不依赖第三方高层封装，覆盖 MoE、数据清洗、预训练、SFT、LoRA、DPO、PPO/GRPO/CISPO、Tool Use、Agentic RL、自适应思考与模型蒸馏全流程。提供全阶段开源数据集、Streamlit 聊天 WebUI、兼容 OpenAI API 协议的服务端，模型结构对齐 Qwen3 生态，可被 transformers/llama.cpp/vllm/ollama 等框架加载。适合想亲手理解 LLM 训练链路的个人，单张 NVIDIA 3090 上 SFT 1 epoch 实测约 2 小时。", "highlights": ["全训练链路代码从 0 用 PyTorch 原生实现，不依赖第三方框架封装", "覆盖 Pretrain/SFT/LoRA/DPO/PPO/GRPO/CISPO/Tool Use/Agentic RL/蒸馏全流程", "开源全阶段数据集，主线模型结构对齐 Qwen3/Qwen3-MoE 生态", "兼容 transformers、llama.cpp、vllm、ollama 及 OpenAI API 协议服务端"], "use_cases": ["从零动手训练并复现一个极小语言模型，理解 LLM 内部机制", "在个人 GPU 上跑通预训练、SFT 到强化学习的完整流程", "接入 FastGPT、Open-WebUI 等聊天界面做本地推理实验"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": nu