s、负载均衡与管理后台；SDK 侧提供带重试/回退的 Router 与可观测性回调。核心为 Rust 实现，附 Python SDK。", "highlights": ["Python SDK 与 AI Gateway（Proxy Server）两种形态，OpenAI 格式调用 100+ 供应商", "A2A Agent 网关与 MCP 网关：将 MCP 服务器接入 /chat/completions", "虚拟密钥、多租户花费跟踪、guardrails、负载均衡与管理后台", "Router 支持跨部署的重试/回退与应用级负载均衡"], "use_cases": ["为团队搭建集中式 LLM 网关，统一密钥与费用管理", "在 Python 项目中用统一接口切换多个模型供应商", "把 MCP 服务器和 A2A Agent 暴露为统一网关端点", "在 Azure/OpenAI 等多部署间做重试与回退"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM网关", "模型路由", "MCP", "A2A", "成本跟踪"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/模型网关", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["bedrock", "anthropic", "cohere", "deepseek", "google", "groq", "vllm", "ollama", "openrouter", "together"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L40: LiteLLM is an open source AI Gateway that gives you a single, unified interface to call 100+ LLM providers — OpenAI, Ant", "L42: Use it as a **Python SDK** for direct library integration, or deploy the **AI Gateway (Proxy Server)** as a centralized ", "L53: - **Production-ready gateway** — virtual keys, spend tracking, guardrails, load balancing, and an admin dashboard out of"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "bedrock", "rel": "support", "lines": [40, 216], "quotes": ["LiteLLM is an open source AI Gateway that gives you a single, unified interface to call 100+ LLM providers — OpenAI, Ant", "|AWS - Bedrock (`bedrock`)|✅|✅|✅|✅||||||✅|"]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [211, 212], "quotes": ["|Anthropic (`anthropic`)|✅|✅|✅||||||✅||", "|Anthropic 