6-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": [23, 25, 26]}, "audit_dep": null}}, "4c734e241611": {"fn": "crewAIInc/crewAI", "sha": "4c734e241611", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的多 Agent 协作编排 Python 框架", "review": "开源 Python 框架，通过 Crews（基于角色的自主协作 Agent 团队）与 Flows（事件驱动、精细控制的确定性工作流）两种抽象构建多 Agent 自动化。提供 CLI（crewai create/install/run）以 JSON-first 项目结构脚手架化项目，支持工具、记忆、知识、结构化输出、checkpointing 与 MCP/A2A；要求 Python >=3.10 且 <3.14，依赖 uv 管理。另有面向企业的 AMP Suite 商业控制面提供托管部署、可观测性与支持。", "highlights": ["Crews（自主协作）与 Flows（事件驱动控制）双模型组合", "CLI 一键创建项目并按 JSON 定义运行（crewai create/run）", "支持工具、记忆、知识、结构化输出、checkpointing 与 MCP/A2A", "提供 Claude Code/Cursor 等 AI 编码 agent 的官方 skills 安装"], "use_cases": ["构建多 Agent 角色分工协作的自动化流水线", "需要精细流程控制与状态管理的事件驱动工作流", "将原型级 agent 应用推进到生产级部署", "让 AI 编码助手按官方最佳实践生成 CrewAI 项目"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["多Agent框架", "Agent编排", "工作流自动化", "LLM应用开发"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L49: > CrewAI is an open-source Python framework with high-level abstractions and low-level APIs for building production-read", "L52: - **CrewAI Crews**: Optimize for autonomy and collaborative intelligence with role-based AI agents.", "L53: - **CrewAI Flows**: Build event-driven automations that combine precise workflow control, single LLM calls, and native s"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["npm"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [83], "note": "仅指通过 Claude Code 安装官方 skills，非模型接入说明", "quotes": ["**Claude Code:**"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [37, 38, 41, 194], "quotes": [" <a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/crewai/\">", " PyPI version", " PyPI downloads", "uv tool install crewai"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "mention", "lines": [100], "note": "npx skills 安装编码 agent 技能包，非本框架安装途径", "quotes": ["npx skills add crewaiinc/skills"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [83], "quotes": ["**Claude Code:**"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [98], "quotes": ["**Cursor, Codex, Windsurf, and others (skills.sh):**"]}, {"term": "Windsurf", "rel": "mention", "lines": [98], "quotes": ["**Cursor, Codex, Windsurf, and others (skills.sh):**"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [33, 60], "quotes": [" <a href=\"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT\">", "For organizations that need a commercial control plane around CrewAI, CrewAI AMP Suite adds managed deployment, observab"]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "61bb05221049": {"fn": "meilisearch/meilisearch", "sha": "61bb05221049", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为网站与应用提供 AI 混合搜索的搜索引擎 API", "review": "开源搜索引擎，提供 RESTful API 与多语言 SDK，供应用与网站集成搜索功能。核心机制包括语义与全文结合的混合搜索、输入即搜（50 毫秒内返回）、容错、过滤与分面、地理搜索、多语言支持（含中文/日文优化）与多租户。支持自然语言对话式搜索并生成基于检索结果的 AI 回答，可与 LangChain 及 MCP 配合。分社区版（MIT）与企业版（商业许可/BSL 1.1，生产环境需商业协议），官方提供 Cloud 托管服务，并默认收集可关闭的匿名遥测数据。", "highlights": ["混合搜索：语义搜索与全文搜索结合", "对话式搜索：基于检索结果生成 AI 回答", "支持地理搜索、分面过滤、同义词与多租户", "开箱支持 LangChain 与 Model Context Protocol"], "use_cases": ["给电商网站加带过滤分面的商品搜索", "为媒体平台做语义混合搜索找影片", "让用户用自然语言提问并获得基于站内内容的回答", "多租户 SaaS 中的联系人/客户搜索"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["搜索引擎", "全文检索", "混合搜索", "RAG", "API服务"], "domain": "搜索/数据库基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["对中文语言的优化支持（L52）"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L45: - **Hybrid search:** Combine the best of both semantic & full-text search to get the most relevant results", "L57: - **Conversational search:** let users ask questions in natural language and get AI-generated answers grounded in your s", "L62: - **AI-ready:** works out of the box with LangChain and the Model Context Protocol (MCP)"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "binary", "rel": "support", "lines": [150], "note": "发布页提供二进制文件", "quotes": ["Meilisearch releases and their associated binaries are available on the project's releases page."]}, {"term": "cargo", "rel": "none", "lines": [154], "note": "README 明确本仓库 crates 未发布到 crates.io，非安装途径", "quotes": ["Differently from the binaries, crates in this repository are not currently available on crates.io and do not follow SemV"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [62], "note": "声称为可配合的集成框架，非替代/竞品", "quotes": ["- **AI-ready:** works out of the box with LangChain and the Model Context Protocol (MCP)"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [95, 99, 109, 110], "quotes": ["Meilisearch is available in two editions:", "- Fully open source under the MIT license", "- Governed by a commercial license or the Business Source License 1.1", "- Not allowed in production without a commercial agreement with Meilisearch."]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "7a801314b0cb": {"fn": "MemPalace/mempalace", "sha": "7a801314b0cb", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 AI 编码代理提供本地化、可溯源的会话记忆存储与语义检索", "review": "以逐字文本存储对话历史，不做摘要或改写，通过语义搜索检索；索引按 wing/room/drawer 层级结构化以支持范围化搜索。检索后端可插拔（默认 ChromaDB），支持 Milvus、Qdrant、pgvector、SQLite、Rust 原生引擎等六种。以 CLI 与 MCP 服务器形式提供，共 47 个 MCP 工具；含时间性知识图谱、多 agent 协作日志流，以及 Claude Code、Codex CLI、Cursor IDE 的自动保存 hooks。默认路径无需 API key 与云服务，数据默认留在本地。", "highlights": ["逐字存储 + 语义检索，默认路径零 API 调用、零云端依赖", "可插拔检索后端：ChromaDB 默认，另支持 Milvus/Qdrant/pgvector/SQLite/Rust 原生", "47 个 MCP 工具与结构化 wing/room/drawer 索引", "LongMemEval 基准 96.6% R@5（原始语义检索，无 LLM）可复现"], "use_cases": ["让 Claude Code 等 MCP 客户端跨会话回忆历史对话内容", "为多 agent 系统提供本地持久记忆与协调日志", "在离线/隐私要求环境下存储与检索 AI 会话记录"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AI记忆", "MCP服务器", "语义检索", "本地优先", "CLI工具"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/记忆系统", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5: Local-first AI memory. Verbatim storage, pluggable backend, 96.6% R@5 raw on LongMemEval — zero API calls.", "L22: MemPalace stores your conversation history as verbatim text and retrieves", "L264: 47 MCP tools cover palace reads/writes, knowledge-graph operations,"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "compat", "lines": [125, 224, 225], "note": "可作为 MCP 客户端接入 Claude Code；rerank 管线可用 Claude 模型但明确无 Anthropic 依赖", "quotes": ["Wire it into an MCP client (e.g. Claude Code) as a stdio server. Mount", "capable model — we have reproduced it with Claude Haiku, Claude Sonnet,", "and minimax-m2.7 via Ollama Cloud (no Anthropic dependency). The gap"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "mention", "lines": [225], "note": "rerank 测试中经 Ollama Cloud 使用 minimax 模型", "quotes": ["and minimax-m2.7 via Ollama Cloud (no Anthropic dependency). The gap"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [13, 88, 250], "quotes": ["> **Beware of impostor sites.** MemPalace has no other official websites. The **only** official sources are this **GitHu", "pip install mempalace", "uv sync --extra dev   # or: pip install -e \".[dev]\""]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [48], "note": "npx 安装 agent skills，为引导式安装途径", "quotes": ["npx skills add MemPalace/mempalace"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "mention", "lines": [68], "note": "提及 Homebrew Python 的 PEP 668 问题，非安装途径", "quotes": ["PEP 668 errors on Debian/Ubuntu/Homebrew Pythons and to keep mempalace's"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [102, 107, 115, 148], "quotes": ["A container image is also available for running the MCP server or the CLI", "docker pull ghcr.io/mempalace/mempalace:latest", "docker run -i --rm -v mempalace-data:/data ghcr.io/mempalace/mempalace", "`docker compose run --rm mcp` works too (see `docker-compose.yml`), and"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [248, 250], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/MemPalace/mempalace.git", "uv sync --extra dev   # or: pip install -e \".[dev]\""]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [16, 125, 195, 199], "note": "被接入的 MCP 客户端，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["> **Claude Code sessions expire in 30 days without auto-save hooks wired.** Read this →", "Wire it into an MCP client (e.g. Claude Code) as a stdio server. Mount", "mempalace mine ~/.claude/projects/ --mode convos   # Claude Code sessions (scope with --wing per project)", "For Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Antigravity,"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [279, 284], "note": "提供 hooks 的 IDE 客户端", "quotes": ["Auto-save hooks for **Claude Code, Codex CLI, and Cursor IDE** save", "- Cursor IDE (adds session-start recall and a transcript snapshot before"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "49f034648be0": {"fn": "pathwaycom/serviette", "sha": "49f034648be0", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向企业和开发者的零代码文档问答 RAG 服务器，答案随文档实时更新", "review": "基于 Pathway Live Data Framework 的 RAG 服务器：指向一个文档目录，在单个 YAML 文件中选择向量数据库与 embedder，运行两条命令即获得带来源引用的聊天界面与 REST API。索引器与服务器为独立进程，仅通过向量数据库耦合；文档的增、改、删在数秒内反映到答案，无需重新上传或重建索引。默认使用内嵌 DuckDB 零配置启动，支持本地免费 embedder。运行需要免费的 Pathway license key；目前一次只回答一个问题，未内置对话记忆、用户账号与托管服务。", "highlights": ["8 种向量数据库后端，通过 Pathway 原生连接器写入 upsert/delete", "文档编辑、新增、删除数秒内同步到答案（实时增量索引）", "多源接入：本地文件、Google Drive、S3/MinIO、SharePoint、FTP/SFTP/WebDAV/ZIP", "文本、Office、PDF、扫描图片开箱即用，可配置音频与视频解析"], "use_cases": ["给组织文档搭一个带来源引用、随文档自动更新的问答助手", "不写代码，用一份 YAML 配置就能跑起的 RAG 服务", "需要索引和检索能力保持解耦、分别扩缩容的部署场景"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["RAG", "文档问答", "向量数据库", "实时索引", "no-code"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/RAG", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["bedrock"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L12: **A no-code, always up-to-date RAG server for any vector database — built on", "L65: **How mature it is.** serviette is a thin layer over the", "L126: - **Live & incremental.** Built on Pathway: additions, edits and deletions"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "bedrock", "rel": "support", "lines": [140], "note": "Bedrock 是五类 embedder 家族之一", "quotes": [" LiteLLM, SentenceTransformers, Gemini, Bedrock) work identically on the"]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [148], "note": "仅以 Claude 风格形容聊天页面外观，非接入 Anthropic API", "quotes": [" ChatGPT/Claude-style chat page on `/` next to the versioned API"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [7, 28, 34, 96], "quotes": [" PyPI version", "pip install serviette", "**Use pip 23.1 or newer** (`python -m pip install -U pip` first): older pip lacks", "pip install \"serviette[local]\" --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "mention", "lines": [148], "note": "仅描述聊天页面风格，非替代/竞品声明", "quotes": [" ChatGPT/Claude-style chat page on `/` next to the versioned API"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "acb2217cdc38": {"fn": "ultralytics/yolov5", "sha": "acb2217cdc38", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "基于 PyTorch 的目标检测/实例分割/分类模型及训练导出工具", "review": "Ultralytics 发布的 YOLOv5 视觉模型仓库：基于 PyTorch 框架，覆盖目标检测、实例分割与图像分类任务。提供 detect.py 推理脚本、PyTorch Hub 加载、train.py 训练（COCO 复现，n/s/m/l/x 五档模型），并支持导出 TFLite、ONNX、CoreML、TensorRT 等部署格式。安装需 Python>=3.8 与 PyTorch>=1.8，通过克隆仓库安装依赖；预训练权重从 release 自动下载。README 另提示最新任务（姿态估计、OBB）可使用 ultralytics 统一包。", "highlights": ["目标检测、实例分割、图像分类三类任务的训练与推理", "导出 TFLite/ONNX/CoreML/TensorRT 部署格式", "n/s/m/l/x 五档 COCO 预训练权重自动下载", "多 GPU DDP 训练、TTA、模型剪枝与超参数演化教程"], "use_cases": ["在自己的数据集上训练目标检测模型", "将检测/分割模型导出为 ONNX/TensorRT 部署到边缘设备（如 NVIDIA Jetson）", "通过 PyTorch Hub 快速加载预训练模型做推理", "复现 COCO 基准结果"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["计算机视觉", "目标检测", "实例分割", "模型训练", "模型导出"], "domain": "计算机视觉", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["cpu-infer"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L14: Ultralytics YOLOv5 🚀 is a fast, accurate, and easy-to-use computer vision model developed by Ultralytics. Based on the P", "L52: Clone the repository and install dependencies in a **Python>=3.8.0** environment. Ensure you have **PyTorch>=1.8** insta", "L85: The commands below demonstrate how to reproduce YOLOv5 COCO dataset results. Both models and datasets are downloaded aut"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["docker", "pypi"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "cpu-infer", "rel": "support", "lines": [144, 146], "note": "性能表列出 CPU 推理速度指标", "quotes": ["|Model|Size (pixels)|mAP val 50-95|mAP val 50|Speed CPU b1 (ms)|Speed V100 b1 (ms)|Speed V100 b32 (ms)|Params (M)|FLOPs ", "|YOLOv5n|640|28.0|45.7|**45**|**6.3**|**0.6**|**1.9**|**4.5**|"]}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "mention", "lines": [7], "note": "徽章显示 Docker Pulls", "quotes": [" Docker Pulls"]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [11, 190], "quotes": [" Open In Colab", " Segmentation Usage Examples &nbsp;Open In Colab"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [40], "note": "安装的是 ultralytics 统一包，非本仓库 yolov5", "quotes": ["pip install ultralytics"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [56], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/ultralytics/yolov5"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [18], "quotes": ["To request an Enterprise License, please complete the form at Ultralytics Licensing."]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "4bf565df6b84": {"fn": "jamiepine/voicebox", "sha": "4bf565df6b84", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "本地优先的 AI 语音工作室：克隆声音、生成语音、全局听写", "review": "本地优先的开源语音应用，整合语音输入与输出两个环节：从几秒参考音频做零样本克隆，支持 8 个 TTS 引擎与 23 种语言生成语音，通过全局热键做听写并以 Whisper 转写，还可经内置 MCP 服务器让 MCP 感知的 agent 以克隆声音发声。附带后期音效处理、多轨 Stories 编辑器、生成版本管理与 REST API。模型与音频数据全程留在本机。基于 Tauri (Rust) 构建，macOS/Windows 提供安装包，Linux 需从源码构建。", "highlights": ["8 个可切换的 TTS 引擎（Qwen3-TTS、Chatterbox、Kokoro 等）与 23 种语言", "零样本声音克隆与 50+ 预置声音", "全局热键听写 + Whisper 语音转写，支持 LLM 清理口头语", "内置 MCP 服务器与 REST API，agent 可通过 voicebox_speak 发声"], "use_cases": ["从几秒参考音频克隆声音并批量生成长文本语音", "系统级全局热键听写输入到任意应用", "给 Claude Code/Cursor 等 agent 配上克隆声音输出", "制作多角色对话、播客与叙事音频"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "消费者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://voicebox.sh", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["语音合成/TTS", "声音克隆", "语音听写/STT", "MCP/Agent", "本地优先"], "domain": "语音 AI/桌面工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L61: Voicebox is a **local-first AI voice studio** — a free and open-source alternative to **ElevenLabs** and **WisprFlow** i", "L74: - **Agent voice output** — one tool call (`voicebox_speak`) and any MCP-aware agent (Claude Code, Cursor, Cline) speaks ", "L78: - **Runs everywhere** — macOS (MLX/Metal), Windows (CUDA), Linux, AMD ROCm, Intel Arc, Docker"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [74, 234], "quotes": ["- **Agent voice output** — one tool call (`voicebox_speak`) and any MCP-aware agent (Claude Code, Cursor, Cline) speaks ", "- **Per-agent voice binding** — in **Settings → MCP**, pin Claude Code to Morgan and Cursor to Scarlett so you can tell "]}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [87], "quotes": ["|Docker|`docker compose up`|"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [356], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/jamiepine/voicebox.git"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "1GB VRAM", "rel": "mention", "lines": [106], "quotes": ["|**LuxTTS**|English|Lightweight (~1GB VRAM), 48kHz output, 150x realtime on CPU|"]}], "products": [{"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [66, 103, 104, 105], "note": "集成的 Qwen 系列 TTS 引擎，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["- **8 TTS engines** — Qwen3-TTS, Qwen CustomVoice, Qwen VoiceDesign, LuxTTS, Chatterbox Multilingual, Chatterbox Turbo, ", "|**Qwen3-TTS** (0.6B / 1.7B)|10|High-quality multilingual cloning, delivery instructions (\"speak slowly\", \"whisper\")|", "|**Qwen CustomVoice**|10|9 curated preset voices with natural-language delivery control — no reference audio required|", "|**Qwen VoiceDesign**|10|Builds a voice from a written description — no reference audio or preset needed|"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [74, 234], "quotes": ["- **Agent voice output** — one tool call (`voicebox_speak`) and any MCP-aware agent (Claude Code, Cursor, Cline) speaks ", "- **Per-agent voice binding** — in **Settings → MCP**, pin Claude Code to Morgan and Cursor to Scarlett so you can tell "]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [74, 234], "quotes": ["- **Agent voice output** — one tool call (`voicebox_speak`) and any MCP-aware agent (Claude Code, Cursor, Cline) speaks ", "- **Per-agent voice binding** — in **Settings → MCP**, pin Claude Code to Morgan and Cursor to Scarlett so you can tell "]}, {"term": "Windsurf", "rel": "mention", "lines": [236], "quotes": ["- **HTTP + stdio transports** — install as a URL in Claude Code / Cursor / Windsurf / VS Code MCP, or point stdio-only c"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "c3552d40a40f": {"fn": "deepfakes/faceswap", "sha": "c3552d40a40f", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给研究/创作者用深度学习换脸图片与视频的工具", "review": "FaceSwap 是一个用深度学习识别并替换图片和视频中人脸的 Python 程序，工作流分为提取人脸、训练模型、应用转换三步，均通过 faceswap.py 命令行调用，另提供 GUI 入口和基于 ffmpeg 的视频转换工具。可运行于 Windows、Linux 和 macOS，README 建议使用支持 CUDA 的现代 GPU 以获得更好性能，AMD GPU 在 Linux 上可经 ROCm 支持。项目明确列出伦理约束，禁止用于未经同意或不当内容的制作，支持主要通过 Discord 和论坛提供。", "highlights": ["extract/train/convert 三段式换脸工作流与 GUI 入口", "支持 Windows/Linux/macOS 多平台", "AMD GPU 可通过 ROCm 支持（Linux）", "附视频格式转换工具（effmpeg/ffmpeg）"], "use_cases": ["将照片或视频中的人脸替换为模型学到的另一张脸", "动手实验和学习深度学习人脸技术", "影视或社会评论类的合规换脸制作"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "viral", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["换脸", "深度学习", "图像/视频处理", "桌面工具"], "domain": "深度学习/图像视频处理", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L6:  FaceSwap is a tool that utilizes deep learning to recognize and swap faces in pictures and videos.", "L45: FaceSwap is a Python program that will run on multiple Operating Systems including Windows, Linux, and MacOS.", "L47: See INSTALL.md for full installation instructions. You will need a modern GPU with CUDA support for best performance. Ma"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "276617d2c31e": {"fn": "blader/humanizer", "sha": "276617d2c31e", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 agent 用户的 AI 痕迹改写技能：按 Wikipedia 标准去除 AI 写作特征", "review": "以 skill 形式运行的文本改写工具：基于 Wikipedia「Signs of AI writing」归纳的 26 种 AI 写作模式（分六类，含弱特征需共现才判定），逐条标注后重写，输出初稿、对残留人工痕迹的批评与终稿。可通过写作样本做声音匹配，改写文件时只改散文内容，保留代码、数据、frontmatter 与链接。要求事实细节必须来自原文或作者，缺失时询问而非编造。支持 Claude Code 插件、Codex、Claude.ai/Desktop 及 Skills CLI 覆盖的其他 agent。明确不以免过 AI 检测器为目标。", "highlights": ["基于 Wikipedia「Signs of AI writing」的 26 种 AI 写作模式检测与改写", "提供写作样本可做声音匹配（节奏、用词、标点）", "改写文件时仅改散文，保留代码、数据、frontmatter、链接", "事实细节不编造，缺失时向作者询问"], "use_cases": ["把 AI 起草的公告、博客改得更像人写的", "在 Claude Code/Codex 等工具中以 /humanizer 直接调用", "按自己的写作风格样本定制改写口吻", "清理文档中的 AI 套话与格式化痕迹"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["agent-skills", "文本改写", "AI写作", "提示工程"], "domain": "内容创作/写作辅助", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L7: Humanizer makes AI-written text sound like a person wrote it, without changing what it says. It is built on Wikipedia's ", "L29: Humanizer checks for 26 patterns in all.", "L104: Humanizer marks every tell it finds, strongest first. It drafts a rewrite without treating the original structure as fix"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [7, 35, 42, 50], "note": "通过 Claude Code/Claude.ai/Claude Desktop 安装使用，无 API/模型接入声明", "quotes": ["Humanizer makes AI-written text sound like a person wrote it, without changing what it says. It is built on Wikipedia's ", "### Claude Code", "The plugin answers to `/humanizer:humanizer`. It needs Claude Code 2.1.142 or newer; on older versions, use `npx skills ", "#