 (TTS) and Automatic ", "L34: 2025-09-05: VibeVoice is an open-source research framework intended to advance collaboration in the speech synthesis com", "L140: We do not recommend using VibeVoice in commercial or real-world applications without further testing and development. Th"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [26, 27], "quotes": ["- ⚡️ **vLLM inference** is now supported for faster inference; see vllm-asr for more details.", "- 🎤 **Streaming recognition** transcribes while the audio is still arriving, emitting text once per chunk; see asr-strea"]}], "install": [{"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [6, 32, 52, 129], "quotes": ["Colab", "2025-12-03: 📣 We open-sourced VibeVoice‑Realtime‑0.5B , a real‑time text‑to‑speech model that supports streaming text in", "|VibeVoice-Realtime-0.5B|HF Link|Colab|", "📖 Documentation | 🤗 Hugging Face | 🚀 Colab"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "no GPU required", "rel": "support", "lines": [17], "quotes": [" 2026-07-23: ⚡ We released VibeVoice-ASR-BitNet, an edge CPU inference engine for VibeVoice-ASR. Through heterogeneous q"]}], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": true, "lines": [34, 51]}}}, "5c5e22cadea3": {"fn": "zylon-ai/private-gpt", "sha": "5c5e22cadea3", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "把本地模型变成私有 AI 应用的开源 API 层", "review": "以 Claude API 为参照模型的 API 层，为本地模型提供消息、文件摄取、带引用的检索与 agentic RAG、内置工具、MCP、数据库/CSV 访问、嵌入与编排等后端原语。自身不运行模型，通过 OPENAI_API_BASE 连接任意 OpenAI 兼容推理服务器。附内置演示 UI，API 为核心产品。2023 年以离线文档问答脚本起步，后重构为 1.0 API 层，由 Zylon 团队维护。", "highlights": ["兼容 Claude API 的消息流式、文件摄取、引用检索与工具调用", "内置 web search/fetch、代码执行工具与 MCP 连接器", "连接任意 OpenAI 兼容推理服务器（Ollama、llama.cpp、vLLM 等）", "提供 brew/uv 安装与内置演示 UI"], "use_cases": ["在本地推理服务器之上搭建私有 AI 应用后端", "为 Claude Code、Claude Desktop 等客户端接入本地模型", "企业内网无云依赖的文档问答与检索场景", "用 API 层为终端产品封装 