-compatible inference server (Ollama, llama.cpp, vLLM, …)", "Ollama / LM Studio / LocalAI / vLLM / llama.cpp  =  local inference layer", "Use them together. Run your model with whichever inference server you prefer, then point PrivateGPT at it."]}], "install": [{"term": "brew", "rel": "support", "lines": [48, 49], "quotes": ["brew tap zylon-ai/tap", "brew install private-gpt"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [122], "note": "可指向 PrivateGPT 后端的集成工具，非替代/竞品", "quotes": ["|**Claude Code**|Use your local models as the backend for agentic coding in the terminal|"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "365030d96bb6": {"fn": "ggml-org/whisper.cpp", "sha": "365030d96bb6", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "在本地多平台离线运行 Whisper 语音识别的 C/C++ 推理实现", "review": "OpenAI Whisper 语音识别模型的 C/C++ 移植，无依赖的纯 C/C++ 实现，基于 ggml 机器学习库构建。提供 C 风格 API、整数量化、VAD、混合精度推理，支持 Metal、Core ML、CUDA、Vulkan、OpenVINO 及 AMD NPU 等后端。模型需转换为 ggml 格式后由 whisper-cli 等示例程序运行，仅支持 16-bit WAV 输入，其他音频需用 ffmpeg 预先转换。支持 macOS/iOS/Android/Linux/Windows/WebAssembly 等平台，MIT 许可。", "highlights": ["纯 C/C++ 无依赖实现，基于 ggml 库，提供 C 风格 API", "多后端支持：Metal、Core ML、ANE、CUDA、Vulkan、OpenVINO、AMD NPU", "整数量化降低模型内存与磁盘占用（tiny 75 MiB 至 large 2.9 GiB）", "跨平台覆盖 iOS、Android、WebAssembly、树莓派、Docker 等"], "use_cases": ["在手机或嵌入式设备上完全离线运行语音转文字", "搭建本地离线语音助手应用", "在 Apple Silicon 或 NVIDIA GPU 上加速语音识别推理"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": "cpu-ok", "install_friction": "high", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["语音识别", "本地推理", "C/C++", "边缘设备", "语音转文字"], "domain": "语音识别/推理引擎", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["cpu-infer"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", 