e (based on Gradio ).", "L7: Fooocus presents a rethinking of image generator designs. The software is offline, open source, and free, while at the s", "L13: The Fooocus project, built entirely on the **Stable Diffusion XL** architecture, is now in a state of limited long-term "], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["pypi"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [103, 107, 109, 111], "quotes": ["### Colab", "| Colab | Info", "Open In Colab | Fooocus Official", "In Colab, you can modify the last line to `!python entry_with_update.py --share --always-high-vram` or `!python entry_wi"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [125, 147, 169], "quotes": [" git clone https://github.com/lllyasviel/Fooocus.git", " git clone https://github.com/lllyasviel/Fooocus.git", " git clone https://github.com/lllyasviel/Fooocus.git"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [129, 151, 171], "note": "pip 安装依赖文件，属源码安装步骤之一", "quotes": [" pip install -r requirements_versions.txt", " pip install -r requirements_versions.txt", " pip3 install -r requirements_versions.txt"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "GPU memory requirement is 4GB", "rel": "support", "lines": [7], "quotes": ["Fooocus presents a rethinking of image generator designs. The software is offline, open source, and free, while at the s"]}, {"term": "4GB VRAM", "rel": "support", "lines": [89], "quotes": ["Note that the minimal requirement is **4GB Nvidia GPU memory (4GB VRAM)** and **8GB system memory (8GB RAM)**. This requ"]}, {"term": "8GB RAM", "rel": "support", "lines": [89], "quotes": ["Note that the minimal requirement is **4GB Nvidia GPU memory (4GB VRAM)** and **8GB system memory (8GB RAM)**. This requ"]}, {"term": "6GB VRAM", "rel": "support", "lines": [83], "note": "实测机型配置", "quotes": ["Below is a test on a relatively low-end laptop with **16GB System RAM** and **6GB VRAM** (Nvidia 3060 laptop). The speed"]}], "products": [{"term": "Midjourney", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [7, 23, 25], "note": "README 以 Midjourney 示例做功能对照表", "quotes": ["Fooocus presents a rethinking of image generator designs. The software is offline, open source, and free, while at the s", "Below is a quick list using Midjourney's examples:", "|Midjourney|Fooocus|"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "eed8f3398e12": {"fn": "bojieli/ai-agent-book", "sha": "eed8f3398e12", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向工程师的 AI Agent 开源书：10 章正文加 109 个配套实验", "review": "开源图书仓库，正文按 Agent = LLM + 上下文 + 工具的框架分 10 章，主题覆盖上下文工程、用户记忆与 RAG、MCP 工具、Coding Agent、评估、后训练与多 Agent 协作。提供 15 种语言的 PDF/EPUB 下载与在线阅读，正文源码为 markdown，可自行编译（需 pandoc/xelatex/ElegantBook）。实验代码统一支持 Python 3.11–3.13，用 uv 或 pip 按章节安装依赖，调用模型需自行配置 API Key；第 6/7/8/10 章部分实验需另行克隆 22 个外部仓库。", "highlights": ["10 章正文与 109 个配套实验全部开源（Apache 2.0）", "15 种语言的 PDF/EPUB 构建与在线阅读，main 分支推送后自动更新", "实验环境用 uv.lock 固定，按章节 extra 安装依赖", "配套代码由 coding agent 生成，附思考题参考答案与学习建议"], "use_cases": ["系统学习 AI Agent 的设计原理与工程实践", "跟着 109 个实验动手实现自己的 coding agent", "为团队搭建 Agent 评估集与持续改进流程"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["技术书籍", "AI Agent", "教学实验", "RAG", "多Agent协作"], "domain": "教育/技术图书", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["中文原版正文，其余语言为社区翻译", "作者李博杰", "推荐 Kimi、智谱 GLM 等中国大陆可访问平台"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L10: **Agent = LLM + 上下文 + 工具**——本书围绕这个核心公式，用 10 章把 AI Agent 从原理讲到工程实战。全书正文、配图、**109 个配套实验**全部开源，欢迎亲手把实验跑一遍。", "L64: |1|🚀 **AI Agent 入门**|**Agent = LLM + 上下文 + 工具**；Harness 工程才是竞争力|读|4|", "L91: 运行会调用模型的实验前，请按该实验 README 配置凭据：支持根目录配置的实验可复制 `.env.example` 为 `.env` 并填入至少一个提供商 Key；有些实验要求在自身目录放 `.env` 或直接导出环境变量。只有在实验 R"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "mention", "lines": [91, 103], "note": "仅在实验明确列出时可用本地 Ollama，属可选本地推理方式", "quotes": ["运行会调用模型的实验前，请按该实验 README 配置凭据：支持根目录配置的实验可复制 `.env.example` 为 `.env` 并填入至少一个提供商 Key；有些实验要求在自身目录放 `.env` 或直接导出环境变量。只有在实验 R", "- 浏览器、CUDA、FFmpeg、Ollama、Playwright 浏览器及外部仓库等系统依赖，请继续参考各实验 README。第 8 章部分内置第三方组件需要 Python 3.12+。"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "mention", "lines": [102], "note": "作为 uv sync 的可选 extra 出现", "quotes": ["- `all` 是不含本地训练栈的 CPU 友好组合，并不代表每个实验；`uv sync` 每次都会精确同步当前选择，使用特殊 extra 时请合并到同一条命令，例如 `uv sync --locked --extra ch2 --extr"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "mention", "lines": [113, 114, 116, 117], "note": "作为推荐申请 API Key 的平台/被列举的模型提及", "quotes": ["|**Siliconflow**|<https://siliconflow.cn/>|各种开源模型（DeepSeek、Qwen 等），中国大陆访问速度快|中国大陆|", "|**DeepSeek**|<https://platform.deepseek.com/>|DeepSeek 官方 API|全球 + 中国大陆|", "|**Krill AI**|www.krill-code.com|一站式访问全球及国内主流模型（OpenAI、Claude、Gemini、Grok、Kimi、GLM、DeepSeek、Qwen、Minimax）|全球 + 中国大陆|", "|**OpenRouter**|<https://openrouter.ai/>|一站式访问全球及国内主流模型（GPT、Claude、Gemini、Kimi、GLM、DeepSeek、Qwen 等）|全球|"]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [116, 117, 125, 137, 148], "note": "Claude/Anthropic 相关模型与工具被提及，无专门接入", "quotes": ["|**Krill AI**|www.krill-code.com|一站式访问全球及国内主流模型（OpenAI、Claude、Gemini、Grok、Kimi、GLM、DeepSeek、Qwen、Minimax）|全球 + 中国大陆|", "|**OpenRouter**|<https://openrouter.ai/>|一站式访问全球及国内主流模型（GPT、Claude、Gemini、Kimi、GLM、DeepSeek、Qwen 等）|全球|", "引言的“前置知识”一节有完整说明：能读懂并修改中等复杂度的 Python 代码；用过 ChatGPT、Claude 等 LLM 产品；熟悉至少一款 AI 辅助编程工具（Claude Code、Codex、Cursor 等）；了解命令行、Gi", "推荐从头做一个像 Claude Code、Codex 那样的 coding agent：第 1–5 章足以做出一个可用的 coding agent；第 7、9 章帮它建立评估集并从失败案例中持续改进；第 8 章介入模型本身；第 6、10 章", "感谢 **Krill AI** 赞助本项目！Krill 提供 