": {"fn": "ClickHouse/ClickHouse", "sha": "9b45adc34192", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的实时分析型列式数据库管理系统", "review": "开源列式数据库管理系统，用于实时生成分析数据报告。通过官方脚本一行命令安装于 Linux、macOS 和 FreeBSD，并提供 ClickHouse Cloud 托管服务作为免安装使用方式。README 同时维护月度发布与社区电话会议、全球线下 meetup、培训与招聘信息，公司由该数据库的创建者与维护者运营。核心定位为 OLAP 场景下的分析查询，主题标签覆盖分布式、云原生、lakehouse 等部署形态。", "highlights": ["列式存储的实时分析数据报告生成", "一行 curl 脚本安装，支持 Linux/macOS/FreeBSD", "提供托管服务 ClickHouse Cloud 免安装试用"], "use_cases": ["搭建实时数据分析报表与查询服务", "需要分布式、云原生部署的分析型数据库选型", "构建 lakehouse 场景下的查询引擎"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["数据库", "OLAP", "实时分析", "大数据"], "domain": "数据库/大数据分析", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L6:  ClickHouse® is an open-source column-oriented database management system that allows generating analytical data reports", "L11: curl https://clickhouse.com/ | sh"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "xai", "rel": "mention", "lines": [59], "quotes": ["* Grok Bot Montreal Build Day - October 3rd, 2026"]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": []}}, "3c068e0f7ed0": {"fn": "mudler/LocalAI", "sha": "3c068e0f7ed0", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "本地运行各类 AI 模型的开源引擎，无需 GPU", "review": "以小型核心加按需拉取后端镜像的架构运行 LLM、视觉、语音、图像、视频模型，每个后端封装 llama.cpp、vLLM、whisper.cpp 等引擎。提供 OpenAI/Anthropic/ElevenLabs 兼容 API、API key 认证与用户配额、内置带工具调用与 RAG 的 Agent、分布式模式与 WebUI。