iders from the Web console ", "|Kimi|kimi-k3|✅|✅|||||", "> **2026.06.18:** v2.1.2 — Web console upgrades (scheduled task management, knowledge base categories, multiple custom m"]}, {"term": "豆包", "rel": "mention", "lines": [45, 119], "note": "模型供应商，非竞品", "quotes": ["|Models|Claude, GPT, Gemini, DeepSeek, Qwen, GLM, Kimi, MiniMax, Doubao, and more — swap providers from the Web console ", "|Doubao|doubao-seed-2.1 series|✅|✅|✅|||✅|"]}, {"term": "文心一言", "rel": "mention", "lines": [120], "note": "ERNIE 模型供应商条目，非竞品", "quotes": ["|ERNIE|ernie-5.1|✅|✅|||||"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [228], "note": "Cow Skill Hub 兼容工具列举，非替代/竞品声明", "quotes": ["- **Cow Skill Hub** — open skill marketplace for AI Agents; works with CowAgent, OpenClaw, Claude Code, and more"]}, {"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "94d2f8f673b0": {"fn": "apache/airflow", "sha": "94d2f8f673b0", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "数据与 AI 工作流的编排平台：用代码编写、调度和监控", "review": "Apache 软件基金会的工作流编排平台，以代码定义工作流（Dag），由调度器按依赖关系在 worker 上执行任务，配合 CLI 与 Web 界面监控运行中的流水线。工作流以代码形式定义，便于版本管理、测试与协作。任务要求幂等，任务间通过 XCom 传递元数据而非大批量数据；定位为批处理编排，非流式方案，也非 agent 本身。README 提到其广泛用于编排机器学习与基于 LLM 的工作负载（数据准备、工具调用、模型调用、评估等步骤）。通过 PyPI 配约束文件安装，官方支持 pip 与 uv。", "highlights": ["以代码定义 Dag，调度器按依赖在 worker 数组上执行任务", "Jinja 模板引擎支持自定义，内置多种 operator 可扩展", "Web UI 提供 Dags、Assets、Grid、Graph、Backfill 等视图", "仅官方支持 pip/uv 安装，需配合约束文件保证可重复安装"], "use_cases": ["编排 ETL/ELT 数据流水线并监控生产运行", "编排机器学习训练、再训练、评估与部署流程", "协调 LLM/AI 流水线中的数据准备、工具调用与模型调用步骤", "按日期区间回填历史数据"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["工作流编排", "数据工程", "ETL", "MLOps", "调度"], "domain": "数据工程/工作流编排", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L21: Apache Airflow (or simply Airflow) is a platform to programmatically author, schedule, and monitor workflows.", "L35: Beyond traditional data pipelines, Airflow is widely used to orchestrate machine learning workflows — training, retraini", "L107: > Note: Only `pip` and `uv` installation is currently officially supported."], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["docker", "pypi"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "ba0e97beeeed": {"fn": "siyuan-note/siyuan", "sha": "ba0e97beeeed", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "隐私优先自托管知识管理工具，人与 AI agent 协作", "review": "思源笔记是一个隐私优先的个人知识管理系统，支持块级引用与 Markdown 所见即所得编辑，涵盖双向链接、SQL 查询嵌入、数据库表格视图、间隔重复闪卡、PDF 标注、导出为 PDF/Word/HTML 等功能。AI 方面通过 OpenAI API 提供写作与问答聊天，主题标签与项目描述表明支持 MCP 与 agent 协作场景。桌面端通过应用商店或安装包分发，移动端有 Android/iOS/HarmonyOS 应用，服务端提供 Docker 部署与社区维护的 Helm chart，部分功能仅对付费会员开放。", "highlights": ["块级引用、双向链接与 SQL 查询嵌入的内容块体系", "通过 OpenAI API 提供 AI 写作与问答聊天", "Docker 部署支持 PUID/PGID 权限配置与 OIDC 认证", "多端应用：Android/iOS/HarmonyOS 与桌面安装包"], "use_cases": ["自托管搭建个人知识库并做块级笔记管理", "在笔记中调用 AI 进行写作与问答", "通过 Docker 在服务器上部署浏览器访问的知识工作空间"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "viral", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "消费者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["知识管理", "笔记", "AI agent", "自托管", "Markdown"], "domain": "知识管理/笔记工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], 