ts into a searchable online archive s", "L29: The easiest way to deploy paperless is `docker compose`. The files in the `/docker/compose` directory are configured to ", "L12: Paperless-ngx is the official successor to the original Paperless & Paperless-ng projects and is designed to distribute "], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [29, 31, 34], "quotes": ["The easiest way to deploy paperless is `docker compose`. The files in the `/docker/compose` directory are configured to ", "If you'd like to jump right in, you can configure a `docker compose` environment with our install script:", "bash -c \"$(curl -L https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/main/install-paperless-ngx.sh)\""]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": []}}, "b58d32ac9246": {"fn": "milvus-io/milvus", "sha": "b58d32ac9246", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 AI 应用的分布式向量数据库：存储并检索大规模向量", "review": "以 Go 和 C++ 编写的云原生向量数据库，存储向量与标量数据并支持向量 ANN 检索、元数据过滤与混合搜索。支持分布式（K8s 部署、计算存储分离）、单机 Standalone 与 Python pip 安装的 Milvus Lite 三种形态。索引类型覆盖 HNSW、IVF、FLAT、SCANN、DiskANN 及 GPU 索引（如 NVIDIA CAGRA），并原生支持 BM25 全文检索与 SPLADE/BGE-M3 稀疏向量。提供用户认证、TLS、RBAC 等企业特性，Apache 2.0 许可，隶属 LF AI & Data 基金会。", "highlights": ["支持 HNSW、IVF、DiskANN 等多种索引类型及 GPU 索引（CAGRA）", "分布式架构支持水平扩展，并提供 Standalone 与 Milvus Lite 部署形态", "原生支持 BM25 全文检索与 SPLADE/BGE-M3 稀疏向量的混合搜索", "提供用户认证、TLS 加密与 RBAC 访问控制"], "use_cases": ["为 RAG 应用搭建向量检索后端", "构建文本、图像语义搜索与推荐系统", "企业场景下多租户向量数据管理与权限控制"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://milvus.io/milvus-demos", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["向量数据库", "ANN检索", "RAG", "分布式存储"], "domain": "数据库/LLM 基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L16: 🐦 Milvus is a high-performance vector database built for scale. It powers AI applications by efficiently organizing and ", "L134:  Milvus integrates with a comprehensive suite of AI development tools, such as LangChain, LlamaIndex, OpenAI and Hugging"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [30, 37], "quotes": ["$ pip install -U pymilvus", "* You can also try Milvus Lite for quickstart by installing `pymilvus[milvus-lite]`. To create a local vector database, "]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [172, 176], "quotes": ["Clone Milvus repo and build.", "$ git clone https://github.com/milvus-io/milvus.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [134], "quotes": [" Milvus integrates with a comprehensive suite of AI development tools, such as LangChain, LlamaIndex, OpenAI and Hugging"]}, {"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [134], "quotes": [" Milvus integrates with a comprehensive suite of AI development tools, such as LangChain, LlamaIndex, OpenAI and Hugging"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "c3e0fad52d2d": {"fn": "streamlit/streamlit", "sha": "c3e0fad52d2d", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "让开发者用 Python 脚本快速构建和分享数据应用", "review": "Streamlit 将 Python 脚本转换为交互式 Web 应用的框架：提供输入组件、数据框、图表、布局与多页面应用等元素，编辑脚本后应用即时更新。应用可通过 Streamlit Community Cloud 平台免费部署、管理和分享。通过 pip 安装，社区可通过 Streamlit Components 扩展功能；目前 README 注明已暂停接受维护者团队之外的 pull request。", "highligh