dio skills add 为编码助手安装 Gradio 技能"], "use_cases": ["为机器学习模型快速搭一个可分享的在线演示", "在 Jupyter/Colab 中内嵌交互式模型界面", "用 Blocks 搭建多数据流的定制化 Web 应用", "为聊天机器人快速生成 Chatbot UI"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1906.02569", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["ML演示", "Web应用构建", "模型分享", "聊天界面"], "domain": "机器学习应用开发工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L21: # Gradio: Build Machine Learning Web Apps — in Python", "L63:  > When developing locally, you can run your Gradio app in hot reload mode , which automatically reloads the Gradio app ", "L136: Gradio provides a \"skill\" that enriches AI coding assistants (like Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, etc.) with Gradio-specifi"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [136, 142], "note": "提及 Claude Code 等编码助手及 --claude 技能目录链接参数，非模型接入", "quotes": ["Gradio provides a \"skill\" that enriches AI coding assistants (like Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, etc.) with Gradio-specifi", "This installs to the shared `.agents/skills` directory used by Codex, Cursor, OpenCode, and other compatible agents. Use"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [10, 11, 31, 34], "quotes": ["PyPI", "PyPI downloads", "We recommend installing Gradio using `pip`, which is included by default in Python. Run this in your terminal or command", "pip install --upgrade gradio"]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "mention", "lines": [42], "note": "运行环境选项之一，非安装途径", "quotes": ["You can run Gradio in 