限学术用途，禁止商用。训练中添加高频噪声并压缩音质以限制滥用。", "highlights": ["面向对话任务优化的 TTS，支持多说话人交互", "细粒度韵律控制：笑声、停顿、插入语", "40,000 小时中英文预训练模型", "提供 WebUI 与命令行两种推理入口"], "use_cases": ["为 LLM 助手生成对话语音", "学术研究中的语音合成实验", "生成带笑声与停顿控制的中英文语音"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["TTS", "语音合成", "对话系统", "LLM语音"], "domain": "语音合成/AI 模型", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["vllm"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["QQ 群作为主要中文社区渠道", "提供简体中文 README", "Bilibili 视频介绍"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L23: ChatTTS is a text-to-speech model designed specifically for dialogue scenarios such as LLM assistant.", "L41: - The main model is trained with Chinese and English audio data of 100,000+ hours.", "L94: #### Optional: Install vLLM (Linux only)"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [94, 96], "quotes": ["#### Optional: Install vLLM (Linux only)", "pip install safetensors vllm==0.2.7 torchaudio"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [142, 144], "quotes": ["1. Install the stable version from PyPI", "pip install ChatTTS"]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [10], "quotes": ["Open In Colab"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [77], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/2noise/ChatTTS"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [9, 42], "quotes": ["Huggingface", "- The open-source version on **HuggingFace** is a 40,000 hours pre-trained model without SFT."]}], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [49, 53], "quotes": ["The code is published under `AGPLv3+` license.", "The model is published under `CC BY-NC 4.0` license. It is intended for educational and research use, and should not be "]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "2d05b724d1a1": {"fn": "mindsdb/mindshub", "sha": "2d05b724d1a1", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向知识工作者的开源 Agent 工作台：可自选模型完成研究与开发任务", "review": "开源 Agent 工作台，定位为完成知识工作与软件开发的统一工作空间，支持研究、分析、内容创作与软件开发。仓库为平台 superproject，聚合桌面/Web 应用、Agent 后端与数据引擎，可从源码构建运行。关键机制包括模型路由器（在多个闭源与开源模型间切换）、可互换的开源 agent harness（Anton 默认与 Hermes）、跨会话记忆、技能库、定时任务与制品发布。部署上支持本机、VPC、云端及隔离环境；Web 版免安装，macOS/Windows 提供桌面安装包，Linux 从源码构建。", "highlights": ["Model Router 在 Claude/GPT/Gemini 与 DeepSeek/Qwen/Kimi 间切换，无需逐家配 key", "可互换的开源 agent harness：Anton（默认）与 Hermes，下拉切换", "安全数据保险箱连接 BigQuery/Postgres/Gmail/Drive 等，凭据按连接隔离", "Agent 输出转为文档、仪表盘、应用并发布到在线 URL，支持定时任务与跨会话记忆"], "use_cases": ["用 Agent 自动化报告、监控、定时运营等多步骤读写工作", "不写代码搭建内部 AI 工具（应用、仪表盘、文档）并分享给团队", "在 VPC 或隔离环境中私有化部署 Agent 工作台", "在同一工作区内切换多家模型供应商"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://console.mindshub.ai", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Agent工作台", "模型路由", "桌面应用", "知识工作自动化", "私有化部署"], "domain": "AI Agent 平台/知识工作", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供中文等多语言版本（L18）"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5: **MindsHub is an agent workspace for completing knowledge work and developing software, with open-source agent harnesses", "L22: MindsHub gives you the freedom to choose among models and providers instead of being locked into one ecosystem. Use its ", "L49: - **Model Router.** Switch between frontier models (Claude, GPT, Gemini) and open models (DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi) without "], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [49], "note": "Model Router 中提及 Claude 模型，非专门适配", "quotes": ["- **Model Router.** Switch between frontier models (Claude, GPT, Gemini) and open models (DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi) without "]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "mention", "lines": [49], "note": "作为可选开源模型提及", "quotes": ["- **Model Router.** Switch between frontier models (Claude, GPT, Gemini) and open models (DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi) without "]}], "install": [{"term": "binary", "rel": "support", "lines": [33, 34], "note": "macOS .pkg 与 Windows .exe 桌面安装包", "quotes": ["- **macOS.** Download the desktop app (`.pkg`).", "- **Windows.** Download the desktop app (`.exe`)."]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [35, 54, 59], "quotes": ["- **Linux.** Build from source.", "## Build from source", "git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/mindsdb/minds.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [49], "note": "Qwen 作为可选模型被提及", "quotes": ["- **Model Router.** Switch between frontier models (Claude, GPT, Gemini) and open models (DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi) without "]}, {"term": "Kimi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [49], "note": "作为可选开源模型提及", "quotes": ["- **Model Router.** Switch between frontier models (Claude, GPT, Gemini) and open models (DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi) without "]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "b4017d418e12": {"fn": "The-Vibe-Company/quivr", "sha": "b4017d418e12", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "开源内容流搜索引擎：将持续内容转为可搜索与监控", "review": "以 Go 编写的单二进制引擎（api/worker/migrate 命令），将持续输入的内容流持久化摄入并提供词汇、语义与混合检索，支持保存的查询、订阅与告警（关键词、描述式、本地语义三类），告警通过签名 webhook 投递。核心保持通用，连接器、规范化、增强、检索与投递均为插件能力。数据规范存储于 PostgreSQL 与 S3，搜索索引为可重建投影。当前处于评估阶段，API 为 v0，README 明确不建议用于生产。", "highlights": ["持久化与幂等摄入：写入提交确认、幂等键、不可变版本与更正/撤回机制", "词汇、语义与混合检索，每次命中从规范存储回读并重新鉴权", "三类告警插件：布尔关键词、外部分类器描述式、基于本地向量的语义告警", "索引可从持久化工件重建，签名 webhook 投递与重试"], "use_cases": ["持续跟踪新闻流并按关键词或语义条件触发告警", "为多来源文档构建带权限校验的混合检索服务", "需要更正、撤回与版本历史的合规性内容库"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [12, 13]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["搜索引擎", "内容摄入", "告警/监控", "RAG基础设施"], "domain": "搜索引擎/数据基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5: **An open-source engine that turns continuous content streams into search and monitoring.**", "L49: |Lexical and vector search|Weaviate|", "L50: |Embeddings|Local TEI serving pinned `multilingual-e5-small` (384 dimensions)|"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "cohere", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "note": "行 393 在窗口外且上下文未展示，无法核实为接入关系，不写为妥", "quotes": []}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [52, 56, 60], "quotes": ["|Local runtime|Docker Compose|", "Requirements (Linux x86_64, or macOS on Apple Silicon for `make dev`): Go 1.27.2, Docker with Compose v2, Python 3 with ", "make dev      # start dependencies, run migrations, launch API + worker"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "note": "行 140 可见内容为 change feed，未出现 Cursor；行 216 窗口外无法核实", "quotes": []}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [3], "quotes": ["License: MIT"]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "35018b0812f0": {"fn": "deepseek-ai/awesome-deepseek-integration", "sha": "35018b0812f0", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "将 DeepSeek API 接入常用软件的项目清单", "review": "由 deepseek-ai 组织维护的聚合清单，收录将 DeepSeek API 集成到各类软件的项目条目，按应用、客户端库等类别组织。条目涵盖桌面/移动端聊天客户端、翻译与 OCR 工具、笔记与知识库软件、浏览器、RPA 客服、Zotero 插件，以及 PHP/Go/Swift 等 API 客户端库和 Laravel 封装。提供英语、简体中文、繁体中文、日语、西班牙语多个语言版本。清单本身不含安装步骤，各条目链接至各自仓库。", "highlights": ["收录数十个接入 DeepSeek API 的应用与工具条目", "包含 PHP、Go、Swift 语言的 DeepSeek API 客户端库条目", "提供英语、简体中文、繁体中文、日语、西班牙语版本"], "use_cases": ["查找支持接入 DeepSeek API 的桌面或移动端客户端", "为自己的技术栈寻找 DeepSeek API 的客户端库", "浏览 DeepSeek 生态中已集成的软件列表"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "viral", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["awesome清单", "LLM集成", "生态目录"], "domain": "LLM 生态/资源聚合", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["deepseek"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["deepseek-ai 组织维护", "提供简体中文/繁体中文版本", "收录钉钉、思源笔记、go-stock 等国内软件"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: # Awesome DeepSeek Integrations Awesome", "L5: Integrate the DeepSeek API into popular softwares. Access DeepSeek Open Platform to get an API key.", "L11: ## Table of Contents"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [3, 5], "quotes": ["# Awesome DeepSeek Integrations Awesome", "Integrate the DeepSeek API into popular softwares. Access DeepSeek Open Platform to get an API key."]}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "mention", "lines": [42, 43], "quotes": [" OpenRouter", " OpenRouter provides a unified API that gives you access to hundreds of AI models through a single endpoint, while autom"]}, {"term": "bedrock", "rel": "mention", "lines": [60], "note": "SwiftChat 条目中提及支持