 插件安装，也可经 /v1/agents API 部署。所有输出均标注为供专业人士审阅的分析草稿，不构成投资建议，不执行交易。全部内容基于 markdown/JSON 文件，无构建步骤。", "highlights": ["10 个端到端工作流 Agent，以自包含插件形式提供", "9 个垂直插件，含 comps/DCF/LBO 等建模技能与斜杠命令", "集中管理 11 个 MCP 数据连接器（Daloopa、FactSet、Morningstar 等）", "支持 Cowork 插件安装与 Claude Managed Agents API 两种部署方式"], "use_cases": ["为投行/卖方工作流生成路演材料与可比公司分析", "财报后自动更新模型并起草研究笔记", "基金运营中对账、月末结账与估值复核", "KYC 文档解析与规则引擎筛查"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "企业", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["金融服务", "Agent模板", "MCP连接器", "技能包", "Claude插件"], "domain": "金融服务/企业应用", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Reference agents, skills, and data connectors for the financial-services workflows we see most — investment banking, equ", "L5: Everything here is available **two ways from one source**: install it as a Claude Cowork plugin, or deploy it through th", "L12: - **Agents** — named, end-to-end workflow agents (Pitch Agent, Market Researcher, GL Reconciler, …). Each ships as a Cow"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [1, 5, 12], "quotes": ["# Claude for Financial Services", "Everything here is available **two ways from one source**: install it as a Claude Cowork plugin, or deploy it through th", "- **Agents** — named, end-to-end workflow agents (Pitch Agent, Market Researcher, GL Reconciler, …). Each ships as a Cow"]}, {"term": "bedrock", "rel": "mention", "lines": [127], "note": "Microsoft 365 插件路由选项之一（Vertex AI、Bedrock 或内部网关），非本仓库专属适配", "quotes": ["If your firm runs Claude inside Excel, PowerPoint, Word, and Outlook via the Microsoft 365 add-in, `claude-for-msft-365-"]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [54, 129], "note": "安装途径之一，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["### Claude Code", "It's a Claude Code plugin (not a Cowork plugin) that walks an IT admin through generating the customized add-in manifest"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "93086187c45a": {"fn": "VectifyAI/PageIndex", "sha": "93086187c45a", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向长专业文档 RAG 的树状索引检索引擎，无需向量库", "review": "PageIndex 用层次化树索引替代向量索引：索引阶段从文档版式提取树结构并由基础模型摘要精炼，检索阶段由 LLM 在树上推理式搜索定位相关章节，不需要向量数据库与分块。以 pip 包提供 SDK，支持本地模式（本地索引/检索/对话，用自有 LLM key）与 PageIndex Cloud（托管解析、OCR、存储）两种形态；提供 OpenAI Agents SDK、Claude Agent SDK 集成路径。开源版仅处理文本型 PDF；扫描件与图像文档需走云服务。", "highlights": ["树状索引 + LLM 推理检索，无向量库、无分块", "SDK 本地模式：本机索引/检索/对话，用自有 LLM key", "可接入 OpenAI Agents SDK / Claude Agent SDK 等 agent 框架", "本地索引成本与耗时的基准数据（约 $0.001/页，9–1,098 页文档 13 秒–4.5 分钟）"], "use_cases": ["对财报、法律文件、技术手册等长 PDF 做问答检索", "把文档检索工具接入自己的 agent 框架", "本地用自有模型 key 建立可溯源的文档索引"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["RAG", "文档检索", "agent工具", "PDF问答"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/RAG", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L7: # PageIndex: Vectorless, Reasoning-based RAG", "L30: 1. **Index**: generate a **tree-structure index** for each document", "L76: Drop PageIndex tools into the OpenAI Agents SDK, the Claude Agent SDK, or any other framework."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [76], "note": "Claude Agent SDK 集成途径，非专门适配的模型提供方", "quotes": ["Drop PageIndex tools into the OpenAI Agents SDK, the Claude Agent SDK, or any other framework."]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [19, 55], "quotes": ["- [Aug '26] 🔥 **PageIndex SDK**: `pip install -U pageindex` now ships **local mode**: index, retrieve, and chat entirely", "pip install -U pageindex"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "af96c39633d3": {"fn": "pingcap/tidb", "sha": "af96c39633d3", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "开源分布式 SQL 数据库：面向事务、分析与向量检索负载", "review": "TiDB 是开源、云原生的分布式 SQL 数据库，采用存算分离架构，通过两阶段提交与 Raft 协议提供分布式事务、强一致与高可用。内置 TiKV 行存与 TiFlash 列存双引擎，支持 HTAP 混合负载；兼容 MySQL 8.0 协议与工具生态，提供迁移工具；支持向量搜索。可部署于本地、公有云或 Kubernetes（TiDB Operator），亦提供全托管的 TiDB Cloud（含免费计划）。以 Go 编写，Apache 2.0 许可。", "highlights": ["两阶段提交 + Raft 多副本的分布式事务与自动故障转移", "TiKV 行存与 TiFlash 列存双引擎 HTAP 架构", "兼容 MySQL 8.0 协议、框架与工具，支持向量搜索", "支持本地、Kubernetes（TiDB Operator）与 TiDB Cloud 托管部署"], "use_cases": ["为水平扩展的 OLTP 应用替换 MySQL 后端", "在同一数据库中同时运行交易与分析查询", "在 Kubernetes 上自管理分布式数据库集群", "为 AI 应用存储事务数据并执行向量检索"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://www.pingcap.com/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=tidb", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["分布式数据库", "SQL", "HTAP", "向量搜索", "云原生"], "domain": "数据库/基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["PingCAP 中国背景", "TiDB 中文用户案例", "TiDB Chinese Forum"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L14: TiDB (/’taɪdiːbi:/, \"Ti\" stands for Titanium) is an open-source, cloud-native, distributed SQL database designed for hig", "L26: - **Hybrid Transactional/Analytical Processing (HTAP)**: TiDB provides two storage engines: TiKV, a row-based storage en", "L28: - **Cloud-Native**: TiDB can be deployed in public clouds, on-premises, or natively in Kubernetes. TiDB Operator helps m"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "a9ab4dadc2b1": {"fn": "google/langextract", "sha": "a9ab4dadc2b1", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "用 LLM 从非结构化文本提取结构化信息并溯源的 Python 库", "review": "LangExtract 是一个 Python 库：按用户自定义指令和 few-shot 示例，用 LLM 从临床笔记、报告等非结构化文本中提取结构化信息。核心机制包括：分块与并行处理长文档、多次抽取提高召回、将每个抽取值锚定回原文精确字符区间，并可生成自包含的交互式 HTML 可视化文件。模型侧支持 Gemini 系列、OpenAI（可选依赖）、经内置 Ollama 接口的本地模型，并提供插件系统接入自定义 provider。云模型需配置 API key；本地模型无需 key。", "highlights": ["抽取值精确锚定到源文本字符区间，支持可视化高亮核验", "分块+并行+多次抽取策略处理长文档", "内置 Ollama 支持本地推理，无需 API key", "轻量插件系统注册自定义模型 provider"], "use_cases": ["从临床笔记或报告中抽取结构化字段并保留原文出处", "整本小说级长文档的批量实体抽取", "无 API key 环境下用本地模型做信息抽取", "生成可视化 HTML 供人工审阅大量抽取结果"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "L21-L22 指向浏览器内 live demo", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["信息抽取", "结构化输出", "NLP", "LLM基础设施"], "domain": "NLP/信息抽取", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L17: LangExtract is a Python library that uses LLMs to extract structured information from unstructured text documents based ", "L30: 5. **Flexible LLM Support:** Supports your preferred models, from cloud-based LLMs like the Google Gemini family to loca"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [153, 266, 267], "quotes": ["using local LLMs, LangExtract offers built-in support for Ollama and can be", "## Using Local LLMs with Ollama", "LangExtract supports local inference using Ollama, allowing you to run models without API keys:"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [115, 118], "quotes": ["### From PyPI", "pip install langextract"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [136], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/google/langextract.git"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [145, 146], "quotes": ["docker build -t langextract .", "docker run --rm -e LANGEXTRACT_API_KEY=\"your-api-key\" langextract python your_script.py"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "f21ce455a915": {"fn": "google-research/google-research", "sha": "f21ce455a915", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "Google Research 开源研究代码汇总仓库", "review": "该仓库集中存放 Google Research 发布的研究代码，内容按子目录划分为多个独立项目，覆盖主题标签所列的 AI 与机器学习研究方向。仓库体量较大，README 建议仅下载感兴趣的子目录（可通过 github.dev 编辑器下载），或以浅克隆方式获取源码。数据集采用 CC BY 4.0 许可，源代码采用 Apache 2.0 许可，仓库声明非 Google 官方产品。", "highlights": ["集中托管 Google Research 发布的多个研究项目代码", "数据集采用 CC BY 4.0，源代码采用 Apache 2.0 双许可结构", "支持通过 github.dev 编辑器按子目录下载", "提供浅克隆命令以减小下载体积"], "use_cases": ["按子目录下载感兴趣的研究项目代码", "复现或查阅论文配套的开源实现", "以浅克隆方式浏览仓库内容"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_frict