）机器学习教程中文笔记**", "L19: 本人2014年下半年开始翻译本课程字幕，并写了课程的中文笔记。笔记被下载了几万次，应该帮助了不少人，也有很多人一直在帮助我，现在我把笔记的**word**原稿和**markdown**原稿分享给大家。", "L21: **markdown**的笔记和课程中英文字幕我将放在**github**，希望大家能继续完善。为方便数学公式的在线显示，在线观看的是**html**文件，公式已经被转为图片，公式源码在**markdown**文件。"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "a35e63bfb4d7": {"fn": "ItzCrazyKns/Vane", "sha": "a35e63bfb4d7", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "自托管的 AI 答问搜索引擎，本地运行并带引用来源", "review": "Vane 是一个注重隐私的 AI 答问引擎，可完全运行在用户自己的硬件上。它通过 SearxNG 聚合多个搜索引擎结果（支持网页、讨论、学术论文来源），接入本地 LLM（Ollama、OpenAI 兼容服务器、Lemonade）或云服务商（OpenAI、Claude、Groq、Gemini），生成带引用来源的回答。功能包括文件上传问答（PDF/文本/图片）、图片与视频搜索、域名限定搜索、天气/股价等小组件、搜索历史本地保存，并提供 API 供开发者集成。Docker 镜像内置 SearxNG，也支持 npm 从源码运行。", "highlights": ["基于 SearxNG 的网页/讨论/学术搜索，回答带引用来源", "支持本地 LLM（Ollama）与多家云服务商，可混合搭配模型", "文件上传问答：PDF、文本、图片", "提供 API 与浏览器搜索引擎快捷方式接入"], "use_cases": ["在自有硬件上自托管一个带引用来源的问答搜索引擎", "用本地 LLM 保持搜索查询隐私", "将搜索引擎集成到自己的应用中", "把浏览器搜索栏切换为自托管 AI 搜索"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AI搜索引擎", "RAG", "自托管", "本地LLM"], "domain": "AI 搜索/信息检索", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "groq", "ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L11: Vane is a **privacy-focused AI answering engine** that runs entirely on your own hardware. It combines knowledge from th", "L19: 🤖 **Support for all major AI providers** - Use local LLMs through Ollama or connect to OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Google ", "L27: 🔍 **Web search powered by SearxNG** - Access multiple search engines while keeping your identity private. Support for Ta"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [11, 19], "quotes": ["Vane is a **privacy-focused AI answering engine** that runs entirely on your own hardware. It combines knowledge from th", "🤖 **Support for all major AI providers** - Use local LLMs through Ollama or connect to OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Google "]}, {"term": "groq", "rel": "support", "lines": [11, 19], "quotes": ["Vane is a **privacy-focused AI answering engine** that runs entirely on your own hardware. It combines knowledge from th", "🤖 **Support for all major AI providers** - Use local LLMs through Ollama or connect to OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Google "]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [11, 19, 144, 146, 148], "quotes": ["Vane is a **privacy-focused AI answering engine** that runs entirely on your own hardware. It combines knowledge from th", "🤖 **Support for all major AI providers** - Use local LLMs through Ollama or connect to OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Google ", "#### Ollama Connection Errors", "If you're encountering an Ollama connection error, it is likely due to the backend being unable to connect to Ollama's A", "1. **Check your Ollama API URL:** Ensure that the API URL is correctly set in the settings menu."]}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [47, 54, 66, 92, 93], "quotes": ["There are mainly 2 ways of installing Vane - With Docker, Without Docker. Using Docker is highly recommended.", "docker run -d -p 3000:3000 -v vane-data:/home/vane/data --name vane itzcrazykns1337/vane:latest", "docker run -d -p 3000:3000 -e SEARXNG_API_URL=http://your-searxng-url:8080 -v vane-data:/home/vane/data --name vane itzc", "   docker build -t vane .", "   docker run -d -p 3000:3000 -v vane-data:/home/vane/data --name vane vane"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [78, 84], "quotes": ["If you prefer to build from source or need more control:", "   git clone https://github.com/ItzCrazyKns/Vane.git"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [113], "quotes": ["   npm i"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "620f2ba5126d": {"fn": "Dokploy/dokploy", "sha": "620f2ba5126d", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "自托管 PaaS：部署和管理应用与数据库", "review": "免费、可自托管的平台即服务（PaaS），用于简化应用与数据库的部署管理。支持部署多种语言应用（Node.js、PHP、Python、Go、Ruby 等）及 MySQL、PostgreSQL、MongoDB、MariaDB、Redis 等数据库；基于 Docker Swarm 实现多节点集群，内置 Traefik 路由集成、数据库外部备份、一键部署开源模板、实时资源监控与日志指标推送（Grafana、Datadog 等），并提供 CLI 与 API 管理入口。在 VPS 上通过一行脚本安装，另有 Dokploy Cloud 托管选项。", "highlights": ["部署多语言应用与管理 6 种数据库", "Docker Swarm 多节点伸缩与 Traefik 自动集成", "日志与指标推送至 Grafana、Datadog、AWS CloudWatch 等多个平台", "CLI 与 API 管理途径，支持多服务器远程部署"], "use_cases": ["在自有 VPS 上托管 Web 应用与数据库", "为数据库配置到外部存储的自动备份", "用 Docker Compose 管理复杂多容器应用", "一键部署 Plausible、Pocketbase 等开源模板"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["PaaS", "自托管", "DevOps", "Docker", "应用部署"], "domain": "开发运维/部署平台", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L2:  Dokploy - Open Source Alternative to Vercel, Heroku and Netlify.", "L10: Dokploy is a free, self-hostable Platform as a Service (PaaS) that simplifies the deployment and management of applicati", "L20: - **Multi Node**: Scale applications to multiple nodes using Docker Swarm to manage the cluster."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [19, 38], "note": "基于 Docker 的部署体系并随安装脚本部署", "quotes": ["- **Docker Compose**: Native support for Docker Compose to manage complex applications.", "curl -sSL https://dokploy.com/install.sh | bash"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "c0e986472ac6": {"fn": "khoj-ai/khoj", "sha": "c0e986472ac6", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "自托管的个人 AI 第二大脑：检索文档与网络、构建自定义 agent", "review": "Khoj 是一个可自托管的个人 AI 应用，支持接入本地或在线 LLM，从互联网和本地文档（PDF、Markdown、Notion、Word、org-mode 等）中检索并回答问题；可创建带有自定义知识、persona、聊天模型与工具的 agent，支持定时自动化研究与通知。可通过浏览器、Obsidian、Emacs、桌面、手机或 WhatsApp 访问，提供云端版本供免安装使用，另有面向企业的云/本地/混合部署形态。", "highlights": ["支持 llama3、qwen、mistral、gpt、claude、gemini、deepseek 等本地或在线 LLM", "读取 PDF、Markdown、Notion、Word、org-mode 等多种文档并做语义搜索", "创建自定义知识、persona、模型与工具的 agent，支持自动化研究任务", "支持自托管，也提供云端直接使用入口"], "use_cases": ["在 Obsidian/Emacs 中对个人笔记与文档提问", "自托管私有 AI 助手并接入本地模型", "让 agent 定时执行研究并推送通知"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "viral", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://app.khoj.dev", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["个人知识库", "自托管", "AI助手/Agent", "语义搜索"], "domain": "个人知识管理/LLM 应用", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L28: Khoj is a personal AI app to extend your capabilities. It smoothly scales up from an on-device personal AI to a cloud-sc", "L30