d tested with multiple datasets: aidatatang_200zh, magicdata, aishell3, data_aishell,", "L166: |**1806.04558**|**SV2TTS**|**Transfer Learning from Speaker Verification to Multispeaker Text-To-Speech Synthesis**|This", "L19: 🌍 **Webserver Ready** to serve your result with remote calling"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [33, 35, 61, 62, 66], "quotes": ["* Run `pip install -r requirements.txt` to install the remaining necessary packages.", "* Install webrtcvad `pip install webrtcvad-wheels`(If you need)", "    pip install --upgrade pip", "    pip install pyqt5", "> Both packages seem to be unique to this project and are not seen in the original Real-Time Voice Cloning project. When"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "support", "lines": [69], "quotes": [" * `brew install python` `Python.h` can come with Python installed by brew"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [75], "quotes": [" * `git clone https://github.com/lumaku/ctc-segmentation.git`"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": true, "lines": [1]}}}, "af5ec4d38dfd": {"fn": "songquanpeng/one-api", "sha": "af5ec4d38dfd", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "开发者的 LLM API 网关：统一多家模型接口并管理分发 key", "review": "以 Go 编写的 LLM API 管理与分发系统，将数十家模型服务商的接口统一为 OpenAI API 格式对外提供。核心机制包括渠道管理、负载均衡、失败重试、令牌（额度、过期时间、IP 范围、模型范围）与兑换码管理、多机部署主从节点、按分组的倍率计费。默认 SQLite 存储，可通过环境变量切换 MySQL/PostgreSQL 并配置 Redis 缓存。提供单可执行文件、Docker 镜像及宝塔、Sealos、Zeabur、Render 等部署途径。README 提醒需遵循 OpenAI 使用条款及中国区备案要求。", "highlights": ["支持 30 余家模型服务商，统一以 OpenAI API 格式访问", "令牌与兑换码管理：额度、过期时间、IP 范围、模型访问控制", "多渠道负载均衡与失败自动重试，支持多机主从部署", "单可执行文件 + Docker 镜像，支持 SQLite/MySQL/PostgreSQL"], "use_cases": ["为团队或应用统一管理多家模型服务商的 API key", "将 key 二次分发给多个用户并控制额度与权限", "在多个上游渠道间做负载均衡和失败重试", "自建 LLM 网关供前端应用（如 ChatGPT Next Web）接入"]}, "filters": {"ai