dds it: Install in VS Code Add to Cursor"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [150], "note": "列为受支持的模型服务商", "quotes": ["25 providers are supported: AWS Bedrock (default), OpenAI, Anthropic, Google AI, Google Vertex AI, Azure OpenAI, Ollama,"]}, {"term": "Kimi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [150], "note": "列为受支持的模型服务商", "quotes": ["25 providers are supported: AWS Bedrock (default), OpenAI, Anthropic, Google AI, Google Vertex AI, Azure OpenAI, Ollama,"]}, {"term": "豆包", "rel": "mention", "lines": [150], "note": "ByteDance Doubao，列为受支持的模型服务商", "quotes": ["25 providers are supported: AWS Bedrock (default), OpenAI, Anthropic, Google AI, Google Vertex AI, Azure OpenAI, Ollama,"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "59a085290697": {"fn": "p-e-w/heretic", "sha": "59a085290697", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "自动去除语言模型审查（abliteration）的命令行工具", "review": "Heretic 是一个对 transformer 语言模型执行去审查（移除安全对齐）的工具，采用方向消融（abliteration）实现，并用 Optuna 的 TPE 参数优化器自动搜索消融参数，目标为同时最小化拒答数与与原模型的 KL 散度。支持多数稠密模型、部分多模态、MoE 及混合架构，纯状态空间模型暂不支持。通过 pip 安装后以命令行运行，提供内置评估、量化（bitsandbytes）、保存、上传 Hugging Face 与聊天测试等功能。", "highlights": ["方向消融 + TPE 自动参数优化，无需手动调参与 transformer 内部知识", "同时最小化拒答数与 KL 散度以保留原模型能力", "运行前自动基准测试系统以确定最优 batch size", "支持 bitsandbytes 量化以降低 VRAM 占用，完成后可上传 Hugging Face"], "use_cases": ["对已发布的开源模型自动生成去审查版本", "复现/评估消融模型的拒答率与 KL 散度指标", "在不了解 transformer 内部机制的情况下批量处理模型"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "viral", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["模型去审查", "abliteration", "模型修改", "LLM工具"], "domain": "LLM 模型修改工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L7: Heretic is a tool that removes censorship (aka \"safety alignment\") from", "L13: with a TPE-based parameter optimizer powered by Optuna.", "L89: pip install -U heretic-llm"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [89], "quotes": ["pip install -U heretic-llm"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "16gb vram", "rel": "mention", "lines": [70], "note": "用户评论中提及运行某模型的硬件语境，非本产品自身硬件要求", "quotes": ["> Has been the best unquantized abliterated model that I have been able to run on 16gb vram.\""]}], "products": [{"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [90, 93], "note": "Qwen 模型作为示例/输入对象出现，非竞品或替代关系", "quotes": ["heretic Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507", "Replace `Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507` with whatever model you want to decensor."]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "e1a795ae93b0": {"fn": "can1357/oh-my-pi", "sha": "e1a795ae93b0", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的 IDE 级编码 agent CLI，60+ 模型接入", "review": "Stencil Labs 维护的 Pi 分叉，以 CLI/TUI 形式提供编码 agent：内置 31 个工具、14 个 LSP 操作、28 个 DAP 调试操作，Rust 核心约 8 万行。支持 60+ 模型提供方，接入 lldb/dlv/debugpy 等调试器，提供子代理 fan-out（隔离 worktree、schema 校验返回）、reviewer 模型逐轮监督、流中规则注入、/collab 会话共享、按内容哈希的编辑（hashline）与基于 git 的原子提交拆分。安装覆盖 curl 脚本、Homebrew、Bun、Nix、Windows PowerShell、mise。PR 接受采用 vouch 机制（当前暂停试用中）。", "highlights": ["60+ 模型提供方、31 内置工具、14 LSP 操作、28 DAP 操作", "持久 Python/Bun 执行内核可回调 agent 工具", "子代理在隔离 worktree 并行，返回 schema 校验结果", "通过 ACP 在 Zed 中驱动同一 agent，无需插件"], "use_cases": ["在终端用所选模型驱动具备 IDE 能力（LSP/调试器）的编码 agent", "把任务拆给多个子代理并行完成并汇总结果", "与同事共享 agent 会话进行结对或观摩", "让 agent 生成原子化 git 提交序列"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"ta