uter、Claude、Mistral 等），提供移动端友好布局、Visual Novel 模式、Automatic1111 与 ComfyUI 图像生成集成、TTS、WorldInfo（lorebooks）、自定义 UI、自动翻译，并支持第三方扩展。不提供在线托管服务，也不收集用户数据；运行需 NodeJS 20 及以上。", "highlights": ["统一界面接入多种 LLM API", "集成 Automatic1111 与 ComfyUI 图像生成及 TTS", "支持 WorldInfo（lorebooks）、自定义 UI 与第三方扩展", "支持 Windows、macOS/Linux、Android (Termux) 与 Docker 安装"], "use_cases": ["在本地通过统一前端使用多家 LLM 服务对话", "为聊天角色配置 lorebooks 与提示词选项", "在对话中集成图像生成与语音合成"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "viral", "deploy": null, "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "消费者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM前端", "聊天界面", "角色扮演", "本地部署"], "domain": "LLM 前端/聊天工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "openrouter"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L10: SillyTavern provides a single unified interface for many LLM APIs (KoboldAI/CPP, Horde, NovelAI, Ooba, Tabby, OpenAI, Op", "L16: SillyTavern (or ST for short) is a locally installed user interface that allows you to interact with text generation LLM", "L28: The hardware requirements are minimal: it will run on anything that can run NodeJS 20 or higher. If you intend to do LLM"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [10], "quotes": ["SillyTavern provides a single unified interface for many LLM APIs (KoboldAI/CPP, Horde, NovelAI, Ooba, Tabby, OpenAI, Op"]}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "support", "lines": [10], "quotes": ["SillyTavern provides a single unified interface for many LLM APIs (KoboldAI/CPP, Horde, NovelAI, Ooba, Tabby, OpenAI, Op"]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "88b1a775df83": {"fn": "TheAlgorithms/C-Plus-Plus", "sha": "88b1a775df83", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向教学的多领域 C++ 算法实现集合", "review": "The Algorithms 社区维护的 C++ 算法实现集合，覆盖计算机科学、数学与统计、数据科学、机器学习、工程等主题，MIT 许可证开源。每个源码文件独立、仅使用 STL、无需外部库，遵循 C++17 标准，每次提交在 Windows/macOS/Ubuntu 三系统上用 MSVC/AppleClang/GNU 编译测试。文档由源码自动生成，提供程序执行说明、流程图示与 STL 函数链接。定位为教育者与学生的学习资源，同一目标可能提供多种算法策略的实现。", "highlights": ["仅依赖 STL、无需外部库即可编译运行的原子化实现", "每次提交在三大操作系统上以三种编译器编译测试", "文档由源码生成，含执行说明与程序流程图", "遵循 C++17 标准，可移植到 ESP32、ARM Cortex 等嵌入式平台"], "use_cases": ["学习算法原理并阅读带注释的 C++ 实现", "教师在课程中作为教学素材与参考实现", "面试准备时练习算法与数据结构"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["算法", "C++", "教育", "数据结构", "机器学习实现"], "domain": "教育/算法与数据结构", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": null, "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L15: This repository is a collection of open-source implementation of a variety of algorithms implemented in C++ and licensed", "L21: - Each source code is atomic using STL classes and _no external libraries_ are required for their compilation and execut", "L22: - Source codes are compiled and tested for every commit on the latest versions of three major operating systems viz., Wi"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "6cce8399490c": {"fn": "mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills", "sha": "6cce8399490c", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 AI 代理提供网络安全技能库：818 条技能，映射 6 大框架", "review": "面向 AI 代理的网络安全技能库，收录 818 条遵循 agentskills.io 标准的结构化技能，覆盖 34 个安全领域，并映射到 MITRE ATT&CK、NIST CSF 2.0、MITRE ATLAS、D3FEND、NIST AI RMF 与 MITRE F3 六个框架。每条技能以 YAML frontmatter 加 Markdown 正文组织，支持渐进式加载（扫描约 30 tokens，完整加载 500–2,000 tokens）。通过 npx 或 git clone 获取，可在 Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、Codex CLI、Cursor、Gemini CLI 等平台直接使用。README 声明为独立社区项目，与 Anthropic PBC 无隶属关系，并要求仅在授权合法场景下使用。", "highlights": ["818 条技能覆盖 34 个安全领域，映射 6 个行业框架", "每条技能带 YAML frontmatter，扫描约 30 tokens、完整加载 500–2,000 tokens 的渐进式披露架构", "ATT&CK v19.1 映射经官方 mitreattack-python 库校验，覆盖 290 个技术 ID", "通过 npx skills add 或 git clone 安装，兼容 agentskills.io 标准平台"], "use_cases": ["给安全分析类 AI 代理加载内存取证、威胁狩猎等结构化工作流", "按 MITRE ATT&CK/NIST CSF 框架组织团队的安全技能资产", "用于红队、DFIR、渗透测试等授权安全场景的代理指导"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "Casky.ai Playground（L120-122）", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["网络安全", "AI代理技能库", "MITRE ATT&CK", "安全运营", "知识库"], "domain": "网络安全/Agent 技能知识库", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L34: This repo contains **818 structured cybersecurity skills** spanning **34 security domains**, each following the agentski", "L137: **Anthropic Cybersecurity Skills** is not a collection of scripts or checklists. It is an **AI-native knowledge base** b", "L101: Works immediately with Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, OpenAI Codex CLI, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and any agentskills.io-compati"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdict