": "huggingface/diffusers", "sha": "45d7760fb734", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为开发者提供 PyTorch 扩散模型的推理与训练工具库", "review": "Hugging Face 维护的 PyTorch 扩散模型库，覆盖图像、音频与分子 3D 结构的生成任务。核心由三部分组成：数行代码即可运行的推理 pipeline、可互换的噪声调度器、可组合搭建自定义系统的预训练模型模块。README 提供 pip/conda 安装方式、文本生成图像的快速上手示例，并列出文本生成图像、图生图、修复、超分辨率等任务对应的 pipeline 与 Hub 上的 30,000+ 检查点入口。设计取向为可用性与可定制性，并提示贡献者参考 .ai/ 目录的 AI agent 约定。", "highlights": ["提供数行代码完成推理的 diffusion pipeline 与 30,000+ 预训练检查点加载", "噪声调度器可互换，预训练模型可作为组件组合搭建自定义扩散系统", "覆盖文本生成图像、图生图、修复、超分辨率等任务及对应 pipeline 清单", "提供面向 AI agent 的贡献约定（.ai/ 目录、claude plugin 安装）"], "use_cases": ["用几行代码加载预训练扩散模型生成图像", "训练自己的扩散模型或搭建自定义端到端生成系统", "按任务查找 Stable Diffusion、ControlNet、DDPM 等模型与 pipeline"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["扩散模型", "图像生成", "深度学习库", "PyTorch"], "domain": "AI 生成/深度学习工具库", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L7: 🤗 Diffusers is the go-to library for state-of-the-art pretrained diffusion models for generating images, audio, and even", "L11: - State-of-the-art diffusion pipelines that can be run in inference with just a few lines of code.", "L74: If you are using an AI agent, please point it at the project conventions in `.ai/` first (install them as a plugin with "], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [74], "note": "贡献流程中提及以 claude plugin/skill 形式使用 AI agent，非模型接入", "quotes": ["If you are using an AI agent, please point it at the project conventions in