ing Plan, Zhipu, Moonshot (Kimi), Qianfan (Baidu), Hunyuan (Ten"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [101, 103, 120, 126], "note": "被接入的外部 CLI Agent", "quotes": ["If you already use Claude Code, Codex, Hermes Agent, or OpenClaw, AionUi auto-detects them and lets you Cowork with all ", "**Supported Agents:** Built-in Agent (powered by the embedded aionrs agent engine) • Claude Code • Codex • Qwen Code • G", "- **Leader orchestration** — Leader assigns, tracks, and aggregates results; supported backends include Claude Code, Cod", "- **Supported backends** — Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, Snow CLI, Aion CLI (aionrs); other ACP backends with `mcpCapabili"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [51, 103], "note": "被接入的外部 CLI Agent", "quotes": ["|Multiple AI Agents at once|No|**Dozens of external agents — including Claude Code, Codex, Qwen Code, Hermes Agent, Curs", "**Supported Agents:** Built-in Agent (powered by the embedded aionrs agent engine) • Claude Code • Codex • Qwen Code • G"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [51, 103, 154], "note": "Qwen Code 与 Dashscope 平台接入", "quotes": ["|Multiple AI Agents at once|No|**Dozens of external agents — including Claude Code, Codex, Qwen Code, Hermes Agent, Curs", "**Supported Agents:** Built-in Agent (powered by the embedded aionrs agent engine) • Claude Code • Codex • Qwen Code • G", "- **Chinese Platforms** — Dashscope (Qwen), Dashscope Coding Plan, Zhipu, Moonshot (Kimi), Qianfan (Baidu), Hunyuan (Ten"]}, {"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "mention", "lines": [103], "note": "被接入的外部 CLI Agent", "quotes": ["**Supported Agents:** Built-in Agent (powered by the embedded aionrs agent engine) • Claude Code • Codex • Qwen Code • G"]}]}}, "b9d247c74b44": {"fn": "zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw", "sha": "b9d247c74b44", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "个人 AI 助手运行时：单二进制 Rust 程序，多渠道多模型自托管", "review": "ZeroClaw 是一个以单个 Rust 二进制分发的 agent 运行时，用户在本机配置运行：通过 30+ 渠道（Discord、Telegram、Matrix、邮件、webhook、CLI 等）收发消息，接入约 20 余家 LLM 提供商并可配置 fallback 链与路由，通过 shell、浏览器、HTTP、硬件、自定义 MCP 服务器等工具执行动作。默认自治级别为 supervised，中等风险操作需审批、高风险被阻止，支持 Landlock/Bubblewrap/Seatbelt/Docker 沙箱与工具回执。配置为单个 TOML 文件，可注册为系统服务常驻运行。", "highlights": ["单 Rust 二进制，本地运行，数据与密钥留在用户机器", "30+ 消息渠道适配器与可插拔模型提供商（含 fallback 链）", "supervised 默认自治模式、OS 级沙箱与每次动作的加密工具回执", "通过 Peripheral trait 支持 Raspberry Pi、STM32、Arduino、ESP32 的 GPIO/I2C/SPI/USB"], "use_cases": ["在一台自己的机器上部署跨 Discord/Telegram 等渠道的常驻个人助手", "配置多个 LLM 提供商并在故障时自动切换", "在树莓派等设备上让 agent 控制硬件外设", "通过 MQTT/webhook/cron 事件触发带审批门的标准作业流程"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": null, "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AI助手/Agent", "自托管", "agent运行时", "多渠道接入"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 运行时", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama", "anthropic"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L21: ZeroClaw is an agent runtime — a single Rust binary you configure and run. It talks to LLM providers (Anthropic, OpenAI,", "L67: - **Provider-agnostic** — model providers are pluggable. Configure Anthropic, OpenAI, local Ollama, or any OpenAI-compat", "L68: - **Security-first, with escape hatches** — default autonomy is `supervised`: medium-risk ops require approval, high-ris"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [21, 67], "quotes": ["ZeroClaw is an agent runtime — a single Rust binary you configure and run. It talks to LLM providers (Anthropic, OpenAI,", "- **Provider-agnostic** — model providers are pluggable. Configure Anthropic, OpenAI, local Ollama, or any OpenAI-compat"]}, {"t