 与 Web 服务器形式提供的自托管平台：`setup --all` 通过 QEMU（KVM 或 Windows Hypervisor Platform 加速）构建/下载 Dot 的镜像，每个 Dot 拥有一台带持久磁盘的 Linux 桌面虚拟机，空闲休眠、有任务时唤醒。浏览器基于 C++ 补丁版 Firefox（invisible_playwright_mcp），指纹在引擎内设置，各身份独立保存 cookies 与登录态；支持 MCP 服务器接入、权限分级（allow/ask/deny）、定时任务队列、以及 Web UI/CLI/HTTP API/Telegram/WhatsApp 多通道触达，重启后消息与任务不丢失。README 注明状态为 alpha，仅支持 Linux 与 Windows，使用时需遵守目标站点条款与 robots.txt。", "highlights": ["硬件加速 VM 内运行 Linux 桌面，持久磁盘，空闲休眠/按任务唤醒", "C++ 补丁版 Firefox 浏览器，指纹在引擎内设置，身份级 cookies 与登录态", "MCP 服务器声明式接入与 allow/ask/deny 权限分级，ask 请求可在重启后恢复", "Web UI、CLI、HTTP API、Telegram、WhatsApp 多通道接入"], "use_cases": ["让智能体每天定时查询机票价格并写入 CSV 汇报最低价", "以指定身份登录网站下载发票并记住页面位置供下次使用", "在自托管环境运行浏览器自动化任务，持久保存各身份登录态"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [84]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["浏览器自动化", "自主智能体", "反检测浏览器", "自托管", "虚拟机"], "domain": "AI Agent/浏览器自动化", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["openrouter"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L51: |**A computer of its own**|A hardware-accelerated VM with a Linux desktop and a persistent disk. It sleeps when idle and", "L52: |**A browser that is not blocked**|invisible_playwright_mcp: Firefox patched in C++, the fingerprint set inside the engi", "L54: |**Your MCP servers**|Any MCP server you declare, a program on its computer or a URL, as in Claude Code. Its keys stay o"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [53, 54], "note": "以 Claude Code 的行为作类比说明，非接入 Anthropic 通道", "quotes": ["|**Memory and skills**|It writes its own notes and 