x 插件，支持 Docker Compose 部署，Postgres 单机整合当前为 demo 特性。", "highlights": ["无 LLM key 时用本地 GLiNER 与嵌入模型在 CPU 上构建图谱", "remember/recall/improve/forget 四种记忆操作", "Claude Code、Codex、OpenClaw、MCP 客户端等多种接入接口", "Docker 镜像内置 GLiNER 运行时，可用 COGX 格式从 Mem0/Letta/Zep/Graphiti 导入"], "use_cases": ["为 agent 保留跨会话的项目上下文与历史决策", "把团队文档、工单、代码汇入共享的 Company Brain", "在自有基础设施上运行自托管记忆层", "从其他记忆方案（Mem0/Letta/Zep/Graphiti）迁移记忆数据"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.xxxxx (Optimizing the Interface Between Knowledge Graphs and LLMs for Complex Reasoning, Markovic et al. 2025，README 未给直接链接)", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["agent记忆", "知识图谱", "RAG", "自托管"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 记忆", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供中文等多语言版本"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L32:  Cognee is a free open-source AI memory platform that gives AI agents persistent long-term memory across sessions. Turn ", "L34:  Runs locally for free — no API key required.", "L116: Once a key is set, Cognee uses OpenAI for language models and embeddings, and processing and generated answers make prov"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [116, 203], "quotes": ["Once a key is set, Cognee uses OpenAI for language models and embeddings, and processing and generated answers make prov", "- Run with local Ollama models, including a local embedding model."]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [149, 152], "note": "Claude Code 插件接入，非 LLM 提供方适配", "quotes": 