 tools，避免将大量工具定义载入上下文；每个会话也可暴露托管 MCP 端点供 Claude、Cursor 等 MCP 客户端使用。CLI 支持工具搜索、执行、账号连接和 TypeScript 脚本工作流。需要 COMPOSIO_API_KEY。TypeScript SDK 要求 Node 22+，Python SDK 支持 3.10+。", "highlights": ["1000+ 预认证工具集与按用户会话管理", "meta tools 运行时发现/认证/执行，控制上下文占用", "每个会话可开启托管 MCP 端点", "覆盖 OpenAI、Anthropic、LangChain、CrewAI 等的 provider 适配器"], "use_cases": ["让 Agent 跨多个应用执行操作而无需自行维护集成", "为不同 Agent 框架统一接入工具并管理用户认证", "通过 CLI 在本地为编码 Agent 提供工具面"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Agent工具集成", "SDK", "MCP", "function-calling"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 工具层", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L20: Composio gives your AI agents 1000+ pre-authenticated toolkits, per-user sessions, authentication, triggers, and a sandb", "L27: - **Provider adapters** for OpenAI Agents, Claude Agent SDK, Vercel AI SDK, LangChain, and more"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [27, 85, 86], "quotes": ["- **Provider adapters** for OpenAI Agents, Claude Agent SDK, Vercel AI SDK, LangChain, and more", "|Anthropic|`@composio/anthropic`|`composio-anthropic`|", "|Claude Agent SDK|`@composio/claude-agent-sdk`|`composio-claude-agent-sdk`|"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [51], "quotes": ["pip install composio composio-openai-agents openai-agents"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [36], "quotes": ["npm install @composio/core @composio/openai-agents @openai/agents"]}], "