warehouses, desig"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [3, 13, 41], "quotes": ["Plugins that turn Claude into a specialist for your role, team, and company. Built for Claude Cowork, also compatible wi", "We're open-sourcing 11 plugins built and inspired by our own work:", "claude plugin marketplace add anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins"]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [3, 37], "note": "兼容的运行环境之一，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["Plugins that turn Claude into a specialist for your role, team, and company. Built for Claude Cowork, also compatible wi", "### Claude Code"]}]}}, "4b8978a2bc24": {"fn": "trycua/cua", "sha": "4b8978a2bc24", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 AI agent 提供可操作的完整桌面环境与自动化工具", "review": "Cua 是一套面向 computer-use agent 的基础设施：Cua Spaces 提供运行于自有 Mac/机器/云账号上的 macOS 与 Linux 桌面 Space，支持应用 Teleport 与人机多人协作；Cua Driver 提供 CLI/MCP/多语言 SDK 驱动 macOS、Windows、Linux 原生应用与浏览器；Lume 基于 Virtualization.Framework 在 Apple Silicon 上管理本地 VM；另含 CUA-S1 小型决策模型（研究发布，权重在 Hugging Face）与 Cua Bench 任务评测框架。主体 MIT 许可，Spaces 与部分 Bench 为 FSL-1.1-MIT。", "highlights": ["Cua Driver 支持 macOS/Windows/Linux 桌面自动化，经 CLI、MCP 或类型化 SDK 接入", "Lume 用 Apple Virtualization.Framework 在 Apple Silicon 上管理 macOS/Linux VM", "SDK 覆盖 Python/TypeScript/Swift/Kotlin，含 gVisor 容器沙箱与 cua-spacesd 守护进程", "Cua Bench 可构建任务、评测 agent 并导出训练轨迹"], "use_cases": ["让 agent 在隔离虚拟桌面中操作图形界面完成任务", "为 computer-use agent 构建评测任务并导出轨迹用于训练", "在自有 Mac 或云主机上托管供 agent 使用的桌面环境"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2ccc86b-10d0-48c0-bee6-7ae652ba1c59", "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [153]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["computer-use", "桌面自动化", "agent评测", "虚拟机/沙箱", "MCP"], "domain": "AI Agent 基础设施/computer-use", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L7:  Give AI agents computers they can use. Cua Spaces gives your agents full desktops on your Mac and on machines you own. ", "L69: Give your agent tools to inspect and operate native desktop apps and browsers on macOS, Windows, and Linux. Connect thro", "L141: - **SDK:** the same API in Python (`pip install cua`), TypeScript (`@trycua/cua`), Swift (`Cua`) and Kotlin (generated b"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [87, 123], "note": "Claude Code 等作为可集成 agent 的提及", "quotes": ["Using Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenClaw, or another agent? Find your integration. Source documentation and architectu", "In a terminal the script shows a short checklist: the `cua` CLI, the Cua Spaces app (default on macOS), the cua-driver M"]}], "install": [{"term": "binary", "rel": "support", "lines": [58, 61, 74, 80, 100, 114], "note": "curl 安装脚本与 .dmg/.pkg 安装包", "quotes": ["curl -fsSL https://cua.ai/install.sh | sh", "On macOS the installer selects the Cua Spaces app by default and adds the `cua` CLI. You can also download the signed `.", "/bin/bash -c \"$(curl -fsSL https://cua.ai/driver/install.sh)\"", "irm https://cua.ai/driver/install.ps1 | iex", "/bin/bash -c \"$(curl -fsSL https://cua.ai/lume/install.sh)\"", "curl -fsSL https://cua.ai/install.sh | sh"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [141, 166, 180], "quotes": ["- **SDK:** the same API in Python (`pip install cua`), TypeScript (`@trycua/cua`), Swift (`Cua`) and Kotlin (generated b", "uv tool install 'cua-bench[browser]'", "|cua (Python)|The cua SDK for Python (`pip install cua`)|"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [87, 123], "note": "作为可集成的 AI coding agent 提及", "quotes": ["Using Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenClaw, or another agent? Find your integration. Source documentation and architectu", "In a terminal the script shows a short checklist: the `cua` CLI, the Cua Spaces app (default on macOS), the cua-driver M"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [87, 123], "note": "作为可集成的 AI coding agent 提及", "quotes": ["Using Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenClaw, or another agent? Find your integration. Source documentation and architectu", "In a terminal the script shows a short checklist: the `cua` CLI, the Cua Spaces app (default on macOS), the cua-driver M"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [228, 229, 230], "quotes": ["Everything outside Cua Spaces and Cua Driver Bench is MIT-licensed (LICENSE): the cua SDK and its Python, TypeScript, Sw", "Cua Spaces is source-available under FSL-1.1-MIT: the Spaces apps, cua-spacesd, the Cua Keyvault, teleport, Cua Volume (", "Cua Driver Bench (`benchmarks/cua-driver-bench`) is under the same FSL-1.1-MIT; versions published before 11 Oct 2026 (#"]}, "deprecation": {"flag": true, "lines": [193, 197, 198, 200, 201]}}}, "202f93357ca3": {"fn": "modular/modular", "sha": "202f93357ca3", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 AI 开发与部署的平台：MAX 框架 + Mojo 语言", "review": "该仓库托管 Modular Platform 的开源组件，覆盖 AI 开发与部署全链路：MAX 框架提供模型创作（Python）、推理服务端（OpenAI 兼容端点）、Mojo 编写的计算内核与 GPU 编程抽象、模型流水线；Mojo 语言提供编译器与标准库。README 指出正持续开源更多组件，即当前并非全部源码开放。接受两部分代码的贡献与 bug 报告，采用 Apache License v2.0，并提示用户自行核验第三方（如 Hugging Face）下载内容的许可证。", "highlights": ["MAX 推理服务器提供 OpenAI 兼容端点", "Mojo 编译器与标准库已开源", "MAX 内核与 GPU 编程抽象以 Mojo 编写", "Apache License v2.0 许可"], "use_cases": ["部署兼容 OpenAI 接口的模型推理服务", "用 Python 进行模型创作与构建流水线", "用 Mojo 编写 GPU 计算内核", "参与 Mojo/MAX 的开源贡献"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AI推理", "编程语言", "GPU内核", "开发平台"], "domain": "AI 开发与部署平台/编程语言", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5: This repo hosts open-source components of the Modular Platform,", "L6: a unified platform for AI development and deployment,", "L35: - MAX inference server: /max/python/max/serve"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "2f8a372ab476": {"fn": "hpcaitech/Open-Sora", "sha": "2f8a372ab476", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的开源高质量视频生成模型与训练工具集", "review": "提供 11B 参数的视频生成模型（Open-Sora 2.0），支持文生视频与图生视频，支持 256px/768px 分辨率及多种宽高比与帧长设置，并通过 torchrun 支持单卡与多卡（ColossalAI 序列并行）推理。发布 checkpoints 与完整训练代码，含数据预处理管线；提供 arXiv 技术报告与 Hugging Face Spaces 上的 Gradio demo。安装依赖 conda 环境与 Python 3.10，可选安装 flash attention 提速。", "highlights": ["11B 模型一个 checkpoint 同时支持 T2V 与 I2V，覆盖 256px 与 768px", "发布完整训练代码与 checkpoints，报告训练成本为 $200K", "支持多分辨率、多宽高比（16:9/9:16/1:1/2.39:1）与帧长调节", "多 GPU 推理基于 colossalai 序列并行"], "use_cases": ["自己训练或微调视频生成模型", "用文本或参考图生成视频", "研究视频生成模型的训练成本优化"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.09642v1", "demo_url": "https://huggingface.co/spaces/hpcai-tech/open-sora", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["视频生成", "扩散模型", "文生视频", "图生视频"], "domain": "多模态/视频生成", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: We design and implement **Open-Sora**, an initiative dedicated to **efficiently** producing high-quality video. We hope ", "L25: - **[2025.03.12]** 🔥 We released **Open-Sora 2.0** (11B). 🎬 11B model achieves on-par performance with 11B HunyuanVideo ", "L131: Our 11B model supports 256px and 768px resolution. Both T2V and I2V are supported by one model. 🤗 Huggingface 🤖 ModelSco"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [124], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention # 4f0640d5"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [136, 143], "note": "huggingface_hub 与 modelscope 经 pip 安装用于模型下载", "quotes": ["pip install \"huggingface_hub[cli]\"", "pip install modelscope"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [26, 131, 133, 136, 137], "note": "模型分发与 demo 平台，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["- **[2025.02.20]** 🔥 We released **Open-Sora 1.3** (1B). With the upgraded VAE and Transformer architecture, the quality", "Our 11B model supports 256px and 768px resolution. Both T2V and I2V are supported by one model. 🤗 Huggingface 🤖 ModelSco", "Download from huggingface:", "pip install \"huggingface_hub[cli]\"", "huggingface-cli download hpcai-tech/Open-Sora-v2 --local-dir ./ckpts"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "0f04c0e97a87": {"fn": "huggingface/smolagents", "sha": "0f04c0e97a87", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的极简 Agent 库：以代码片段作为行动形式", "review": "Hugging Face 维护的 Python Agent 库，核心是 CodeAgent——LLM 以 Python 代码片段形式书写动作并执行，另提供基于 JSON/文本工具调用的 ToolCallingAgent 与多 Agent 层级。模型侧通过 InferenceClientModel、LiteLLMModel、OpenAIModel、TransformersModel、AzureOpenAIModel、AmazonBedrockModel 等封装接入多类推理来源；工具可来自 MCP 服务器或 LangChain，Agent/工具可经 Hub 分享。代码执行存在安全风险，需在 E2B/Blaxel/Modal/Docker 等沙箱中运行，内置 LocalPythonExecutor 不构成安全边界。", "highlights": ["CodeAgent 以 Python 代码片段作为动作形式，agents.py 主代码约 1,000 行", "支持 E2B、Blaxel、Modal、Docker 沙箱执行与本地 LocalPythonExecutor", "模型来源可换：transformers/ollama 本地模型、Hub 提供商、LiteLLM、OpenAI 兼容服务、Azure、Bedrock", "提供 smolagent/webagent 两个 CLI 命令与 Hub 上的 Agent/工具分享"], "use_cases": ["让 Agent 以代码形式执行多步工具调用任务", "通过 CLI 快速运行网页浏览类 Agent", "在 Hub 上分享和复用他人构建的 Agent 与工具"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Agent框架", "CodeAgent", "LLM工具调用", "沙箱执行"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["together", "openrouter", "bedrock"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L10: `smolagents` is a library that enables you to run powerful agents in a few lines of code. It offers:", "L14: 🧑‍💻 **First-class support for Code Agents**. Our `CodeAgent` writes its actions in code (as opposed to \"agents being use", "L18: 🌐 **Model-agnostic**: smolagents supports any LLM. It can be a local `transformers` or `ollama` model, one of many provi"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "mention", "lines": [18], "quotes": ["🌐 **Model-agnostic**: smolagents supports any LLM. It can be a local `transformers` or `ollama` model, one of many provi"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "mention", "lines": [62, 192], "quotes": ["    model_id=\"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1\",", " benchmark of different models on agentic workflows. Open model DeepSeek-R1 beats closed-source models."]}, {"term": "together", "rel": "support", "lines": [76, 82], "quotes": [" OpenAI-compatible servers: Together AI", "…（5 行代码略）"]}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "support", "lines": [85, 91], "quotes": [" OpenAI-compatible servers: OpenRouter", "…（5 行代码略）"]}, {"term": "bedrock", "rel": "support", "lines": [112, 116, 118], "quotes": [" Amazon Bedrock models", "from smolagents import AmazonBedrockModel", "model = AmazonBedrockModel("]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [33], "quotes": ["pip install \"smolagents[toolkit]\""]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [22], "quotes": ["🛠️ **Tool-agnostic**: you can use tools from any MCP server, from LangChain, you can even use a Hub Space as a tool."]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [216], "quotes": ["  howpublished = {\\url{https://github.com/huggingface/smolagents}},"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "985288382b24": {"fn": "labring/FastGPT", "sha": "985288382b24", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "知识库问答应用构建平台：可视化工作流编排 + RAG", "review": "基于 LLM 的 AI Agent 构建平台，提供数据处理、RAG 检索、模型调用等开箱即用能力，并通过 Flow 可视化界面编排对话工作流与插件工作流。核心模块包括应用编排、应用调试（调用链路日志、应用评测）、知识库（多格式导入、混合检索与重排）、插件与运营（免登录分享、iframe 嵌入、对话记录标注）。支持云服务、Docker 自托管、Sealos 一键部署三种方式，另有商业版提供扩展功能与服务。", "highlights": ["Flow 可视化编排对话与插件工作流，含 RPA 节点与用户交互", "知识库支持 TXT/MD/HTML/PDF/Docx/PPTX/CSV/XLSX 导入及 URL 读取", "双向 MCP 支持与 Agent Skill 编排", "混合检索 & 重排，对话可反馈引用并修改删除"], "use_cases": ["私有化部署企业知识库问答系统", "可视化编排复杂 AI 对话