M 工程相关参考"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["网络安全", "资源清单", "伦理黑客", "AI安全", "认证备考"], "domain": "网络安全/知识聚合", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: This repository is a comprehensive collection of cybersecurity references, scripts, tools, code, labs, and training reso", "L7: The repository serves as supplemental material for books, video courses, and live training created by Omar Santos. It in", "L12: - **AI**: ai contains AI security, LLM engineering, AI-assisted incident response and automation, and AI ethics/privacy/"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "32e7a0c12801": {"fn": "simstudioai/sim", "sha": "32e7a0c12801", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给开发者的可视化 AI agent 与工作流构建平台", "review": "Sim 提供一个协作工作区，用于构建、部署和管理 AI agent 与工作流：支持可视化/对话式/代码三种构建方式，内置数据库表格、文件存储、知识库，可接入 270+ 集成（5,400+ 动作、520+ 触发器），并提供运行监控、日志与调度。部署方式包括云端（sim.ai）、macOS 桌面应用（需 macOS 12+）和自托管（npx sim-setup 向导，需 Node.js 20+ 与 Docker）。自托管 Chat 服务由 Sim 管理并需 API key。", "highlights": ["270+ 集成、5,400+ 动作、520+ 触发器", "可视化/对话式/代码三种 agent 构建方式", "内置表格数据库、文件存储与知识库（agent 共享工作区）", "自托管安装向导 sim-setup 支持 Docker Compose、本地开发与 Kubernetes 模式"], "use_cases": ["搭建自动化工作流连接 Slack、Notion、Salesforce 等服务", "团队协作构建并监控 AI agent", "自托管部署并接入本地模型运行 agent"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://sim.ai", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AI agent", "工作流自动化", "低代码", "自托管", "可视化编排"], "domain": "AI agent 构建平台/工作流自动化", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama", "vllm"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L13:  A workspace to build, deploy and manage AI agents and workflows.", "L37: - Connect 270+ integrations (5,400+ actions, 520+ triggers) and every major LLM", "L61: **Requirements:** Node.js 20+ and Docker."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [94], "quotes": ["Sim also supports local models via Ollama and vLLM. See the self-hosting docs for details."]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [94], "quotes": ["Sim also supports local models via Ollama and vLLM. See the self-hosting docs for details."]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [24, 63, 72, 73, 74], "quotes": ["npx sim-setup", "`npx sim-setup` is an interactive wizard that creates a small `sim/` deployment directory, provisions the database, gene", "npx sim-setup config", "npx sim-setup add email", "npx sim-setup add storage"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [63, 78], "quotes": ["`npx sim-setup` is an interactive wizard that creates a small `sim/` deployment directory, provisions the database, gene", "`npx sim-setup config` detects the effective local-dev, Docker Compose, or current-context"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [7], "quotes": [" Set Up with Cursor"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [127], "quotes": ["This project is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 - see the LICENSE file for details."]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "05faf3cd4e0a": {"fn": "HandsOnLLM/Hands-On-Large-Language-Models", "sha": "05faf3cd4e0a", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "O'Reilly《Hands-On Large Language Models》图书代码仓库", "review": "存放 Jay Alammar 与 Maarten Grootendez 所著《Hands-On Large Language Models》全书示例代码，按书中章节组织，配合近 300 幅自绘图示讲解 LLM 的实践工具与概念。仓库还收录补充内容（Mamba、量化、稳定扩散、MoE、推理 LLM、DeepSeek-R1 等可视化指南），并提供书籍的 BibTeX 引用条目。购书渠道覆盖 Amazon、O'Reilly、Kindle、Barnes and Noble 等平台。", "highlights": ["收录全书各章节示例代码", "提供 Mamba/量化/MoE/推理 LLM/DeepSeek-R1 等补充可视化指南", "提供 BibTeX 学术引用条目", "书籍在 Amazon、O'Reilly、Kindle 等多平台发售"], "use_cases": ["跟随图书章节运行代码学习 LLM 概念", "科研写作中引用该书", "阅读补充可视化指南深入了解新技术"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["图书配套代码", "LLM教程", "可视化学习"], "domain": "教育/知识聚合", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Welcome! In this repository you will find the code for all examples throughout the book Hands-On Large Language Models w", "L7: Through the visually educational nature of this book and with **almost 300 custom made figures**, learn the practical to", "L51: **A Visual Guide to Mixture of Experts** | **A Visual Guide to Reasoning LLMs** | **The Illustrated DeepSeek-R1**"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "cohere", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "note": "可见行号范围内未出现，无法核实", "quotes": []}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "mention", "lines": [51], "note": "补充内容中的可视化指南，非模型接入", "quotes": ["**A Visual Guide to Mixture of Experts** | **A Visual Guide to Reasoning LLMs** | **The Illustrated DeepSeek-R1**"]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "09f0dae8aade": {"fn": "opendataloader-project/opendataloader-pdf", "sha": "09f0dae8aade", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 AI 数据管道解析 PDF 的开源工具：输出 Markdown/JSON/HTML", "review": "Python/Node.js/Java 三种 SDK 提供的 PDF 解析器：本地确定性模式用 XY-Cut++ 阅读序与边界框坐标输出 Markdown、JSON、HTML；hybrid 模式将复杂页（复杂表格、扫描件、公式、图表）路由到 AI 后端处理，内置 80+ 语言 OCR。另提供无障碍功能：将未标记 PDF 自动标记为屏幕阅读器可用的 Tagged PDF（Apache 2.0），PDF/UA-1/2 导出为企业版附加项。依赖 Java 11+。", "highlights": ["输出带边界框的 JSON、Markdown 与 HTML，支持 RAG 分块与来源引用", "hybrid 模式：简单页本地处理，复杂页路由到 AI 后端", "内置 80+ 语言 OCR，支持 EasyOCR/RapidOCR/Tesseract/ocrmac 等多种 OCR 引擎", "自动将未标记 PDF 生成 Tagged PDF（Apache 2.0 免费层）"], "use_cases": ["为 RAG 系统把 PDF 转成结构化 Markdown 并按标题层级分块", "批量处理扫描件并提取带坐标的表格与公式", "批量将未标记 PDF 转为屏幕阅读器可用的 Tagged PDF"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": "cpu-ok", "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["PDF解析", "RAG数据准备", "OCR", "文档无障碍"], "domain": "文档处理/AI 数据准备", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L13: 🔍 **PDF parser for AI data extraction** — Extract Markdown, JSON (with bounding boxes), and HTML from any PDF. #1 in ben", "L75: |Auto-tagging → Tagged PDF for untagged PDFs|Yes|Free (Apache 2.0)|", "L76: |PDF/UA-1, PDF/UA-2 export|💼 Available|Enterprise|"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [6, 18, 34, 111, 112, 125, 168], "quotes": ["PyPI version", "- **How do I use this for RAG?** — `pip install opendataloader-pdf`, convert in 3 lines. Outputs structured Markdown for", "pip install -U opendataloader-pdf", "|Standard digital PDF|Fast (default)|`pip install opendataloader-pdf`|None needed|`opendataloader-pdf file1.pdf file2.pd", "|Complex or nested tables|**Hybrid**|`pip install \"opendataloader-pdf[hybrid]\"`|`opendataloader-pdf-hybrid --port 5002`|", "pip install -U opendataloader-pdf", "pip install -U \"opendataloader-pdf[hybrid]\""]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [7, 138], "quotes": ["npm version", "npm install @opendataloader/pdf"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "No GPU required", "rel": "support", "lines": [79], "note": "能力矩阵中明确 GPU required: No", "quotes": ["|Process Word/Excel/PPT|No|—|"]}], "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [18], "note": "提供集成，非替代/竞品", "quotes": ["- **How do I use this for RAG?** — `pip install opendataloader-pdf`, convert in 3 lines. Outputs structured Markdown for"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [23, 54, 76, 77], "note": "核心功能 Apache 2.0，PDF/UA 导出与无障碍编辑器为企业版附加项", "quotes": ["- **What's free?** — Layout analysis + auto-tagging (Apache 2.0). Untagged PDF in → Tagged PDF out. No proprietary SDK d", "|**Manual PDF remediation cost** — Accessibility regulations (EAA, ADA, Section 508) demand Tagged PDFs. Manual remediat", "|PDF/UA-1, PDF/UA-2 export|💼 Available|Enterprise|", "|Accessibility studio (visual editor)|💼 Available|Enterprise|"]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "82b131261373": {"fn": "langchain-ai/deepagents", "sha": "82b131261373", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给开发者的开箱即用 agent harness，构建长程多步 agent", "review": "LangChain 团队开源的 agent harness，基于 LangGraph 构建，提供子代理、可插拔文件系统后端、上下文管理与持久化记忆等默认组件，每个部件可覆盖或替换而不需 fork。支持任何具备工具调用能力的模型（前沿 API、开源权重或本地模型），随流式输出、检查点持久化与经 LangSmith 的追踪评估能力一同提供。提供 Python 与 JavaScript/TypeScript 两个库版本，另有终端编码代理 Deep Agents Code，通过 curl 脚本安装。", "highlights": ["子代理机制：将任务委派给具有独立上下文窗口的代理", "可插拔文件系统（本地/沙箱/远程后端）与 shell 执行", "上下文管理：摘要长对话并将工具输出落盘", "人在回路审批、按需加载的 Skills 与任意 MCP 服务器接入"], "use_cases": ["构建需要长程规划与多步执行的生产级 agent", "为 agent 配置子代理分工与隔离上下文", "接入本地或开源权重模型运行 agent", "在终端中使用预构建编码代理辅助编程"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["agent框架", "LLM基础设施", "编码代理", "多智能体"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": ["Claude Code", "Cursor"], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama", "vllm"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L14: Deep Agents is an open source agent harness — an opinionated agent that runs out of the box. Extend, override, or replac", "L20: - **Model-agnostic** — works with any LLM that supports tool calling: frontier, open-weight, or local", "L21: - **Production-ready** — built on LangGraph (streaming, persistence, checkpointing) with first-class tracing, evaluation"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [65], "quotes": ["Yes. Any model that supports tool calling works — frontier APIs (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google), open-weight models hosted o"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [65], "note": "作为自托管模型运行途径被列举，经 LangChain chat model 接入", "quotes": ["Yes. Any model that supports tool calling works — frontier APIs (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google), open-weight models hosted o"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "compat", "lines": [65], "note": "同上", "quotes": ["Yes. Any model that supports tool calling works — frontier APIs (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google), open-weight models hosted o"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [9, 10, 42], "quotes": [" PyPI - License", " PyPI - Downloads", "uv add deepagents"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [59, 61, 71], "note": "同一生态栈的组件层级关系说明", "quotes": ["### How is this different from LangGraph or LangChain?", "LangGraph is the graph runtime. LangChain's `create_agent` is a minimal agent harness on top of it. Deep Agents is a mor", "### When should I use Deep Agents vs. LangChain or LangGraph directly?"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [37, 91], "note": "Deep Agents Code 被描述为 similar to Claude Code，致谢中称受其启发", "quotes": ["> **Deep Agents Code** — a pre-built coding agent in your terminal, similar to Claude Code or Cursor, powered by any LLM", "Inspired by Claude Code: an attempt to identify what makes it general-purpose, and push that further."]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [37], "note": "Deep Agents Code 被描述为 similar to Cursor", "quotes": ["> **Deep Agents Code** — a pre-built coding agent in your terminal, similar to Claude Code or Cursor, powered by any LLM"]}]}}, "95f0b18440cf": {"fn": "chroma-core/chroma", "sha": "95f0b18440cf", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 AI 应用的开源向量/检索数据库", "review": "开源的 AI 数据基础设施项目，提供向量、混合与全文检索能力，支持 Python 客户端（pip）与 JavaScript 客户端（npm）接入，并可启动 client-server 模式运行。核心 API 为 4 个函数，提供内存模式便于原型开发并支持持久化。项目另提供托管服务 Chroma Cloud，以 pypi 和 npm 包形式按周发布新版本，采用 Apache 2.0 许可证。", "highlights": ["提供向量、混合与全文检索", "Python（pip）与 JavaScript（npm）客户端安装", "核心 API 仅 4 个函数，支持内存与持久化模式", "提供 client-server 运行模式与托管服务 Chroma Cloud"], "use_cases": ["为 AI 应用存储和检索向量数据", "快速原型开发后切换到持久化/服务端部署", "使用托管服务搭建检索数据库"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://docs.trychroma.com/", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["向量数据库", "检索", "AI基础设施"], "domain": "AI 基础设施/数据库", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L4:  Chroma - the open-source data infrastructure for AI .", "L27: Our hosted service, Chroma Cloud, powers serverless vector, hybrid, and full-text search. It's extremely fast, cost-effe"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [20, 53], "quotes": ["pip install chromadb # python client", "We currently release new tagged versions of the `pypi` and `npm` packages on Mondays. Hotfixes go out at any time during"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [21, 53], "quotes": ["# for javascript, npm install chromadb!", "We currently release new tagged versions of the `pypi` and `npm` packages on Mondays. Hotfixes go out at any time during"]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "mention", "lines": [33], "note": "提供 Google Colab 演示入口，非本产品安装途径", "quotes": ["The core API is only 4 functions (run our 💡 Google Colab):"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "d654d9ae4f66": {"fn": "rohitg00/agentmemory", "sha": "d654d9ae4f66", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 AI 编码 agent 提供跨会话持久记忆的 MCP 服务器", "review": "基于 iii 引擎的记忆服务：通过 12 个自动 hook 捕获 agent 会话，压缩为可检索记忆，下次会话时注入相关上下文；支持 BM25、本地向量嵌入（Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2）与图结构匹配的混合检索（RRF 融合），提供 54 个 MCP 工具与 REST API。兼容支持 hooks、MCP 或 REST 的任意 agent，官方列出 20 余个适配器。无外部数据库依赖（SQLite + 内置 iii 引擎）。可配置 LLM provider 实现 LLM 压缩，也可完全 keyless 运行。", "highlights": ["54 个 MCP 工具 + 12 个自动 hook，静默捕获会话并注入上下文", "BM25 + 本地向量 + 图匹配的混合检索，keyless 模式默认可用", "20+ agent 适配器（Claude Code、Codex CLI、Cursor 等），共享同一记忆服务器", "无外部数据库依赖，状态存于本地 SQLite + iii 引擎"], "use_cases": ["避免每次会话向编码 agent 重复解释项目架构与偏好", "多个编码工具（如 Claude Code 与 Cursor）间共享同一份项目记忆", "本地离线运行语义记忆检索（本地嵌入模型，无 API key）"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["agent记忆", "MCP", "编码助手", "开发者工具", "本地推理"], "domain": "AI 开发者工具/agent 基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "deepseek"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L6:  Persistent memory for Claude Code, GitHub Copilot CLI, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI, Hermes, OpenClaw, pi, OpenCode, a", "L132: agentmemory works with any agent that supports hooks, MCP, or REST API. All agents share the same memory server.", "L236: You explain the same architecture every session. You re-discover the same bugs. You re-teach the same preferences. Built"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["docker", "pypi"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "compat", "lines": [6, 89], "note": "Claude Code 为接入对象，可配置 LLM provider", "quotes": [" Persistent memory for Claude Code, GitHub Copilot CLI, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI, Hermes, OpenClaw, pi, OpenCode, a", "The first run is an interactive setup: pick the agents to wire (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, ...), "]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "compat", "lines": [214], "note": "DeepSeek Harness 通过 MCP 服务器接入", "quotes": ["DeepSeek Harness"]}, {"term": "cohere", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [79, 86, 117], "quotes": ["- Node.js 20 or newer with npm and npx (`node -v`, `npm -v`, and `npx -v`).", "npx -y @agentmemory/agentmemory@latest", "npm install -g @agentmemory/agentmemory@latest"]}, {"term": "binary", "rel": "mention", "lines": [112], "note": "Windows 需手动下载 iii.exe，属依赖组件非本产品安装途径", "quotes": ["The fast path is WSL2. Native Windows engine setup requires the pinned v0.22.1 ZIP to be downloaded and `iii.exe` extrac"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "source", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "mention", "lines": [251], "note": "Docker Desktop 为 Windows 支持路径，bind-mount 数据目录", "quotes": ["Native and Docker launches use this same resolved host directory; Docker bind-mounts it at `/data`. `--instance 1` appen"]}, {"term": "cargo", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "go", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "mention", "lines": [6, 142], "note": "被接入的 agent，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": [" Persistent memory for Claude Code, GitHub Copilot CLI, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI, Hermes, OpenClaw, pi, OpenCode, a", " GitHub Copilot CLI"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [6, 134], "note": "被接入的 agent", "quotes": [" Persistent memory for Claude Code, GitHub Copilot CLI, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI, Hermes, OpenClaw, pi, OpenCode, a", "Claude Code"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [6, 146], "note": "被接入的 agent；另在 L236 提及其内置 .cursorrules 局限", "quotes": [" Persistent memory for Claude Code, GitHub Copilot CLI, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI, Hermes, OpenClaw, pi, OpenCode, a", " Cursor"]}, {"term": "Devin", "rel": "mention", "lines": [154], "note": "被接入的 agent", "quotes": ["Devin"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [210], "note": "Qwen Code 通过 MCP 服务器接入", "quotes": [" Qwen Code"]}, {"term": "Windsurf", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "note": "Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 为嵌入模型，未见 Hugging Face 平台提及", "quotes": []}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "85001301661f": {"fn": "TencentCloud/TencentDB-Agent-Memory", "sha": "85001301661f", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 AI Agent 团队用的共享记忆中枢，沉淀可复用资产", "review": "由腾讯云维护的团队级 Agent 记忆中枢：把对话、文档与代码自动转换为四类记忆资产（Chat Memory、Skill、LLM-Wiki、CodeGraph），统一注册为 Memory Asset，经 Memory Hub 面板完成审核、共享、版本与 ACL 管理，并通过一个 Proxy 按固定绑定分发给不同 Agent。对话按 L0–L3 分层蒸馏，检索采用 BM25+向量+RRF 并受条目数、字符预算与超时限制。部署为 memory-core、memory-hub、proxy 三个服务，Node 环境运行；MongoDB 存储后端为实验性且默认关闭。", "highlights": ["四类记忆资产：Chat Memory、Skill、Wiki、CodeGraph，统一注册与分发", "单 Proxy 零代码接入：改 base URL 即可，无需插件或 MCP 服务器", "L0–L3 分层记忆与 BM25+向量+RRF 混合检索", "private/team/restricted/agent 四级可见性与 ACL 权限控制"], "use_cases": ["Agent 团队共享沉淀的工作流与调试经验", "导入已有代码库与文档让新 Agent 冷启动", "给不同角色的 Agent 装配各自需要的记忆资产", "控制团队记忆的归属、版本与访问权限"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [18]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Agent记忆", "长期记忆", "知识管理", "团队协作", "向量检索"], "domain": "AI Agent 基础设施/记忆管理", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["deepseek"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["提供简体中文 README", "腾讯云仓库"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L64: # What is TencentDB Agent Memory?", "L78: **Memory Hub** for Agent teams closes the loop across the entire experience lifecycle: work produces assets, assets circ", "L80: 1. **Automatic asset extraction**: Extract Chat Memory and Skills from conversations and tasks; convert documents and co"], "xcheck": {"license_from_readme": "MIT"}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [31, 51], "quotes": ["./start-all.sh     # Launch everything with one command; when finished, it prints a one-liner you can paste directly int", " Claude Code"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [50], "quotes": [" DeepSeek Harness"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [27], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/TencentCloud/TencentDB-Agent-Memory.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [36, 51], "note": "列出的客户端之一，非竞品/替代对象", "quotes": ["Complete installation documentation (standalone Memory Hub deployment, Proxy + Claude Code / CodeBuddy usage, stop and c", " Claude Code"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "5e66ae8202d1": {"fn": "alibaba/page-agent", "sha": "5e66ae8202d1", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "网页内嵌 JS GUI agent：让任意网页支持自然语言控制", "review": "以页内 JavaScript 形式提供 GUI agent，通过文本化 DOM 操作执行任务，不依赖浏览器扩展、Python 或无头浏览器，也不使用截图或多模态模型；一行 script 标签或 npm 安装即可集成到任意网页。支持接入大多数主流模型（含本地部署模型），可选 Chrome 扩展支持跨页面任务，并提供 Beta 版 MCP Server 供外部 agent 客户端控制浏览器。基于 browser-use 的 DOM 处理组件与 prompt，定位为客户端网页增强而非服务端自动化。MIT 协议。", "highlights": ["页内 JavaScript 集成，无需扩展/Python/无头浏览器", "基于文本 DOM 操作，无需截图与多模态 LLM", "支持主流模型及本地部署模型", "提供 Chrome 扩展（多页任务）与 MCP Server (Beta)"], "use_cases": ["在 SaaS 产品中内置 AI copilot 而不重写后端", "把 ERP/CRM 中多步骤表单操作变成一句话指令", "让 Web 应用通过自然语言（含语音）无障碍使用"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["浏览器自动化", "GUI agent", "网页集成", "MCP"], "domain": "浏览器自动化/前端 AI 集成", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["alibaba 组织仓库", "README 提供中文版本"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L14: The GUI Agent Living in Your Webpage. One script gives any web page its own AI agent.", "L28:  - Just in-page javascript. Everything happens in your web page.", "L94: `PageAgent` is designed for **client-side web enhancement**, not server-side automation."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [61, 64], "quotes": ["### NPM Installation", "npm install page-agent"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "none", "lines": [38], "note": "误命中：L38 的 copilot 指为自家 SaaS 产品内置的 AI 助手概念，非 GitHub Copilot", "quotes": ["- **SaaS AI Copilot** — Ship an AI copilot in your product in lines of code. No backend rewrite."]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "4b08a88a3d8e": {"fn": "ATH-MaaS/Pixelle-Video", "sha": "4b08a88a3d8e", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "输入主题即自动生成配图、配音、字幕短视频的引擎", "review": "以 Web UI（Streamlit）运行的短视频自动生成流水线：LLM 撰写文案，按句分镜后通过 ComfyUI/RunningHub 工作流或直连 API 生成图像/视频片段，TTS 合成解说（支持参考音频克隆音色），叠加 BGM 与 HTML 模板后合成成片。扩展模块含数字人口播、图生视频、动作迁移。Windows 提供整合包，macOS/Linux 需自装 uv 与 ffmpeg 从源码运行；LLM 与媒体模型均需配置 API Key 或本地服务。", "highlights": ["输入主题即可完成文案→配图→语音→合成视频的全流程", "支持 ComfyUI/RunningHub 工作流与 DashScope、OpenAI、Seedance、Kling 等直连 API 两种媒体生成路径", "TTS 支持 Edge-TTS、Index-TTS 及参考音频声音克隆", "数字人口播、图生视频、动作迁移等扩展模块"], "use_cases": ["输入一个主题批量产出竖屏/横屏短视频", "用自有文案与素材直接生成配图解说视频", "本地 Ollama 加 ComfyUI 组成零 API 费用的生成方案"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "消费者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AIGC", "短视频生成", "ComfyUI", "TTS", "Web应用"], "domain": "内容创作/AIGC 视频", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["deepseek", "ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["全中文 README", "通义千问/DashScope/可灵等国内服务适配", "微信群社区", "Windows 一键整合包"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L15: 只需输入一个 **主题**，Pixelle-Video 就能自动完成：", "L55: - ✅ **原子能力灵活组合** - 支持 ComfyUI / RunningHub 工作流，也支持直连 API 模型，可按需替换图像、视频、TTS、VLM 等能力", "L151: ### 从源码安装（适合 macOS / Linux 用户或需要自定义的用户）"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "deepseek", "rel": "compat", "lines": [54, 220], "note": "作为可选 LLM 预设列出", "quotes": ["- ✅ **多种 AI 模型** - 支持 GPT、通义千问、DeepSeek、Ollama 等", "- 通过下拉菜单选择预设模型（通义千问、GPT-4o、DeepSeek 等）"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [54, 365], "note": "作为可选本地 LLM 列出", "quotes": ["- ✅ **多种 AI 模型** - 支持 GPT、通义千问、DeepSeek、Ollama 等", "- **完全免费方案**: LLM 使用 Ollama（本地运行）+ ComfyUI 本地部署 = 0 元"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [151, 186, 194], "quotes": ["### 从源码安装（适合 macOS / Linux 用户或需要自定义的用户）", "git clone https://github.com/AIDC-AI/Pixelle-Video.git", "uv run streamlit run web/app.py"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "mention", "lines": [168], "note": "ffmpeg 依赖的安装方式，非本产品安装途径", "quotes": ["brew install ffmpeg"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "48G 显存", "rel": "mention", "lines": [33], "no