L 面试题库，并为教师提供 16 周教学大纲与讲义。硬拷贝将由 MIT Press 出版。支持英中日韩多语言。", "highlights": ["四卷本教材覆盖单机推理到分布式扩展、agent 编排与机器人物理系统", "TinyTorch 提供从零构建 ML 框架的 20 个渐进模块", "MLSys·im 模拟器可计算内存瓶颈、网络饱和与调度上限", "硬件套件支持在 Arduino、Seeed、Grove、树莓派上部署 ML"], "use_cases": ["自学机器学习系统设计与工程化部署", "高校开设 ML Systems 课程并使用配套教学资源", "准备 ML 系统方向岗位面试（StaffML 题库）", "在边缘设备上做受资源约束的 ML 实验"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://mlsysbook.ai", "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [31, 82, 84, 222, 230]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["教材/课程", "ML Systems", "边缘AI", "Agentic AI", "教育"], "domain": "AI 教育/课程教材", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "university", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L79:  Four-volume MIT Press textbook series on Machine Learning Systems Architecture:", "L100:  Deploy ML to Arduino, Seeed, Grove, and Raspberry Pi devices. Real memory limits, real power budgets, real latency.", "L121:  The AI Engineering Blueprint: two 16-week syllabi, pedagogy guide, assessment rubrics, and a TA handbook."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "69dfb64ae0a2": {"fn": "dmlc/xgboost", "sha": "69dfb64ae0a2", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向数据科学者的分布式梯度提升树库", "review": "XGBoost 是一个分布式梯度提升库，实现 Gradient Boosting 框架下的机器学习算法，提供并行树提升（GBDT/GBM）。同一份代码可运行在单机及 Kubernetes、Hadoop、SGE、Dask、Spark、PySpark 等分布式环境，可处理超过十亿样本规模的问题。以库形式提供，经 PyPI、Conda、CRAN 等渠道分发，支持 Python、R 等多种语言，源自华盛顿大学研究项目，基于 Apache-2 许可证发布。", "highlights": ["并行树提升（GBDT/GBM）实现", "同一代码运行于 Kubernetes/Hadoop/SGE/Dask/Spark/PySpark 等分布式环境", "支持 Python、R、Java、Scala、C 等多语言接口", "支持 Colab 在线运行"], "use_cases": ["在单机或 Spark/Dask 集群上训练梯度提升模型", "处理十亿级样本的分类回归问题"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": "https://doi.org/10.1145/2939672.2939785", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["机器学习", "梯度提升", "分布式训练", "数据科学"], "domain": "机器学习/数据科学", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L20: XGBoost is an optimized distributed gradient boosting library designed to be highly ***efficient***, ***flexible*** and ", "L23: The same code runs on major distributed environment (Kubernetes, Hadoop, SGE, Dask, Spark, PySpark) and can solve proble"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [7], "quotes": ["PyPI version"]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [12], "quotes": ["Open In Colab"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "6071af56fa23": {"fn": "yamadashy/repomix", "sha": "6071af56fa23", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给开发者把整个仓库打包成单文件供 LLM 使用", "review": "一个 CLI/网站/浏览器扩展工具，将仓库内容打包为单个 AI 友好格式文件。提供 XML/Markdown/JSON/纯文本四种输出格式，统计每文件与整仓 token 数，支持 .gitignore 感知、Secretlint 凭证检测排除、Tree-sitter 代码压缩，可打包远程仓库与 stdin 文件列表。通过 npm 安装或 Docker 运行，也可在 repomix.com 网页使用，另提供 Chrome/Firefox 扩展与社区 VSCode 扩展。生成文件可发送给各类 AI 工具做代码审查、文档生成、测试用例生成等。", "highlights": ["单命令打包整仓并生成 repomix-output.xml 等格式文件", "token 计数与 Tree-sitter 代码压缩（--compress）", "Secretlint 凭证格式检测并从输出中排除", "支持远程仓库打包、git log 注入与 stdin 文件列表"], "use_cases": ["把代码库喂给 AI 助手做代码审查与重构建议", "基于仓库内容生成文档或测试用例", "通过 JSON 输出配合 jq 做程序化文件分析"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://repomix.com", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["代码打包", "LLM 工具", "开发者工具", "CLI"], "domain": "开发者工具/LLM 基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L46: 📦 Repomix is a powerful tool that packs your entire repository into a single, AI-friendly file.", "L71: - **AI-Optimized**: Formats your codebase in a way that's easy for AI to understand and process.", "L238: Once you have generated the packed file, you can use it with Generative AI tools like ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, Gem"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [47, 340, 343], "quotes": ["It is perfect for when you need to feed your codebase to Large Language Models (LLMs) or other AI tools like Claude,", "https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/use-xml-tags", "> game-changer. They help Claude parse your prompts more accurately, leading to higher-quality outputs."]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "mention", "lines": [48, 238, 265], "quotes": ["ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, Gemini, Gemma, Llama, Grok, and more.", "Once you have generated the packed file, you can use it with Generative AI tools like ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, Gem", "Once you have generated the packed file with Repomix, you can use it with AI tools like ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, G"]}, {"term": "xai", "rel": "mention", "lines": [48, 238, 265], "quotes": ["ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, Gemini, Gemma, Llama, Grok, and more.", "Once you have generated the packed file, you can use it with Generative AI tools like ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, Gem", "Once you have generated the packed file with Repomix, you can use it with AI tools like ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, G"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [86, 93], "quotes": ["npx repomix@latest", "npm install -g repomix"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [248, 254, 260], "quotes": ["docker run -v .:/app -it --rm ghcr.io/yamadashy/repomix", "docker run -v .:/app -it --rm ghcr.io/yamadashy/repomix path/to/directory", "docker run -v ./output:/app -it --rm ghcr.io/yamadashy/repomix --remote https://github.com/yamadashy/repomix"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "mention", "lines": [48, 238, 265], "quotes": ["ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, Gemini, Gemma, Llama, Grok, and more.", "Once you have generated the packed file, you can use it with Generative AI tools like ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, Gem", "Once you have generated the packed file with Repomix, you can use it with AI tools like ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, G"]}, {"term": "Perplexity", "rel": "mention", "lines": [48, 238, 265], "quotes": ["ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, Gemini, Gemma, Llama, Grok, and more.", "Once you have generated the packed file, you can use it with Generative AI tools like ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, Gem", "Once you have generated the packed file with Repomix, you can use it with AI tools like ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Perplexity, G"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [751], "quotes": ["**For Cursor:**"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [759], "quotes": ["**For Claude Code:**"]}, {"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "mention", "lines": [1021], "quotes": ["Repomix provides a ready-to-use **Repomix Explorer** skill that enables AI coding assistants to analyze and explore code"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "7dddec294672": {"fn": "mastra-ai/mastra", "sha": "7dddec294672", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的 TypeScript AI 应用与 Agent 框架", "review": "Mastra 提供基于 TypeScript 的框架，用于构建 AI 应用与 Agent，覆盖从原型到生产部署的环节。关键机制包括：统一接口接入 40+ 模型提供商的模型路由、基于图的 workflow 引擎（.then/.branch/.parallel）、human-in-the-loop 暂停恢复（依赖存储保存执行状态）、上下文与记忆管理、MCP server 编写，以及内置 evals 与可观测性。可嵌入 React/Next.js/Node.js 应用或作为独立服务部署。仓库采用 Apache-2.0 与企业许可的双许可模式，`ee/` 目录代码生产使用需企业许可。", "highlights": ["模型路由：单一标准接口接入 40+ 提供商（OpenAI、Anthropic、Gemini 等）", "图式 workflow 引擎与 human-in-the-loop 暂停/恢复机制", "MCP server 编写：以标准协议暴露 agents、tools 与资源", "内置 evals 与可观测性支持生产迭代"], "use_cases": ["用 TypeScript 从零搭建 AI Agent 应用并接入多家模型", "把 Agent 与 workflow 打包进现有 React/Next.js/Node.js 项目", "需要人工审批环节的多步骤自动化流程", "为 Agent 添加评测与可观测性以持续调优"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Agent框架", "TypeScript", "workflow编排", "MCP", "模型路由"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L11: Mastra is a framework for building AI-powered applications and agents with a modern TypeScript stack.", "L21: - **Model routing**: Connect to 40+ providers through one standard interface. Use models from OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini,", "L33: - **MCP servers**: Author Model Context Protocol servers, exposing agents, tools, and other structured resources via the"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [72, 74, 75, 77], "quotes": ["This repository uses a dual-license model:", "- **Apache License 2.0**: The core framework and the vast majority of this codebase is open source under Apache-2.0.", "- **Mastra Enterprise License**: Code in any directory named `ee/` (e.g., `packages/core/src/auth/ee/`) is source-availa", "See LICENSE.md for the full license mapping and ee/LICENSE for the enterprise license terms."]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "Vercel AI SDK", "rel": "mention", "lines": [31], "note": "可集成的 UI 库，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["- **Integrations**: Bundle agents and workflows into existing React, Next.js, or Node.js apps, or ship them as standalon"]}]}}, "73ad0e5f8fc5": {"fn": "srbhr/Resume-Matcher", "sha": "73ad0e5f8fc5", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "本地自托管的 AI 简历定制与 ATS 优化工具", "review": "开源简历工具：上传主简历（PDF/DOCX）与目标职位描述，生成针对该职位的定制简历、求职信与面试准备内容，并导出可被 ATS 解析的 PDF。架构为 FastAPI 后端 + Next.js 前端 + SQLite，本机运行、无需注册账号，数据存于本地数据库。支持接入云端 API 或本地模型（Ollama）；另提供 MCP 服务器，可由 Claude Code、Cursor 等编码代理驱动生成，无需 LLM key。ATS 评分与 ATS 检查为纯代码实现，不调用 LLM。定制提示词禁止添加主简历中不存在的经历。", "highlights": ["主简历+职位描述生成定制简历、求职信与面试准备", "支持云端 API 与本地模型（Ollama），数据留在本机", "ATS 评分与解析检查为纯代码（pdfminer），不调用 LLM", "10 套模板，其中 7 套提供可编辑 pdfLaTeX 工程；多语言界面与内容生成"], "use_cases": ["针对每个职位描述定制主简历并导出 PDF", "用 ATS 检查核验简历 PDF 的可解析性", "本地模型运行下让简历数据不出本机", "批量粘贴多个职位描述排队后台定制"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["简历工具", "求职", "AI写作", "自托管", "ATS优化"], "domain": "求职/文档工具", "