text, just like you do"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "openrouter", "rel": "support", "lines": [128, 145], "quotes": ["Gemini, OpenRouter and so on. Press ctrl+l to open the model picker,", "|`OPENROUTER_API_KEY`|OpenRouter|"]}, {"term": "groq", "rel": "support", "lines": [149], "quotes": ["|`GROQ_API_KEY`|Groq|"]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [14, 136, 154, 155, 156], "quotes": ["- **Multi-Model:** choose from a wide range of LLMs or add your own via OpenAI- or Anthropic-compatible APIs", "|`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`|Anthropic|", "|`AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`|Amazon Bedrock (Claude)|", "|`AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`|Amazon Bedrock (Claude)|", "|`AWS_REGION`|Amazon Bedrock (Claude)|"]}, {"term": "bedrock", "rel": "support", "lines": [154, 155, 156, 157, 158], "quotes": ["|`AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`|Amazon Bedrock (Claude)|", "|`AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`|Amazon Bedrock (Claude)|", "|`AWS_REGION`|Amazon Bedrock (Claude)|", "|`AWS_PROFILE`|Amazon Bedrock (Custom Profile)|", "|`AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK`|Amazon Bedrock|"]}, {"term": "azure", "rel": "support", "lines": [159, 160, 161], "quotes": ["|`AZURE_OPENAI_API_ENDPOINT`|Azure OpenAI models|", "|`AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY`|Azure OpenAI models (optional when using Entra ID)|", "|`AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION`|Azure OpenAI models|"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [165, 193, 194], "quotes": ["Local Models. For more info see", "# Add Ollama.", "provider add ollama --type ollama --base-url \"http://localhost:11434/v1\""]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "mention", "lines": [635, 636, 639, 640, 641], "quotes": ["Here’s an example configuration for Deepseek, which uses an OpenAI-compatible", "API. Don't forget to set `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` in your environment.", "provider add deepseek --type openai-compat \\", "  --base-url \"https://api.deepseek.com/v1\" \\", "  --api-key \"$DEEPSEEK_API_KEY\""]}], "install": [{"term": "brew", "rel": "support", "lines": [27, 28], "quotes": ["# Homebrew", "brew install charmbracelet/tap/crush"]}, {"term": "go", "rel": "support", "lines": [97, 106], "quotes": ["go install github.com/charmbracelet/crush@latest", "go install -tags sqlite3_dotlk github.com/charmbracelet/crush@latest"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "mention", "lines": [526], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/anthropics/skills.git _temp"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [512], "quotes": ["- `.cursor/skills`"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": true, "lines": [213, 214]}}}, "4f0e02add554": {"fn": "microsoft/semantic-kernel", "sha": "4f0e02add554", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为开发者提供构建 AI 智能体与多智能体系统的 SDK", "review": "Semantic Kernel 是一个模型无关的 SDK，提供 Python、.NET、Java 三语言包，用于构建、编排和部署 AI agent 与多智能体系统。关键机制包括：插件/工具扩展（原生函数、prompt 模板、OpenAPI、MCP）、多智能体编排、向量数据库集成、多模态输入处理与本地部署支持。README 顶部声明该项目已由 Microsoft Agent Framework 接替，MAF 1.0 已发布并提供迁移指南。", "highlights": ["模型无关 SDK，内置接入 OpenAI、Azure OpenAI、Hugging Face、NVidia 等", "提供 Python / .NET / Java 三语言包", "插件扩展支持原生函数、prompt 模板、OpenAPI、MCP", "支持 Ollama、LMStudio、ONNX 本地运行"], "use_cases": ["在应用中接入 LLM 构建聊天助手", "编排多个协作 agent 处理复杂工作流", "通过插件/工具扩展让 agent 调用自有能力", "企业环境中构建可观测、安全的 agent 系统"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM SDK", "AI Agent", "多智能体编排", "开发者框架"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["azure", "ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L17: Semantic Kernel is a model-agnostic SDK that empowers developers to build, orchestrate, and deploy AI agents and multi-a", "L4: > Semantic Kernel is now Microsoft Agent Framework! Microsoft Agent Framework (MAF) is the enterprise‑ready successor to"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "azure", "rel": "support", "lines": [28, 42, 78, 118, 138], "quotes": ["- **Model Flexibility**: Connect to any LLM with built-in support for OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Hugging Face, NVidia and mor", "**Azure OpenAI:**", "from semantic_kernel.connectors.ai.open_ai import AzureChatCompletion", "from semantic_kernel.connectors.ai.open_ai import AzureChatCompletion, OpenAIChatCompletion", "- **Model Availability**: Verify your Azure OpenAI deployment or OpenAI model access"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [34], "quotes": ["- **Local Deployment**: Run with Ollama, LMStudio, or ONNX"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [55], "quotes": ["pip install semantic-kernel"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "ramework 1.0 g", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": true, "lines": [4, 6]}}}, "96e4f93f87ef": {"fn": "HumanSignal/label-studio", "sha": "96e4f93f87ef", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 ML 团队的多类型数据标注与标注工具", "review": "开源数据标注工具，支持对音频、文本、图像、视频、时间序列等数据类型进行标注，提供直观 UI 并可导出多种模型训练格式，用于准备原始数据或改进已有训练数据。关键机制包括：多用户账号与多项目管理、可配置的标注界面模板与专用配置语言、从 AWS S3/Google Cloud Storage 或文件导入、通过 ML SDK 连接模型后端实现预标注、在线学习与主动学习、REST API 嵌入数据流水线。限制方面：README 未提及移动端；Windows 需额外安装 wheel 依赖；Python 要求 >=3.10。", "highlights": ["支持图像、音频、文本、HTML、时间序列、视频等多类型数据标注", "通过 ML SDK 连接模型后端，支持预标注、在线学习与主动学习", "提供 Docker、pip、poetry、Anaconda 等多种安装与部署方式", "REST API 支持嵌入现有数据流水线，前端/后端可独立集成"], "use_cases": ["为计算机视觉项目标注图像与边界框数据集", "为 NLP 模型准备文本标注训练数据", "多人协作标注团队的项目与账号管理", "结合模型后端做主动学习式标注迭代"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "lice