pleeter", "sha": "e01fc7a36b06", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为开发者提供音频音轨分离库与预训练模型", "review": "Deezer 出品的 Python 音源分离库，基于 TensorFlow，提供预训练模型：2 stems（人声/伴奏）、4 stems、5 stems 三种分离配置。可从命令行直接使用，也可作为 Python 库嵌入开发管线。依赖 ffmpeg 与 libsndfile，可通过 pip 或 Docker 安装，另提供 Google Colab 在线试用。2.1.0 版本引入 CLI 选项命名变更并移除独立 GPU 包；Apple M1 芯片存在已知兼容问题；另有商业版 Spleeter Pro。", "highlights": ["提供 2/4/5 stems 三种预训练分离模型", "支持命令行与 Python 库两种使用方式", "可 pip 或 Docker 安装，并提供 Colab 试用", "GPU 上 4 stems 分离速度达实时 100 倍"], "use_cases": ["从歌曲中分离人声与伴奏", "将鼓、贝斯、钢琴等分轨提取为独立音频", "在自己的音频处理管线中集成分离能力"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.02154", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["音频处理", "音源分离", "深度学习", "TensorFlow"], "domain": "音频处理/深度学习", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L8: **Spleeter** is Deezer source separation library with pretrained models", "L9: written in Python and uses Tensorflow. It makes it easy", "L20: as well as directly in your own development pipeline as a Python library. It can be installed with pip or be used with"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [20, 53], "quotes": ["as well as directly in your own development pipeline as a Python library. It can be installed with pip or be used with", "# install spleeter with pip"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [21], "quotes": ["Docker."]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [1, 45], "quotes": ["Github actions PyPI - Python Version PyPI version Conda Docker Pulls Open In Colab Gitter chat status", "Want to try it out but don't want to install anything ? We have set up a Google Colab."]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [72], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/Deezer/spleeter && cd spleeter"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [39, 41], "quotes": ["## Spleeter Pro (Commercial version)", "Check out our commercial version : Spleeter Pro. Benefit from our expertise for precise audio separation, faster process"]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "f9bb86abbc03": {"fn": "OtterMind/Chat2DB", "sha": "f9bb86abbc03", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "连接 40+ 数据库的本地优先 SQL 客户端，支持自带 AI 模型", "review": "面向开发者、DBA、分析师与数据团队的跨平台数据库客户端与 SQL 工作区，完全运行在本机。支持通过 JDBC 配置接入 40+ 数据库，提供 SQL 编辑、补全、格式化、执行历史、元数据浏览、DDL/DML 管理、数据导入导出、仪表盘与 ER 图。AI 部分采用自带模型（BYOM）方式：用户接入自己的模型来生成、解释和优化 SQL；开源 CLI 提供 MCP 支持。桌面版从 Releases 安装，另提供 Docker/Web 部署与源码构建路径；数据源密码与 AI API key 以 AES-256-GCM 本地加密。", "highlights": ["40+ 数据库连接，新 JDBC 数据库仅靠配置即可接入", "自带 AI 模型生成/解释/优化 SQL，开源 CLI 支持 MCP", "AES-256-GCM 本地加密数据源密码与 AI API key", "桌面、Web/Docker、CLI 多形态分发"], "use_cases": ["在同一工作区管理 MySQL、ClickHouse、MongoDB 等多种数据库", "用自然语言生成并优化 SQL 查询", "本地环境可视化浏览数据、绘制仪表盘与 ER 图"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [35, 37, 39]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["数据库客户端", "SQL工作区", "AI助手", "MCP"], "domain": "数据库工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["简体中文版自述文件(L8)"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L15: Chat2DB Community is a free, cross-platform database client for Windows, macOS, and Linux. It runs entirely on your mach", "L19: - **AI assistant** — bring your own AI model to generate, explain, and optimize SQL in natural language.", "L178: The Community edition contains the full local database client described above, including custom AI model support. The co"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [51, 68, 74], "quotes": ["Requirements: Docker 19.03.0+, Docker Compose 2.0.0+ (Compose V2, only for the Compose variant), 2+ CPU cores, 4+ GiB RA", "docker compose --file docker/docker-compose.yml up --detach", "- The `docker run` example stores application data in `$HOME/.chat2db-community-docker`; the Compose definition uses the"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [57, 131, 142], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/OtterMind/Chat2DB.git && cd Chat2DB", "## Build from Source", "git clone https://github.com/OtterMind/Chat2DB.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [176, 178], "quotes": ["## Community vs Commercial Editions", "The Community edition contains the full local database client described above, including custom AI model support. The co"]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "57c3c7ba757c": {"fn": "huggingface/lerobot", "sha": "57c3c7ba757c", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为机器人提供模型、数据集与工具的开源库", "review": "Hugging Face 的机器人学 PyTorch 库：提供统一的 Robot 硬件控制接口（覆盖 SO100、LeKiwi、Reachy2 等原生支持型号）、托管于 HF Hub 的 LeRobotDataset 数据格式（Parquet+MP4）及配套工具、纯 PyTorch 实现的策略模型（涵盖模仿学习、强化学习、VLA、世界模型、奖励模型五类），并提供 lerobot-train 与 lerobot-eval 训练评估脚本，支持 LIBERO、MetaWorld 基准。通过 lerobot_ 前缀包名机制自动发现社区硬件插件。面向机器人研究者与开发者。", "highlights": ["统一 Robot 类接口解耦控制逻辑与硬件，原生支持 SO100、LeKiwi、Unitree G1 等设备", "LeRobotDataset 标准数据格式托管于 HF Hub，支持流式读取与可视化", "提供五类策略模型：模仿学习、强化学习、VLA、世界模型、奖励模型", "社区硬件插件按包名前缀自动发现与接入"], "use_cases": ["为低成本的机械臂采集、训练和部署操作策略", "在 LIBERO、MetaWorld 基准