local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["大语言模型", "开源权重", "推理框架", "多语言"], "domain": "AI 模型/大语言模型", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama", "vllm", "llama.cpp"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["微信社区入口", "ModelScope 建议大陆用户使用", "阿里巴巴 Qwen 团队"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L40:  We are excited to announce the release of Qwen3, the latest addition to the Qwen family of large language models.", "L46:  Dense and Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) models of various sizes , available in 0.6B, 1.7B, 4B, 8B, 14B, 32B and 30B-A3B, 235", "L74: ### 🤗 Transformers"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [13, 147, 149, 151, 152], "quotes": ["- Run Locally: the instructions for running LLM locally on CPU and GPU, with frameworks like llama.cpp, Ollama, and LM S", "### Ollama", "After installing Ollama, you can initiate the Ollama service with the following command (Ollama v0.9.0 or higher is reco", "ollama serve", "# You need to keep this service running whenever you are using ollama"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "compat", "lines": [14, 63, 121], "quotes": ["- Deployment: the demonstration of how to deploy Qwen for large-scale inference with frameworks like SGLang, vLLM, TGI, ", "- 2024.03.28: We released the first MoE model of Qwen: Qwen1.5-MoE-A2.7B! Temporarily, only HF transformers and vLLM sup", "For vLLM and SGLang, the environment variable `VLLM_USE_MODELSCOPE=true` and `SGLANG_USE_MODELSCOPE=true` can be used re"]}, {"term": "llama.cpp", "rel": "compat", "lines": [15, 130, 136], "quotes": ["- Quantization: the practice of quantizing LLMs with GPTQ, AWQ, as well as