R 审查反馈、复杂度分析、视频", "提供 SPEC.md 规范可自行实现，附 Elixir 参考实现", "任务隔离运行，工程师以更高层级管理工作"], "use_cases": ["团队将任务板上的工作自动分派给编码 agent 执行", "通过 CI 状态与 PR 反馈验收 agent 产出的代码", "在已采用 harness engineering 的代码库中转向以工作为单元的管理方式"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "企业", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [11]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["编码agent编排", "任务自动化", "工程效能", "Linear集成"], "domain": "开发者工具/工程效能", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L3: Symphony turns project work into isolated, autonomous implementation runs, allowing teams to manage", "L8: _In this demo video, Symphony monitors a Linear board for work and spawns agents to handle the tasks. The agents complet", "L11: > Symphony is a low-key engineering preview for testing in trusted environments."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [38], "quotes": ["This project is licensed under the Apache License 2.0."]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "37452bf5f630": {"fn": "vercel/ai", "sha": "37452bf5f630", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 TypeScript 开发者的统一接口 AI 应用与 Agent 构建工具包", "review": "Vercel 出品的 provider-agnostic TypeScript 工具库，用于构建 AI 应用与 Agent。核心机制：统一 Provider API 接入 OpenAI、Anthropic、Google 等模型提供方，默认经 Vercel AI Gateway 访问各提供方，也可安装各家的 @ai-sdk/* 包直连。提供 generateText 文本生成、基于 zod 的结构化输出、ToolLoopAgent 工具循环 Agent，以及框架无关的 UI hooks（Next.js/React/Svelte/Vue）用于构建聊天与生成式界面。要求 Node.js 22+，通过 npm 安装，并为 Claude Code、Cursor 等 coding agent 提供 skill 安装命令。", "highlights": [