aude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, and other AI coding agents can query your databas", "DBX provides a separate Rust-powered MCP server that lets AI coding agents query databases using connections configured "]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [131], "quotes": [" DBX speaks the Model Context Protocol. Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, and other AI coding agents can query your databas"]}, {"term": "Windsurf", "rel": "mention", "lines": [131], "quotes": [" DBX speaks the Model Context Protocol. Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, and other AI coding agents can query your databas"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "225022667bf2": {"fn": "onlook-dev/onlook", "sha": "225022667bf2", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给设计/前端工程师的开源可视化 AI 代码编辑器", "review": "面向 Next.js + TailwindCSS 项目的开源可视化编辑器：在浏览器 iFrame 中直接编辑 DOM 元素并映射回代码位置，支持从文本或图像起步创建应用、实时预览、图层浏览、分支试验设计、检查点保存恢复，以及带代码访问能力的 AI 聊天。架构上把代码加载进 web 容器运行，通过插桩把元素映射到代码位置，编辑同步回代码。README 明确当前聚焦 Next.js + Tailwind，非该栈的项目尚在待办中；托管托管版处于 early access。", "highlights": ["可视化编辑 iFrame 元素并同步写回代码（插桩映射元素到代码位置）", "AI 聊天具备代码读取与编辑工具", "分支机制用于试验设计变体，支持检查点保存与恢复", "架构声明可扩展到任何声明式 DOM 语言，目前聚焦 Next.js + TailwindCSS"], "use_cases": ["在真实代码库上做可视化设计与样式调整", "从文本或图像快速生成 Next.js 原型", "在浏览器中拖拽调整布局并实时查看代码"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [4, 33]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["可视化编辑器", "design-to-code", "Next.js", "AI编程", "前端"], "domain": "开发者工具/前端设计", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": ["Lovable"], "ecosystem_compat": ["openrouter"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["提供中文等多语言 README（L24）"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L35: # An Open-Source, Visual-First Code Editor", "L37: Craft websites, prototypes, and designs with AI in Next.js + TailwindCSS. Make", "L152: - OpenRouter - LLM model provider"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "openrouter", "rel": "compat", "lines": [151, 152], "note": "技术栈中作为 LLM 模型提供方，经 AI SDK 接入", "quotes": ["- AI SDK - LLM client", "- OpenRouter - LLM model provider"]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Lovable", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [39], "note": "README 称自身为 Bolt.new、Lovable、V0 等的开源替代", "quotes": ["code. An open-source alternative to Bolt.new, Lovable, V0, Replit Agent, Figma"]}, {"term": "Vercel AI SDK", "rel": "mention", "lines": [151], "note": "作为自身技术栈的 LLM 客户端，非竞品", "quotes": ["- AI SDK - LLM client"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "cf5414c7cef5": {"fn": "deepset-ai/haystack", "sha": "cf5414c7cef5", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 Python 开发者的 LLM 应用编排框架", "review": "Haystack 是一个 Python 开源编排框架，用于构建生产级 LLM 应用。提供模块化 Pipeline 与 Agent 工作流，对检索、路由、记忆、生成环节做显式控制；同一 Pipeline 支持同步/异步运行与逐 token 流式输出，Agent 可并发调用工具并暴露生命周期钩子与 token/工具调用计数。模型与厂商无关，内置组件可自建扩展，可通过 pip 或 Docker 安装，另有 Hayhooks 将流水线封装为 REST API 或 MCP 服务。", "highlights": ["模块化 Pipeline 与 Agent 工作流，显式控制检索/路由/记忆/生成", "同一 Pipeline 支持同步、异步与逐 token 流式输出，Agent 可并发工具调用", "模型与厂商无关，可替换模型或基础设施组件", "匿名组件级遥测，可按文档说明关闭"], "use_cases": ["构建带检索、排序、路由控制的 RAG 应用", "搭建需要显式上下文控制的 agent 工作流", "构建多模态应用与语义搜索/问答系统", "通过 Hayhooks 把流水线部署为 REST API 或 MCP 服务"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM编排框架", "RAG", "Agent框架", "语义搜索"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/编排框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L10: Haystack is an open-source AI orchestration framework for building production-ready LLM applications in Python.", "L57: Integrate with OpenAI, Mistral, Anthropic, Cohere, Hugging Face, Google, Azure OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, local models, and ma"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "cohere", "rel": "mention", "lines": [57], "quotes": ["Integrate with OpenAI, Mistral, Anthropic, Cohere, Hugging Face, Google, Azure OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, local models, and ma"]}, {"term": "azure", "rel": "mention", "lines": [57], "quotes": ["Integrate with OpenAI, Mistral, Anthropic, Cohere, Hugging Face, Google, Azure OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, local models, and ma"]}, {"term": "bedrock", "rel": "mention", "lines": [57], "note": "AWS Bedrock 作为可集成的模型提供方列举，非专门适配说明", "quotes": ["Integrate with OpenAI, Mistral, Anthropic, Cohere, Hugging Face, Google, Azure OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, local models, and ma"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [18, 21, 26], "quotes": ["The simplest way to get Haystack is via pip:", "pip install haystack-ai", "pip install --pre haystack-ai"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": []}}, "5b5760178810": {"fn": "WZMIAOMIAO/deep-learning-for-image-processing", "sha": "5b5760178810", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "图像处理深度学习入门教程：讲解与代码实现经典网络", "review": "作者整理研究生期间学习内容的教程项目，以视频课程形式在 bilibili 分享。内容覆盖图像分类（LeNet 至 ConvNeXt/MobileViT）、目标检测（Faster-RCNN、SSD、YOLO 系列等）、语义分割（FCN、DeepLabV3、U-Net 等）、实例分割、关键点检测。每个网络按“结构与创新点讲解→PyTorch 搭建→TensorFlow2 搭建”三段式教学，配套 PPT 放在 course_ppt 文件夹供下载，各模型源码以目录形式组织在仓库中。", "highlights": ["每个网络提供 PyTorch 与 TensorFlow2 双框架实现", "覆盖分类、检测、分割、关键点检测四大任务方向", "配套 bilibili 视频教程与可下载的课程 PPT", "涵盖 LeNet 到 Swin Transformer、ConvNeXt 等多代网络"], "use_cases": ["跟着视频入门图像分类与目标检测的网络结构", "对照源码学习用 PyTorch 或 TensorFlow2 搭建经典网络", "下载 PPT 辅助复习深度学习课程知识点"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "viral", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["深度学习教程", "图像分类", "目标检测", "语义分割", "PyTorch/TensorFlow"], "domain": "教育/计算机视觉", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["全中文 README", "微信公众号（阿喆学习小记）", "bilibili 频道"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L1: # 深度学习在图像处理中的应用教程", "L7: 2）使用Pytorch进行网络的搭建与训练", "L13: * 图像分类"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "04c09e70dc3f": {"fn": "huggingface/open-r1", "sha": "04c09e70dc3f", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "复现 DeepSeek-R1 训练流程的开源项目", "review": "以 DeepSeek-R1 技术报告为蓝本，提供三步复现路径：蒸馏复刻 R1-Distill 模型、纯 RL 管线（R1-Zero 路径）、多阶段训练。仓库包含 SFT、GRPO 训练脚本与基于 Distilabel 的合成数据生成脚本，配套 Makefile 快捷命令与 YAML 配方。已发布 Mixture-of-Thoughts（350k）、OpenR1-Math-220k、CodeForces-CoTs 等数据集。训练默认配置为 8×H100 节点，依赖 CUDA 12.4、vLLM 0.8.5.post1、PyTorch 2.6.0，多节点经 Slurm 调度。README 声明项目已停止维护，训练部分后续由 TRL 承接。", "highlights": ["提供 sft.py/grpo.py/generate.py 覆盖 R1 流水线的训练与数据生成", "发布 350k Mixture-of-Thoughts 与 OpenR1-Math-220k 等蒸馏推理数据集", "支持 DDP 与 DeepSpeed ZeRO-2/3，GRPO 可经 TRL vLLM 后端多节点扩展", "代码奖励函数支持 E2B 与 Morph 两种沙箱执行提供方"], "use_cases": ["按配方在自有数据上对模型做 SFT 蒸馏与 GRPO 强化训练", "从 R1 蒸馏的推理轨迹数据集训练数学/代码推理模型", "搭建多节点 Slurm 集群上的大规模 RL 训练"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "high", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM训练", "模型复现", "GRPO/RL", "数据集"], "domain": "LLM 训练/机器学习研究", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["deepseek", "vllm"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L7: *A fully open reproduction of DeepSeek-R1.*", "L25: The goal of this repo is to build the missing pieces of the R1 pipeline such that everybody can reproduce and build on t", "L103: We support training models with either DDP or DeepSpeed (ZeRO-2 and ZeRO-3). For example, to perform SFT on a dataset di"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "deepseek", "rel": "compat", "lines": [7, 37, 38, 103], "note": "以 DeepSeek-R1 及其蒸馏数据为复现对象与数据来源，非模型 API 接入", "quotes": ["*A fully open reproduction of DeepSeek-R1.*", "* Step 1: replicate the R1-Distill models by distilling a high-quality corpus from DeepSeek-R1.", "* Step 2: replicate the pure RL pipeline that DeepSeek used to create R1-Zero. This will likely involve curating new, la", "We support training models with either DDP or DeepSpeed (ZeRO-2 and ZeRO-3). For example, to perform SFT on a dataset di"]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [44], "note": "仅基准对比中提及 Claude 3.7 Sonnet", "quotes": ["* **⚡️ [2025/03/11] (update #3):** We release the **CodeForces-CoTs** dataset of 10k competitive programming problems an"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [66, 69, 180, 186, 263], "note": "作为 GRPO 训练后端与推理服务安装使用", "quotes": ["Next, install vLLM and FlashAttention:", "uv pip install 