图、规划并执行点击、滑动、输入等操作，响应用户的自然语言指令。支持命令行与 Python API 两种调用方式，内置敏感操作确认与人工接管机制，提供远程 WiFi 调试。模型可用智谱 BigModel、ModelScope 等第三方 API，或通过 vLLM/SGLang 自行部署（本地部署建议 24GB+ 显存 GPU）。面向研究与学习用途。", "highlights": ["通过 ADB/HDC 控制安卓与鸿蒙设备，以截图+视觉模型循环执行操作", "支持 50+ 款 Android 中文应用与 60+ 款鸿蒙原生应用", "提供 vLLM/SGLang 本地部署与智谱 BigModel、ModelScope API 两种模型接入方式", "内置敏感操作确认、人工接管回调与远程 ADB/HDC 调试"], "use_cases": ["用自然语言让 AI 代为操作手机完成搜索、下单等任务", "研究与开发手机端 GUI Agent 的二次开发", "通过 Midscene.js 实现 iOS/Android 上的自动化流程"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "README 中提供 AutoGLM 论文 BibTeX 引用（L592-597）", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["手机自动化", "GUI Agent", "多模态模型", "设备控制"], "domain": "AI Agent/手机自动化", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["vllm", "local-weights"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["全中文 README", "智谱 AI（zai-org）维护", "针对中文手机应用优化"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L24: Phone Agent 是一个基于 AutoGLM 构建的手机端智能助理框架，它能够以多模态方式理解手机屏幕内容，并通过自动化操作帮助用户完成任务。系统通过", "L610: - **原理**：截图 → 视觉模型理解界面 → 输出点击坐标 → ADB 执行操作 → 循环", "L642:  - 需要 NVIDIA GPU(建议 24GB+ 显存)"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["docker"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [15, 601], "note": "仅作为自动化部署工具 Claude Code 的语境提及", "quotes": ["你可以使用Claude Code，配置 GLM Coding Plan 后，输入以下提示词，快速部署本项目。", "> **本章节专为 AI 助手(如 Claude Code)设计，用于自动化部署 Open-AutoGLM。**"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [207, 210, 221, 223, 226], "note": "官方提供的模型部署推理引擎之一，含启动参数", "quotes": ["对于 vLLM，除了使用pip 安装，你也可以使用官方docker:", "> docker pull vllm/vllm-openai:v0.12.0", "1. 在对应容器或者实体机中(非容器安装)下载模型，通过 SGlang / vLLM 启动，得到 OpenAI 格式服务。这里提供一个 vLLM部署方案，请严格遵循我们提供的启动参数:", "- vLLM:", "python3 -m vllm.entrypoints.openai.api_server \\"]}, {"term": "local-weights", "rel": "support", "lines": [189, 641, 644], "note": "支持自行下载模型（约 20GB）本地部署", "quotes": ["#### 选项 B: 自行部署模型", "- **选项 B：本地部署模型(高配置要求)**", " - 需要下载约 20GB 的模型文件"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [122, 123, 518], "quotes": ["pip install -r requirements.txt", "pip install -e .", "pip install -e \".[dev]\""]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "mention", "lines": [198, 210], "note": "用于推理引擎（SGLang/vLLM）的官方镜像，非本产品安装途径", "quotes": ["> docker pull lmsysorg/sglang:v0.5.6.post1", "> docker pull vllm/vllm-openai:v0.12.0"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "mention", "lines": [654], "note": "ADB 依赖工具的安装方式", "quotes": ["brew install android-platform-tools"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [668], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/zai-org/Open-AutoGLM.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [15, 601], "note": "README 提供面向 Claude Code 的自动化部署提示词，非替代/竞品关系", "quotes": ["你可以使用Claude Code，配置 GLM Coding Plan 后，输入以下提示词，快速部署本项目。", "> **本章节专为 AI 助手(如 Claude Code)设计，用于自动化部署 Open-AutoGLM。**"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "68512a7fd6d3": {"fn": "mozilla-ai/llamafile", "sha": "68512a7fd6d3", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "把 LLM 打包成单文件分发与本地运行的开发者工具", "review": "将 llama.cpp 与 Cosmopolitan Libc 结合，把 LLM 运行时压缩为单个可执行文件（llamafile），在多数操作系统与 CPU 架构上本地运行，无需安装；另含基于 whisper.cpp 的单文件语音转文字工具 whisperfile。0.10.0 起改用新构建系统以跟进 llama.cpp 最新模型与功能，旧版本仍可从 releases 页获取。Windows 下可执行文件有 4GB 上限，超限时需以二进制搭配外部 GGUF 权重运行。", "highlights": ["LLM 运行时与模型打包为单文件可执行，免安装跨平台运行", "whisperfile：单文件语音转写与翻译工具", "0.10.0 新构建系统对齐 llama.cpp 最新版本", "支持下载预构建 llamafile 或从源码安装"], "use_cases": ["向最终用户分发开箱即用的本地 LLM", "无安装条件下跨系统本地推理", "本地音频转写与翻译"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["本地LLM推理", "单文件分发", "语音转文字", "llama.cpp"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/本地推理", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["llama.cpp"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L13: **llamafile lets you distribute and run LLMs with a single file.**", "L19: combining llama.cpp with Cosmopolitan Libc into one", "L24: llamafile also includes **whisperfile**, a single-file speech-to-text tool built on whisper.cpp and the same Cosmopolita"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "llama.cpp", "rel": "support", "lines": [8, 19], "quotes": ["Based on llama.cpp", "combining llama.cpp with Cosmopolitan Libc into one"]}], "install": [{"term": "binary", "rel": "support", "lines": [33, 47], "quotes": ["releases page. Our pre-built llamafiles always", "curl -LO https://huggingface.co/mozilla-ai/llamafile_0.10/resolve/main/Qwen3.5-0.8B-Q8_0.llamafile"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [47], "note": "示例模型下载来源，非替代/竞品", "quotes": ["curl -LO https://huggingface.co/mozilla-ai/llamafile_0.10/resolve/main/Qwen3.5-0.8B-Q8_0.llamafile"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [78, 79], "note": "Apache 2.0 + 对 llama.cpp/whisper.cpp 的 MIT 修改，均为开源许可", "quotes": ["While the llamafile project is Apache 2.0-licensed, our changes", "to llama.cpp and whisper.cpp are licensed under MIT (just like the projects"]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "56f1fbeab17f": {"fn": "datawhalechina/pumpkin-book", "sha": "56f1fbeab17f", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "机器学习学习者的西瓜书公式推导详解笔记", "review": "对周志华《机器学习》（西瓜书）中较难理解的公式进行解析，并补充部分公式的推导细节，内容以本科数学基础视角表述，超纲知识以附录和参考文献给出。使用前提是读者具备西瓜书内容作为前置知识，定位为西瓜书的配套查阅资料而非独立教材。提供在线阅读、PDF 下载、B 站视频教程及组队学习资源，另有经人民邮电出版社修缮的纸质版。", "highlights": ["对西瓜书公式补充推导细节与解析", "以本科数学基础视角讲解，超纲内容附附录与参考文献", "提供 PDF 下载、视频教程与组队学习等配套资源"], "use_cases": ["自学西瓜书时查阅推导不出来的公式", "机器学习初学者按组队学习计划配套学习", "需要离线阅读时下载 PDF 版本"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Mh411e7VU", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["机器学习", "教材配套", "公式推导", "开源书籍"], "domain": "教育/机器学习学习资料", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "media", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["全中文 README", "Datawhale 开源组织项目"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L1: 南瓜书（pumpkin-book）", "L3: “周志华老师的《机器学习》（西瓜书）是机器学习领域的经典入门教材之一，周老师为了使尽可能多的读者通过西瓜书对机器学习有所了解, 所以在书中对部分公式的推导细节没有详述，但是这对那些想深究公式推导细节的读者来说可能“不太友好”，本书旨在对西瓜", "L13: ## 配套资源"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "0916e5a9f9d0": {"fn": "promptfoo/promptfoo", "sha": "0916e5a9f9d0", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为开发者提供 LLM 应用评估与红队扫描的 CLI/库", "review": "promptfoo 是一个用于评估与红队测试 LLM 应用的 CLI 和库：支持对 prompt、agent 与 RAG 做自动化评估，进行漏洞扫描与红队测试，并排比较多个模型，在 CI/CD 中自动执行检查，通过代码扫描审查 PR 中的 LLM 安全与合规问题。评估可 100% 本地运行，配置采用声明式 YAML 式写法，附 Web 查看器展示评估矩阵与安全报告。安装途径覆盖 npm、brew、pip，也可用 npx 免安装运行。README 声明该项目现为 OpenAI 旗下，仍以 MIT 许可开源。", "highlights": ["自动化评估 prompt、agent 与 RAG 应用", "红队测试与 LLM 漏洞扫描并生成安全报告", "并排比较 OpenAI、Anthropic、Azure、Bedrock、Ollama 等模型", "CI/CD 集成与 PR 代码扫描审查"], "use_cases": ["发布前对 prompt 与 agent 做回归评估", "对 LLM 应用做红队测试找出漏洞", "在 CI/CD 流水线中自动执行 LLM 检查", "团队共享评估结果并并排比较模型"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM评估", "红队测试", "CI/CD", "安全扫描"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/评估与安全", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["bedrock", "ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L9:  <code>promptfoo</code> is a CLI and library for evaluating and red-teaming LLM-based apps. Stop using trial-and-error..", "L46: - **Test your prompts and models** with automated evaluations", "L48: - **Compare models** side-by-side (OpenAI, Anthropic, Azure, Bedrock, Ollama, and more)"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "bedrock", "rel": "compat", "lines": [48], "quotes": ["- **Compare models** side-by-side (OpenAI, Anthropic, Azure, Bedrock, Ollama, and more)"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [48], "quotes": ["- **Compare models** side-by-side (OpenAI, Anthropic, Azure, Bedrock, Ollama, and more)"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [22, 26], "quotes": ["npm install -g promptfoo", "Also available via `brew install promptfoo` and `pip install promptfoo`. Or use `npx promptfoo@latest` to run any comman"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [26], "quotes": ["Also available via `brew install promptfoo` and `pip install promptfoo`. Or use `npx promptfoo@latest` to run any comman"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "support", "lines": [26], "quotes": ["Also available via `brew install promptfoo` and `pip install