、代码复用", "高阶自动微分支持科学计算（微分方程求解）", "多芯片异构适配，标准化接口抽象不同硬件栈"], "use_cases": ["工业场景的分布式深度学习模型训练", "大模型的训练与推理一体化开发", "数学、力学、材料、气象等科学计算探索", "在多种国产/异构硬件芯片上部署训练"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["深度学习框架", "分布式训练", "科学计算", "大模型训练"], "domain": "AI 框架/深度学习基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["中国首个自主研发深度学习平台", "提供简体中文文档"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L11: PaddlePaddle, as the first independent R&D deep learning platform in China, has been officially open-sourced to professi", "L24: ## **PaddlePaddle New Generation Framework 3.2**", "L28:  By requiring only minimal tensor partitioning annotations based on a single-card configuration, PaddlePaddle automatica"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "7bdf7cc487f2": {"fn": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-Coder", "sha": "7bdf7cc487f2", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的开源代码大模型系列（1B-33B）", "review": "DeepSeek Coder 是一系列从零训练的代码语言模型，训练语料 2T tokens，其中 87% 为代码、13% 为中英文自然语言。模型提供 1B、5.7B、6.7B、33B 多个规模，采用 16K 窗口与 fill-in-the-blank 任务训练，支持项目级代码补全与填充。提供 Base 与指令微调的 Instruct 两类模型，附 Hugging Face transformers 推理示例、vLLM 高吞吐推理路径、微调脚本及 llama.cpp/GPTQ 量化问答。代码仓库为 MIT 许可，模型使用另有 Model License，声明支持商业使用。", "highlights": ["1B/5.7B/6.7B/33B 多规模模型，87% 代码 + 13% 中英文语料从零训练", "16K 窗口与 fill-in-the-blank 任务支持项目级代码补全与填充", "提供 finetune_deepseekcoder.py 微调脚本，支持 DeepSpeed 训练", "支持 vLLM 高吞吐推理及 GGUM/GPTQ 量化路径"], "use_cases": ["在 IDE 或工作流中做项目级代码补全与插入", "下载 Instruct 模型搭建代码问答助手", "在下游任务上微调自己的代码模型", "通过 vLLM 部署高吞吐推理服务"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "README L5 提供论文链接（arXiv，标题见 L229）", "demo_url": "README L62：Hugging Face Space demo 及本地 app.py", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["代码大模型", "代码补全", "模型微调", "推理部署"], "domain": "AI 模型/代码生成", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["deepseek", "vllm", "llama.cpp"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 含微信入口（L3）", "联系方式 service@deepseek.com（L235）", "仓库归属 deepseek-ai 组织"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L11: DeepSeek Coder is composed of a series of code language models, each trained from scratch on 2T tokens, with a compositi", "L17: - **Highly Flexible & Scalable**: Offered in model sizes of 1B, 5.7B, 6.7B and 33B, enabling users to choose the setup m", "L167: ### Inference with vLLM"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["docker"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [1, 9, 11, 97, 110], "quotes": ["DeepSeek Coder", "### 1. Introduction of DeepSeek Coder", "DeepSeek Coder is composed of a series of code language models, each trained from scratch on 2T tokens, with a compositi", "tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(\"deepseek-ai/deepseek-coder-6.7b-instruct\", trust_remote_code=True)", "You are an AI programming assistant, utilizing the DeepSeek Coder model, developed by DeepSeek Company, and you only ans"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [167, 169, 171, 174], "quotes": ["### Inference with vLLM", "You can also employ vLLM for high-throughput inference.", "**Text Completion**", "from vllm import LLM, SamplingParams"]}, {"term": "llama.cpp", "rel": "compat", "lines": [195, 197, 199, 202], "note": "通过提交 PR 使 llama.cpp 支持其分词器以生成 GGUF 量化模型", "quotes": ["##### GGUF(llama.cpp)", "We have submitted a PR to the popular quantization repository llama.cpp to fully support all HuggingFace pre-tokenizers,", "While waiting for the PR to be merged, you can generate your GGUF model using the following steps:", "git clone https://github.com/DOGEwbx/llama.cpp.git"]}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "none", "lines": [24], "note": "误命中：语言支持列表中的 dockerfile，非 Docker 安装途径", "quotes": ["`['ada', 'agda', 'alloy', 'antlr', 'applescript', 'assembly', 'augeas', 'awk', 'batchfile', 'bluespec', 'c', 'c-sharp', "]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [58, 60, 135], "note": "pip install -r requirements.txt 及微调依赖安装", "quotes": ["Before proceeding, you'll need to install the necessary dependencies. You can do this by running the following command:", "pip install -r requirements.txt", "pip install -r finetune/requirements.txt"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "mention", "lines": [202, 203, 204], "note": "git clone 的是 llama.cpp 分支用于生成 GGUF，非本产品安装方式", "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/DOGEwbx/llama.cpp.git", "cd llama.cpp", "git checkout regex_gpt2_preprocess"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [62, 70, 193, 197], "note": "模型分发平台与所依赖的 tokenizer/Space 生态，非替代或竞品", "quotes": ["A demo is also available on the 🤗 Hugging Face Space, and you can run the demo locally using `app.py` in the demo folder", "tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(\"deepseek-ai/deepseek-coder-6.7b-base\", trust_remote_code=True)", "DeepSeek Coder utilizes the HuggingFace Tokenizer to implement the Bytelevel-BPE algorithm, with specially designed pre-", "We have submitted a PR to the popular quantization repository llama.cpp to fully support all HuggingFace pre-tokenizers,"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": true,