"support", "lines": [129], "quotes": ["   git clone https://github.com/Cinnamon/kotaemon"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [148, 149, 181, 189], "quotes": ["  pip install -e \"libs/kotaemon[all]\"", "  pip install -e \"libs/ktem\"", "- Install nano-GraphRAG: `pip install nano-graphrag`", "- Install LightRAG: `pip install git+https://github.com/HKUDS/LightRAG.git`"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "16 GB of RAM", "rel": "mention", "lines": [306], "note": "本地 GGUF 模型选型的内存建议示例，非本产品自身硬件要求", "quotes": [" about 2 GB. For example, if you have 16 GB of RAM in total, of which 12 GB is available,"]}, {"term": "10 GB of RAM", "rel": "mention", "lines": [307], "note": "同上，模型大小选择建议", "quotes": [" then you should choose a model that takes up at most 10 GB of RAM. Bigger models tend to"]}], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "3b57560c781d": {"fn": "guillaumemeyer/watermarks-remover", "sha": "3b57560c781d", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给内容所有者去除多厂商 AI 水印/溯源标记的 agent skill 与本地服务", "review": "由 agent skill（纯 Markdown 薄客户端，经 HTTP 调用）与 Python stdlib 服务两部分组成，用于清除用户自有内容中的 AI 溯源标记。分三层：A 层确定性脚本清理不可见 Unicode/bidi/标签字符；B 层借助模型改写处理统计型文本水印（可选）；文件层读取 C2PA/EXIF/XMP/文档属性，覆盖 PNG、JPEG、PDF、DOCX、MP4 等多种格式。支持安装到 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、Grok 等宿主，并提供 Claude Code PostToolUse hook 与 pre-commit 门禁实现确定性清理。需 Python 3.10+；hook 无法改写聊天消息本身。", "highlights": ["三层清理：不可见 Unicode（确定性脚本）、统计型文本水印（模型改写）、文件元数据（C2PA/EXIF/XMP）", "skill 为无代码 HTTP 薄客户端，宿主无需 Python；服务仅需 Python 3.10+ stdlib 无依赖", "支持 Claude Code/Codex/Cursor/Cowork/Grok 多宿主安装，含 Claude Code plugin marketplace 一键安装", "PostToolUse hook 提供确定性 check/clean 两种模式，并支持 pre-commit 门禁与 SARIF 导出"], "use_cases": ["清理自己用 AI 生成文档中的 C2PA 与 EXIF 元数据", "在 Claude Code 中通过 hook 自动检测/清理 agent 写出文件中的溯源标记", "git 提交前用 pre-commit 门禁拦截带水印文件", "为 claude.ai/Cowork 云会话打包上传自包含的纯文本清理 skill"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["水印清理", "内容溯源/C2PA", "Agent Skills", "隐私"], "domain": "内容安全/隐私工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "xai"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L14: Agent skill + stdlib Python service to strip **multi-vendor AI provenance marks** from text and files — for privacy and ", "L37: (Python 3.10+ stdlib, no dependencies):", "L22: Vendors / ecosystems (class-level): **Claude**, **Gemini / SynthID-Text**, **OpenAI** provenance surfaces, **open-LLM** "], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["docker", "pypi"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [22, 34, 40, 45], "quotes": ["Vendors / ecosystems (class-level): **Claude**, **Gemini / SynthID-Text**, **OpenAI** provenance surfaces, **open-LLM** ", "In Claude Code, the fastest route is the bundled", "python3 install_skill.py --skill remove-ai-marks --target claude-code", "|Claude Code (personal)|`--target claude-code`|`~/.claude/skills/<skill>` (honors `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`)|"]}, {"term": "xai", "rel": "compat", "lines": [209, 212, 213, 214], "note": "Grok Build 通过符号链接目录接入 skill", "quotes": ["### Grok", "# Grok Build / project-local", "mkdir -p .grok/skills", "ln -sfn \"$(pwd)/skills/remove-ai-marks\" .grok/skills/remove-ai-marks"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "mention", "lines": [245, 253, 255, 257], "note": "文档提及 Docker/compose 用于完整基础设施，本产品路径明确\"no Docker\"", "quotes": ["The fastest path is a local HTTP server (Python 3.10+ stdlib only — no deps, no Docker):", "### Windows (no Docker)", "See docs/windows-autostart.md for auto-starting the service at Windows login without Docker.", "For the whole infra (core + optional harness/heavy backends), see Docker / compose below."]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "hardware": [{"term": "CPU-only", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "note": "窗外行无法验证；README 仅声明 Python 3.10+ stdlib 要求", "quotes": []}], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [34, 45, 46, 136, 146], "note": "集成宿主，非替代/竞品", "quotes": ["In Claude Code, the fastest route is the bundled", "|Claude Code (personal)|`--target claude-code`|`~/.claude/skills/<skill>` (honors `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR`)|", "|Claude Code (project)|`--target claude-project --project-dir PATH`|`PATH/.claude/skills/<skill>`|", "before you read it. Claude Code's `Stop` hook receives `last_assistant_message`", "The repository is also a Claude Code **plugin** and a single-plugin"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [50, 138, 227, 231, 240], "note": "集成宿主，非替代/竞品", "quotes": ["|Cursor|`--target cursor` (default)|`~/.cursor/skills/<skill>`|", "this project already documents for Cursor rules. So the deterministic guarantee", "python3 install_skill.py --skill clean-user-facing-text --target cursor", "workflow in Cursor can also copy the optional rule:", "Rules improve consistency but remain model instructions; Cursor does not expose"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": [28], "note": "仅记录更名迁移（formerly remove-claude-marks），非弃用"}}}, "2da1cea7a3dd": {"fn": "pyg-team/pytorch_geometric", "sha": "2da1cea7a3dd", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "基于 PyTorch 的图神经网络库，面向结构化数据", "review": "构建在 PyTorch 之上的库，用于编写和训练图神经网络（GNN），覆盖结构化数据相关应用。收录来自多篇已发表论文的图与不规则结构深度学习方法（几何深度学习）；提供小图与巨型图的 mini-batch 加载器、多 GPU 支持、torch.compile 与 DataPipe 支持、常见基准数据集接口，以及面向任意图、3D 网格与点云的变换。架构分为 engine、storage、operators、models 四层，GNN 层基于 nn.MessagePassing 接口实现，面向机器学习研究者与初学者。", "highlights": ["通过 MessagePassing 接口实现数十种论文发表的 GNN 层（GCN、GAT、SAGE、GIN 等）", "支持大规模图训练：百万级节点图、动态图、异构图，提供多种采样方案", "多 GPU、torch.compile、TorchScript 与 DataPipe 支持", "10-20 行代码即可完成一个 GNN 模型训练，附带 Colab 笔记本与 OGB 示例"], "use_cases": ["在引文网络等图结构数据上做节点分类等机器学习研究", "复现或扩展论文中的图神经网络架构", "处理 3D 网格与点云的深度学习任务", "在异构图数据上构建预测模型"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["图神经网络", "深度学习", "科研工具", "PyTorch生态"], "domain": "机器学习/图深度学习", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L13: **PyG** *(PyTorch Geometric)* is a library built upon PyTorch to easily write and train Graph Neural Networks (GNNs) for", "L84: - The PyG **engine** utilizes the powerful PyTorch deep learning framework with full `torch.compile` and TorchScript sup", "L94: All Graph Neural Network layers are implemented via the **`nn.MessagePassing`** interface."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [1, 2], "quotes": ["[![PyPI Version][pypi-image]][pypi-url]", "[![PyPI Download][pypi-download-image]][pypi-download-url]"]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "mention", "lines": [9], "note": "提供 Colab 笔记本资源链接，非安装途径", "quotes": ["**Colab Notebooks** |"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": []}}, "fb1c55b890a1": {"fn": "AccumulateMore/CV", "sha": "fb1c55b890a1", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "中文自学者的深度学习与大模型课程笔记合集", "review": "以 Jupyter Notebook 形式整理的中文深度学习学习笔记，覆盖四个视频课程系列：土堆 Pytorch（100-122 号笔记）、李沐动手学深度学习（200-268）、吴恩达深度学习（300-354）、大飞大模型 Agent（400-409），并预告另一 Agent 系列待上线。附百度网盘分享的数据集、在线观看图片/公式显示问题的说明、Jupyter Notebook 目录插件建议及自学交流群。面向中文自学入门者，仓库本身不含代码工程或安装流程。", "highlights": ["四套视频课程的中文笔记（PyTorch、李沐、吴恩达、大模型 Agent）", "以 Jupyter Notebook 组织，可在线阅读或下载本地查看", "附百度网盘数据集分享与交流群入口"], "use_cases": ["跟着土堆视频学 PyTorch 时对照笔记复习", "通过李沐/吴恩达课程笔记自学深度学习", "入门大模型 Agent 概念的中文资料查阅"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "消费者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["学习笔记", "深度学习", "大模型", "Jupyter Notebook", "中文教程"], "domain": "教育/机器学习学习资料", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["全中文 README", "bilibili 视频课程链接", "百度网盘数据集分享", "微信交流群"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L1: # 超级全面的 深度学习 笔记（包含CV、NLP、大模型、Agent）", "L5: Pytorch 视频讲解【主讲人：土堆】【对应笔记：100-122】", "L17: 大模型Agent 视频讲解【主讲人：大飞】【对应笔记：400-409】"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "ada43f4108b5": {"fn": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-OCR", "sha": "ada43f4108b5", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向研究者的视觉文本压缩 OCR 模型", "review": "DeepSeek AI 发布的开源模型，探索从 LLM 中心视角研究视觉编码器的作用，将文本上下文以视觉形式压缩表示。提供 vLLM 与 Transformers 两条推理路径，支持图片流式输出、PDF 处理与基准批量评测，提供 5 种分辨率模式（Tiny 至 Gundam 动态分辨率）与文档转 Markdown、OCR、Free OCR 等 prompt 模板。模型权重发布于 Hugging Face，环境依赖 CUDA 11.8 与 torch 2.6.0，README 注明 vLLM/transformers 同环境安装可能报依赖版本冲突。", "highlights": ["支持 vLLM 与 Transformers 两条推理路径", "5 种分辨率模式：512×512 至动态 Gundam 模式", "提供文档转 Markdown、OCR、Free OCR 等 prompt 模板", "已获上游 vLLM 官方支持"], "use_cases": ["将图片或 PDF 文档转换为 Markdown 文本", "批量评测 OCR 基准", "研究视觉-文本压缩机制"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": "arXiv:2510.18234", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["OCR", "视觉文本压缩", "文档转Markdown", "视觉语言模型"], "domain": "AI/视觉语言模型", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["deepseek", "vllm"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L23:  DeepSeek-OCR: Contexts Optical Compression", "L30: - [2025/10/20]🚀🚀🚀 We release DeepSeek-OCR, a model to investigate the role of vision encoders from an LLM-centric viewpo", "L104: The current open-source model supports the following modes:"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [1, 23], "quotes": ["DeepSeek AI", " DeepSeek-OCR: Contexts Optical Compression"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [29, 56, 57], "quotes": ["- [2025/10/23]🚀🚀🚀 DeepSeek-OCR is now officially supported in upstream vLLM. Thanks to the vLLM team for their help.", "## vLLM-Inference", "- VLLM:"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [36, 38], "quotes": ["1. Clone this repository and navigate to the DeepSeek-OCR folder", "git clone https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-OCR.git"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [49, 50, 51, 52], "quotes": ["pip install torch==2.6.0 torchvision==0.21.0 torchaudio==2.6.0 --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118", "pip