ag to Applications, done. The app includes in-app auto-update, so future upgrades a"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "support", "lines": [37, 41, 42], "quotes": ["### Homebrew", "brew install jundot/omlx/omlx --with-custom-kernel   # With native custom kernels (needs full Xcode)", "# No full Xcode? brew install jundot/omlx/omlx installs without the kernels"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [49, 51], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/jundot/omlx.git", "make install                # Editable install with the web UI and native custom kernels"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [67], "note": "pip install -e 为跳过内核的源码安装方式", "quotes": ["> `pip install -e .` also skips them. `make kernels` rebuilds only the kernels"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "RAM - 8GB", "rel": "support", "lines": [165], "note": "产品自身进程内存上限默认为系统内存减 8GB", "quotes": ["- **Process memory enforcement**: Total memory limit (default: system RAM - 8GB) prevents system-wide OOM."]}], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [29, 153, 155], "note": "针对 Claude Code 的上下文/超时优化，非替代关系", "quotes": ["> *oMLX persists KV cache across a hot in-memory tier and cold SSD tier - even when context changes mid-conversation, al", "### Claude Code Optimization", "Runs smaller context models with Claude Code by reporting the model's real context window to auto-compact instead of sca"]}, {"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "mention", "lines": [79, 192], "note": "可接入本服务器的集成对象", "quotes": ["Launch oMLX from your Applications folder. The Welcome screen guides you through three steps - model directory, server s", "Set up OpenClaw, OpenCode, Codex, Hermes Agent, Copilot, Pi, Mistral Vibe, and DeepSeek Harness directly from the admin "]}, {"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [186], "note": "模型下载来源", "quotes": ["Search and download MLX models from HuggingFace directly in the admin dashboard. Browse model cards, check file sizes, a"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines"