ents.txt 安装依赖", "quotes": ["python -m pip install -r requirements.txt"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "不需要 GPU", "rel": "support", "lines": [24], "note": "基础课程不需要 GPU，属学习环境要求", "quotes": ["脚本默认把图形保存在 `outputs/`。打开 Notebook 时按顺序运行所有单元；完整说明见安装文档。深度学习依赖单独安装，基础课程不需要 GPU。"]}], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": [7], "note": "Day 55～100 尚未编写（非弃用，标注为进行中状态）"}}}, "547eb704fd76": {"fn": "microsoft/onnxruntime", "sha": "547eb704fd76", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给开发者提供跨平台高性能的 ML 推理与训练加速运行时", "review": "ONNX Runtime 是跨平台的机器学习加速运行时：推理侧可读取来自 PyTorch、TensorFlow/Keras 等深度学习框架，以及 scikit-learn、LightGBM、XGBoost 等经典机器学习库导出的模型，利用硬件加速器与图优化/变换提升性能；训练侧通过在现有 PyTorch 训练脚本中添加一行代码，加速多节点 NVIDIA GPU 上 transformer 模型的训练。以 MIT 许可发布，由微软维护，配套独立的推理与训练示例仓库及 QNN Plugin EP 插件仓库。项目可能收集使用数据并回传 Microsoft。", "highlights": ["跨平台推理加速，支持 PyTorch/TensorFlow/Keras/scikit-learn/LightGBM/XGBoost 等来源模型", "利用硬件加速器并结合图优化与 transforms 提供性能", "训练侧一行代码接入现有 PyTorch 脚本，加速多节点 NVIDIA GPU 上 transformer 训练", "提供独立的推理/训练示例仓库与 QNN Plugin EP 插件仓库"], "use_cases": ["将已训练好的深度学习或经典 ML 模型部署到多平台做推理", "加速 transformer 模型在多节点 NVIDIA GPU 上的训练", "在兼容的硬件加速器上运行模型以提升性能"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["推理引擎", "训练加速", "深度学习", "模型部署"], "domain": "机器学习基础设施/推理与训练运行时", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L1: **ONNX Runtime is a cross-platform inference and training machine-learning accelerator**.", "L3: **ONNX Runtime inference** can enable faster customer experiences and lower costs, supporting models from deep learning ", "L5: **ONNX Runtime training** can accelerate the model training time on multi-node NVIDIA GPUs for transformer models with a"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [45], "quotes": ["This project is licensed under the MIT License."]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "d4d9ef450cc7": {"fn": "openai/swarm", "sha": "d4d9ef450cc7", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的轻量多 Agent 编排教学框架", "review": "OpenAI 团队维护的实验性教育框架，用于探索多 Agent 编排模式。核心机制为 Agent（封装 instructions 与 functions）和 handoffs（通过函数返回值转移执行权）两个原语；client.run() 实现补全-工具执行-换 Agent-更新上下文的循环，函数自动转 JSON Schema，支持流式输出与 REPL 调试循环。完全基于 Chat Completions API，无状态运行，默认模型 gpt-4o。README 明确其已被 OpenAI Agents SDK 取代，生产场景建议迁移。", "highlights": ["Agent 与 handoffs 两个原语表达多 Agent 编排", "函数自动转换为 Chat Completions tools 的 JSON Schema", "基于 Chat Completions API 的无状态设计", "提供 airline、support_bot、triage_agent 等 6 组示例"], "use_cases": ["学习多 Agent 编排与 handoff 模式", "构建客户服务分流/多 Agent 协作原型", "在本地 REPL 中流式调试 Agent 对话"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["多Agent编排", "教学框架", "Agent框架", "LLM基础设施"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/多 Agent 编排", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L6: > Swarm is now replaced by the OpenAI Agents SDK, which is a production-ready evolution of Swarm. The Agents SDK feature", "L43: Swarm focuses on making agent **coordination** and **execution** lightweight, highly controllable, and easily testable.", "L56: The Assistants API is a great option for developers looking for fully-hosted threads and built in memory management and "], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [15, 21], "quotes": ["pip install git+ssh://git@github.com/openai/swarm.git", "pip install git+https://github.com/openai/swarm.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": true, "lines": [3, 6, 8]}}}, "189587ab0d62": {"fn": "docmost/docmost", "sha": "189587ab0d62", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给团队提供的开源协作 wiki 与文档软件", "review": "Docmost 是一个开源的协作 wiki 与文档软件，自称是 Confluence 和 Notion 的开源替代品。功能包括实时协作、图表绘制（Draw.io、Excalidraw、Mermaid）、空间管理、权限管理、群组、评论、页面历史、搜索、文件附件与嵌入（Airtable、Loom、Miro 等），支持 10+ 种语言翻译。可参考其文档自行部署，或使用官方提供的云版本。核心采用 AGPL 3.0 许可证。", "highlights": ["实时协作编辑", "支持 Draw.io、Excalidraw、Mermaid 图表", "空间与权限管理、群组、页面历史", "10+ 种语言翻译支持"], "use_cases": ["团队知识库与内部 wiki", "项目与产品文档协作撰写", "替代 Confluence/Notion 的自托管文档方案"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "viral", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "企业", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["wiki", "文档协作", "知识库", "自托管"], "domain": "企业协作/知识管理", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L3:  Open-source collaborative wiki and documentation software.", "L33: Docmost core is licensed under the open-source AGPL 3.0 license."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "82ce94d93cda": {"fn": "dyad-sh/dyad", "sha": "82ce94d93cda", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "本地运行的开源 AI 应用构建器，面向进阶用户", "review": "Dyad 是一个在本地机器上运行的开源 AI 应用构建器，定位为 Lovable、v0、Bolt 的替代品。采用自带 API 密钥（bring your own keys）模式，用户使用自己的 AI API 密钥，无需注册即可下载使用，支持 Mac 与 Windows 双平台。代码采用 Apache 2.0 许可证，仓库中 `src/pro` 目录之外的代码开源。项目维护 Reddit 社区（r/dyadbuilders）供用户分享项目与交流。", "highlights": ["本地运行，自带 API 密钥，无供应商锁定", "支持 Mac 与 Windows 跨平台", "无需注册，下载即用", "代码以 Apache 2.0 许可开源（src/pro 除外）"], "use_cases": ["在本地机器上用 AI 生成应用", "使用自己的 AI API 密钥构建应用", "参与 AI 应用构建社区交流项目"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AI应用构建器", "本地优先", "低代码/无代码", "生成式AI"], "domain": "AI 应用开发工具", "alternative_to": ["Lovable"], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Dyad is a local, open-source AI app builder. It's fast, private, and fully under your control — like Lovable, v0, or Bol", "L11: - ⚡️ **Local**: Fast, private and no lock-in.", "L12: - 🛠 **Bring your own keys**: Use your own AI API keys — no vendor lock-in."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Lovable", "rel": "alternative", "lines": [3], "note": "自称类似/替代 Lovable 的本地运行版本", "quotes": ["Dyad is a local, open-source AI app builder. It's fast, private, and fully under your control — like Lovable, v0, or Bol"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "0241ed1383ce": {"fn": "screenpipe/screenpipe", "sha": "0241ed1383ce", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "持续录制电脑屏幕与音频，为企业/个人构建可搜索的 AI 记忆", "review": "本地持续捕获屏幕与音频的应用：事件驱动截屏（配 accessibility tree，OCR 兜底）、Whisper 本地语音转写与说话人识别、自然语言检索（SQLite FTS5）、时间线回放。通过 Markdown 定义的 Pipes 运行 AI agent（如 meeting-summary、day-recap），带 YAML 确定性数据权限控制；以 MCP server 与 localhost REST API 向 AI 助手暴露屏幕历史。source-available 许可：个人非商用免费，商用需购买许可。桌面应用支持 macOS/Windows/Linux，也可经 CLI 运行。", "highlights": ["事件驱动截屏 + accessibility tree/OCR 兜底，本地 Whisper (Large-V3-Turbo) 转写", "Pipes 插件系统：markdown 定义的定时 AI agent，含三层确定性数据权限", "MCP server 零配置接入 Claude Desktop、Cursor 等 MCP 客户端", "localhost REST API 与 JS/TS SDK，支持原始 SQL 访问 SQLite"], "use_cases": ["回忆/检索自己在电脑上看过的内容与会议录音", "给 AI 编码助手提供工作上下文", "自动生成会议纪要、每日总结与时间分配报告", "分析团队工作流，找出可自动化的环节"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "企业", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["屏幕录制", "AI记忆", "MCP", "本地优先", "工作流自动化"], "domain": "效率工具/AI 记忆基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供简体中文翻译（L146），无其他中文来源信号"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L12:  Continuously record your company's computer work, map workflows, help find work worth automating, and power agents' con", "L51: - **Local-first** - capture history stays on your device by default. Cloud AI, sync, integrations, and managed team stor", "L166: - **License**: Screenpipe Commercial License (source-available; personal, non-commercial use permitted, commercial use r"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "s