: ["### Ollama", "You can also use models available to Ollama. Install Ollama and pull a model like Llava. If Ollama is not running on htt", "### Ollama"]}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [35, 42, 69, 92], "quotes": ["### Docker (preferred)", "docker run --rm --name openui -p 7878:7878 -e OPENAI_API_KEY -e ANTHROPIC_API_KEY -e OLLAMA_HOST=http://host.docker.inte", "docker run -n openui -p 7878:7878 -v $(pwd)/litellm-config.yaml:/app/litellm-config.yaml ghcr.io/wandb/openui", "docker-compose up -d"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [47, 52], "quotes": ["### From Source / Python", "git clone https://github.com/wandb/openui"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [75], "quotes": ["pip install .[litellm]"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "16GB of Ram", "rel": "mention", "lines": [108], "note": "Codespace 中运行 Ollama 的内存建议，非产品自身要求", "quotes": ["Choose more options when creating a Codespace, then select **New with options...**. Select the US West region if you wan"]}], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "9b9ca242831c": {"fn": "huggingface/peft", "sha": "9b9ca242831c", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "大模型参数高效微调库：小参数量适配下游任务", "review": "Hugging Face 的参数高效微调（PEFT）库，通过仅微调少量（额外）参数实现大模型向下游任务的适配，降低计算与存储开销，检查点仅数 MB 量级。与 Transformers 集成用于训练推理、Diffusers 管理适配器、Accelerate 支持分布式训练推理，并可与量化（QLoRA）、TRL（RLHF/DPO）组合使用。通过 pip 安装，README 提供 LoRA 训练与推理的代码示例及各方法的概念指南与 API 参考。", "highlights": ["仅微调少量参数即可适配大模型（示例中仅训练 0.19% 参数）", "与 Transformers/Diffusers/Accelerate 集成，支持适配器加载与切换", "支持 LoRA 等多种 PEFT 方法，可与量化、TRL/RLHF 组合", "提供 Stable Diffusion LoRA DreamBooth 训练脚本与示例 Space"], "use_cases": ["在消费级 GPU 上微调 LLM 而不 OOM", "为 Stable Diffusion 训练 LoRA 适配器", "用 RLHF/DPO 微调 LLM 时降低显存与存储开销", "为多个下游任务保存轻量适配器而非完整模型"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "m