就地重写 `tool_result` / `role:\"tool\"` 内容：git diff、git status、git log、grep、find、ls、tree、构建与包管理器日志、带行号"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "92660131f580": {"fn": "cube-js/cube", "sha": "92660131f580", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 AI、BI 与嵌入式分析的开源语义层", "review": "Cube Core 是开源语义层：以代码形式集中定义指标、维度、关联与访问规则，通过 SQL、REST 和 GraphQL API 向下游暴露给 BI 工具、自定义应用或 AI agent。支持所有 SQL 数据源（Snowflake、Databricks、BigQuery、Presto、Amazon Athena、Postgres 等），内置关系缓存引擎以降低 API 请求延迟并支撑高并发。无头设计，不附带 UI。Docker 本地或自托管运行；开发模式存在认证绕过，仅限本机调试，不可用于生产。", "highlights": ["一次定义指标/维度/访问规则，经 SQL、REST、GraphQL API 供下游消费", "兼容 Snowflake、Databricks、BigQuery、Athena、Postgres 等 SQL 数据源", "内置关系缓存引擎，提供亚秒级延迟与高并发", "无头设计，数据模型与商业版 Cube 双向兼容"], "use_cases": ["为 AI agent 提供受治理的语义层 API", "自建嵌入式分析，把指标接口暴露给产品", "统一内部 BI 工具的指标定义，避免重复建模"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["语义层", "BI/分析", "嵌入式分析", "数据建模"], "domain": "数据/BI与分析基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L9: __Cube Core is the open-source semantic layer.__ Define metrics, dimensions, joins, and access rules once in code, then ", "L26: Cube Core is an open, standalone semantic layer that any analytics application or AI agent can consume through standard ", "L66: Cube is our commercial product — an agentic analytics platform built on Cube Core. Same semantic layer underneath, plus "], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term"