rm worker 每会话额外内存约 3.1 MB，支持在同一仓库生成多个 agent 并由服务器管理协作（文件变更通知、DM/广播消息、自动冲突处理）；agent 可自主生成子 swarm。附带 agentgrep 检索工具返回文件结构并按已见内容裁剪结果以节省上下文。安装提供 macOS/Linux 一键脚本，Windows 另有说明。", "highlights": ["多 agent swarm：服务器管理的协作、消息通道与冲突通知", "agentgrep 工具返回文件结构并自适应裁剪以节省上下文", "支持 Claude OAuth 与 OpenAI Codex OAuth 等多种 provider", "self dev 模式：agent 可修改、构建、测试自身源码并热重载"], "use_cases": ["在同一仓库并行运行数十个编码 agent", "让多个 agent 协作修改代码并自动处理文件冲突", "作为终端 TUI 编码 agent 日常开发工具"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://github.com/1jehuang/jcode/releases/download/readme-assets/jcode-yc-launch.mp4", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["编码agent", "TUI/CLI", "多agent协作", "Rust"], "domain": "开发工具/AI 编码", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": ["Claude Code"], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L7:  High-performance coding agents.", "L8:  Run dozens of agents in parallel without melting your machine. More agents, less RAM, no lag.", "L78: Spawn two or more agents in the same repo, and they will automatically be managed by the server to allow native collabor", "L111: Supports a wide range of providers, including Claude OAuth and OpenAI Codex OAuth."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "compat", "lines": [111], "note": "README 提到支持 Claude OAuth 等 provider，未列专门适配细节", "quotes": ["Supports a wide range of providers, including Claude OAuth and OpenAI Codex OAuth."]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [49, 66], "note": "基准对比对象", "quotes": ["|**Claude Code**|~164 MB|**~54× more RAM**|", "|**Claude Code**|3512.8 ms|**72.2× slower**|"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "96552837b32c": {"fn": "pydantic/pydantic-ai", "sha": "96552837b32c", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 Python 开发者的类型安全 AI Agent SDK", "review": "Pydantic 团队出品的 Python AI SDK，核心是带类型标注的可扩展 agent 循环：结构化输出、依赖注入与工具参数校验由 Pydantic 类型系统保证。同一 agent 定义可运行于终端 CLI、Web 聊天、实时语音会话、持久化后台队列或 GitHub Actions。配套 Harness 能力库提供记忆、护栏、子 agent、规划等能力；另有 Evals 评估、Graph 控制流、OpenTelemetry 原生可观测性。安装经 PyPI/uv，无需编译，内置 'test' 模型可不带 API key 起步。", "highlights": ["任意模型通过字符串切换，统一 Python API（OpenAI、Anthropic、Google、Bedrock、Ollama 等数十家）", "类型端到端：结构化输出、类型化依赖注入与工具 schema 校验", "九种持久化执行引擎（Temporal、DBOS、Prefect、Restate、AWS Lambda 等），支持人审", "实时语音（OpenAI Realtime、Gemini Live、Azure、xAI Grok Voice）与图像生成同栈提供"], "use_cases": ["用 Python 构建带类型校验的结构化数据抽取 pipeline", "搭建需要长时运行、可从崩溃恢复的多 agent 工作流", "在终端或 GitHub Actions 中运行编码 agent", "为同一 agent 增加实时语音对话前端"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["agent框架", "LLM基础设施", "类型安全", "实时语音", "持久化工作流"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": ["LangChain"], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "xai", "groq", "bedrock", "ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L18: **Pydantic AI** is the Python AI SDK: a typed, extensible agent loop with every model a string swap away. The same agent", "L157: - **Any model, one Python API.** Virtually every model and provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Bedrock, Azure AI Foundr", "L163: - **Batteries, composably.** One primitive, the capability, bundles tools, instructions, hooks, and model settings into "], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [157], "quotes": ["- **Any model, one Python API.** Virtually every model and provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Bedrock, Azure AI Foundr"]}, {"term": "xai", "rel": "support", "lines": [157, 165], "quotes": ["- **Any model, one Python API.** Virtually every model and provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Bedrock, Azure AI Foundr", "- **Every interface.** One agent definition runs as a CLI, a built-in web chat, or realtime speech (OpenAI Realtime, Gem"]}, {"term": "groq", "rel": "support", "lines": [157], "quotes": ["- **Any model, one Python API.** Virtually every model and provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Bedrock, Azure AI Foundr"]}, {"term": "bedrock", "rel": "support", "lines": [157], "quotes": ["- **Any model, one Python API.** Virtually every model and provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Bedrock, Azure AI Foundr"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [157], "quotes": ["- **Any model, one Python API.** Virtually every model and provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Bedrock, Azure AI Foundr"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [11, 37, 71], "quotes": [" PyPI", "uv add pydantic-ai pydantic-ai-harness", "uv add pydantic-ai"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [169, 171], "note": "对比/迁移对象", "quotes": ["- **Coming from another framework?** The comparisons show where Pydantic AI differs from LangChain, Google ADK, the Clau", "Built by the Pydantic team: Pydantic Validation is the validation layer of the OpenAI SDK, the Anthropic SDK, the Google"]}, {"term": "Vercel AI SDK", "rel": "mention", "lines": [165], "note": "作为可对接的 UI 事件流协议提及", "quotes": ["- **Every interface.** One agent definition runs as a CLI, a built-in web chat, or realtime speech (OpenAI Realtime, Gem"]}]}}, "170b5a64d56f": {"fn": "SWE-agent/SWE-agent", "sha": "170b5a64d56f", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "科研团队的自动修复 GitHub issue 的 LM agent", "review": "SWE-agent 让用户选择的语言模型自主调用工具，修复真实 GitHub 仓库中的 issue，也可用于进攻性网络安全（CTF，EnIGMA 模式）与竞赛编程等自定义任务。配置由单一 yaml 文件管理，面向研究场景设计。由普林斯顿与斯坦福的研究者维护，MIT 许可；README 警告当前开发重心已转向 mini-swe-agent，一般建议新用户改用 mini-SWE-agent，EnIGMA 模式目前需使用 0.7 版本。", "highlights": ["接入用户自选 LM（如 GPT-4o、Claude Sonnet 4）自主调用工具修复 GitHub issue", "EnIGMA 模式用于 CTF 进攻性网络安全挑战", "单一 yaml 文件配置，面向研究可修改设计", "提供 GitHub Codespaces 浏览器内试运行途径"], "use_cases": ["自动尝试修复仓库中的 GitHub issue", "在 SWE-bench 上做基准评测", "解 CTF 网络安全挑战题"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.15793", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["软件工程自动化", "agent", "网络安全/CTF", "科研工具"], "domain": "开发者工具/软件工程自动化", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "university", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L20: SWE-agent enables your language model of choice (e.g. GPT-4o or Claude Sonnet 4) to autonomously use tools to", "L28: * ✅ **Made for research**: Simple & hackable by design", "L30: SWE-agent is built and maintained by researchers from Princeton University and Stanford University."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [20, 36, 37], "note": "作为示例模型被提及，非专门适配", "quotes": ["SWE-agent enables your language model of choice (e.g. GPT-4o or Claude Sonnet 4) to autonomously use tools to", "* Feb 28: SWE-agent 1.0 + Claude 3.7 is SoTA on SWE-Bench full", "* Feb 25: SWE-agent 1.0 + Claude 3.7 is SoTA on SWE-bench verified"]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": true, "lines": [13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18], "note": "README 警告开发重心已转向 mini-swe-agent，建议今后使用后者"}}}, "db1b5389252b": {"fn": "modelscope/FunASR", "sha": "db1b5389252b", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的语音识别工具包：训练/推理/流式 ASR 与部署服务", "review": "FunASR 是一个语音识别工具包，将任务、checkpoint 与运行时分开选择：提供文件转写、流式转写、VAD、标点、说话人分离、情感与音频事件识别等 pipeline，模型库含 SenseVoiceSmall、Paraformer、Fun-ASR-Nano 等。支持 Python AutoModel、CLI、OpenAI 兼容 HTTP 服务、Docker 流式服务、vLLM 批处理加速以及 llama.cpp/GGUF 的无 Python 边缘部署，并提供 MCP Server 供 Claude/Cursor 等 agent 调用。工具包本身为 MIT 许可，第三方模型许可单独约定。", "highlights": ["任务/checkpoint/运行时分离的工具包架构，含模型选择与部署矩阵指南", "多种部署路径：Python、CLI、OpenAI 兼容服务、Docker、vLLM、llama.cpp/GGUF", "提供 MCP Server 与 OpenAI API 接入 LangChain/Dify/AutoGen 等 agent 框架", "GPU（CUDA/Vulkan）与 CPU/边缘设备的预编译二进制分发"], "use_cases": ["为中文/多语言音频做文件转写、标点与说话人分段", "部署实时流式 ASR 的 WebSocket 服务", "在无 GPU 的边缘设备上以 GGUF 二进制运行语音识别", "把语音转写接入 Claude/Cursor 等 agent 工作流"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": "cpu-ok", "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.11013", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["语音识别", "流式ASR", "说话人分离", "边缘部署", "模型服务"], "domain": "语音/AI 基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["llama.cpp", "vllm"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供简体中文版本", "阿里 OSS 示例音频与达摩院模型示例文本", "modelscope 组织"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5:  Industrial speech recognition toolkit for offline, streaming, and edge deployment.", "L6:  ASR · VAD · punctuation · speaker pipelines · emotion and audio-event models · OpenAI-compatible serving", "L112: FunASR is a toolkit: choose the task, checkpoint, and runtime separately."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "llama.cpp", "rel": "support", "lines": [123, 231, 233, 238], "quotes": ["|Native CPU/edge transcription|Fun-ASR-Nano or SenseVoiceSmall GGUF|llama.cpp runtime|Requires matching converted weight", "### CPU / Edge — llama.cpp / GGUF (no GPU, no Python)", "Run **SenseVoice / Paraformer / Fun-ASR-Nano** as a **single self-contained binary** on CPU and edge devices — this is t", "./llama-funasr-sensevoice -m ./gguf/sensevoice-small-q8.gguf --vad ./gguf/fsmn-vad.gguf -a audio.wav"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [95, 98, 100], "quotes": ["At scale, accelerate Fun-ASR-Nano with vLLM (batch processing):", "from funasr.auto.auto_model_vllm import AutoModelVLLM", "model = AutoModelVLLM(model=\"FunAudioLLM/Fun-ASR-Nano-2512\", tensor_parallel_size=1)"]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [106], "note": "MCP Server 供 Claude 使用，非专门 SDK 接入", "quotes": ["> **Use with AI agents:** MCP Server for Claude/Cursor · OpenAI API for LangChain/Dify/AutoGen"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [35, 37, 134, 143], "quotes": ["# CPU-only installs can use the default PyPI wheels.", "pip install funasr", "pip install funasr", "Requirements: Python ≥ 3.8. Install PyTorch + torchaudio first (pytorch.org), then `pip install funasr`."]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [28, 30, 129], "quotes": ["Open In Colab", "No local setup? Open the Colab quickstart to transcribe a public sample or upload your own audio in a browser.", "Trying FunASR for the first time? Use the Colab quickstart before setting up a local environment. Choosing a first model"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [140, 141], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/modelscope/FunASR.git && cd FunASR", "pip install -e ./"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [228], "quotes": ["docker pull registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/funasr_repo/funasr:funasr-runtime-sdk-online-cpu-0.1.12"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "CPU-only", "rel": "support", "lines": [35], "note": "CPU-only 安装可用默认 PyPI wheel", "quotes": ["# CPU-only installs can use the default PyPI wheels."]}], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [106], "note": "MCP Server 的使用方，非竞品", "quotes": ["> **Use with AI agents:** MCP Server for Claude/Cursor · OpenAI API for LangChain/Dify/AutoGen"]}, {"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [106], "note": "OpenAI API 的配合框架", "quotes": ["> **Use with AI agents:** MCP Server for Claude/Cursor · OpenAI API for LangChain/Dify/AutoGen"]}, {"term": "Dify", "rel": "mention", "lines": [106], "note": "OpenAI API 的配合框架", "quotes": ["> **Use with AI agents:** MCP Server for Claude/Cursor · OpenAI API for LangChain/Dify/AutoGen"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "d7597260c8a6": {"fn": "openai/gpt-oss", "sha": "d7597260c8a6", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "OpenAI 开放权重的两个开源语言模型（120B/20B）", "review": "本仓库提供 gpt-oss-120b 与 gpt-oss-20b 两个开放权重模型的参考实现与工具链：PyTorch、Triton、Metal 三种推理实现，浏览器与 Python 两个内置工具，终端聊天客户端与 Responses API 示例服务器。模型采用 harmony 响应格式训练，需以该格式调用；权重经 MXFP4 量化，120b 可在单张 80GB GPU 上运行，20b 可在 16GB 内存内运行。提供 Transformers、vLLM、Ollama、LM Studio 等多种推理途径。", "highlights": ["两个开放权重模型：117B/5.1B 激活与 21B/3.6B 激活", "MXFP4 量化 MoE 权重，120b 适配单张 80GB GPU，20b 适配 16GB 内存", "原生函数调用、网页浏览、Python 代码执行与 Structured Outputs 能力", "Apache 2.0 许可，支持参数微调与三档推理努力配置"], "use_cases": ["在自有 GPU 或消费级硬件上本地部署推理服务", "为 Agent 应用接入函数调用与浏览/代码执行工具", "基于开放权重做微调定制", "研究模型架构与推理过程的参考实现"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["开源大模型", "本地推理", "Agent能力", "权重开放"], "domain": "LLM/开源模型", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["vllm", "ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L10: Welcome to the gpt-oss series, OpenAI's open-weight models designed for powerful reasoning, agentic tasks, and versatile", "L28: - **MXFP4 quantization:** The models were post-trained with MXFP4 quantization of the MoE weights, making `gpt-oss-120b`", "L104: This repository provides a collection of reference implementations:"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [45, 47, 50, 55], "quotes": ["#### vLLM", "vLLM recommends using `uv` for Python dependency management. You can use vLLM to spin up an OpenAI-compatible web server", "uv pip install --pre vllm==0.10.1+gptoss \\", "vllm serve openai/gpt-oss-20b"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [76, 78, 82, 83], "quotes": ["#### Ollama", "If you are trying to run `gpt-oss` on consumer hardware, you can use Ollama by running the following commands after inst", "ollama pull gpt-oss:20b", "ollama run gpt-oss:20b"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [128, 132, 134], "quotes": ["If you want to try any of the code you can install it directly from PyPI", "pip install gpt-oss", "pip install gpt-oss[torch]"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [142, 183], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss.git", "git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "9c53f8382dea": {"fn": "kortix-ai/suna", "sha": "9c53f8382dea", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "开源自托管 AI 操作系统：团队用 Agent 交付并审批实际工作", "review": "以 git 仓库承载整个组织的 Agent 配置：agents、skills、记忆与连接器均以文件形式版本化。每个会话在独立云沙箱分支上运行，产出的变更经人工批准的 change request 合入 main。支持 Slack/Microsoft Teams 接入、cron/webhook 触发、每工具的 Allow/Ask/Block 审批门、3,000+ 应用连接器、SAML SSO 与审计日志。通过 Docker Compose 自托管，或使用 Kortix Cloud 托管服务；模型可自选提供商并使用自己的 API key。", "highlights": ["公司配置全部为 git 仓库内文件，可版本化、diff 与审计", "每会话独立隔离沙箱，变更默认拒绝合并、需人工审批 change request", "3,000+ 应用连接器加 MCP/OpenAPI/GraphQL/HTTP，凭据服务端代理", "cron 与签名 webhook 自动触发会话"], "use_cases": ["团队自托管替代方案运行有审批门的 AI Agent", "在 Slack/Teams 里 @机器人 分派任务并在线程内收取成果", "用 Agent 定时替代 Zapier 式自动化流程", "后台云端编码 Agent 修 bug 并提 PR 待人审"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "企业", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["AI操作系统", "Agent平台", "自托管", "企业协作", "工作流自动化"], "domain": "AI Agent 平台/企业协作", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": ["ChatGPT"], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5: **The open-source AI Operating System**", "L22: **Kortix is the one you own.** It's an open-source **AI Operating System**: your agents, the", "L24: diffable, and shared by the whole company. The agents work on real **cloud computers** — an"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [46, 49], "note": "对比表中作为竞品绑定的模型提供商提及，README 声明任意提供商可用", "quotes": ["||Claude Cowork|ChatGPT Work|**Kortix**|", "|**Models**|Anthropic only|GPT-5.6 only|**Any provider, your own API keys**|"]}, {"term": "bedrock", "rel": "mention", "lines": [50], "note": "对比表中提及 Claude Cowork 可部署于 Bedrock，非本项目接入", "quotes": ["|**Where it runs**|Anthropic's cloud, or Bedrock / Google Cloud / Microsoft Foundry — no self-host|OpenAI's cloud, no se"]}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [120, 211, 215], "quotes": ["kortix self-host start      # your own box: one Docker Compose stack", "network. Start a production-style local instance from Docker images, then switch the CLI between", "kortix self-host start"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [7, 46, 113], "quotes": ["**The leading open-source alternative to Claude Cowork and ChatGPT Work.**", "||Claude Cowork|ChatGPT Work|**Kortix**|", "Kortix is the leading open-source alternative to Claude Cowork and ChatGPT Work. Your team uses it"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [62], "note": "作为 Paperclip 场景中被编排的 Agent 举例提及", "quotes": ["|**Paperclip** (agent orchestration)|You already run agents such as Claude Code or Codex and want an org chart, budgets "]}]}}, "58eb016e442d": {"fn": "walkinglabs/learn-harness-engineering", "sha": "58eb016e442d", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的 AI coding agent harness 工程课程（14 讲+8 项目）", "review": "以项目制课程形式讲解如何为 AI coding agent 构建运行环境（harness）：覆盖指令、状态、验证、范围、会话生命周期五个子系统，以及 loop engineering 与 graph engineering 等进阶主题。内容含 14 讲、8 个动手项目、可复制的模板资源库（AGENTS.md、feature_list.json、init.sh 等），全部课程材料以 MIT 许可发布并提供 15 种语言翻译，可通过 npm 脚本在本地生成 PDF 教材。毕设项目为一个 Electron 知识库桌面应用，随课程阶段演进。", "highlights": ["harness 五子系统框架：指令、状态、验证、范围、会话生命周期", "提供可复制模板库与 harness-creator 脚手架技能（AGENTS.md、init.sh、验证流程）", "14 讲 + 8 项目，15 种语言翻译，MIT 许可", "含 Claude Code、Codex、DeepSeek、Pi 四个生产 harness 的拆解章节"], "use_cases": ["学习如何在真实仓库中让 coding agent 可靠地完成多轮任务", "为自己的项目搭建 AGENTS.md、状态文件与验证工作流", "参考生产级 agent harness（Claude Code/Codex/DeepSeek/Pi）的设计方式"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["教程/课程", "AI Agent", "Harness 工程", "编码代理"], "domain": "AI 开发教育/Agent 工程", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L19:  A project-based course on building the environment, state management, verification, and control mechanisms that make AI", "L136: A harness has five subsystems:", "L187: 1. **Lectures**: 13 conceptual units explaining the theory behind harness engineering.", "L188: 2. **Projects**: 7 hands-on projects where you build an agentic workspace from scratch."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [69, 70, 111, 37], "note": "引用其 harness 工程文章与 Claude Code 拆解，非接入其服务", "quotes": ["- Anthropic: Effective harnesses for long-running agents", "- Anthropic: Harness design for long-running application development", "The evidence is clear. Anthropic ran a controlled experiment: same model (Opus 4.5), same prompt (\"build a 2D retro game", "|**Claude Code**|How Claude Code builds its harness — four-layer memory, five-level compaction, hooks, and sub-agent iso"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "mention", "lines": [39], "note": "harness 拆解章节对象之一，非模型接入", "quotes": ["|**DeepSeek**|How DeepSeek builds its harness — \"everything is a plugin,\" capability seams, and an event pipeline.|"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [365], "note": "npm run pdf:build 生成本地 PDF 教材", "quotes"