 by combining search engines, web sc", "L5: The goal of this repo is to provide the simplest implementation of a deep research agent - e.g. an agent that can refine", "L30: - API keys for:"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [109, 111, 117], "quotes": ["### DeepSeek R1", "Deep research performs great on R1! We use Fireworks as the main provider for the R1 model. To use R1, simply set a Fire", "The system will automatically switch over to use R1 instead of `o3-mini` when the key is detected."]}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "mention", "lines": [121], "quotes": ["There are 2 other optional env vars that lets you tweak the endpoint (for other OpenAI compatible APIs like OpenRouter o"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [42, 84], "quotes": ["npm install", "npm start"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [65, 70, 76], "quotes": ["3. Run `docker build -f Dockerfile`", "docker compose up -d", "docker exec -it deep-research npm run docker"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "64a9bd7aa55f": {"fn": "QwenLM/Qwen3-VL", "sha": "64a9bd7aa55f", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的开源多模态视觉语言模型系列及使用代码", "review": "阿里云 Qwen 团队开发的多模态大语言模型系列，提供 Dense 与 MoE 两种架构、2B 到 235B 多种规模及 Instruct/Thinking 版本。模型能力覆盖视觉 Agent（操作 PC/手机 GUI）、从图像/视频生成代码、2D/3D 空间定位、原生 256K 上下文（可扩展至 1M）、32 语言 OCR 等。README 提供 Transformers 与 ModelScope 的推理示例、qwen-vl-utils 工具包用法、图像/视频像素预算控制方法，并附 Colab Cookbook 集合。", "highlights": ["提供 2B/4B/8B/32B/30B-A3B/235B-A22B 多种规模的 Dense 与 MoE 模型及 FP8 版本", "支持 32 语言 OCR、原生 256K 上下文（可扩展至 1M）与小时级视频理解", "提供 qwen-vl-utils 工具包控制图像/视频像素预算与视觉 token 数量", "通过 Colab 提供 12 类能力 Cookbook（识别、文档解析、视频理解、Agent 等）"], "use_cases": ["构建操作 PC/手机图形界面的视觉 Agent", "文档解析、OCR 与关键信息抽取", "长视频理解与时间戳定位", "基于图像/视频生成前端代码"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "README 中提及（L3/L41 链接指向 paper）", "demo_url": "README 头部提供 Demo 链接（L5）", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["多模态大模型", "视觉语言模型", "视频理解", "OCR", "Agent"], "domain": "AI 模型/多模态", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["vllm"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["阿里云 Qwen 团队", "提供微信群入口", "建议中国大陆用户使用 ModelScope"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L1: # Qwen3-VL", "L8: Meet Qwen3-VL — the most powerful vision-language model in the Qwen series to date.", "L12: Available in Dense and MoE architectures that scale from edge to cloud, with Instruct and reasoning‑enhanced Thinking ed"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [283, 292, 295, 342, 344], "note": "窗外行，README 后续部署章节提供 vLLM 部署指南", "quotes": ["For supported frameworks (currently transformers and vLLM), you could modify `max_position_embeddings` and `rope_scaling", "When using vLLM for serving, you can also enable YaRN by adding the additional arguments `--rope-scaling` and `--max-mod", "vllm serve Qwen/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct --rope-scaling '{\"rope_type\":\"yarn\",\"factor\":3.0,\"original_max_position_embe", "We recommend using vLLM for fast Qwen3-VL deployment and inference. You need to install `vllm>=0.11.0` to enable Qwen3-V", "Please check vLLM official documentation for more details about online serving and offline inference for multimodal mode"]}], "install": [{"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [66, 67, 68, 69, 70, 71, 72, 73, 74, 75, 76, 77], "note": "Cookbook 以 Colab 形式提供", "quotes": ["|Omni Recognition|Not only identify animals, plants, people, and scenic spots but also recognize various objects such as", "|Powerful Document Parsing Capabilities|The parsing of documents has reached a higher level, including not only text but", "|Precise Object Grounding Across Formats|Using relative position coordinates, it supports both boxes and points, allowin", "|General OCR and Key Information Extraction|Stronger text recognition capabilities in natural scenes and multiple langua", "|Video Understanding|Better video OCR, long video understanding, and video grounding.|Colab|", "|Mobile Agent|Locate and think for mobile phone control.|Colab|", "|Computer-Use Agent|Locate and think for controlling computers and Web.|Colab|", "|3D Grounding|Provide accurate 3D bounding boxes for both indoor and outdoor objects.|Colab|", "|Thinking with Images|Utilize image_zoom_in_tool and search_tool to facilitate the model’s precise comprehension of fine", "|MultiModal Coding|Generate accurate code based on rigorous comprehension of multimodal information.|Colab|", "|Long Document Understanding|Achieve rigorous semantic comprehension of ultra-long documents.|Colab|", "|Spatial Understanding|See, understand and reason about the spatial information|Colab|"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [85, 161, 163], "quotes": ["pip install \"transformers>=4.57.0\"", "pip install qwen-vl-utils==0.0.14", "# pip install qwen-vl-utils[decord]"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [437], "note": "窗外行，提供 Docker 部署", "quotes": ["docker run --gpus all --ipc=host --network=host --rm --name qwen3vl -it qwenllm/qwenvl:qwen3vl-cu128 bash"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [3, 8, 141], "note": "Qwen 系列自身，非替代/竞品关系", "quotes": [" 💜 Qwen Chat &nbsp&nbsp | &nbsp&nbsp🤗 Hugging Face&nbsp&nbsp | &nbsp&nbsp🤖 ModelScope&nbsp&nbsp | &nbsp&nbsp📑 Blog&nbsp&", "Meet Qwen3-VL — the most powerful vision-language model in the Qwen series to date.", "processor = Au