，无需编写评测代码", "提供 Completion Function Protocol 支持提示链与工具调用 agent 类用例", "评测结果可记录至 Snowflake 数据库"], "use_cases": ["对比不同模型版本对自身用例的影响", "用私有工作流数据构建不公开的评测集", "按现有模板快速提交评测供 OpenAI 参考"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM评测", "基准测试", "开发者工具"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/评测", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5: Evals provide a framework for evaluating large language models (LLMs) or systems built using LLMs. We offer an existing ", "L13: To run evals, you will need to set up and specify your OpenAI API key. After you obtain an API key, specify it using the", "L15: **Minimum Required Version: Python 3.9**"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [39, 47, 59], "quotes": ["pip install -e .", "pip install -e .[formatters]", "pip install evals"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "1336ddbc64be": {"fn": "Unity-Technologies/ml-agents", "sha": "1336ddbc64be", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "让游戏与仿真成为强化学习智能体训练环境的 Unity 工具包", "review": "Unity 官方开源项目，将 2D/3D/VR/AR 游戏与仿真作为智能体训练环境：基于 PyTorch 提供 PPO、SAC、MA-POCA、自博弈等深度强化学习算法和 BC、GAIL 模仿学习算法，含 17+ 示例环境、课程学习、多实例并发训练。通过 Python API 和 Gym/PettingZoo 封装供研究人员使用，训练产物可经 Inference Engine 跨平台推理。以 Unity 包（com.unity.ml-agents）+ Python 包双组件发布，已迁移至 Unity Package 文档并停止维护 web 文档。", "highlights": ["基于 PyTorch 的 PPO/SAC/MA-POCA/自博弈等强化学习与 BC/GAIL 模仿