者通过对话式 AI 编程把想法做成产品。内容分三个阶段：产品原型（需求验证、原型搭建、接入 AI 能力）、全栈开发（前端、Git、Supabase、API、部署、Stripe 计费）、进阶（Claude Code、MCP、Skills、Agent Teams、跨平台项目），另附 9 大知识领域的附录知识库与交互式演示组件。面向初学者、产品经理、创始人及各级开发者，提供学习路径导航与 Vibe Stories 用户案例。", "highlights": ["三阶段路径：产品原型→全栈交付→Claude Code 进阶工作流", "10 种语言完整覆盖教程内容", "提供 llms.txt 供 OpenClaw、Claude、Cursor、Trae 等 AI agent 读取仓库结构", "附录含 9 大知识领域、80+ 交互式主题与用户研究方法（Double Diamond、JTBD、The Mom Test）"], "use_cases": ["零基础用 AI 对话做出第一个可演示的产品原型", "把想法推进到带登录、计费的全栈 SaaS 应用", "学习 Claude Code、MCP、Agent Teams 等进阶 AI 协作工作流", "产品经理快速验证想法并搭建 MVP"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [5, 6], "note": "自称 The first course for AI-native product builders / 从零开始学 AI 编程"}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["教程/课程", "vibe coding", "产品原型", "全栈开发", "AI编程工具"], "domain": "教育/AI 编程课程", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "media", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["datawhalechina 组织", "中英双语 README", "微信登录/小程序相关内容"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L5:  Learn AI coding from zero by shipping real products.", "L90: - **[2026-08-12]** 📘 **Stage 1 has been restructured and polished**: The beginner path now starts with real problems and", "L140: ### AI-Native: I want advanced Claude Code and agent workflows"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["npm"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [99, 100, 140, 142, 158], "note": "教程内容覆盖 Claude Code 工作流，非产品自身接入该 provider", "quotes": ["- **[2026-03-02]** 🦞 **OpenClaw and AI Agent friendly support**: Added `llms.txt` so OpenClaw, Claude, Cursor, Trae, and", "- **[2026-03-01]** The Advanced Development s