DF，内容随修订更新", "第二版 16 章加 5 个数学基础附录，含注意力机制与 Transformer、图神经网络、大语言模型等章节", "通识版 16 章，覆盖大模型、智能体、多模态、具身智能与 AI 安全", "第一版资料归档于 legacy/nndl-v1 目录与 nndl-v1 分支，含各章 PDF 与教学幻灯片"], "use_cases": ["系统学习神经网络与深度学习的理论与数学推导", "高校通识课或跨学科读者建立对 AI 的直觉理解", "向作者反馈教材勘误或提交改进建议"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["教材/电子书", "深度学习", "机器学习", "大语言模型", "中文资源"], "domain": "教育/机器学习教材", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "university", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["全中文 README", "作者邱锡鹏（复旦大学）", "第二版通称蒲公英书为国内常用教材"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: 邱锡鹏著 · **第二版与通识版的电子书、目录和勘误入口**", "L15:  从机器学习基础出发，系统讲解神经网络、优化、Transformer、图神经网络、强化学习、生成模型与大语言模型。", "L23:  用故事、案例和生活类比解释神经网络与深度学习，并延伸到大语言模型、智能体、多模态、科学智能、具身智能、AI 安全与未来。"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "9aa5a2a449cd": {"fn": "nari-labs/dia", "sha": "9aa5a2a449cd", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "单次生成超真实对话的 1.6B 文本转语音模型", "review": "Nari Labs 开源的 1.6B 参数 TTS 模型，从文本一次生成对话语音，支持 [S1]/[S2] 说话人标签、笑声咳嗽等非语言标记，以及基于音频提示的语音克隆与情感语调控制。权重托管在 Hugging Face，可通过 Transformers 库或本仓库推理代码运行；目前仅支持英文，仅支持 GPU 推理（pytorch 2.0+/CUDA 12.6），Apache 2.0 许可，面向研究与教育用途。bfloat16 下 VRAM 约 4.4GB。", "highlights": ["[S1]/[S2] 标签一次生成多说话人对话", "语音克隆：上传 5-10 秒音频加转写作为提示", "支持 (laughs)、(coughs) 等 21 种非语言标记", "已接入 Hugging Face Transformers（DiaForConditionalGeneration）"], "use_cases": ["从剧本文本直接生成双人对话播客或配音素材", "通过音频提示克隆音色并控制情感语调", "TTS 语音生成研究与实验"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://huggingface.co/spaces（ZeroGPU Space，L10/L24）", "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [26]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["TTS", "语音克隆", "对话生成", "开源模型权重"], "domain": "语音生成/AI 模型", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L12: Dia is a 1.6B parameter text to speech model created by Nari Labs.", "L18: Dia **directly generates highly realistic dialogue from a transcript**. You can condition the output on audio, enabling ", "L142: Dia has been tested on only GPUs (pytorch 2.0+, CUDA 12.6). CPU support is to be added soon."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [53, 55, 81], "quotes": ["pip install git+https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.git", "uv pip install git+https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.git", "pip install git+https://github.com/nari-labs/dia.git"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [72], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/nari-labs/dia.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [9, 10, 16, 53, 55], "note": "模型权重托管与 Transformers 集成平台，非替代/竞品", "quotes": ["Model on HuggingFace", "Space on HuggingFace", "**UPDATE 🚀(11/19)**: Dia2 is released on Github and HuggingFace link!", "pip install git+https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.git", "uv pip install git+https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.git"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "c80a080e7bbd": {"fn": "Avaiga/taipy", "sha": "c80a080e7bbd", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给数据科学家/ML工程师：把数据和AI算法快速变成Web应用", "review": "Taipy 是 Avaiga 维护的 Python 库，面向数据科学家与机器学习工程师，用于构建数据与 AI 驱动的 Web 应用。功能覆盖用户界面生成、数据集成、流水线编排、假设分析与场景管理、认证与用户管理、定时任务调度。生态还包括 Taipy Designer、Taipy Studio、预定义模板与数据平台集成，并随附 CLI、部署脚本、版本管理、数据迁移和遥测监控等生产运维材料。仅需 Python（3.9–3.12），通过 pip 安装。", "highlights": ["以纯 Python 构建 Web 应用，无需学习其他语言", "提供 UI 生成、数据集成、流水线编排与场景管理", "内置认证、角色与用户管理、Cron 调度", "附带 CLI、部署脚本、版本管理与遥测监控等运维工具"], "use_cases": ["把训练好的模型包装成生产可用的 Web 应用", "为业务用户搭建假设分析和场景管理界面", "对数据流水线做编排与定时调度", "部署并维护数据/AI 应用的生产环境"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Web应用框架", "数据科学", "MLOps", "流水线编排", "低代码UI"], "domain": "数据科学/应用开发工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L56: Taipy is designed for data scientists and machine learning engineers to create", "L66: Taipy includes the Taipy Python library enabling developers to easily empower their end-users with:", "L120: Copyright 2021-2025 Avaiga Private Limited"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [92], "quotes": ["pip install taipy"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "03facd47074b": {"fn": "mlc-ai/web-llm", "sha": "03facd47074b", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "开发者用浏览器内 LLM 推理引擎：WebGPU 加速、无需服务器", "review": "运行在浏览器中的 LLM 推理引擎，依赖 WebGPU 做硬件加速，推理全部在客户端完成、无服务器参与。以 npm 包形式提供 MLCEngine 接口，兼容 OpenAI API 风格（流式、JSON-mode、seed、function-calling 为初步支持），支持 Web Worker 与 Service Worker 将计算移出主线程，提供 Chrome 扩展示例。模型以 MLC 格式接入，首次加载需下载模型文件。是 MLC LLM 的伴生项目。", "highlights": ["浏览器内推理，WebGPU 硬件加速，无服务器支持", "全量兼容 OpenAI API：流式、JSON-mode、seed、function-calling（WIP）", "支持 Web Worker / Service Worker 卸载计算与离线缓存", "四种缓存后端（Cache API、IndexedDB、OPFS、cross-origin 扩展）"], "use_cases": ["在 Web 应用中本地运行 LLM 聊天补全而不搭建后端", "利用 Service Worker 实现模型缓存的离线推理页面", "开发内置 LLM 的 Chrome 扩展", "隐私敏感场景下的客户端推理"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["浏览器推理", "WebGPU", "LLM运行时", "前端SDK", "隐私计算"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/浏览器推理", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L15: WebLLM is a high-performance in-browser LLM inference engine that brings language model inference directly onto web brow", "L18: WebLLM is **fully compatible with OpenAI API.**", "L24: You can use WebLLM as a base npm package and build your own web application on top of it by following the examples below"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [84, 86, 88], "quotes": ["npm install @mlc-ai/web-llm", "yarn add @mlc-ai/web-llm", "pnpm install @mlc-ai/web-llm"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "mention", "lines": [329], "note": "窗外行为自定义模型编译相关语境", "quotes": ["To build from source, simply run:"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [34], "quotes": ["- **Structured JSON Generation**: Web