une LLM using chat history with support for image modal data, infusing it with that authentic \"flavor\"", "L46: |WeChat (Personal Account)|✅ (Based on **openclaw-weixin**)|"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["pypi"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [79], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/xming521/WeClone.git && cd WeClone"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [82, 99, 178, 257], "note": "uv pip 安装依赖，非本产品发布渠道", "quotes": ["uv pip install --group main -e .", "5. (Optional) Install FlashAttention to accelerate training and inference: `uv pip install flash-attn --no-build-isolati", "uv pip install \"deepspeed<=0.16.9\"", "uv pip install --group dev -e ."]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [102, 105], "note": "模型下载渠道", "quotes": ["It is recommended to use Hugging Face to download models, or use the following command:", "git clone https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct models/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [62, 105], "note": "默认使用的基座模型 Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct", "quotes": ["The project uses Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct model by default with LoRA method for SFT stage fine-tuning. You can also use ot", "git clone https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct models/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "455545f738e7": {"fn": "emcie-co/parlant", "sha": "455545f738e7", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向企业客服场景的 AI Agent 对话控制框架", "review": "面向客户服务的 Agent 框架，核心机制是按对话轮次动态收窄上下文：开发者以代码定义规则、知识与工具，引擎在每轮匹配仅相关的指令与工具再调用 LLM。提供 Guidelines（条件-动作规则）、Journeys（多轮 SOP）、Canned Responses（预审模板）、工具按需触发与 OpenTelemetry 全链路追踪。通过 pip 安装，提供 Python SDK 与官方 React 聊天组件，Apache 2.0 协议。", "highlights": ["条件-动作式 Guidelines，引擎按轮次匹配相关规则注入上下文", "Journeys 多轮 SOP 流程，支持快进、回退与节奏自适应", "Canned Responses 预审模板限制关键回复用词", "内置 OpenTelemetry 日志、指标与追踪"], "use_cases": ["搭建需遵守话术与合规要求的客服 Agent", "在金融、保险、医疗等需要可解释审计的场景部署对话系统", "管理数百条行为规则而不想让系统提示词超载", "为现有 LangGraph/LlamaIndex 工作流补充行为控制层"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "企业", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["客服Agent", "对话控制", "LLM框架", "合规"], "domain": "AI Agent/客户服务", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: ### The interaction control harness for customer-facing AI agents", "L45: Parlant is an agentic harness offering optimized context engineering for conversational use cases: getting the right con"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [5, 71], "quotes": [" PyPI", "pip install parlant"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "2ea6401b52ba": {"fn": "langchain-ai/langchainjs", "sha": "2ea6401b52ba", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "JavaScript 开发者构建 LLM 应用的组件化框架", "review": "LangChain.js 是 TypeScript 编写的框架，用于构建由 LLM 驱动的应用：提供 agents、models、embeddings、vector stores 等的统一接口，可组合互操作组件与第三方集成。README 列出数据增强、模型互换、快速原型等用途，并指向生态内的 Deep Agents、LangGraph.js（agent 编排）与 LangSmith（构建/测试/监控平台）。通过 npm/pnpm/yarn 安装，支持 Node.js、Cloudflare Workers、浏览器、Deno、Bun 等运行环境。", "highlights": ["为 agents、模型、嵌入、向量库等提供统一标准接口", "可替换模型的互操作层，含模型供应商/工具/向量库集成库", "支持 Node.js、Cloudflare Workers、Vercel/Next.js、Deno、Bun 等多种环境", "npm/pnpm/yarn 三种包管理器安装"], "use_cases": ["用 TypeScript 构建 LLM 驱动的应用与 agent", "在不同模型供应商之间切换以测试选型", "连接 LLM 与内部/外部数据源做检索增强", "从原型到生产部署 LLM 应用（配合 LangSmith 监控调试）"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM框架", "Agent开发", "TypeScript", "应用开发框架"], "domain": "LLM 应用开发框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L11: LangChain is a framework for building LLM-powered applications. It helps you chain together interoperable components and", "L32: LangChain helps developers build applications powered by LLMs through a standard interface for agents, models, embedding", "L55: - Node.js (ESM and CommonJS) - 20.x, 22.x, 24.x"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [26, 28], "quotes": ["You can use npm, pnpm, or yarn to install LangChain.js", "`npm install -S langchain` or `pnpm install langchain` or `yarn add langchain`"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [11, 14, 20], "note": "本仓库即 LangChain 的 JS 版本；L20 提及对应的 Python 库", "quotes": ["LangChain is a framework for building LLM-powered applications. It helps you chain together interoperable components and", "> Just getting started? Check out **Deep Agents** — a higher-level package built on LangChain for agents that have built", "For an equivalent Python library, check out LangChain."]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "ed38dbfe3906": {"fn": "ahmedkhaleel2004/gitdiagram", "sha": "ed38dbfe3906", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "把 GitHub 仓库转成交互式架构图与一分钟讲解视频", "review": "将公开或私有 GitHub 仓库转换为可交互的架构图：点击组件可跳转到对应文件或目录，支持导出 PNG 或复制 Mermaid 源码；私有仓库通过 GitHub token 访问。近期新增生成约一分钟解说视频的功能（制作新视频处于 early access）。对外提供远程 MCP 服务器（无需 key），供 Claude、Cursor、VS Code、ChatGPT 等 agent 客户端读取仓库架构说明与 Mermaid 源码。本地运行需 Bun、Cloudflare R2、Upstash Redis 及 OpenAI 或 OpenRouter API key。", "highlights": ["AI 生成交互式架构图，点击组件跳转源码，可导出 PNG/Mermaid", "远程 MCP 服务器（gitdiagram.com/mcp，无需 key）供 AI agent 调用", "生成约一分钟解说视频，支持 MP4 横竖屏下载与内嵌字幕", "支持通过 GitHub token 访问私有仓库"], "use_cases": ["快速了解陌生开源仓库的架构与组件连接", "让 AI agent/Claude 读取项目结构后再做代码分析", "为代码评审或文档生成架构图与讲解视频"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [24]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["代码可视化", "架构图", "MCP", "开发者工具"], "domain": "开发者工具/代码可视化", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "openrouter"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Visualize any codebase: turn any public or private GitHub repository into an interactive architecture diagram, or watch ", "L36: GitDiagram is a remote MCP server at `https://gitdiagram.com/mcp` (no key or sign-in). Agents can read a public reposito", "L54: Requires Bun, Cloudflare R2, Upstash Redis, and an OpenAI or OpenRouter API key. See the setup guide for prerequisites a"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [38, 71, 75], "note": "Claude 客户端接入支持；视频脚本使用 Claude，需 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY", "quotes": ["Add to Claude", "Explainer videos ar