udents, graduate students, researchers, and practitioners interested in", "L36: I have been teaching a graduate-level course on reinforcement learning since 2019. Along with teaching, I have been prep"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "4305e983d6e8": {"fn": "RightNow-AI/openfang", "sha": "4305e983d6e8", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给需要自主运行的 agent 的 Rust 单二进制操作系统", "review": "用 Rust 编写的开源 Agent OS，编译为约 32MB 的单个二进制文件，含 14 个 crate 与 1,767+ 测试。核心概念是 Hands：预置的自主能力包（HAND.toml 清单+系统提示词+SKILL.md+审批护栏），按计划独立运行，内置 Clip、Lead、Collector、Predictor、Researcher、Twitter、Browser 共 7 个。系统自带 16 项安全机制（WASM 沙箱、Merkle 审计链、提示注入扫描等）、40 个频道适配器、SQLite+向量记忆与 Web 仪表盘。当前为 pre-1.0 版本，README 提示小版本间可能有破坏性变更。", "highlights": ["7 个内置自主 Hand，按计划运行无需人工提示", "编译为单个约 32MB 二进制，Hand 全部编译进二进制无需额外下载", "16 项安全机制：WASM 沙箱、Merkle 哈希链审计、Ed25519 签名清单、提示注入扫描等", "40 个频道适配器（Telegram/Discord/Slack/飞书/钉钉等），支持按频道覆盖模型"], "use_cases": ["让 agent 定时跑竞品监控、线索挖掘并推送到 Telegram", "自主管理 Twitter/X 账号内容与回复（带审批队列）", "通过浏览器 Hand 自动化填表与多步网页流程（购买需人工确认）"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [22]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Agent OS", "自主Agent", "Rust", "消息频道集成", "安全沙箱"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "low", "evidence": ["L26: OpenFang is an **open-source Agent Operating System**. Not a chatbot framework. Not a Python wrapper around an LLM.