 "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [52, 67, 101], "note": "以 Claude Code 作为编码 agent 的选项，非模型接入适配", "quotes": ["You can set up background agents that run on events like new email or on schedule like every day at 8am. They can connec", "Code mode lets you spin up parallel coding agents with Claude Code or Codex, and have Rowboat drive them with all the wo", "<code>@rowboat implement the proposal</code> hands the work to Claude Code or Codex on that teammate's machine, with the"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [193], "note": "本地模型接入途径", "quotes": ["- **Local models** via Ollama or LM Studio"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [235], "note": "Harbor 自托管构建使用 pnpm install", "quotes": ["pnpm install && pnpm build"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [241], "note": "Harbor 部署提供 Dockerfile 构建镜像", "quotes": ["**Deploy it for a team.** The Dockerfile builds the deployment image. Orgs are served by hostname under your apex domain"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [52, 67, 101], "note": "被驱动使用的编码 agent，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["You can set up background agents that run on events like new email or on schedule like every day at 8am. They can connec", "Code mode lets you spin up parallel coding agents with Claude Code or Codex, and have Rowboat drive them with all the wo", "<code>@rowboat implement the proposal</code> hands the work to Claude Code or Codex on that teammate's machine, with the"]}]}}, "b249e14498a8": {"fn": "camel-ai/camel", "sha": "b249e14498a8", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向研究者的多智能体系统开源框架与数据生成工具", "review": "CAMEL 是一个开源多智能体框架与社区，定位为研究 agent 行为与规模的实验平台。框架支持大规模 agent 系统仿真、状态记忆、角色扮演式多 agent 协作（Workforce）、多种基准测试与工具集成；提供 CoT、Self-Instruct 等合成数据生成模块，以及 Agents、Memory、Retrievers（RAG）、Benchmarks 等模块化组件。通过 PyPI 安装，附 Cookbooks 与文档，主要面向从事 Multi-Agent Systems 研究的科研群体，社区包含 100+ 研究者并附论文引用入口。", "highlights": ["支持最多 1M 规模 agent 的仿真与协调（框架设计目标）", "Role Playing 与 Workforce 多智能体协作机制", "CoT、Self-Instruct、Source2Synth 等合成数据生成模块", "含 Memory、Retrievers、Benchmarks 等 13 个核心模块"], "use_cases": ["研究大规模多智能体系统的协作与涌现行为", "用 agent 管线生成 CoT / 指令格式的合成训练数据", "基于 RAG 与工具集成搭建任务自动化 agent"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.17760", "demo_url": "https://docs.camel-ai.org", "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [1, 32]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["多智能体框架", "Agent研究", "合成数据生成", "科研工具"], "domain": "AI/多智能体系统研究框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": null, "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L32:  🐫 CAMEL is an open-source community dedicated to finding the scaling laws of agents. We believe that studying these age", "L69: We are a community-driven research collective comprising over 100 researchers dedicated to advancing frontier research i", "L137: Installing CAMEL is a breeze thanks to its availability on PyPI. Simply open your terminal and run:"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [137, 140, 150], "quotes": ["Installing CAMEL is a breeze thanks to its availability on PyPI. Simply open your terminal and run:", "pip install camel-ai", "  pip install 'camel-ai[web_tools]'"]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "mention", "lines": [197], "note": "提供的在线演示环境，非本产品安装途径", "quotes": ["We provide a Google Colab demo showcasing a conversation between two ChatGPT agents playing roles 