tions powered by AI agents. It co", "L29: 1. **Data connectors** give agents a common way to connect to different data", "L65: - **Model Support**: OpenAI, Azure, Ollama, Anthropic via LiteLLM (feedback)"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "mention", "lines": [65], "note": "经 LiteLLM 列为可接入的模型提供方之一", "quotes": ["- **Model Support**: OpenAI, Azure, Ollama, Anthropic via LiteLLM (feedback)"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [10, 47, 48, 121], "quotes": [" PyPI&ensp;", "> Preview with `pip install --pre data_formulator==0.8.0b1` or `uvx data_formulator@0.8.0b1`.", "> Install the latest stable release (0.7) with `pip install data_formulator` or run instantly with `uvx data_formulator`", "  pip install data_formulator # install"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [127, 130, 133], "quotes": ["- **Option 3: Run with Docker**", "  docker compose up --build", " Open http://localhost:5567 in your browser. To stop, press `Ctrl+C` or run `docker compose down`."]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": []}}, "31dfdc3a2127": {"fn": "NVlabs/instant-ngp", "sha": "31dfdc3a2127", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 NeRF/图形研究者：用哈希编码 MLP 秒级训练并渲染神经图形基元", "review": "实现四类神经图形基元：NeRF、符号距离函数（SDF）、神经图像与神经体渲染，核心是用多分辨率哈希输入编码训练 MLP，基于 tiny-cuda-nn 框架实现。提供交互式 GUI（VR 查看、相机路径编辑、NeRF/SDF 转网格、快照保存加载）与 Python 绑定。Windows 提供按显卡系列划分的预编译包，Linux 或需要开发者绑定时须自行用 CMake 编译，要求 NVIDIA GPU 与 CUDA。README 含数据集制作、故障排查 FAQ 与 Colab 示例指引。", "highlights": ["支持 NeRF、SDF、神经图像、神经体四类基元的训练与渲染", "多分辨率哈希输入编码 + tiny-cuda-nn 框架", "GUI 含 VR 模式、相机路径编辑、网格导出与快照管理", "全部 GUI 功能均有 Python 绑定，可脚本化运行"], "use_cases": ["从照片集训练 NeRF 并渲染环绕视频", "将 NeRF/SDF 模型转换为网格导出", "通过 Python 绑定做自动化实验", "在 VR 头显中查看训练好的场景"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-enhanced", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": "https://github.com/nvlabs/instant-ngp#project-page--paper--video--presentation--real-time-live--bibtex", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["NeRF", "3D重建", "实时渲染", "CUDA", "图形学"], "domain": "计算机图形学/3D 重建", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L5: Here you will find an implementation of four __neural graphics primitives__, being neural radiance fields (NeRF), signed", "L6: In each case, we train and render a MLP with multiresolution hash input encoding using the __tiny-cuda-nn__ framework.", "L147: - __(optional) Python 3.8 or higher__ for interactive bindings. Also, run `pip install -r requirements.txt`."], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["docker", "pypi"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [135, 174, 180, 181], "quotes": ["## Building instant-ngp (Windows & Linux)", "$ git clone --recursive https://github.com/nvlabs/instant-ngp", "instant-ngp$ cmake . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo", "instant-ngp$ cmake --build build --config RelWithDebInfo -j"]}, {"term": "colab", "rel": "mention", "lines": [238, 240], "note": "FAQ 提及可在 Colab 运行并给出示例链接", "quotes": ["__Q:__ Does this codebase run on Google Colab?", "__A:__ Yes. See this example inspired on the notebook created by user @myagues. Caveat: this codebase requires large amo"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [147], "note": "pip 仅安装 requirements.txt 依赖，非本产品分发途径", "quotes": ["- __(optional) Python 3.8 or higher__ for interactive bindings. Also, run `pip install -r requirements.txt`."]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "mention", "lines": [243], "note": "FAQ 提及 Docker 容器，正文在窗外", "quotes": ["__Q:__ Is there a Docker container?"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "153f4fad2373": {"fn": "leon-ai/leon", "sha": "153f4fad2373", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "开源个人 AI 助手：以工具、上下文、记忆与 agent 执行完成任务", "review": "Leon 是一个开源个人 AI 助手，围绕工具、上下文、记忆与 agentic 执行构建。三种运行模式：smart 自动选择、controlled 走确定性原生技能、agent 逐步规划；技能分 native 与 SKILL.md 格式的 agent 两类，并含可操作桌面与浏览器界面的 computer use 能力。支持本地与远程 AI 提供商以平衡隐私。需 Node.js >= 24，克隆仓库后 pnpm 运行，默认本地 http://localhost:5366 访问。当前为 2.0 Developer Preview，新文档尚未就绪。", "highlights": ["smart/controlled/agent 三种执行模式", "原生技能与 SKILL.md agent 技能双层体系", "渐进加载的 computer use 可操作桌面与浏览器界面", "支持本地与远程 AI 提供商"], "use_cases": ["本地运行个人助手以减少数据经第三方服务", "让助手用工具端到端完成确定性工作流", "用 agent 模式逐步规划复杂任务"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "消费者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [14, 17, 113]}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["个人助理", "AI助手/Agent", "本地优先", "自动化"], "domain": "个人助手/自动化", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L31: **Leon** is **your open-source personal AI assistant** built around **tools, context, memory, and agentic execution**.", "L41: - Leon can run in different ways depending on the task: `smart` mode chooses for you, `controlled` mode follows determin", "L47: - Leon supports both local and remote AI providers, which helps balance privacy, control, and capability."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [70, 72], "quotes": ["```sh", "git clone https://github.com/leon-ai/leon.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "3626d6140986": {"fn": "citrolabs/ego-lite", "sha": "3626d6140986", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "让 AI agent 与用户共享同一浏览器的自动化浏览器", "review": "ego lite 是一款为 AI agent 设计的浏览器：agent 在浏览器内的隔离 Space 中执行自动化任务，用户可同时继续使用自己的标签页，并可通过迁移 Chrome 数据让 agent 继承已有登录、Cookie 与扩展。agent 经 `ego-browser` 技能连接层（支持 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor 等命令行 agent），以页面内 JavaScript 工具（snapshot、fill、click、navigate 等）驱动浏览器。当前仅支持 macOS（Apple Silicon/Intel），Windows 封测、Linux 在路线图中；MIT 许可，仓库内容与浏览器本体分发分离。", "highlights": ["每个 agent 拥有隔离 Space，多任务并行且不占用用户标签页", "ego-browser 技能将浏览器暴露为页面内 JavaScript 工具集", "首次启动可迁移 Chrome 数据（登录、Cookie、扩展、书签）", "提供 npx skills add 安装 ego-browser 技能"], "use_cases": ["让 Claude Code/Codex 在我保持浏览的同时并行执行网页操作", "让 agent 复用我已登录的账号状态完成自动化任务", "多个 agent 同时抓取或处理多个站点而不互相冲突"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ffe7954b-58ee-411e-b35d-ec30c58a08bc", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["浏览器自动化", "AI agent", "技能", "桌面应用"], "domain": "浏览器/agent 基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": ["ChatGPT", "Perplexity"], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供简体中文等多语言版本"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L24: ego (lite) is a browser where you and your AI agents work in parallel. Your agents run their browser tasks in their own ", "L89: |**Any agent can drive it through `ego-browser`**|`ego-browser` is the connection layer between any agent CLI (Claude Co", "L96: |Capability|ego lite|Browser-Use|agent-browser (Vercel)|ChatGPT Atlas|Perplexity Comet|"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [87, 89], "note": "Claude Code 作为可驱动本浏览器的 agent 被提及，非专门适配通道", "quotes": ["|**Your agents multitask in Spaces, parallel workspaces inside the same browser**|Each Space gets its own AI agent or it", "|**Any agent can drive it through `ego-browser`**|`ego-browser` is the connection layer between any agent CLI (Claude Co"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [52], "quotes": ["npx skills add citrolabs/ego-lite"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [87, 89], "quotes": ["|**Your agents multitask in Spaces, parallel workspaces inside the same browser**|Each Space gets its own AI agent or it", "|**Any agent can drive it through `ego-browser`**|`ego-browser` is the connection layer between any agent CLI (Claude Co"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [89], "quotes": ["|**Any agent can drive it through `ego-browser`**|`ego-browser` is the connection layer between any agent CLI (Claude Co"]}, {"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [96, 109], "note": "ChatGPT Atlas 在对比表中作为竞品", "quotes": ["|Capability|ego lite|Browser-Use|agent-browser (Vercel)|ChatGPT Atlas|Perplexity Comet|", "Two other categories try to solve the same problem. Browser automation frameworks like Browser-Use and Vercel's agent-br"]}, {"term": "Perplexity", "rel": "competitor", "lines": [96, 109], "note": "Perplexity Comet 在对比表中作为竞品", "quotes": ["|Capability|ego lite|Browser-Use|agent-browser (Vercel)|ChatGPT Atlas|Perplexity Comet|", "Two other categories try to solve the same problem. Browser automation frameworks like Browser-Use and Vercel's agent-br"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "eab8d2382778": {"fn": "lidge-jun/opencodex", "sha": "eab8d2382778", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "本地代理：让 Codex/Claude Code 等工具运行任意 LLM", "review": "opencodex 是一个本地代理服务，将 Codex 的 Responses API 翻译为各提供商的协议（流式、工具调用、推理 token、图像双向转换），使 Claude Code、Codex、Claude Desktop、Grok Build 可调用 40+ 内置提供商或任意 OpenAI 兼容端点。通过 `provider/model` 语法路由模型，支持 Combo 故障转移/加权轮询、子代理任意模型、ChatGPT 账号池配额路由、xAI/Anthropic/Kimi OAuth 登录。CLI 经 npm 安装（Node 18+，Bun 运行时自动捆绑），另提供 beta 桌面应用（.dmg/.msi/.AppImage/.deb），仪表盘运行在 localhost:10100。", "highlights": ["将 Codex Responses API 翻译为各提供商协议，40+ 内置提供商", "ChatGPT 账号池：配额刷新、最低用量路由、线程亲和", "Combo 虚拟模型：跨提供商 failover 或加权轮询", "内存有界管理：14 个保留存储按 256 MiB 预算驱逐"], "use_cases": ["让 Codex CLI 改用 Claude、Gemini、Ollama 等非 OpenAI 模型干活", "管理多个 ChatGPT 账号自动分摊 Codex 配额", "在仪表盘集中查看各提供商状态与实时请求日志", "为子代理挑选不同厂商模型并配置回退链"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["LLM代理网关", "开发者工具", "模型路由", "CLI工具"], "domain": "开发者工具/LLM 网关", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "xai", "deepseek", "ollama", "azure", "groq", "openrouter"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供简体/繁体中文翻译"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L48: opencodex is a lightweight local proxy that translates Codex's Responses API into whatever your", "L120: - **Use any LLM with Codex, Claude Code, Claude Desktop, and Grok Build** — 40+ providers out of", "L114: The CLI install requires Node 18+; the desktop app needs neither Node nor Bun. The Bun runtime is bundled on `npm instal"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [50, 120, 138, 207], "quotes": ["Gemini, Grok, GLM, DeepSeek, Kimi, Qwen, Ollama, or any other LLM with Codex, Claude Code, Claude", "- **Use any LLM with Codex, Claude Code, Claude Desktop, and Grok Build** — 40+ providers out of", "- **Log in once, skip the API key** — OAuth for xAI, Anthropic, and Kimi; or forward", "OpenAI (ChatGPT login or API key), Anthropic, Google Gemini, xAI, Kimi, Azure OpenAI, Ollama"]}, {"term": "xai", "rel": "support", "lines": [138, 207], "quotes": ["- **Log in once, skip the API key** — OAuth for xAI, Anthropic, and Kimi; or forward", "OpenAI (ChatGPT login or API key), Anthropic, Google Gemini, xAI, Kimi, Azure OpenAI, Ollama"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [50, 208, 209], "quotes": ["Gemini, Grok, GLM, DeepSeek, Kimi, Qwen, Ollama, or any other LLM with Codex, Claude Code, Claude", "(local + Cloud), Cursor (experimental), and every OpenAI-compatible endpoint — plus DeepSeek,", "Groq, OpenRouter, OpenGateway, Together, Fireworks, Cerebras, Mistral, Hugging Face, NVIDIA NIM, MiniMax,"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [50, 179, 200, 207], "quotes": ["Gemini, Grok, GLM, DeepSeek, Kimi, Qwen, Ollama, or any other LLM with Codex, Claude Code, Claude", "codex -m \"ollama/llama3\" \"Refactor this function\"", "A JEV Combo can instead ask a self-hosted decision model, such as Ollama's keyless `tev1`: add a", "OpenAI (ChatGPT login or API key), Anthropic, Google Gemini, xAI, Kimi, Azure OpenAI, Ollama"]}, {"term": "azure", "rel": "support", "lines": [207], "quotes": ["OpenAI (ChatGPT login or API key), Anthropic, Google Gemini, xAI, Kimi, Azure OpenAI, Ollama"]}, {"term": "groq", "rel": "support", "lines": [209], "quotes": ["Groq, OpenRouter, OpenGateway, Together, Fireworks, Cerebras, Mistral, Hugging Face, NVIDIA NIM, MiniMax,"]}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "support", "lines": [209], "quotes": ["Groq, OpenRouter, OpenGateway, Together, Fireworks, Cerebras, Mistral, Hugging Face, NVIDIA NIM, MiniMax,"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [13, 60, 114], "quotes": ["npm install -g @bitkyc08/opencodex", "npm install -g @bitkyc08/opencodex   # Node 18+; the Bun runtime is bundled automatically", "The CLI install requires Node 18+; the desktop app needs neither Node nor Bun. The Bun runtime is bundled on `npm instal"]}, {"term": "binary", "rel": "support", "lines": [17, 18, 19, 20, 79, 80, 81], "quotes": [" Download for macOS (.dmg)", " Download for Windows (.msi)", " Download for Linux (.AppImage)", " Download for Linux (.deb)", "|macOS 13+ (Apple Silicon and Intel)|`OpenCodex-<version>-macos.dmg`|Universal build, signed with a Developer ID and not", "|Windows (x64)|`OpenCodex-<version>-windows-x64.msi`|Not code-signed yet: SmartScreen asks once, choose **More info → Ru", "|Linux (x86_64)|`OpenCodex-<version>-linux-x86_64.AppImage` or `-linux-amd64.deb`|The tray needs an AppIndicator-capable"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [288], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/lidge-jun/opencodex.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [1, 4, 22, 24], "note": "被代理接入的工具，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["opencodex — universal provider proxy for Codex, Claude Code, Claude Desktop and Grok Build", " Universal provider proxy for OpenAI Codex, Claude Code, Claude Desktop &amp; Grok Build", "### Claude Code, running any model", "The picker is stock Claude Code. The brain behind it isn't."]}, {"term": "Kimi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [50, 138, 207], "note": "被接入的提供商", "quotes": ["Gemini, Grok, GLM, DeepSeek, Kimi, Qwen, Ollama, or any other LLM with Codex, Claude Code, Claude", "- **Log in once, skip the API key** — OAuth for xAI, Anthropic, and Kimi; or forward", "OpenAI (ChatGPT login or API key), Anthropic, Google Gemini, xAI, Kimi, Azure OpenAI, Ollama"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [50, 210