"多语言示例"], "domain": "开发者教育/AI 协议", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L48: ## **Learn MCP with Hands-on Code Examples in C#, Java, JavaScript, Rust, Python, and TypeScript**", "L61: The current protocol revision is **MCP Specification 2026-07-28**. The MCP", "L149: Module 11 deserves special mention - it's a complete 13-lab hands-on learning path that teaches you to build production-"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [174], "note": "窗外行，MCP 协议背景提及", "quotes": ["|3.12|MCP Hosts|Configure Claude Desktop, Cursor, Cline, and other MCP hosts|Guide|"]}, {"term": "azure", "rel": "mention", "lines": [214], "note": "窗外行，课程模块提及 Azure 云平台集成（参见 L143）", "quotes": ["|11.8|Semantic Search|Implementing vector embeddings with Azure OpenAI and pgvector|Lab 07|"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [17, 32], "quotes": ["2. **Clone the Repository**: `git clone https://github.com/microsoft/mcp-for-beginners.git`", "> git clone --filter=blob:none --sparse https://github.com/microsoft/mcp-for-beginners.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [174, 180], "note": "窗外行，作为支持 MCP 的开发工具提及", "quotes": ["|3.12|MCP Hosts|Configure Claude Desktop, Cursor, Cline, and other MCP hosts|Guide|", "|4.1|Pagination|Handle large result sets with cursor-based pagination|Guide|"]}, {"term": "GitHub Copilot", "rel": "mention", "lines": [221, 371, 372, 373, 374], "note": "窗外行，课程示例中提及", "quotes": ["|12.1|Tooling|MCP usage in Copilot App|Guide|", "### Copilot Series", "Copilot for AI Paired Programming", "Copilot for C#/.NET", "Copilot Adventure"]}, {"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [345, 347, 348], "note": "窗外行，课程内容中提及", "quotes": ["### LangChain", "LangChain.js for Beginners", "LangChain for Beginners"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": [67], "note": "L67 提到规范层面弃用 Roots/Sampling/Logging，属课程内容而非仓库弃用"}}}, "2a88cbd33957": {"fn": "RyanCodrai/turbovec", "sha": "2a88cbd33957", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 Python/Rust 开发者的 2-4 比特量化内存向量索引库", "review": "基于 Google Research TurboQuant 的进程内向量索引，提供 Python 与 Rust 双 API。将向量以 2 或 4 bit/维存储并用 SIMD 内核直接检索，无需训练步骤，支持增量持久化（sync 只写变更）、id 过滤搜索与微秒级删除。以库而非服务形式分发，无网络 API；x86 内核运行时按 CPU 特性选择。提供与 LangChain、LlamaIndex、Haystack、Agno 的集成包，并可从源码用 maturin 构建。", "highlights": ["2/4 bit 每维量化存储，内存较 float32 缩小 7.8–15.5 倍", "无需训练与重建，增删向量即时生效，sync() 增量落盘且崩溃安全", "提供 LangChain/LlamaIndex/Haystack/Agno 的 drop-in 替代集成", "Rust API 与 Python 对应，支持 allowlist/bitmask 过滤检索"], "use_cases": ["在本机进程内为 RAG 应用存储和检索嵌入向量", "资源受限环境下降低大规模嵌入的内存占用", "需要完全离线嵌入+检索栈的本地部署", "作为框架内存向量存储的替换组件接入现有检索管线"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.18657（README L6/L123 指向 TurboQuant ICLR 2026 论文，具体 URL 未在可见文本给出）", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["向量检索", "量化/压缩", "RAG", "Rust/Python库"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/向量检索", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L17: turbovec is an in-process vector index for Python and Rust. It stores each vector at 2 or 4 bits per dimension using Goo", "L50: Framework integrations are drop-in replacements for each framework's in-memory store — same public surface, same persist", "L95: - **You need a graph index.** turbovec scans every vector. At 100K vectors a query costs 0.13–0.25 ms on all eight cores"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [4, 29, 51, 111, 112], "quotes": [" PyPI version", "pip install turbovec", "LangChain (`pip install turbovec[langchain]`) ·", "pip install maturin", "cd turbovec-python && maturin build --release && pip install target/wheels/*.whl"]}, {"term": "cargo", "rel": "support", "lines": [5, 59], "quotes": [" crates.io version", "cargo add turbovec"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "31 GB of RAM", "rel": "mention", "lines": [15], "note": "float32 存储场景的内存对比描述，非本产品自身要求", "quotes": ["**Ten million 768-dimensional embeddings take 31 GB of RAM as float32. turbovec holds them in 4 GB and searches them 4.4"]}], "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [51], "note": "提供集成包的被集成框架，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["LangChain (`pip install turbovec[langchain]`) ·"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "f39d13241583": {"fn": "QwenLM/Qwen-Agent", "sha": "f39d13241583", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的 Qwen 系列 LLM 应用开发 Agent 框架", "review": "基于 Qwen 模型的指令遵循、工具使用、规划与记忆能力构建 LLM 应用的 Python 框架，提供 BaseChatModel、BaseTool、Agent 等原子与高层组件，内置 Function Calling、MCP 接入、基于本地 Docker 容器的 Code Interpreter 与快速 RAG 方案，附带 Gradio WebUI 部署及 BrowserQwen 浏览器助手等示例应用。模型服务可使用阿里云 DashScope API 或自行部署 OpenAI 兼容服务（vLLM/Ollama）。代码解释器沙箱隔离为基本实现，官方提示在生产环境谨慎使用；GUI 需 Python 3.10+。", "highlights": ["提供 Function Calling、MCP、Code Interpreter、RAG 等内置能力", "基于本地 Docker 容器的代码解释器沙箱执行", "支持 1M token 超长文档问答的快速 RAG 方案", "Gradio WebUI 一行代码部署 Agent 界面"], "use_cases": ["为 Qwen 系列模型开发带工具调用的自定义助手", "对超长文档进行检索增强问答", "通过浏览器扩展让模型辅助网页浏览操作", "接入 MCP 服务器扩展 agent 可用工具"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Agent框架", "Function Calling", "MCP", "RAG", "代码解释器"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["vllm", "ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供中文/English 双语入口", "关联 Qwen Chat、微信社群", "Qwen/通义千问为阿里巴巴模型系列"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L7: Qwen-Agent is a framework for developing LLM applications based on the instruction following, tool usage, planning, and", "L59: Qwen-Agent offers atomic components, such as LLMs (which inherit from `class BaseChatModel` and come with function calli", "L86: We implement a code interpreter tool based on local Docker containers. You can enable the built-in `code interpreter` to"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "vllm", "rel": "support", "lines": [53, 54, 55], "quotes": ["Specifically, consult the vLLM section for high-throughput GPU deployment or the Ollama section for local CPU (+GPU) dep", "For the QwQ and Qwen3 model, it is recommended to **do not** add the `--enable-auto-tool-choice` and `--tool-call-parser", "For Qwen3-Coder, it is recommended to enable both of the above parameters, use vLLM's built-in tool parsing, and combine"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [53], "quotes": ["Specifically, consult the vLLM section for high-throughput GPU deployment or the Ollama section for local CPU (+GPU) dep"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [27, 29, 30], "quotes": ["- Install the stable version from PyPI:", "pip install -U \"qwen-agent[gui,rag,code_interpreter,mcp]\"", "# Or use `pip install -U qwen-agent` for the minimal requirements."]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "s