r-gapped 部署"], "use_cases": ["企业统一管理分布在不同云上的多个 Kubernetes 集群", "为开发团队提供带 Web UI 的 DevOps 与 CI/CD 流水线", "多租户场景下做角色权限与资源配额隔离", "在边缘设备上部署应用并集中查看日志与监控"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "企业", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Kubernetes", "多云管理", "DevOps", "边缘计算", "多租户"], "domain": "云原生/容器平台", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["QingCloud AppCenter(QKE) 托管服务（L108）", "README 提供中英双语（L12）"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L3:  The container platform tailored for Kubernetes multi-cloud, datacenter, and edge management", "L75: KubeSphere 4.x adopts a microkernel + extension components architecture (codename LuBan). The core part (KubeSphere Core", "L97: helm upgrade --install -n kubesphere-system --create-namespace ks-core https://charts.kubesphere.io/main/ks-core-1.1.3.t"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "95512c65a73b": {"fn": "argoproj/argo-workflows", "sha": "95512c65a73b", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 Kubernetes 的容器化并行任务工作流引擎", "review": "Argo Workflows 是以 Kubernetes CRD 形式实现的开源工作流引擎，用于编排并行作业：每个步骤以容器运行，支持以任务序列或 DAG 建模多步骤流程。提供工作流模板、cron 定时调度、归档、重试/超时/挂起恢复、步骤级输入输出、UI 管理界面、REST/gRPC 服务端接口以及 Java/Golang/Python/TypeScript SDK。制品存储支持 S3、GCS、Azure Blob 等。面向在 Kubernetes 上运行机器学习、数据处理、CI/CD 等计算密集型作业的用户。为 CNCF 毕业项目。", "highlights": ["以 Kubernetes CRD 实现，每步为一个容器", "支持 DAG 与 Steps 两种工作流声明方式", "提供 UI、REST/gRPC 接口与四种语言 SDK", "支持 cron 调度、重试、超时、归档、并行度限制等"], "use_cases": ["在 Kubernetes 上运行机器学习训练流水线", "数据与批处理作业编排", "搭建 CI/CD 流水线", "基础设施自动化任务编排"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["工作流引擎", "Kubernetes", "ML流水线", "CI/CD", "批处理"], "domain": "云原生/工作流编排", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L14: Argo Workflows is an open source container-native workflow engine for orchestrating parallel jobs on Kubernetes.", "L15: Argo Workflows is implemented as a Kubernetes CRD (Custom Resource Definition).", "L21: Argo is a Cloud Native Computing Foundation (CNCF) graduated project."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "d94d0115b620": {"fn": "cft0808/edict", "sha": "d94d0115b620", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给个人/团队用的多 Agent 协作编排系统，以三省六部制分权制衡执行任务", "review": "基于 OpenClaw 的多 Agent 编排系统，由 12 个 Agent 模拟三省六部流程：太子分拣消息、中书省规划、门下省审议封驳、尚书省派发、六部与吏部并行执行。配套 React 军机处看板，提供 Kanban 任务管理、任务叫停/取消/恢复、奏折归档、模型热切换、技能管理、Token 统计与新闻推送。依赖已安装的 OpenClaw、Python 3.10+ 与 macOS/Linux，后端基于 Python 标准库 http.server，服务间经 Redis Streams 事件总线通信，支持 Docker Demo 镜像与 systemd 部署。", "highlights": ["门下省专职审核，封驳不合格产出并强制返工", "Kanban 看板实时监控，支持叫停/取消/恢复与状态机校验", "Agent 权限矩阵与奏折流转审计日志", "看板内按 Agent 热切换 LLM 与远程 Skills 导入"], "use_cases": ["通过飞书/Telegram/Signal 下达任务，让多个 Agent 分工完成并全程可视化监控", "需要规划、审核、执行分离的任务流程管理", "为每个 Agent 独立配置模型与技能，按看板切换"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-nati