ent、voice assistant、RAG、MCP 工具等类型", "条目标明所用框架与技术栈，便于按框架检索", "部分类别含多 agent、记忆与沙箱执行等进阶示例"], "use_cases": ["学习某个 AI 框架（LangGraph、CrewAI、Agno 等）的入门示例", "为构建语音助手或 MCP 工具寻找参考实现", "对比不同框架下同类 agent 应用的写法"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["示例合集", "Agent", "RAG", "MCP", "学习资源"], "domain": "LLM 应用开发/知识聚合", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L7: This repository is a comprehensive collection of **132 projects**, tutorials, and recipes for building powerful LLM-powe", "L119: **Quick-start agents for learning and extending different AI frameworks.** _21 projects_", "L184: **Examples using Model Context Protocol for external tool integration.** _14 projects_"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "vllm", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "install": [{"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [291, 292], "quotes": ["- Open-Source LLM Fine-Tuning on Token Factory: Colab-first LoRA fine-tuning walkthrough to upload a dataset, train, mon", "- Standalone Customer Support Fine-Tuning (Colab): Fully standalone Colab notebook for the customer-support distillation"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [327], "quotes": ["   git clone https://github.com/Arindam200/awesome-ai-apps.git"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [348], "quotes": ["   pip install -r requirements.txt"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [132, 156, 159, 160, 165], "note": "示例项目所用框架，非