lf_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["字幕生成", "视频处理", "翻译", "LLM应用", "桌面应用"], "domain": "视频工具/字幕处理", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["deepseek"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["全中文 README", "必剪/剪映语音识别", "B站视频下载", "VideoCaptioner 中转站（api.videocaptioner.cn）"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3:  基于大语言模型的视频字幕处理工具 — 语音识别、字幕优化、翻译、视频合成一站式处理", "L39: |`transcribe`|语音转字幕。引擎：`faster-whisper`、`whisper-api`、`bijian`（免费）、`jianying`（免费）、`whisper-cpp`|", "L100: 音视频输入 → 语音识别 → 字幕断句 → LLM 优化 → 翻译 → 视频合成"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [78, 86], "note": "中转站支持列表提及 Claude；Claude Code Skill 为调用本工具的技能", "quotes": ["|**VideoCaptioner 中转站**|api.videocaptioner.cn — 高并发，性价比高，支持 GPT/Claude/Gemini 等|", "本项目提供了 Claude Code Skill，让 AI 编程助手可以直接调用 VideoCaptioner 处理视频。"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "compat", "lines": [80], "note": "OpenAI 兼容接口服务商之一，填入 API Key 即可使用", "quotes": ["|DeepSeek|platform.deepseek.com|"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [10, 52], "quotes": ["pip install videocaptioner          # 安装 CLI + GUI 桌面版", "pip install videocaptioner"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [111, 113], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/WEIFENG2333/VideoCaptioner.git", "uv sync && uv run videocaptioner     # 运行 GUI"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [84, 86, 88, 95], "note": "本工具以 Skill 形式被 Claude Code 调用，非替代/竞品关系", "quotes": ["## Claude Code Skill", "本项目提供了 Claude Code Skill，让 AI 编程助手可以直接调用 VideoCaptioner 处理视频。", "安装到 Claude Code：", "然后在 Claude Code 中输入 `/videocaptioner transcribe video.mp4 --asr bijian` 即可使用。"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "3c5ff095aec1": {"fn": "googleapis/mcp-toolbox", "sha": "3c5ff095aec1", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "连接 AI agent/IDE 与企业数据库的开源 MCP 服务器", "review": "Google 维护的 Model Context Protocol 服务器，双用途：一是开箱即用的预置通用工具（如 list_tables、execute_sql），让 Gemini CLI、Claude Code、Codex 等 MCP 客户端直接探索数据库、生成代码；二是通过 tools.yaml 定义结构化查询、语义搜索与 NL2SQL 的自定义工具框架，供生产 agent 集成。内置连接池、IAM 认证与 OpenTelemetry 可观测性。支持 AlloyDB、BigQuery、PostgreSQL、MySQL、MongoDB、Redis 等多种数据库，提供二进制、Docker、Homebrew、Go、npm 等多种安装方式。", "highlights": ["预置通用工具可直接接入 Gemini CLI、Claude Code、Codex 等 MCP 客户端", "tools.yaml 自定义工具框架：结构化查询、语义搜索、NL2SQL", "支持 AlloyDB、BigQuery、PostgreSQL、MySQL、MongoDB、Redis 等多种数据库", "内置连接池、IAM 集成认证与 OpenTelemetry 指标与追踪"], "use_cases": ["在 IDE 中用自然语言查询数据库、自动发现与管理 schema", "为生产环境 agent 构建带访问限制的数据库工具", "少于 10 行代码将数据库工具集成进 ADK、LangChain 或 LlamaIndex"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["MCP", "数据库", "AI agent", "开发者工具"], "domain": "AI 基础设施/数据库工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L18: MCP Toolbox for Databases is an open source Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that connects your AI agents, IDEs, and ", "L23: 1. **Ready-to-use MCP Server (Build-Time):** Instantly connect Gemini CLI, Google Antigravity, Claude Code, Codex, or ot", "L24: 2. **Custom Tools Framework (Run-Time):** A robust framework to build specialized, highly secure AI tools for your produ"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [23, 50, 54], "quotes": ["1. **Ready-to-use MCP Server (Build-Time):** Instantly connect Gemini CLI, Google Antigravity, Claude Code, Codex, or ot", "You can use the Toolbox in any MCP-compatible IDE or client (e.g., Gemini CLI, Google Antigravity, Claude Code, Codex, e", "1. Add the following to your client's MCP configuration file (usually `mcp.json` or `claude_desktop_config.json`):"]}], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [169, 307], "quotes": ["npx @toolbox-sdk/server --config tools.yaml", "npm install -g @google/gemini-cli"]}, {"term": "binary", "rel": "support", "lines": [181, 194, 233], "quotes": ["For the latest version, check the [releases page][releases] and use the", "> # see releases page for other versions", "> :: see releases page for other versions"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [282, 344], "quotes": ["docker pull us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/database-toolbox/toolbox/toolbox:$VERSION", "docker run -p 5000:5000 \\"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "support", "lines": [287, 290], "quotes": ["To install Toolbox using Homebrew on macOS or Linux:", "brew install mcp-toolbox"]}, {"term": "go", "rel": "support", "lines": [296, 299], "quotes": ["Go installed, and then run the following command:", "go install github.com/googleapis/mcp-toolbox@v1.14.0"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [434, 454], "quotes": ["    pip install toolbox-core", "    pip install toolbox-langchain"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [23, 50], "quotes": ["1. **Ready-to-use MCP Server (Build-Time):** Instantly connect Gemini CLI, Google Antigravity, Claude Code, Codex, or ot", "You can use the Toolbox in any MCP-compatible IDE or client (e.g., Gemini CLI, Google Antigravity, Claude Code, Codex, e"]}, {"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [41], "quotes": ["- **Simplified Development:** Integrate tools into your Agent Development Kit (ADK), LangChain, LlamaIndex, or custom ag"]}], "dual_li