This MCP server is specifically designed for use with Cursor. Before responding with context from the Figma API, it simp", "L52: > NOTE: You will need to create a Figma access token to use this server. Instructions on how to create a Figma API acces"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [23, 25, 37, 42], "note": "主要适配的客户端工具，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["Give Cursor and other AI-powered coding tools access to your Figma files with this Model Context Protocol server.", "When Cursor has access to Figma design data, it's **way** better at one-shotting designs accurately than alternative app", "1. Open your IDE's chat (e.g. agent mode in Cursor).", "This MCP server is specifically designed for use with Cursor. Before responding with context from the Figma API, it simp"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "fdaebf9b07a9": {"fn": "NVIDIA/OpenShell", "sha": "fdaebf9b07a9", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为自主 AI agent 提供安全隔离运行时与策略管控", "review": "面向多 agent 舰队（fleets of autonomous AI agents）的运行时：agent 需要读文件、装包、调 API、用凭证才有用，OpenShell 通过策略声明限定其可触达范围并在运行时强制执行。机制包括内核级隔离沙箱（文件、系统调用、网络逐一管控，真实凭证不暴露给 agent）与形式化验证（策略变更先标记高风险新增访问，等待人工审查）。提供 CLI 安装脚本、Python/TypeScript/Go/Rust SDK、agent skills 包及 Helm 部署网关。", "highlights": ["内核级沙箱强制执行文件/系统调用/网络策略", "策略变更经形式化验证后进入人工审查", "凭证仅注入发往已批准端点的请求", "提供 Python/TypeScript/Go/Rust 四语言 SDK 与 Helm 部署"], "use_cases": ["运行能读写文件、调用 API 的自主 agent 但限制其权限", "为 agent 使用的推理凭证做按端点的隔离注入", "在 Kubernetes 上部署网关统一管理沙箱与策略"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["agent安全", "沙箱运行时", "策略管控", "基础设施"], "domain": "AI 基础设施/agent 安全运行时", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L11: OpenShell is the safe, private runtime for fleets of autonomous AI agents. Agents are most useful when they can read fil", "L15: OpenShell governs what agents can do in two ways: it instruments the kernel to enforce policy on every file access, syst", "L17: - **Kernel-level enforcement.** Each agent runs in an isolated sandbox. Kernel controls confine which files it can acces"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "openrouter", "rel": "mention", "lines": [31], "note": "首次运行示例中经由 OpenRouter 免费模型驱动 OpenCode，非官方适配通道", "quotes": ["The installer sets up the CLI and a local gateway. The default sandbox image is minimal Ubuntu with no agent installed. "]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [4, 60], "note": "徽章与 uv add openshell", "quotes": ["PyPI", "|Python|`uv add openshell`|README|"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [49, 61], "note": "skills 安装与 TypeScript SDK", "quotes": ["npx skills add NVIDIA/OpenShell", "|TypeScript|`npm install @nvidia/openshell-sdk` (GitHub Packages)|README|"]}, {"term": "helm", "rel": "support", "lines": [39, 69], "quotes": ["- Kubernetes: deploy the gateway with Helm. Your CNI must enforce `NetworkPolicy`.", "OpenShell collects anonymous telemetry, limited to operational categories and counts, to help improve the project. It do"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "6b30ca0cb864": {"fn": "budtmo/docker-android", "sha": "6b30ca0cb864", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "在 Docker 中运行 Android 模拟器的镜像，供开发测试与 AI-Agent 场景", "review": "提供封装 Android 模拟器的 Docker 镜像，覆盖 9.0–14.0 多个 Android 版本与多种手机/平板设备配置。功能包括：noVNC 网页查看容器内部、日志 Web-UI 共享、adb connect 从容器外控制模拟器、运行 Appium/Espresso 等测试框架构建 Android 项目。含 beta 版 MCP-Server 与 AI-Agent 支持（AI-Agent 属 pro 版），支持对接 Genymotion 云及 Azure/AWS/GCP 部署。要求宿主机为 Ubuntu 并支持虚拟化（KVM），macOS/Windows 需借助虚拟机或 WSL2。", "highlights": ["多 Android 版本与设备配置的模拟器 Docker 镜像", "noVNC 网页查看与 Web-UI 日志共享", "支持 adb connect 外部控制与 Appium/Espresso UI 测试", "beta 版 MCP-Server；AI-Agent 支持本地 LLM 服务器 Ollama/VLLM（pro 版）"], "use_cases": ["在容器中构建 Android 项目并运行单元与 UI 测试", "CI（如 Jenkins）中运行 Android 模拟器测试", "通过网页浏览器查看与操作容器内模拟器", "在云端部署 Android 模拟器环境"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Android模拟器", "Docker镜像", "自动化测试", "MCP/AI-Agent"], "domain": "开发测试/移动端模拟", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama", "vllm"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Docker-Android is a docker image built to be used for everything related to Android. It can be used for Application deve", "L13: 8. It support (http) MCP-Server (beta-version)", "L14: 9. It support AI-Agent (beta-version) - supported local-LLM server: Ollama, VLLM"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [14, 149], "quotes": ["9. It support AI-Agent (beta-version) - supported local-LLM server: Ollama, VLLM", "|ai-agent|No|Yes|Currently supported local-LLM server: Ollama, VLLM|"]}, {"term": "vllm", "rel": "compat", "lines": [14, 149], "quotes": ["9. It support AI-Agent (