ike Git-LFS but without a server) and models, connecting them with", "L143: Depending on the remote storage type you plan to use to keep and share your data, you might need to install optional dep"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [145, 147, 151, 154], "quotes": ["PyPI (Python)", "|PyPI|", " pip install dvc", "The command should look like this: ``pip install 'dvc[s3]'`` (in this case AWS S3 dependencies such as ``boto3`` will be"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "support", "lines": [126, 132], "quotes": ["Brew (mac OS)", " brew install dvc"]}, {"term": "binary", "rel": "support", "lines": [162, 166, 167], "quotes": ["Package (Platform-specific)", "Self-contained packages for Linux, Windows, and Mac are available.", "The latest version of the packages can be found on the GitHub `releases page <https://github.com/treeverse/dvc/releases>"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "28025cf72069": {"fn": "coderamp-labs/gitingest", "sha": "28025cf72069", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "把 Git 仓库转成 LLM 可用文本摘要的开发者工具", "review": "将任意 Git 仓库 URL 或本地目录转换为面向 LLM 提示词优化的文本摘要，输出文件/目录结构、提取大小与 token 统计（基于 tiktoken 估算）。提供三种使用途径：网页版（改 GitHub URL 中的 hub 为 ingest）、CLI 命令行工具与 Python 包（同步/异步 API，兼容 Jupyter）。默认跳过 .gitignore 文件，私有仓库需 GitHub PAT。支持 Docker/Compose 自托管服务端，可选 MinIO S3 存储、Prometheus 指标与 Sentry 错误跟踪。", "highlights": ["CLI、Python 包（含 sync/async API）与浏览器扩展三种使用方式", "输出文件结构、提取大小与 token 统计（tiktoken 估算）", "默认跳过 .gitignore，可用 --include-gitignored 覆盖，支持 STDOUT 管道输出", "Docker Compose 提供 prod/dev 两套 profile，dev 集成 MinIO 对象存储"], "use_cases": ["把代码库内容喂给 LLM 做分析或问答前先提取上下文", "命令行里把仓库摘要直接管道给其他工具处理", "在 Jupyter notebook 中异步提取仓库内容做代码研究", "自托管一个仓库摘要网页服务供团队使用"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["代码上下文提取", "LLM工具链", "CLI工具", "自托管"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/开发者工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["提供中文等多语言 README"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L20: Turn any Git repository into a prompt-friendly text ingest for LLMs.", "L37: - **Easy code context**: Get a text digest from a Git repository URL or a directory", "L43: - **CLI tool**: Run it as a shell command", "L44: - **Python package**: Import it in your code"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [53, 57, 63], "quotes": ["Gitingest is available on PyPI.", "pip install gitingest", "pip install gitingest[server]"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "mention", "lines": [72], "note": "pipx 的安装方式之一，非本产品直接安装途径", "quotes": ["brew install pipx"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [180, 186, 275, 281], "quotes": ["   docker build -t gitingest .", "   docker run -d --name gitingest -p 8000:8000 gitingest", "docker compose --profile dev up", "docker compose --profile prod up -d"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "64795b4df67c": {"fn": "GreyDGL/PentestGPT", "sha": "64795b4df67c", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向渗透测试人员与 CTF 选手的 LLM 自动化测试代理框架", "review": "由 LLM 驱动的自动化渗透测试代理框架，发表于 USENIX Security 2024。v1.0 采用多阶段流水线（CTF：侦察→利用→通关；渗透：资产发现→漏洞识别→报告），前一阶段结果作为下一阶段输入，代理驱动 Claude Code 或 Codex CLI 运行工具并保存/恢复会话。另保留人机交互的 legacy 模式（pentestgpt-legacy），运行推理/生成/解析三个 LLM 会话并维护 Pentesting Task Tree，通过官方 SDK 原生接入 OpenAI、Anthropic、Gemini、DeepSeek、xAI、Qwen、Moonshot 及本地 Ollama。默认收集匿名遥测数据（上传 Langfuse），可用 --no-telemetry 关闭。", "highlights": ["多阶段流水线代理，自动驱动 Claude Code 或 Codex CLI 执行工具", "legacy 模式通过官方 SDK 原生支持 8 类提供商及本地 Ollama", "三个协作 LLM 会话维护 Pentesting Task Tree（PTT）", "Docker 镜像捆绑工具与两个 CLI，登录凭据持久化在卷中"], "use_cases": ["让代理自动完成 CTF 题目的侦察、利用与通关", "在授权渗透测试中做资产发现、漏洞识别并生成报告", "本地/云端多模型间切换运行交互式渗透测试会话"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "https://www.usenix.org/conference/usenixsecurity24（USENIX Security 2024，见引用章节 L191-195）", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["渗透测试", "CTF", "AI Agent", "网络安全"], "domain": "网络安全/渗透测试", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "deepseek", "ollama", "xai"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L38: - **Multi-Stage Pipeline** - The agent works through staged phases (recon → exploit → walkthrough for CTF; asset discove", "L116: pipeline supports Claude and Codex backends; this legacy mode talks **natively** to many providers", "L49: - **AI-Powered Challenge Solver** - Leverages LLM advanced reasoning to perform penetration testing and CTFs"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [42, 61, 116], "quotes": ["> The autonomous CTF pipeline is backend-pluggable for Claude Code and Codex. The interactive", "- **Claude Code CLI** (`claude`) - installed and authenticated for local Claude runs. See Claude Code docs", "pipeline supports Claude and Codex backends; this legacy mode talks **natively** to many providers"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "compat", "lines": [44, 126, 148], "quotes": ["> Google Gemini, DeepSeek, xAI, Qwen, Moonshot, and local Ollama. See", "DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=...      GROK_API_KEY=...          QWEN_API_KEY=...     KIMI_API_KEY=...", "|**DeepSeek**|`deepseek-v4-flash`, `deepseek-v4-pro`|`deepseek-chat`, `deepseek-reasoner`|`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`|"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [44, 152], "quotes": ["> Google Gemini, DeepSeek, xAI, Qwen, Moonshot, and local Ollama. See", "|**Local (Ollama)**|`ollama:<model>` (e.g. `ollama:qwen3`)|—|none (`OLLAMA_BASE_URL`)|"]}, {"term": "xai", "rel": "compat", "lines": [126, 149], "quotes": ["DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=...      GROK_API_KEY=...          QWEN_API_KEY=...     KIMI_API_KEY=...", "|**xAI Grok**|`grok-4.3`|—|`GROK_API_KEY` / `XAI_API_KEY`|"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [67, 68, 69], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/GreyDGL/PentestGPT.git", "cd PentestGPT", "make install    # runs uv sync"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [92, 94, 98], "quotes": ["### Run in Docker (install once, log in once)", "A self-contained image bundles the tool + the Claude Code **and** Codex CLIs. You log in **once** and", "make docker-build        # build the tool image"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [39, 42, 61], "note": "被代理驱动的后端 CLI，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["- **Autonomous Agent** - Drives Claude Code or Codex to run tools and reason without human intervention.", "> The autonomous CTF pipeline is backend-pluggable for Claude Code and Codex. The interactive", "- **Claude Code CLI** (`claude`) - installed and authenticated for local Claude runs. See Claude Code docs"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [44, 150], "note": "可接入的模型提供商", "quotes": ["> Google Gemini, DeepSeek, xAI, Qwen, Moonshot, and local Ollama. See", "|**Alibaba Qwen**|`qwen3.7-max`, `qwen3.5-flash`|`qwen3-max`|`QWEN_API_KEY` / `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY`|"]}