mple.py` for usage. The API mirrors vLLM's interface with minor differences in the `LLM.generate` method:"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "vllm", "rel": "mention", "lines": [3, 5, 9], "note": "实现对象与对比基线，非模型服务商接入", "quotes": ["# Nano-vLLM", "A lightweight vLLM implementation built from scratch.", "* 🚀 **Fast offline inference** - Comparable inference speeds to vLLM"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [16], "note": "pip 从 GitHub 仓库直接安装", "quotes": ["pip install git+https://github.com/GeeeekExplorer/nano-vllm.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [23, 24], "note": "模型权重下载来源", "quotes": ["huggingface-cli download --resume-download Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B \\", "  --local-dir ~/huggingface/Qwen3-0.6B/ \\"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [23, 46], "note": "示例使用的模型（Qwen3-0.6B）", "quotes": ["huggingface-cli download --resume-download Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B \\", "- Model: Qwen3-0.6B"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "1cc74e76e05e": {"fn": "kubeflow/kubeflow", "sha": "1cc74e76e05e", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 AI 从业者与管理员的云原生 AI 平台", "review": "Kubeflow 是由模块化开源项目组成的 Kubernetes 原生技术栈，面向 AI 从业者、平台管理员与决策者，支持数据、AI/ML 与 HPC 工作负载。项目由社区工作组维护，覆盖 AI 生命周期各环节，强调可移植（本地/本地机房/云同一套代码）与可扩展（超大规模训练与高吞吐 AI agent）。本仓库主要作为各子项目的入口与共享元数据，开发在子项目仓库进行；README 未给出安装与运行步骤。", "highlights": ["由模块化开源项目组成，可按需组合跨 AI 生命周期使用", "同一代码可在本地笔记本、本地机房或任意云上运行", "社区主导，由多个工作组与委员会维护", "本仓库作为子项目入口与项目元数据承载"], "use_cases": ["在 Kubernetes 上运行机器学习训练工作负载", "在本地、机房或云间迁移同一套 AI 工作负载", "组建团队级数据与 AI 平台时按模块选型子项目"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "企业", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Kubernetes", "机器学习平台", "AI基础设施", "云原生"], "domain": "AI 基础设施/云原生平台", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L7: Kubeflow is _the_ Cloud Native AI platform.", "L9: Kubeflow is composed of modular, open source projects that form the Kubernetes-native stack", "L43: This repository serves primarily as a gateway to Kubeflow subprojects and shared project metadata."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "35e426993254": {"fn": "opensandbox-group/OpenSandbox", "sha": "35e426993254", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "在自有基础设施上运行 AI agent 的沙箱运行时", "review": "OpenSandbox 为 AI 应用提供隔离执行环境，支持代码执行、命令运行、文件管理以及浏览器/桌面操作。本地可用 Docker 启动，部署到 Kubernetes 通过统一沙箱 API 管理。提供 Python、Java/Kotlin、TypeScript/JavaScript、C#/.NET、Go 多语言 SDK，附带 `osb` CLI 与 MCP server，支持流量入口网关、出站 egress 策略、凭据保管（Credential Vault），以及 Firecracker 沙箱的暂停/恢复，资源池与批量创建面向 agent 评估与 RL 训练负载。Apache 2.0 开源。", "highlights": ["多语言 SDK（Python/Java/TS/C#/Go）、CLI 与 MCP 三种接入方式", "Firecracker 沙箱支持暂停/恢复并保留内存与磁盘状态", "入站统一 ingress 网关与按沙箱出站 egress 策略", "官方镜像发布于 Docker Hub/ghcr/阿里云三个镜像仓库，Cosign 签名"], "use_cases": ["为 coding agent 提供隔离的文件编辑与命令执行环境", "运行模型生成代码并做数据分析（Code Interpreter SDK）", "给 agent 提供浏览器或桌面自动化环境", "为 agent 评估与 RL 训练批量创建独立沙箱"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["沙箱", "AI agent 基础设施", "代码执行", "Kubernetes"], "domain": "AI 基础设施/沙箱运行时", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["阿里云容器镜像仓库 (Alibaba Cloud Container Registry)", "com.alibaba.opensandbox Maven 坐标", "@alibaba-group npm 包名", "DingTalk 社区"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L17: **Run AI agents in sandboxes on your own infrastructure.**", "L19: OpenSandbox gives AI applications isolated environments to execute code, run commands, manage files, and operate browser", "L32: |**SDKs, CLI, and MCP**|Integrate with Python, Java/Kotlin, TypeScript/JavaScript, C#/.NET, or Go SDKs. Use `osb` from t"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "note": "未命中，示例提及 Claude Code 但非 API provider 接入", "quotes": []}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [58, 90, 136, 161], "quotes": ["uv pip install opensandbox", "pip install opensandbox", "pip install opensandbox-cli", "pip install opensandbox-mcp"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [114], "quotes": ["npm install @alibaba-group/opensandbox"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [76, 156], "quotes": ["|**Coding agents**|Run coding agents in isolated environments to edit files, execute commands, and complete development ", "The OpenSandbox MCP server exposes sandbox creation, command execution, and text file operations to MCP-capable clients "]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [156], "quotes": ["The OpenSandbox MCP server exposes sandbox creation, command execution, and text file operations to MCP-capable clients "]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "b5777572c6c5": {"fn": "camenduru/stable-diffusion-webui-colab", "sha": "b5777572c6c5", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "在 Google Colab 上运行 Stable Diffusion WebUI 的笔记本合集", "review": "为 Stable Diffusion WebUI 提供的一组 Google Colab 笔记本，提供 lite、stable、nightly 三种分支：stable 含 ControlNet v1.1，nightly 使用 PyTorch 2.0 并每日更新扩展。覆盖 txt2img、img2img、inpainting、DreamBooth 与 LoRA 训练（training 分支）等场景，并收录数十个社区模型的 Open In Colab 一键入口。README 声明该仓库已停止更新，建议转向 TostUI。", "highlights": ["lite/stable/nightly 三种分支可选，stable 含 ControlNet v1.1，nightly 基于 PyTorch 2.0", "提供数十个社区模型的 Open In Colab 一键运行入口", "提供 DreamBooth 与 LoRA 训练分支及 Google Drive 安装分支", "支持 stable-diffusion、waifu-diffusion、inpainting、v2 系列等多种模型"], "use_cases": ["在 Colab 上无需本地 GPU 运行 Stable Diffusion WebUI", "为特定社区模型快速生成对应的 WebUI 运行环境", "在 Colab 上进行 DreamBooth 或 LoRA 训练"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["图像生成", "Stable Diffusion", "Colab", "WebUI", "模型训练"], "domain": "图像生成/机器学习工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5: # WebUI Restrictions Lifted! 🥳 Free WebUI is Back! 🔥 This repository is outdated and no longer receives updates. Please ", "L19: `lite` has a stable WebUI and stable installed extensions.", "L23: ## 🦒 Colab"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [8, 14, 23, 26, 27], "quotes": ["https://github.com/camenduru/stable-diffusion-webui-colab/tree/training", "https://github.com/camenduru/stable-diffusion-webui-colab/tree/drive", "## 🦒 Colab", "Open In Colab | Open In Co