esearchers and developers. The runtime"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "colab", "rel": "support", "lines": [48, 51], "quotes": ["running on Google Colab:", " Open In Colab"]}, {"term": "binary", "rel": "support", "lines": [73, 74], "quotes": ["Versioned releases are available as precompiled binaries from the GitHub", "[releases page], built for Linux (x86-64 and AArch64), Windows (x86-64 only),"]}, {"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [86, 89], "quotes": ["be installed from [PyPI] via:", "pip install mujoco"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "b392a98a3958": {"fn": "Unstructured-IO/unstructured", "sha": "b392a98a3958", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 LLM 开发者的文档解析 ETL 库：把文档转为结构化数据", "review": "提供开源组件用于摄取和预处理图像与文本文档（PDF、HTML、Word 等），核心是 partition 函数，自动检测文件类型并路由到对应的分区函数，输出结构化元素。安装方式包括 PyPI 安装（按文档类型选择 extras）、Docker 容器运行及本地开发（uv 管理依赖）。README 注明开源库永久免费，但官方推荐更高精度的 Transform v2 API（商业产品），并默认发送轻量遥测，可通过环境变量关闭。", "highlights": ["partition 函数自动检测文件类型并路由到对应分区函数", "按文档类型提供 pip extras 安装（如 unstructured[docx,pptx]）", "提供多平台 Docker 镜像（x86_64 与 Apple silicon）", "默认遥测可通过 DO_NOT_TRACK 或 SCARF_NO_ANALYTICS 关闭"], "use_cases": ["把 PDF/HTML/Word 等文档解析为结构化输出供 LLM 使用", "用 Docker 容器快速搭建文档预处理环境", "批量摄取不同格式文档并统一为结构化元素"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["文档解析", "ETL", "数据管道", "LLM预处理"], "domain": "数据管道/文档解析", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L29: The `unstructured` library provides open-source components for ingesting and pre-processing images and text documents, s", "L100: - Install the Python SDK to support all document types with `pip install \"unstructured[all-docs]\"`", "L238: Unstructured sends lightweight analytics to `GET https://packages.unstructured.io/python-telemetry` by default: one libr"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [6, 46, 100, 101, 102], "quotes": [" https://pypi.python.org/pypi/unstructured/", " 1. Install from PyPI", "- Install the Python SDK to support all document types with `pip install \"unstructured[all-docs]\"`", " - For plain text files, HTML, XML, JSON and Emails that do not require any extra dependencies, you can run `pip install", " - To process other doc types, you can install the extras required for those documents, such as `pip install \"unstructur"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [55, 57, 60, 67, 78], "quotes": ["NOTE: we build multi-platform images to support both x86_64 and Apple silicon hardware. `docker pull` should download th", "We build Docker images for all pushes to `main`. We tag each image with the corresponding short commit hash (e.g. `fbc7a", "docker pull downloads.unstructured.io/unstructured-io/unstructured:latest", "docker run -dt --name unstructured downloads.unstructured.io/unstructured-io/unstructured:latest", "of the packages/requirements necessary for other data types. See Dockerfile to know which lines are necessary"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "e0b7aec07fdc": {"fn": "ggml-org/ggml", "sha": "e0b7aec07fdc", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向机器学习的 C/C++ 张量计算库", "review": "以纯 C/C++ 实现的机器学习张量库，目标是简单、可移植、高效且安装配置最少。无任何外部依赖，支持 x86、ARM、RISC-V、LoongArch、PowerPC、s390x 与 WebAssembly 多平台，为 x86/ARM/RISC-V 提供 SIMD 优化内核；后端覆盖 CPU、GPU、NPU 与浏览器，支持 2-8 位整数量化及 MXFP4/NVFP4 微缩格式，运行期零内存分配。通过 CMake 从源码构建，MIT 协议。", "highlights": ["纯 C/C++ 实现，无外部依赖", "跨平台支持 x86、ARM、RISC-V 等 7 类架构与 WebAssembly", "后端覆盖 CPU、GPU、NPU 与浏览器", "支持 2-8 位整数量化与 MXFP4/NVFP4 格式"], "use_cases": ["在多种硬件平台上部署机器学习推理计算", "为需要无依赖、可移植性的项目提供张量运算底座", "在受限环境（如浏览器）中运行机器学习计算"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["张量计算", "机器学习基础设施", "量化", "跨平台推理"], "domain": "机器学习基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L28: The main goal of `ggml` is to be a simple, portable, and efficient tensor library for machine learning with minimal setu", "L33: - Broad backend support - CPU, GPU, NPU, and browser"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "llama.cpp", "rel": "mention", "lines": [39], "note": "文档区提及 GGUF 文件格式，llama.cpp 为同组织项目，README 未直接写明", "quotes": ["- The GGUF file format"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [13, 16, 20], "quotes": ["Build from source:", "git clone https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml", "cmake .."]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "8176ec0314e5": {"fn": "cmusatyalab/openface", "sha": "8176ec0314e5", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "基于深度神经网络的开源人脸识别库（CMU）", "review": "Carnegie Mellon University 发布的开源人脸识别研究项目，以深度神经网络生成人脸表示。仓库提供批量图像表示生成（batch-represent）、双图对比、分类器训练与使用、摄像头实时分类等 demo，附带 LFW 精度评估脚本、Python 库代码、模型训练脚本与测试。安装与使用讨论通过 gitter/mailing list 支持；源码与训练模型默认采用 Apache 2.0 许可，包含多个修改过的第三方组件。", "highlights": ["提供 Python 库及批量表示生成、对比、分类器训练等脚本", "包含 LFW 精度评估脚本与网络输出可视化 demo", "支持 webcam 实时分类器与实时 web demo", "附训练新模型脚本与含神经网络训练的测试"], "use_cases": ["对批量人脸图像生成深度神经网络表示", "训练并部署自己的人脸分类器", "在 LFW 上评估人脸识别精度"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": "https://cmusatyalab.github.io/openface/", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["人脸识别", "深度学习", "计算机视觉", "研究工具"], "domain": "计算机视觉/人脸识别", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "university", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: *Free and open source face recognition with", "L33: + openface: Python library code.", "L54: model files are copyright Carnegie Mellon University and licensed"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "dc4e8e6107ae": {"fn": "Anionex/banana-slides", "sha": "dc4e8e6107ae", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "基于图像生成模型的 AI PPT 应用，自然语言生成与修改幻灯片", "review": "前后端分离的 Web 应用（另提供桌面版）：以 nano banana pro / gpt-image 等图像生成模型为核心，从一句话、大纲或页面描述生成整套幻灯片页面，支持上传 PDF/Docx/MD 等文件解析素材、上传模板图片匹配风格、框选区域口头修改，导出 PPTX/PDF 及带 AI 旁白的讲解视频。部署提供 Docker Compose 预构建镜像与源码运行两种途径，依赖各图像/文本模型的 API Key，AGPL-3.0 许可下闭源商业使用需另行授权。", "highlights": ["想法/大纲/页面描述三种创作路径，支持自然语言修改与局部重绘", "上传 PDF/Docx/MD/Txt 等文件自动解析为素材，图片自动入库", "一键导出 PPTX/PDF，含可编辑 PPTX 导出（Beta）与讲解视频（多语言音色、字幕）", "通过 LazyLLM 