Distributed system resources"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "4e47c07bf050": {"fn": "corsairdev/corsair", "sha": "4e47c07bf050", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为开发者提供统一的第三方应用集成平台，供 agent 与应用调用", "review": "Corsair 是一个产品集成平台，基于 REST API 构建，为第三方 API 集成提供统一语法并由官方维护适配器。同一集成层可同时服务 agent、后端服务与多租户用户仪表盘。支持自托管，也可使用 Hub 由官方托管 OAuth 刷新与 webhook。以 npm 包发布，采用 Apache 2.0 许可证。README 未给出具体安装命令与支持的服务列表。", "highlights": ["基于 REST API 的集成层，兼容 agent、后端服务与用户仪表盘", "所有集成统一语法，适配器由项目维护", "支持自托管，Hub 托管模式提供 OAuth 刷新与 webhook", "开源（Apache 2.0），npm 发布"], "use_cases": ["为 agent 接入多个第三方 API 而不重复编写对接代码", "自建多租户仪表盘让用户连接自己的应用", "自托管集成平台以掌控用户 token 与数据"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["API集成", "agent工具", "开发者工具", "function-calling"], "domain": "开发者工具/API 集成平台", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L9: Corsair is a fully-featured product integration platform with a seamless DX. Build anything, from an agent working acros", "L17: Most agent integration tools are MCP-only. Corsair is built on a REST API, so the same integration layer works for agent"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "44ebe8bd2d4a": {"fn": "Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2", "sha": "44ebe8bd2d4a", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给创作者/开发者的图像与文本生成高分辨率带纹理 3D 资产的扩散模型系统", "review": "腾讯混元发布的 Hunyuan3D 2.0 开源 3D 生成系统，采用两阶段管线：基于流扩散 transformer 的形状生成模型 Hunyuan3D-DiT 依据条件图像生成网格，纹理合成模型 Hunyuan3D-Paint 为生成或手工网格生成纹理贴图。提供多系列模型（1.1B 标准、0.6B mini、多视图 mv、蒸馏加速 Turbo/Fast 版本），支持 macOS/Windows/Linux，输出 glb/obj 格式。提供 Python API、Gradio App、本地 API Server 与 Blender 插件；形状生成需 6 GB 显存，形状+纹理共需 16 GB。", "highlights": ["两阶段管线：形状生成（Hunyuan3D-DiT）+ 纹理合成（Hunyuan3D-Paint）", "提供 mini/mv/turbo 等多系列模型，0.6B 起可选", "提供 Python API、Gradio App、API Server 与 Blender 插件四种使用方式", "形状生成 6 GB 显存即可运行"], "use_cases": ["从单张或多视图图片生成带纹理的 3D 网格资产", "为手工建模的网格生成纹理贴图", "通过 Blender 插件在建模工作流中直接调用 3D 生成", "部署本地 API 服务供其他应用调用图像转 3D"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": "gpu-8g", "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["3D生成", "图像转3D", "纹理生成", "扩散模型", "游戏美术"], "domain": "AIGC/3D 资产生成", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供「中文阅读」链接", "腾讯 Hunyuan 团队", "社区整合包条目含中文「整合包」"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L42: We present Hunyuan3D 2.0, an advanced large-scale 3D synthesis system for generating high-resolution textured 3D assets.", "L60: Hunyuan3D 2.0 features a two-stage generation pipeline, starting with the creation of a bare mesh, followed by the", "L120: Hunyuan3D 2.0 supports Macos, Windows, Linux. You may follow the next steps to use Hunyuan3D 2.0 via:"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "supp