L3:  Open-source, self-hostable deployment platform with built-in CI/CD.", "L170: An **MCP** endpoint (for AI agents) and a **REST API** round it out for automation. Only routes that opt in are exposed "], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [67, 168], "quotes": ["curl -fsSL https://get.openship.io | sh          # install  (or: npm i -g openship — needs Node 22+)", "- **Ship SDK** — deploy and manage resources from JavaScript or TypeScript. Connect to an existing instance with `Opensh"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [131, 138, 143], "quotes": [" Self-host with raw Docker Compose (no CLI)", "docker compose --env-file .env -f docker/docker-compose.yml up -d", "**Upgrade:** pin `OPENSHIP_VERSION` in `.env` for reproducible pulls, then `docker compose --env-file .env -f docker/doc"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [136, 143], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/oblien/openship.git && cd openship", "**Upgrade:** pin `OPENSHIP_VERSION` in `.env` for reproducible pulls, then `docker compose --env-file .env -f docker/doc"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "81c5e780ec5d": {"fn": "DataTalksClub/machine-learning-zoomcamp", "sha": "81c5e780ec5d", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向工程师的免费 4 个月机器学习工程实战课程", "review": "DataTalks.Club 出品的免费机器学习工程课程，覆盖从问题定义、数据准备、模型训练评估到通过 API 部署上线的完整流程。技术栈包括 Python、scikit-learn、TensorFlow、PyTorch、FastAPI、Docker、Kubernetes 与 AWS Lambda。支持随直播批次学习（含作业评分、同伴评审、证书资格）或按材料自学（免费但不评分、无证书）。前置要求为至少一年编程经验，不要求 ML 经验或本地 GPU，深度学习模块使用云端资源。", "highlights": ["10 个模块 + 期中与两个 capstone 项目的完整课程结构", "覆盖模型训练到 FastAPI/Docker/Kubernetes/AWS Lambda 部署全链路", "支持直播批次（证书/评审/排行榜）与自学两种参与方式", "深度学习模块使用云端资源，不要求本地 GPU"], "use_cases": ["有编程经验想转入机器学习工程方向", "系统学习模型从开发到生产部署的完整流程", "积累可