no Banana、Seedance、MiniMax H3 系列），调用费用由用户自己的 OpenRouter 账户承担；预览版不含音乐与配音控制。推荐以预构建 Docker 镜像分发部署。", "highlights": ["画布式工作区：上传参考、整理文件、检视生成的图像与视频", "模型感知的宽高比、时长、分辨率与参考角色配置", "首帧/首尾帧/参考图生成模式，结果可迭代出新版本并保留原件", "提供编码助手自动安装脚本与预构建 Docker 镜像两种部署路径"], "use_cases": ["从简报到成片素材，在画布上管理 AI 图像与视频生成流程", "用参考图或首尾帧控制生成结果的可控视频创作", "本地自托管部署一个私有媒体存储的 AI 创作环境"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user": "创作者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": true, "lines": [10], "note": "自述为 Preview release，存在 bug 与粗糙之处"}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["视频生成", "图像生成", "创作画布", "AI影视制作", "自托管"], "domain": "内容创作/影视视频", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["openrouter"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 提供简体中文版本", "提供微信社区入口"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L5:  An AI creative workspace for images and videos: develop ideas with the right-hand Assistant, upload references, and org", "L22: This preview exposes **OpenRouter** configuration. Available models include GPT Image 2, Nano Banana variants, Seedance ", "L43: After launching, open your profile’s **API configuration** and add your OpenRouter API key. Provider calls are paid thro"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "openrouter", "rel": "support", "lines": [22, 43], "note": "预览版暴露 OpenRouter 配置，调用经用户自有账户付费", "quotes": ["This preview exposes **OpenRouter** configuration. Available models include GPT Image 2, Nano Banana variants, Seedance ", "After launching, open your profile’s **API configuration** and add your OpenRouter API key. Provider calls are paid thro"]}], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "note": "v0.5.0-beta.1 起统一为 Elastic License 2.0（source-available，非 OSI 开源），非双许可", "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "93c738ec86d1": {"fn": "carla-simulator/carla", "sha": "93c738ec86d1", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向自动驾驶研究的开源仿真器", "review": "CARLA 是面向自动驾驶系统开发、训练与验证的开源仿真器，提供开源代码、协议及可自由使用的城市布局、建筑、车辆等数字资产，支持灵活配置传感器组合与环境条件。当前 ue5-dev 分支基于 Unreal Engine 5.5，与 ue4-dev 分支并行维护。Linux/Windows 通过官方 setup 脚本从源码构建，需事先关联 Epic Games 账号以访问 UE5 fork，构建消耗较大磁盘空间与时间；项目有 CoRL'17 论文引用要求与 MIT/CC-BY 双重许可安排。", "highlights": ["开源仿真器附带可自由使用的城市、车辆等数字资产", "支持灵活指定传感器组合与环境条件", "提供 ROS-bridge、Scenario_Runner、自动排行榜等生态仓库", "提供 Python API 与蓝图库，跨 Linux/Windows 平台"], "use_cases": ["搭建自动驾驶感知/规划算法的训练与验证仿真环境", "在仿真中运行模仿学习或强化学习模型", "执行交通场景测试并接入 ROS/AutoWare 栈"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": "https://proceedings.mlr.press/v78/dosovitskiy17a.html", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["自动驾驶", "仿真器", "强化学习", "计算机视觉", "科研"], "domain": "自动驾驶研究/仿真", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L11: CARLA is an open-source simulator for autonomous driving research. CARLA has been developed from the ground up to suppor", "L19: > This is the development branch `ue5-dev` for the **Unreal Engine 5.5 version of CARLA**. This branch exists in paralle", "L82: In order to build CARLA, you need access to the CARLA fork of Unreal Engine 5.5. In order to access this repository, you"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [76, 79, 90], "quotes": ["Clone this repository locally from GitHub, specifying the *ue5-dev* branch:", "git clone -b ue5-dev https://github.com/carla-simulator/carla.git CarlaUE5", "./CarlaSetup.sh --interactive"]}], "hardware": [{"term": "32 Gb RAM", "rel": "support", "lines": [23, 24, 25, 26, 27], "quotes": ["* Intel i7 gen 9th - 11th / Intel i9 gen 9th - 11th / AMD Ryzen 7 / AMD Ryzen 9", "* +32 Gb RAM memory", "* NVIDIA RTX 3070/3080/3090 / NVIDIA RTX 4090 / NVIDIA RTX 5090 or better", "* 16 Gb or more VRAM", "* Ubuntu 22.04 or 24.04, or Windows 11"]}], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [185, 187], "quotes": ["CARLA specific code is distributed under the MIT License.", "CARLA specific assets are distributed under the CC-BY License."]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "47d73a7eefa7": {"fn": "davisking/dlib", "sha": "47d73a7eefa7", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "C++ 机器学习与数据分析算法工具库", "review": "一个 C++ 工具包，包含机器学习算法与用于构建复杂软件的工具，同时提供 Python API。README 给出三条使用路径：编译 examples 目录的 C++ 示例程序（需 C++17 编译器与 CMake）、通过 vcpkg 安装 C++ 库、以及从 PyPI 或 GitHub 源码安装 Python API。构建时可开启 AVX 指令加速，支持通过 setup.py 参数或 DLIB_* 环境变量调整构建选项。采用 Boost 软件许可证，允许闭源商业使用。", "highlights": ["C++ 机器学习算法工具包，附 Python API", "vcpkg 单命令安装 C++ 库并集成 CMake", "AVX 指令加速选项与 DLIB_* 环境变量构建配置", "Boost 许可证，允许闭源商业使用"], "use_cases": ["在 C++ 项目中集成机器学习算法", "在 Python 中使用 dlib 的机器学习功能", "通过 vcpkg 管理依赖的 C++ 工程引入该库"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["机器学习库", "C++", "计算机视觉", "Python API"], "domain": "机器学习/C++ 库", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: Dlib is a modern C++ toolkit containing machine learning algorithms and tools for creating complex software in C++ to so", "L7: You need a C++17 compiler and CMake. Go into the examples folder and type:", "L38: Either fetch the latest stable release of dlib from PyPi and install that:"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [38, 40], "quotes": ["Either fetch the latest stable release of dlib from PyPi and install that:", "pip install dlib"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [44, 46], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/davisking/dlib.git", "pip install ."]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "cb4352dc74e6": {"fn": "PaddlePaddle/PaddleDetection", "sha": "cb4352dc74e6", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给开发者的目标检测端到端开发套件", "review": "基于 PaddlePaddle 框架的目标检测开发套件，覆盖 2D/3D 目标检测、实例分割、多目标跟踪、关键点检测、人脸检测与半监督学习等方向。将模型解耦为 backbone、neck、loss、数据增强等可组合模块，提供 PP-YOLOE+、PP-PicoDet、PP-TinyPose、PP-HumanV2、PP-Vehicle 等产业特色模型与预训练权重，并整理农业、工业、交通等领域的应用范例。部署路径包括 Paddle Inference、Paddle Lite、Paddle Serving 及 ONNX 导出。安装说明需另行参考安装文档。", "highlights": ["模型库覆盖 2D/3D 检测、实例分割、多目标跟踪、关键点检测等方向", "模块化设计：backbone/neck/loss/数据增强组件可自定义组合", "提供 Paddle Inference/Paddle Lite/Paddle Serving 部署与 ONNX 导出", "PP 系列产业模型附带预训练模型与产业应用示例代码"], "use_cases": ["训练和部署自定义目标检测模型", "做行人/车辆分析、多目标跟踪等视频分析任务", "在移动端和嵌入式设备上部署轻量级检测模型", "按产业范例流程打通数据标注到部署的链路"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["目标检测", "实例分割", "多目标跟踪", "姿态估计", "模型部署"], "domain": "计算机视觉/目标检测", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["README 以简体中文为主", "基于百度飞桨 PaddlePaddle 框架", "昇腾/昆仑芯/寒武纪等国产硬件适配描述"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L8: PaddleDetection是一个基于PaddlePaddle的目标检测端到端开发套件，在提供丰富的模型组件和测试基准的同时，注重端到端的产业落地应用，通过打造产业级特色模型|工具、建设产业应用范例等手段，帮助开发者实现数据准备、模型选型", "L54: PaddleDetection支持大量的最新主流的算法基准以及预训练模型，涵盖2D/3D目标检测、实例分割、人脸检测、关键点检测、多目标跟踪、半监督学习等方向。`传送门`：📱模型库、⚖️模型性能对比。"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "3f76b95304af": {"fn": "e2b-dev/E2B", "sha": "3f76b95304af", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 AI agent 提供云端安全沙箱，运行生成的代码", "review": "E2B 是开源基础设施，在云端安全隔离沙箱中运行 AI 生成的代码，通过 JavaScript 或 Python SDK 创建并控制沙箱。提供三个 SDK：核心沙箱 SDK（执行命令）、Code Interpreter SDK（runCode 执行代码并获取结果）、Desktop SDK（鼠标、键盘、截图、桌面流等计算机操作 API）。使用需注册获取 API key 并设置环境变量；支持通过 Terraform 自托管部署到自有云环境。", "highlights": ["云端隔离沙箱中运行 AI 生成的代码", "JavaScript 与 Python 双 SDK，另有 Code Interpreter 与 Desktop 扩展 SDK", "Desktop SDK 提供鼠标、键盘、截图与应用流 API", "支持 Terraform 自托管，支持 AWS/GCP/Azure/Linux"], "use_cases": ["为 agent 提供安全的代码执行环境", "让 LLM 生成的 Python/JS 代码在沙箱中运行并取回结果", "agent 的计算机使用场景：操控浏览器、截屏等", "在自有云基础设施上部署沙箱运行时"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["沙箱", "代码解释器", "agent基础设施", "Computer Use"], "domain": "AI agent 基础设施", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L13: E2B is an open-source infrastructure that allows you to run AI-generated code in secure isolated sandboxes in the cloud.", "L99: Read the embed deployment guide to learn how to set up the E2B runtime on your own. The infrastructure is deployed using"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [26, 63, 80], "quotes": ["pip install e2b", "pip install e2b-code-interpreter  # Python", "pip install e2b-desktop  # Python"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [21, 62, 79], "quotes": ["npm i e2b", "npm i @e2b/code-interpreter  # JavaScript/TypeScript", "npm i @e2b/desktop  # JavaScript/TypeScript"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "c46bad7f5c71": {"fn": "fathah/hermes-desktop", "sha": "c46bad7f5c71", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 Hermes Agent 提供安装、配置与对话的桌面应用", "review": "社区维护的原生桌面应用，把 Hermes Agent 的安装、provider 配置与日常使用集中到 GUI：首次启动引导本地安装（调用官方安装脚本，存放于 ~/.hermes）或连接远程 API，本地模式经 127.0.0.1:8642 以 SSE 流式通信。覆盖会话管理、多 Profile 隔离、记忆条目编辑、SOUL.md 人格编辑、cron 定时任务、16 个消息网关与备份/日志查看。API key 默认存于 .env，可选 command provider 对接多种密码管理器；该 provider 仅限 POSIX 系统。项目处于活跃开发期。", "highlights": ["引导式首次安装 Hermes Agent（本地/远程两种模式）", "多 provider 支持：OpenRouter、Anthropic、OpenAI、Gemini、Grok 等 11 类及 OpenAI 兼容本地端点", "22 个 slash 命令与 14 个工具集（浏览器、终端、图像生成、TTS 等）", "secrets command provider 可对接 KeePassXC、GnuPG、pass、1Password CLI 等"], "use_cases": ["不想手动操作 CLI、用图形界面安装和管理 Hermes Agent", "在本地运行 Ollama/LM Studio 等模型端点并与桌面聊天 UI 配合", "通过 Telegram/Discord/微信等消息平台接入同一个 agent"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "idea"}, "eval": {"target_user