oq, Cohere, Mistral AI, Apple MLX, koboldcpp, together.ai,"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [66, 67], "note": "列于 Local & Remote AI Providers 兼容列表", "quotes": [" - Compatible with Local & Remote AI Providers:", " - Ollama, AMD Lemonade, groq, Cohere, Mistral AI, Apple MLX, koboldcpp, together.ai,"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "compat", "lines": [68], "quotes": [" - OpenRouter, Helicone, Perplexity, ShuttleAI, Deepseek, Qwen, and more"]}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "compat", "lines": [68], "quotes": [" - OpenRouter, Helicone, Perplexity, ShuttleAI, Deepseek, Qwen, and more"]}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [158], "note": "Docker Compose 栈一键部署管理面板", "quotes": [" - Bundled with the Docker Compose stacks for one-command setup"]}, {"term": "binary", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "note": "releases 页为版本发布说明入口，README 未提供二进制安装途径", "quotes": []}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "Runway", "rel": "none", "lines": [50], "note": "误命中：runway pressure 指上下文余量，非 Runway 公司", "quotes": ["- **Context Usage:** Inspect dialogue, retained tool traffic, Agent instructions, cache, cost, and runway pressure witho"]}, {"term": "ChatGPT", "rel": "mention", "lines": [61, 145], "note": "UI 灵感来源与对话导入来源，非替代/竞品表述", "quotes": ["- 🖥️ **UI & Experience** inspired by ChatGPT with enhanced design and features", " - Import Conversations from LibreChat, ChatGPT, Chatbot UI"]}, {"term": "Perplexity", "rel": "mention", "lines": [68], "note": "兼容服务商列表中提及", "quotes": [" - OpenRouter, Helicone, Perplexity, ShuttleAI, Deepseek, Qwen, and more"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [68], "note": "Qwen 列于兼容服务商列表", "quotes": [" - OpenRouter, Helicone, Perplexity, ShuttleAI, Deepseek, Qwen, and more"]}]}}, "0199df7d7e1d": {"fn": "volcengine/OpenViking", "sha": "0199df7d7e1d", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 AI Agent 的上下文数据库：统一记忆、知识与技能", "review": "OpenViking 把 Agent 的知识、记忆与技能统一组织为 `viking://` 虚拟文件系统，Agent 可用 ls/read/grep 等文件操作浏览和编辑上下文；目录携带 L0 摘要/L1 概览/L2 全文三层结构，检索可限定在子树内。会话提交后可抽取记忆为可检查的 Markdown，VikingBot 可将素材编译为 wiki/知识图谱。服务端以 AGPLv3 开源，另提供火山引擎托管 SaaS 与 BYOC 商业版；安装依赖 uv 与 Python 3.10+，需配置一个带嵌入模型和 VLM 的模型服务。", "highlights": ["知识与记忆、技能统一为可浏览的虚拟文件系统（viking:// URI）", "L0 摘要/L1 概览/L2 全文三层上下文加载", "支持 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor 等记忆插件一键安装，提供 Python/Go/TypeScript SDK 与 HTTP API", "附带 LoCoMo 与 tau2-bench 基准评测脚本（./benchmark）"], "use_cases": ["给编码 Agent 加跨会话记忆", "把项目文档/代码导入后做目录级语义检索", "自建带用户隔离与 ACL 的记忆服务"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "dual", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.29640", "demo_url": "https://studio.openviking.ai", "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["Agent记忆", "上下文数据库", "RAG", "向量数据库"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Agent 记忆与上下文", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["volcengine（火山引擎）维护", "提供微信群社区（L23）", "托管版部署在中国区（api.vikingdb.cn-beijing）"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L31: OpenViking is an open-source context database for AI agents — one filesystem for everything an agent knows: knowledge, m", "L45: - **One filesystem for knowledge, memory, and skills.** Resources hold documents and code; memories retain user preferen"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [131, 156, 157, 170], "note": "以 Claude Code 集成形式出现，未直接提及 Anthropic 作为模型提供方", "quotes": ["Connect your coding agent to OpenViking for cross-session memory. The memory plugin installer covers Claude Code, Codex,", "  Claude Code", "    Next: restart Claude Code", " Claude"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [108], "note": "init 配置明确支持本地 Ollama", "quotes": ["`init` writes `~/.openviking/ov.conf` and supports Volcengine, OpenAI, Codex OAuth, Kimi, GLM and local Ollama; see the "]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [105, 231], "note": "uv tool install openviking 与 pip install openviking[bot]", "quotes": ["uv tool install openviking --upgrade && openviking-server init", "pip install \"openviking[bot]\""]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "豆包", "rel": "mention", "lines": [78, 200], "note": "评测所用 VLM 及 Doubao Work 集成对象", "quotes": ["The memory evaluation used Doubao 2.0 Pro as the VLM and Doubao-embedding-vision-251215 as the embedding model.", " Doubao&nbsp;Work"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [80, 131, 156, 157], "note": "被接入的 Agent，非替代/竞品关系", "quotes": [" Benchmark results. LoCoMo accuracy: OpenClaw 24.20% native vs 82.08% with OpenViking; Hermes 33.38% vs 82.86%; Claude C", "Connect your coding agent to OpenViking for cross-session memory. The memory plugin installer covers Claude Code, Codex,", "  Claude Code", "    Next: restart Claude Code"]}, {"term": "Kimi", "rel": "mention", "lines": [108], "quotes": ["`init` writes `~/.openviking/ov.conf` and supports Volcengine, OpenAI, Codex OAuth, Kimi, GLM and local Ollama; see the "]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [131, 176], "quotes": ["Connect your coding agent to OpenViking for cross-session memory. The memory plugin installer covers Claude Code, Codex,", " Cursor"]}, {"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [203, 214], "note": "框架集成对象，提供包与指南", "quotes": [" LangChain", "For framework applications, see the LangChain/LangGraph and Microsoft Agent Framework packages, with a guide to adding o"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": true, "lines": [246, 248, 249, 253, 254], "note": "开源版 AGPLv3，另有托管 SaaS 与 BYOC 商业版（license key）", "quotes": ["Managed SaaS", " ☁️ Managed SaaS", " Volcano Engine hosts and operates OpenViking. Personal and Enterprise plans cover individual and team use, with migrati", " 🏢 Self-Managed", " Deploy in your own cloud account / VPC (BYOC) or an offline environment. This edition adds distributed deployment and o"]}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "15d496c87e81": {"fn": "Tencent/WeKnora", "sha": "15d496c87e81", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向企业的开源 LLM 知识平台：文档转 RAG、Agent 与 Wiki", "review": "腾讯开源的 LLM 知识框架，围绕同一知识库提供三种模式：RAG（混合检索、多模态解析、引用溯源）、Agent（多步推理、技能沙箱、本地浏览器、MCP 工具与记忆）、Wiki（知识图谱组织与回滚）。支持飞书、Confluence、Notion 等 10 余种数据源自动同步与 10+ 文档格式解析；内置 29 家模型供应商；多工作区 RBAC、任务队列治理与 Langfuse 追踪。可通过 Docker Compose、Kubernetes Helm、Lite 单二进制或桌面应用部署，数据可留在自有环境。", "highlights": ["RAG、Agent、Wiki 三模式共享同一知识库", "技能经 ClawHub/Git/ZIP 安装并在 Docker/E2B/Cube 沙箱运行，支持操作本地 Chrome/Edge", "29 家内置模型供应商目录，含 OpenAI、DeepSeek、Ollama 等，模型/向量库/存储后端可替换", "飞书、Confluence、GitLab、Notion 等数据源自动同步，10+ 文档格式解析"], "use_cases": ["把团队文档搭建成可引用溯源的企业问答系统", "用 Agent 沙箱执行基于知识库的多步任务", "将文档组织为带知识图谱的内部 Wiki", "通过企业微信、飞书、Slack 等 IM 渠道接入问答"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "企业", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["RAG", "知识库问答", "Agent", "企业知识管理", "自托管"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/知识管理", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["deepseek", "ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["腾讯出品", "支持飞书、企业微信、语雀、钉钉、腾讯 IMA 等数据源", "多语言含简体中文"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L32: WeKnora is an open-source, LLM-powered knowledge framework for enterprise document understanding, semantic retrieval and", "L40:  01 RAG: answers you can check, with hybrid search, multimodal parsing and citations. 02 Agent: tasks done with knowledg", "L49: - **Models**: 29 built-in vendors with a generated model catalog, including OpenAI, DeepSeek, Qwen (Alibaba Cloud), Zhip"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [48], "quotes": ["- **Channels and integrations**: Q&A in WeCom, Feishu, Slack, Telegram and other IM apps; an embed widget for external w"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [49, 174], "quotes": ["- **Models**: 29 built-in vendors with a generated model catalog, including OpenAI, DeepSeek, Qwen (Alibaba Cloud), Zhip", "- **Ecosystem**: official DeepSeek Harness plugin `@wxg-prc-cpg/dsh-weknora`; LiteLLM; Exa and Metaso web search."]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [49, 85], "quotes": ["- **Models**: 29 built-in vendors with a generated model catalog, including OpenAI, DeepSeek, Qwen (Alibaba Cloud), Zhip", "> To use a local Ollama model, run `ollama serve > /dev/null 2>&1 &` first. For the Ollama embedding model name, `OLLAMA"]}, {"term": "cohere", "rel": "mention", "lines": [151], "quotes": ["- **Administration and integrations**: platform user management, invitation-only signup mode, administrator model catalo"]}, {"term": "azure", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [67, 70, 72, 78, 79], "quotes": [" Deploy with Docker or Kubernetes and configure models, storage and networking yourself.", "### Run with Docker Compose", "Requires Docker, Docker Compose and Git.", "docker compose pull     # Pull the latest images", "docker compose up -d    # Start core services"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "mention", "lines": [131], "note": "桌面应用需从源码构建，非主部署途径", "quotes": ["|**Desktop app**|The Lite runtime with a GUI, login-free start and a macOS host sandbox; no installer is published yet, "]}, {"term": "helm", "rel": "support", "lines": [129], "quotes": ["|**Kubernetes (Helm)**|Production clusters; the chart is in `helm/`|"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [48], "note": "MCP Server 服务的 AI 工具，非竞品", "quotes": ["- **Channels and integrations**: Q&A in WeCom, Feishu, Slack, Telegram and other IM apps; an embed widget for external w"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [49], "note": "内置模型供应商之一", "quotes": ["- **Models**: 29 built-in vendors with a generated model catalog, including OpenAI, DeepSeek, Qwen (Alibaba Cloud), Zhip"]}, {"term": "豆包", "rel": "none", "lines": [], "quotes": []}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": true, "lines": [159]}}}, "8440fd2a673e": {"fn": "NirDiamant/RAG_Techniques", "sha": "8440fd2a673e", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "为 RAG 开发者与研究者提供 42+ 可运行 notebook 的技术合集", "review": "以 notebook 教程形式展示检索增强生成（RAG）的各类技术，共 42+ 个可运行示例，按基础、查询增强、上下文丰富、高级检索、迭代技术、评估、可解释性、高级架构等类别组织，每个技术附文档说明、实现指引与参考文献。部分技术提供 LangChain 与 LlamaIndex 两个版本的 notebook 及可运行脚本。仓库同时包含作者的课程、书籍、Newsletter 与 YouTube 内容推广，以及赞助商展示。", "highlights": ["42+ 个可运行 RAG 技术 notebook，覆盖基础到高级架构", "每项技术附详细文档与实现指引", "部分技术提供 LangChain 与 LlamaIndex 双版本", "涵盖 Graph RAG、Self-RAG、CRAG、RAPTOR 等架构"], "use_cases": ["系统学习 RAG 各类检索与分块技术", "为 RAG 项目寻找具体技术的可运行实现参考", "了解 RAG 评估与可解释性工具的用法"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-knowledge", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": null, "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["RAG", "教程/notebook", "LLM基础设施", "信息检索"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/RAG", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L4: A community-driven hub of **42+ runnable notebooks** covering RAG techniques from foundational to cutting-edge - the int", "L109: Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) is revolutionizing the way we combine information retrieval with generative AI. Thi", "L149: > **Recently added:** MemoRAG (memory-augmented retrieval), End-to-End RAG Evaluation, Open-RAG-Eval, JSON RAG. **42 not"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "compat", "lines": [595, 598], "note": "窗外行，notebook 中配合本地 Ollama 使用", "quotes": [" - **NetworkX + Ollama**:", " A privacy-first Graph RAG implementation running entirely locally with Ollama. Uses NetworkX for multi-hop graph traver"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "mention", "lines": [629], "note": "窗外行，克隆仓库运行 notebook 的方式", "quotes": ["   git clone https://github.com/NirDiamant/RAG_Techniques.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [178, 195], "note": "被使用的框架，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["|26|Advanced Architecture 🏗️|Graph RAG with LangChain||", " - **LangChain**:"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "756bba187ea0": {"fn": "huggingface/datasets", "sha": "756bba187ea0", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "ML 从业者的一站式数据集加载与预处理库", "review": "Hugging Face 的 Python 数据集库：通过 load_dataset() 一行命令加载 Hub 上图像、音频、文本（467 种语言）、视频、PDF、NIfTI 等公开数据集，也可读取本地 CSV/JSON/Parquet 等文件或 Python 对象。基于 Apache Arrow 后端做零拷贝内存映射与智能缓存，支持 streaming=True 流式迭代、map() 多进程预处理，并可转换为 NumPy/Pandas/PyTorch/TensorFlow/JAX/Spark 等框架格式。面向训练与评估 ML 模型的开发者与科研人员。", "highlights": ["load_dataset() 一行加载 Hub 公开数据集与本地文件", "Apache Arrow 零拷贝内存映射，支持 streaming 流式迭代", "多框架互转：NumPy/Pandas/Polars/PyTorch/TensorFlow/JAX/Spark", "内置 FAISS 与 Elasticsearch 相似性检索索引支持"], "use_cases": ["为模型训练/评估快速加载公开数据集", "磁盘装不下的大规模数据集用 streaming 方式迭代", "对本地 CSV/JSON/Parquet 数据做可复现预处理", "加载和处理 agent traces 数据"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["数据集加载", "数据预处理", "机器学习", "多模态数据"], "domain": "机器学习/数据工具", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L11: 🤗 Datasets is a lightweight library providing **two** main features:", "L13: - **one-line dataloaders for many public datasets**: one-liners to download and pre-process any of the number of dataset", "L24: |📦 **One-line dataset loading**|Load AI-ready datasets from the Hugging Face Hub or local files with `load_dataset()`|"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [41, 44, 50, 65], "quotes": ["🤗 Datasets can be installed from PyPi and should be installed in a virtual environment (venv or conda for instance):", "pip install datasets", "pip install \"datasets @ git+https://github.com/huggingface/datasets.git\"", "pip install datasets[audio]"]}], "hardware": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}, "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [13, 50, 56, 151], "note": "本库为 Hugging Face 官方产品，Hub 为其依托平台，非替代/竞品", "quotes": ["- **one-line dataloaders for many public datasets**: one-liners to download and pre-process any of the number of dataset", "pip install \"datasets @ git+https://github.com/huggingface/datasets.git\"", "conda install -c huggingface -c conda-forge datasets", "We have a very detailed step-by-step guide to add a new dataset to the number of datasets datasets already provided on t"]}]}}, "051259e1b3fa": {"fn": "camel-ai/owl", "sha": "051259e1b3fa", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发者的多智能体协作框架，自动化真实世界任务", "review": "基于 CAMEL-AI Framework 构建的多智能体协作框架，通过动态 agent 交互完成真实世界任务自动化。内置在线搜索、浏览器自动化（Playwright）、多模态数据处理、文档解析（Word/Excel/PDF/PPT）与 Python 代码执行等工具包，并支持 MCP 协议接入工具。提供 uv/venv/conda/Docker 多种安装方式，运行需配置 LLM API key，模型需具备工具调用能力，多模态任务需多模态模型。提供 Web 界面与示例脚本，已开源训练数据集与模型检查点。", "highlights": ["基于 Playwright 的浏览器自动化与多种搜索引擎接入", "内置 MCP、代码执行、文档解析等大量工具包", "支持多种 LLM 后端，含 Claude、Gemini、OpenRouter 等示例脚本", "提供 Web 界面、Docker 镜像与社区 agent 挑战活动"], "use_cases": ["让多个 agent 协作完成联网检索、浏览器操作等自动化任务", "解析本地文档并基于内容回答问题", "对图像、视频、音频进行多模态分析", "复现 GAIA benchmark 上的多智能体实验"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["多智能体", "任务自动化", "agent框架", "浏览器自动化"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/Multi-Agent 框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["openrouter", "anthropic", "deepseek"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "mid", "evidence": ["L27: 🦉 OWL is a cutting-edge framework for multi-agent collaboration that pushes the boundaries of task automation, built on ", "L75: - **Browser Automation**: Utilize the Playwright framework for simulating browser interactions, including scrolling, cli", "L231: - **Tool Calling**: OWL requires models with robust tool calling capabilities to interact with various toolkits. Models "], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["npm"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "openrouter", "rel": "support", "lines": [54], "quotes": ["- **[2025.03.21]**: Integrated OpenRouter model platform, fix bug with Gemini tool calling."]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [244, 245], "quotes": ["# Run with Claude model", "python examples/run_claude.py"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [392], "quotes": ["- **Easy Model Selection**: Choose between different models (OpenAI, Qwen, DeepSeek, etc.)"]}], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [107], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/camel-ai/owl.git"]}, {"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [137], "quotes": ["docker compose up -d"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "mention", "lines": [320, 321], "note": "MCP 依赖服务的安装方式，非本产品安装途径", "quotes": ["npm install -g @executeautomation/playwright-mcp-server", "npx playwright install-deps"]}, {"term": "brew", "rel": "mention", "lines": [314], "note": "Node.js 的安装方式，非本产品安装途径", "quotes": ["brew install node"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Hugging Face", "rel": "mention", "lines": [9, 47], "note": "数据集与 checkpoint 发布渠道，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["[![Hugging Face][huggingface-image]][huggingface-url]", "- **[2025.07.21]**: We open-sourced the training dataset and model checkpoints of OWL project. Training code coming soon"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "5d97a7e269a6": {"fn": "langbot-app/LangBot", "sha": "5d97a7e269a6", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给开发者的多平台 IM 聊天机器人开发与运行平台", "review": "开源平台，将大语言模型接入 Slack、Discord、Telegram、微信/企业微信、飞书、钉钉、QQ 等 IM 平台，构建能对话、执行任务的智能体。内置 RAG 知识库，深度集成 Dify、Coze、n8n、Langflow 等编排工具；提供 Web 管理面板做配置与监控、插件生态、访问控制与限流。支持 uvx 一行启动、Docker Compose 与多家云平台部署，并通过 MCP Server 与 CLI（lbctl）供编程代理管理机器人、流水线与插件。", "highlights": ["一套代码接入 Discord、Telegram、Slack、LINE、QQ、微信、企业微信、飞书、钉钉、KOOK 等 IM 平台", "内置 RAG 知识库，集成 Dify、Coze、n8n、Langflow、Deerflow、Weknora", "内置 MCP 端点与 lbctl CLI，供编程代理管理机器人、流水线、插件与模型", "插件生态与事件驱动架构，Web 面板配置无需 YAML"], "use_cases": ["在 Slack/Discord/Telegram 部署基于自有知识库的客服机器人", "把 n8n/Dify 工作流接入企业微信/钉钉做业务自动化", "用一个面板统一管理多平台的机器人"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["IM机器人", "Agent", "RAG知识库", "LLM接入", "插件系统"], "domain": "LLM 应用/机器人平台", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["deepseek", "ollama", "anthropic"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "team", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["简体中文文档与多语言README", "飞书/钉钉/企业微信/QQ 等国内平台适配", "阿里云百炼/硅基流动/火山方舟等国内网关支持"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L28: LangBot is an **open-source, production-grade platform** for building AI-powered instant messaging bots. It connects Lar", "L34: - **AI Conversations & Agents** — Multi-turn dialogues, tool calling, multi-modal support, streaming output. Built-in RA", "L144: - **MCP Server** — LangBot exposes a built-in Model Context Protocol endpoint at `/mcp`, mirroring the HTTP API so an ag"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [108], "quotes": ["|DeepSeek|LLM|✅|"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [113], "quotes": ["|Ollama|Local LLM|✅|"]}, {"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [107], "quotes": ["|Anthropic|LLM|✅|"]}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [71, 74], "quotes": ["```bash", "docker compose --profile all up -d"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [72], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/langbot-app/LangBot"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Dify", "rel": "mention", "lines": [34, 115, 136], "note": "被集成的 LLMOps 平台，非竞品", "quotes": ["- **AI Conversations & Agents** — Multi-turn dialogues, tool calling, multi-modal 