ion", "lines": [14, 15, 58, 59], "note": "作为集成 shell/后端被支持，非替代或竞品对象", "quotes": ["- **[2026-07-02]** 🚀 **SkillOpt v0.2.0 is out on PyPI!** Headline feature: **SkillOpt-Sleep**, a nightly offline self-ev", "- **[2026-06-15]** 😴 **SkillOpt-Sleep (preview)** — a nightly offline self-evolution companion for local coding agents (", "`qwen_chat`, `minimax_chat`, `copilot_chat`, `openai_compatible`, `codex_exec`,", "`claude_code_exec`, `cursor_exec`, `copilot_exec`). If a provider implements the OpenAI Chat Completions"]}, {"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [14, 15, 38, 41, 42], "note": "执行 harness 与集成对象", "quotes": ["- **[2026-07-02]** 🚀 **SkillOpt v0.2.0 is out on PyPI!** Headline feature: **SkillOpt-Sleep**, a nightly offline self-ev", "- **[2026-06-15]** 😴 **SkillOpt-Sleep (preview)** — a nightly offline self-evolution companion for local coding agents (", "chat, Codex CLI, Claude Code CLI), SkillOpt is best or tied-best on **all", "the Codex agentic loop, and +19.1 inside Claude Code**. Optimized skill", "artifacts transfer across model scales, between Codex and Claude Code"]}, {"term": "Devin", "rel": "mention", "lines": [14], "quotes": ["- **[2026-07-02]** 🚀 **SkillOpt v0.2.0 is out on PyPI!** Headline feature: **SkillOpt-Sleep**, a nightly offline self-ev"]}, {"term": "通义千问", "rel": "mention", "lines": [17, 58], "note": "作为 chat 后端（qwen）被支持，非产品竞品关系", "quotes": ["- **[2026-06-02]** 🎉 **SkillOpt v0.1.0 is now available on PyPI!** Install with `pip install skillopt`. This initial rel", "`qwen_chat`, `minimax_chat`, `copilot_chat`, `openai_compatible`, `codex_exec`,"]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [59], "quotes": ["`claude_code_exec`, `cursor_exec`, `copilot_exec`). If a provider implements the OpenAI Chat Completions"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "9ccdb46e5f5a": {"fn": "wanshuiyin/Auto-claude-code-research-in-sleep", "sha": "9ccdb46e5f5a", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "给 ML 研究者提供跨模型审查循环的 Markdown 技能集", "review": "ARIS 是一套纯 Markdown 的技能/工作流方法，用于自主 ML 研究：由执行模型驱动、独立模型（默认 Codex MCP）做跨模型审查，覆盖想法发现、实验自动化与审查循环。定位为方法论而非平台，可安装到 Claude Code、Codex CLI、Cursor、OpenClaw 等 agent 环境，也提供独立 CLI（ARIS-Code）与各平台插件发行，含 82-83 个技能；README 说明 codex-cli 0.154 移除 mcp-server 后改用 codex exec 桥接，替代模型组合无需 Claude 或 OpenAI API。", "highlights": ["跨模型审查循环：执行者驱动，独立模型（默认 Codex MCP）审查", "纯 Markdown 技能形式，82-83 个技能，无框架依赖", "提供独立 CLI（ARIS-Code）及 Claude Code / Codex CLI / DeepSeek Harness 插件", "支持 ModelScope 托管模型的替代模型组合，无需 Claude/OpenAI API"], "use_cases": ["让 agent 在夜间自主推进 ML 研究实验与审查循环", "在 Claude Code / Codex CLI / Cursor 等环境中安装研究工作流技能", "为想法发现与实验自动化配置跨模型审查门控"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": "research"}, "eval": {"target_user": "科研", "paper_url": "https://huggingface.co/papers/2605.03042", "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["科研自动化", "LLM技能", "跨模型审查", "CLI工具"], "domain": "科研/LLM 工具链", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "individual", "zh_origin": true, "zh_origin_signals": ["秋招中文表述（L19）", "ARIS-Code 独立安装版中文标题（L27）"]}, "trust": {"confidence": "low", "evidence": ["L9: 🌱 *ARIS is a methodology, not a platform. What matters is the research workflow — take it wherever you go.*", "L11: 💡 *Use ARIS as a skill-based workflow in Claude Code / Codex CLI / Cursor / Trae / Antigravity / GitHub Copilot CLI / Op", "L13: 📦 *Those are the skills installed directly. Want it in one command? ARIS also ships as a standalone CLI and as plugins:*"], "xcheck": {"install_missing": ["npm"]}, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "mention", "lines": [11, 27], "note": "Anthropic 渠道提及，非专门适配声明", "quotes": [