tor database — lightweight, lightning-fast, and designed to embed directly int", "L28: > - **ReMe integration**: zvec is now a file store backend in ReMe, the memory management kit for agents, providing in-p", "L43: - **Hybrid Search**: Fuse vector similarity, full-text search, and structured filters in a single query for precise resu"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [52], "quotes": ["- **Python**: `pip install zvec` (requires 64-bit Python 3.10–3.14)"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [53], "quotes": ["- **Node.js**: `npm install @zvec/zvec`"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "c385b3f8f7bb": {"fn": "MemoriLabs/Memori", "sha": "c385b3f8f7bb", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向 agent 的记忆基础设施：把执行与对话转为持久化结构化记忆", "review": "提供 Python 与 TypeScript SDK 的 agent 记忆层，将 LLM 交互与 agent 执行（含工具调用、决策、结果）捕获为按 entity/process/session 分级的结构化记忆，后台增强生成 attributes、facts、preferences 等类型，不增加请求延迟。LLM、数据存储与框架无关，支持 OpenAI 等多种 LLM 与 LangChain 等框架，可接入自有数据库（BYODB）或使用 Memori Cloud；通过 MCP 一条命令接入 Claude Code、Cursor 等客户端；默认高级增强免账号但限速。", "highlights": ["entity/process/session 三级记忆归属与后台增强（attributes/facts/preferences 等）", "MCP 单命令接入 Claude Code、Cursor、Codex、Warp 等客户端，无需 SDK 集成", "LLM/datastore/framework 无关，提供 BYODB 模式接入自有数据库", "OpenClaw 插件与 Hermes 记忆 provider 两种开箱集成"], "use_cases": ["让 agent 跨会话记住用户偏好、项目约定与历史决策", "为生产环境的 agent 系统沉淀结构化执行轨迹，减少重复工具调用", "团队共享 coding 约定与审阅偏好上下文"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "none", "deploy": "library", "model_dep": "locked-api", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["agent记忆", "记忆管理", "LLM基础设施", "MCP", "企业级"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/agent 记忆", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "bedrock", "deepseek", "xai"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3:  Memory from what agents do, not just what they say.", "L43: Set `MEMORI_API_KEY` and your LLM API key (e.g. `OPENAI_API_KEY`), then:", "L170: ## Supported LLMs"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [172], "quotes": ["- Anthropic"]}, {"term": "bedrock", "rel": "support", "lines": [173], "quotes": ["- Bedrock"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [174, 189], "quotes": ["- DeepSeek", "- DeepSeek"]}, {"term": "xai", "rel": "support", "lines": [176], "quotes": ["- Grok (xAI)"]}], "install": [{"term": "pypi", "rel": "support", "lines": [36, 103, 221], "quotes": ["pip install memori", "pip install hermes-memori", "python -m memori sign-up <email_address>"]}, {"term": "npm", "rel": "support", "lines": [30], "quotes": ["npm install @memorilabs/memori"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "Claude Code", "rel": "mention", "lines": [119, 125], "quotes": ["If you use Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Warp, or Antigravity, you can connect Memori with no SDK integration needed:", "  --header \"X-Memori-Process-Id: claude-code\""]}, {"term": "Cursor", "rel": "mention", "lines": [119, 128], "quotes": ["If you use Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Warp, or Antigravity, you can connect Memori with no SDK integration needed:", "For Cursor, Codex, Warp, and other clients, see the MCP client setup guide."]}, {"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [184], "note": "被支持的集成框架，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["- LangChain"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "706d4634571b": {"fn": "n8n-io/self-hosted-ai-starter-kit", "sha": "706d4634571b", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "自托管本地 AI 工作流入门模板：一条 Docker Compose 拉起整套环境", "review": "由 n8n 官方维护的 Docker Compose 模板，组合四个组件：n8n 低代码平台（400+ 集成与 AI 节点）、Ollama 本地 LLM 运行时、Qdrant 向量库、PostgreSQL。按 GPU 型号（Nvidia/AMD/Apple Silicon/CPU）提供不同 compose profile，一条命令启动；预配置网络与存储，含示例工作流与本地文件共享目录挂载。README 说明面向原型验证，非生产环境优化。", "highlights": ["一条 docker compose 命令启动 n8n + Ollama + Qdrant + PostgreSQL 组合", "按 Nvidia GPU / AMD GPU / Mac / CPU 提供不同启动 profile", "内置示例工作流与 400+ 集成的 n8n 平台", "本地文件共享目录挂载至 n8n 容器 /data/shared"], "use_cases": ["在本地搭建自托管的 AI 工作流开发环境", "构建不泄露数据的 PDF 摘要、财务文档分析等私有文档处理流程", "快速原型化 AI Agent 与 Slack 机器人等自动化场景"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-ecosystem", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "self-host", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["自托管", "工作流自动化", "本地LLM", "Docker模板", "AI Agent"], "domain": "LLM 基础设施/自托管工具链", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L3: **Self-hosted AI Starter Kit** is an open-source Docker Compose template designed to swiftly initialize a comprehensive ", "L7: Curated by <https://github.com/n8n-io>, it combines the self-hosted n8n", "L115: The core of the Self-hosted AI Starter Kit is a Docker Compose file, pre-configured with network and storage settings, m"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [19, 79, 82, 97], "quotes": ["✅ **Ollama** - Cross-platform LLM platform to install", "2. Run Ollama on your Mac for faster inference, and connect to that from the", "If you want to run Ollama on your mac, check the", "1. Set OLLAMA_HOST to `host.docker.internal:11434` in your .env file."]}], "install": [{"term": "docker", "rel": "support", "lines": [48, 56, 69, 90, 110], "quotes": ["### Running n8n using Docker Compose", "docker compose --profile gpu-nvidia up", "docker compose --profile gpu-amd up", "docker compose up", "docker compose --profile cpu up"]}, {"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [43], "quotes": ["git clone https://github.com/n8n-io/self-hosted-ai-starter-kit.git"]}], "hardware": [], "products": [{"term": "LangChain", "rel": "mention", "lines": [173], "note": "推荐阅读清单中的教程标题，非替代/竞品对象", "quotes": ["- Langchain Concepts in n8n"]}], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "ea0e7846d24f": {"fn": "deeplearning4j/deeplearning4j", "sha": "ea0e7846d24f", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "JVM 平台的深度学习训练与部署工具套件", "review": "Eclipse Deeplearning4J 是面向 JVM 的深度学习项目集合，覆盖从数据加载、预处理到构建与调优各类深度网络的流程。套件包含高层 API（DL4J）、线性代数库 ND4J（基于 C++ 的 LibND4J，提供 CPU/GPU 加速）、自动微分框架 SameDiff、ETL 工具 DataVec 与 Python4J。支持 Keras、TensorFlow、ONNX 模型导入，可在 Apache Spark 上分布式训练。仅支持通过构建工具使用，可从源码构建。由 Konduit K.K. 团队开发。", "highlights": ["ND4J 提供 500+ 数学/线性代数/深度学习运算，底层 C++ 支持 CPU（AVX2/512）与 CUDA GPU 加速", "SameDiff 自动微分框架支持导入 TensorFlow .pb 模型", "DL4J 支持 Keras h5 模型导入与 Apache Spark 分布式训练", "支持 Java、Scala、Kotlin、Clojure 等 JVM 语言"], "use_cases": ["在 Java/Scala 等 JVM 技术栈中训练和部署深度学习模型", "将 Keras、TensorFlow、ONNX 模型导入 JVM 环境运行", "在 Spark 集群上做分布式模型训练", "对机器学习数据做多格式 ETL 处理"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": null, "model_dep": null, "hardware": null, "install_friction": "medium", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["深度学习", "JVM", "线性代数库", "模型导入", "分布式训练"], "domain": "AI/深度学习框架", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": []}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": "company", "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L8: The **Eclipse Deeplearning4J** (DL4J) ecosystem is a set of projects intended to support all the needs of a JVM based de", "L14: - **ND4J**: General purpose linear algebra library with over 500 mathematical, linear algebra and deep learning operatio", "L84: Deeplearning4J is actively developed by the team at Konduit K.K.."], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [], "install": [{"term": "source", "rel": "support", "lines": [61, 62], "quotes": ["## Building from source", "It is preferred to use the official pre-compiled releases (see above). But if you want to build from source, first take "]}], "hardware": [], "products": [], "dual_license": {"flag": false, "lines": [], "quotes": []}, "deprecation": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}}, "24b508d8cd47": {"fn": "The-PR-Agent/pr-agent", "sha": "24b508d8cd47", "source": "readme", "identity": {"one_liner": "面向开发团队的 AI 代码审查 agent，自动审查 PR", "review": "PR-Agent 是开源的 AI 代码审查 agent，已在 GitHub 上由 Qodo 捐赠给开源社区，现为社区维护项目，与 Qodo 商业产品相区分。核心工具包括 /describe、/review、/improve、/ask，以 PR 评论或 CLI 方式触发，每个工具使用单次 LLM 调用（约 30 秒）。支持 GitHub、GitLab、BitBucket、Azure DevOps、Gitea 平台，通过 PR Compression 策略处理大小 PR，基于 JSON 的提示词可经配置文件自定义。部署途径含 GitHub Action、CLI、Docker、自托管 webhook。", "highlights": ["/review、/improve、/describe、/ask 等工具以 PR 评论或 CLI 方式运行", "PR Compression 策略处理任意规模的 PR", "JSON 提示词经配置文件自定义审查类别与行为", "支持 GitHub/GitLab/BitBucket/Azure DevOps/Gitea 与多种部署方式"], "use_cases": ["为仓库配置 GitHub Action 自动审查每个 PR", "本地对指定 PR 运行 review/improve 命令", "在自托管环境中控制代码数据的流向", "通过评论命令向 AI 询问 PR 相关问题"]}, "filters": {"ai_role": "ai-native", "license_risk": "permissive", "deploy": "desktop", "model_dep": "local-ok", "hardware": null, "install_friction": "low", "maturity": null}, "eval": {"target_user": "开发者", "paper_url": null, "demo_url": null, "self_declared_early": {"flag": false, "lines": []}}, "links": {"scenario_tags": ["代码审查", "DevTools", "CI/CD", "PR自动化"], "domain": "开发者工具/代码审查", "alternative_to": [], "competitors_mentioned": [], "ecosystem_compat": ["anthropic", "deepseek", "openrouter", "azure", "bedrock", "ollama"]}, "intel": {"maintainer_type": null, "zh_origin": false, "zh_origin_signals": []}, "trust": {"confidence": "high", "evidence": ["L9:  This repository contains the open-source PR Agent Project.", "L12: PR-Agent is an open-source, AI-powered code review agent and a community-maintained legacy project of Qodo. It is distin", "L72: - **AI Models**: OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, and any other model reachable through L"], "xcheck": null, "ver": 1, "prompt_ver": "1.4", "generated_at": "2026-10-18", "softened": null}, "raw_verdicts": {"providers": [{"term": "anthropic", "rel": "support", "lines": [72], "quotes": ["- **AI Models**: OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, and any other model reachable through L"]}, {"term": "deepseek", "rel": "support", "lines": [72], "quotes": ["- **AI Models**: OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, and any other model reachable through L"]}, {"term": "openrouter", "rel": "support", "lines": [72], "quotes": ["- **AI Models**: OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, and any other model reachable through L"]}, {"term": "azure", "rel": "support", "lines": [72], "quotes": ["- **AI Models**: OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, and any other model reachable through L"]}, {"term": "bedrock", "rel": "support", "lines": [72], "quotes": ["- **AI Models**: OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, and any other model reachable through L"]}, {"term": "ollama", "rel": "support", "lines": [72], "quotes": ["- **AI Models**: OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, and